 saw inflows of $2.8 million for the week as Ether rallied after last week\u8217\'20\'19s successful London upgrades. Ether products now represent 26% of capital invested into institutional crypto products.\par \par \uc2 There were minor inflows for some altcoin funds, including XRP, Bitcoin Cash, Cardano, and multi-asset funds \u8212\'20\'14 each of which saw inflows of between $1.1 million and $800k.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  also noted that 2021 has already seen a record 37 new crypto funds launched so far, beating out the 30 cryptocurrency funds that were launched during 2018:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have seen the number of funds/investment products listed accelerate recently with a record 37 launched this year compared to the previous high of 30 seen in 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bears-lick-their-paws-while-bitcoin-price-blasts-through-46-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent market momentum}}}\uc2 , the combined assets under management (AUM) of all institutional crypto products have surpassed $50 billion \u8212\'20\'14 its highest level since mid-May.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-continue-offloading-btc-exposure-despite-price-rebound"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutions continue offloading BTC exposure despite price rebound}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  has also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/investor-relations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  its financials for the first half of 2021, revealing a total income of $81.2 million. As such, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  has earned triple what it did during the entirety of 2020 during the first half of this year.\par \par \uc2 As of June 30, 2021, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 total AUM was $3 billion, up 27.6% compared to the end of December 2020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvYjlmZDVmZjItY2Y3Zi00NzI1LWE0ZmUtODA2MmViMDRjOWZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210810eh8a00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s break above the 200-day SMA suggests that the downtrend could be over and that may pull buyers back into altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery from $29,482.61 on July 21 has continued to surpass one resistance after another. Today, Bitcoin has risen above the 200-day simple moving average, an indicator watched by institutional investors to determine whether the asset is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A positive sign about today\u8217\'20\'19s rally has been that Bitcoin was not affected by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/flash-crash-rattles-gold-markets-as-bitcoin-holds-strong"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flash crash in gold}}}\uc2 , which momentarily dipped to a four-month low. This suggests that traders are focusing on the fundamentals of the sector and are not affected by the performance of other asset classes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/80f0bb7a-52ce-4b69-af88-b936a2a5fb86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Glassnode noted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-bitcoin-isn-t-entering-a-2018-like-bear-cycle-new-data-suggests-as-btc-targets-45k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors holding Bitcoin for more than a year}}}\uc2  have not dumped their positions after the recent rally to $45,000. This is in contrast to the 2018 bear market \u8220\'20\'1Cwhere old hands took exit liquidity on most relief rallies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin enter a bull phase and pull the sector higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s breakout above the overhead resistance at $45,451.67 hit a wall at the 200-day SMA ($44,954) on Aug. 7. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level at $42,451.67 on Aug. 8 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c55e1ce0-8441-47b2-a8f7-39e7ecd0440e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair bounced off the $42,451.67 level today and the bulls have pushed the price above the 200-day SMA. If buyers sustain the price above the 200-day SMA, it will suggest an end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance zone at $50,000 to $51,500 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone but stays above the 200-day SMA, it will increase the possibility of the continuation of the up-move. A break above $51,500 could clear the path for a rally to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move will invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the breakout level at $42,451.67. The pair could then drop to the next support at $36,670.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged above the psychological level at $3,000 on Aug. 7, which suggests that the correction could be over. The bears tried to trap the aggressive bulls by pulling the price back below $3,000 but the buyers held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/26d36bfe-ac32-42fb-87c6-ab109302fd56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to resume the uptrend and push the price to $3,500 and then to the psychological resistance at $4,000. However, the sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into the overbought territory.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the rally is overheated in the short term and a consolidation or correction is possible. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $2,893.23. That could result in a decline to $2,500.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the $340 resistance on Aug. 6, which completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level but the altcoin bounced off the 200-day SMA ($328) today. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/5fedc3d9-4970-42e9-ab52-cc31fa0647a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could now start its march toward the overhead resistance at $433. The bears are again likely to mount a strong defense of this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from it, the pair could drop to $340 and remain range-bound for a few days. A breakdown and close below the 50-day SMA ($308) could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a breakout and close above $433 will suggest that the correction is over. The pair may then attempt to start a new uptrend that could reach $520.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.50 on Aug. 8 but the bulls are in no mood to relent. They purchased the dip and are currently attempting to push the price back above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6673cb07-e4d4-4d16-b964-ad16ede477a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $1.50, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start its northward march toward the overhead resistance at $1.94. This level may act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the pair could resume its up-move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $1.50, the pair could drop to the moving averages. A break and close below the moving averages will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then drop to the critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  soared above the $0.75 resistance and the 200-day SMA ($0.79) on Aug. 7, which completed a double bottom pattern. The price rebounded off the breakout level today, indicating that bulls have flipped the level to support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1fdfbc57-f30c-4c47-b98b-614f2727e395.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above $0.84, the XRP/USDT pair could start its journey toward the overhead resistance zone at $1 to $1.07. A breakout and close above this zone could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA. A bounce off this support could keep the pair stuck between $1.07 and $0.75 for a few days. The bears will have to pull the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.65) to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) consolidation near the overhead resistance at $0.21 resolved to the upside on Aug. 7 as bulls established their supremacy. The bears posed a stiff challenge at $0.29 on Aug. 8 but the positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to break below $0.21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/04ff0844-efbb-4efb-a6e6-a21c87ddf278.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now make one more attempt to propel the price above $0.29. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT could rally to $0.35 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $0.29, the pair may drop to $0.21 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days. A break and close below the 200-day SMA ($0.20) could sink the pair to the critical support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the overhead resistance at $21 but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the bulls are not closing their positions as they anticipate the recovery to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c81a3ef2-5af8-4538-b65a-ceb5a8681474.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the overhead resistance at $21, the DOT/USDT pair could start its journey to the next target objective at $26.50. The 200-day SMA ($27) is placed just above this resistance, hence the bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to $21. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that traders are buying on dips. Conversely, a break below $21 could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($15.46).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 200-day SMA ($25.81) on Aug. 6 and the bulls successfully defended the retest of the level on Aug. 8. This suggests that the 200-day SMA will now act as a support on future declines.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/de871bc3-b84f-47ed-84ee-869cdda33278.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $30. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the downtrend is over. The UNI/USDT pair could then start its journey to $37 and later to $44.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $30, the pair could again drop to the 200-day SMA. A break below this support will suggest that the bulls may be losing their grip. The pair may then drop to $23.45.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-could-pave-way-for-100-000-bitcoin-bloomberg-analyst-asserts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum could pave way for $100,000 Bitcoin, Bloomberg analyst asserts}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $546.83 resistance on Aug. 6, which completed the double bottom pattern. The bulls have successfully held the breakout level for the past two days, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c5ac88fd-1541-4b6a-a42c-7fc9462ebe89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BCH/USDT pair could now rise to the 200-day SMA ($639) where the bulls may again face a stiff resistance. A breakout and close above this level could clear the path for the pair to rally to the pattern target at $710.13.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 200-day SMA, the pair could oscillate between the moving averages for a few days. A break below the 50-day SMA ($493) could increase the likelihood of a decline to $450.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to pull Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) back below the breakout level at $22.07 on Aug. 8 but failed. This suggests that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/390c60c0-ade5-401b-b021-1f75f8d1f02c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $26.48 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the LINK/USDT pair could stay range-bound between $26.48 and $22.07 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 200-day SMA ($27.83) will signal an end of the downtrend. The pair could then rally to $32 and later to $35.33. On the other hand, a break below $22.07 could result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($18.90).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNjkzYmEwODktODI0YS00MDAzLTllZjQtNzNmZGE5M2M2ODcxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210809eh89000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/6: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,771 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are near critical overhead resistance levels, suggesting that the downtrend is very close to ending.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has staged a smart recovery in the past few days and the interest in the crypto sector seems to be picking up. \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-now-offers-clients-access-to-six-crypto-funds-but-only-if-they-ask"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added access to a new Bitcoin fund}}}\uc2  created by New York Digital Investment Group (NYDIG) for its private banking clients.\par \par \uc2 The increasing number of traditional financial institutions opening up crypto trading opportunities for their clients shows there is strong demand for the sector.\par \par \uc2 On-chain analyst Willy Woo said recently that strong holders had been scoping up Bitcoin and locking \u8220\'20\'1Cthem away for long-term investment\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-be-on-the-verge-of-a-big-breakout-at-42k-hodler-activity-suggests"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resulting in a supply squeeze}}}\uc2 . Woo added that he had \u8220\'20\'1Cnot seen a supply shock opportunity like this since Q4 2020 when BTC was priced at $10,000 only to be repriced at $60,000 in the months thereafter.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/1461e761-b07c-4942-8dd4-4159f9c881e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Billionaire hedge fund manager Ray Dalio said on CNBC that Bitcoin was \u8220\'20\'1Csomething like a digital gold\u8221\'20\'1D and an important asset to use for diversifying the portfolio. However, Dalio seemed to be more inclined towards gold if there was a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-ray-dalio-likes-bitcoin-but-would-choose-gold-every-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 need to choose only one asset}}}\uc2  among the two.\par \par \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2  co-founder \uc2 Marc Andreessen\uc2  painted a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on Bitcoin calling it \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the most amazing things I\u8217\'20\'19ve ever seen\u8221\'20\'1D and a \u8220\'20\'1Cfundamental technological breakthrough.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With a pickup in demand, will Bitcoin and altcoins start a stronger rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the 20-day exponential moving average ($38,111) suggests that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying the dips. The bulls are currently attempting to sustain the price above the critical overhead resistance at $42,451.67.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/2721dd6e-0a6f-4130-9a0f-0a27dfd1bbfc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has formed an inverse head and shoulders pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above the neckline. If bulls sustain the price above the neckline, the pair could start its journey toward the pattern target at $55,778.\par \par \uc2 However, it may not be a straight rise to the target objective because the bears are likely to pose stiff resistance in the $50,000 to $51,500 zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could again retest the 20-day EMA. A break below this support will be the first sign that the bears are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the downtrend line on Aug. 4, indicating that bulls have flipped it to support. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price to the psychological resistance at $3,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/819e8549-7e97-4862-ad33-196dcc813850.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $3,000, the ETH/USDT pair could again drop to the 20-day EMA ($2,428). A strong bounce off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains positive. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at $3,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a new uptrend. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. A break below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($320) on Aug. 4, indicating strong demand at lower levels. The bulls are currently attempting to thrust and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $340.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/16b2b5d1-4b66-4420-a7fd-e1b70b18c5be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A close above $340 will complete an ascending triangle pattern, which could open the gates for a rally to $380 and then $433. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the trendline. A break below this support will invalidate the pattern and the pair may then drop to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on Aug. 3, which invalidated the developing descending triangle pattern. The bears tried to pull the price back below the downtrend line on Aug. 4 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/737a587f-0697-4391-a78d-6dbef78fde00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, suggesting advantage to the bulls. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now rally to $1.50 where the bears will again pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $1.50 may attract further buying, which could propel the price to $1.60 and then to $1.74. The bears will have to pull the price below $1.20 to gain the upper hand. If they manage to do that, the pair could again slide to $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  corrected to the 20-day EMA ($0.69) on Aug. 4 but the bulls purchased this dip. The bears again tried to pull the price down on Aug. 5 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/eaa196ce-c198-43a4-bb83-9ac39a75a33b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to drive and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $0.75. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern and start its journey toward the overhead zone at $1 to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the 50-day simple moving average ($0.65). Such a move will suggest that the pair could remain range-bound between $0.50 and $0.75 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) lower on Aug. 3 but the bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back toward the overhead resistance at $0.21 on Aug. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6c18077e-b5d0-4c17-91bb-0ae779a0df91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near the overhead resistance suggests that bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate a move higher. A stronger relief rally could begin if the bulls push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.21).\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.28 and then to $0.33. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.18, the pair could drop to the critical support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $16.93 support on Aug. 4, suggesting strong demand at lower levels. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the overbought territory, indicating that bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c4aa59ed-e01e-45e5-a23b-5bbb8d3e98f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above $21, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $26.50 where bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. The bulls will have to break above $26.50 to suggest the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $21, the pair could again drop to $16.93. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could again drop to the critical support at $13.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($21.04) on Aug. 4 and broke above the overhead resistance at $23.45. This suggests that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/4ca9f683-f1d0-43e6-a395-464d41a8ab58.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below $23.45 on Aug. 5 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. The UNI/USDT pair could now rally to the overhead resistance at $30.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current levels and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the breakout above $23.45 was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fixes-this-us-infrastructure-bill-would-add-250b-to-us-debt-mountain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Bitcoin fixes this\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 US Infrastructure Bill would add $250B to debt mountain}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the $546.83 resistance for the past few days, which suggests that the bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/bb340212-5982-4dee-9bed-570393870577.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($514) is moving up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, suggesting that bulls have a slight advantage. A breakout and close above $546.83 will complete a double bottom pattern, which could start the up-move towards the target objective at $710.13.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that short-term traders have given up and are dumping their positions. That could pull the price down to $383.53.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls have held the support at $22.08 for the past few days, they are struggling to push Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $26.48. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/4e64ad11-e861-484e-aedb-623df17fb13e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Repeat retests of a support tends to weaken it and the bears will now try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($20.79). If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to push the LINK/USDT pair to $26.48.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the overhead resistance could open the doors for a rally to $32.50. The first sign of weakness will be a break below the 20-day EMA. That could result in a decline to the next support at 50-day SMA ($18.72).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvODEwODVhNzUtY2JhZC00MjAwLWI5NzMtZWM4ZWYwNzA3ODI3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210806eh86000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price dips below $38K, with  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  traders eyeing a new higher low next\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 466 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price action targets a higher low after briefly losing $38,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) briefly fell below $38,000 on Tuesday as signs of a retracement from range highs continued to flow in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c6f27f1b-093a-4d5f-a519-e13978856733.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Caution before BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price swings lower\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.69910736.1149317252.1627726574-837655583.1627726574"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD tapping $37,960 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  before rebounding.\par \par \uc2 Still trading 3.7% lower on the day, the pair had come off local highs above $42,500 on the weekend amid concerns over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-tax-bill-fud-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 regulatory moves}}}\uc2  from the United States this week.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-sees-6-correction-in-contrast-to-booming-bitcoin-on-chain-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , analysts were already hoping that a correction would take Bitcoin several thousand dollars lower in order to create a higher low, from which it could continue its upside.\par \par \uc2 The target zone, lying around $36,000, was now key to hold in order to prevent what trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1422184614664286219/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cworst case scenarios.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDeviations wrecking those people who don\u8217\'20\'19t plan for them,\u8221\'20\'1D he warned \uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers alongside a chart showing key price levels.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ll bid on range high reclaim OR in the grey box for a HL. If we fall below the mid range and start closing below then you need to plan for some worst case scenarios. These are my only two triggers for a long (at the moment).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/6a873574-d56d-4552-b4af-7dc5e4461e0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD target chart. Source: Pentoshi/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Exchange levels differed only slightly from that hypothesis on Tuesday, with major support lingering at $35,000 on Binance.\par \par \uc2 Resistance was in place at $41,000, with the range high of $42,500 now of major interest among sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/c6093a83-1f53-4455-a768-65b041136daa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of Aug. 3. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Analyst: Bitcoin retrace \u8220\'20\'1Chas happened\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, meanwhile, fellow trader and analyst Rekt Capital has found sense in longer-term price action, potentially reinforcing $29,000 as a floor.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-2-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 On a yearly timeframe within four-year cycles, $29,000 has provided support in 2021, placing post-halving behavior firmly in historical context.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  retrace has happened\par \par \uc2 Instead of occurring in Q1 however, it took place in mid-Q2\par \par \uc2 In any case, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  rebounded from a key Four Year Cycle level:\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 ~$29,000 (black)\par \par \uc2 Essentially, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  turned Candle 4 resistance into new Candle 1 support {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Crypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Crypto}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/P700exoAae"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/P700exoAae}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GxSuMEUjHK"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/GxSuMEUjHK}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rekt Capital (@rektcapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1422209433397088256?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 2, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Others had also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1421919714624872451"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taken heart}}}\uc2  from Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s July turnaround and monthly close, among them stock-to-flow price model creator PlanB.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvMzEyMGIxMWItNTllYi00MzAwLTkyNDUtMzgyZTBlYjgwOWU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210803eh830002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/2: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,934 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 August 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price has hit a few barriers but many altcoins appear positioned for continuation.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dropped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-sees-6-correction-in-contrast-to-booming-bitcoin-on-chain-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 back below $39,000}}}\uc2  on Aug. 2, suggesting that short-term traders were booking profits after the price failed to close above $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels could again attract buying as seen in late July. Data from Santiment showed that Bitcoin held on wallet addresses storing between 100 and 10,000 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/active-bitcoin-addresses-surged-30-in-late-july-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose to a new all-time high}}}\uc2  at 9.23 million Bitcoin on Aug. 1. The previous all-time high for this group of investors was recorded on April 5, just over a week before Bitcoin hit an all-time high of $64,854 on April 14.\par \par \uc2 Santiment highlighted that the \u8220\'20\'1Caddresses have accumulated approximately 170,000 more Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D in the last four weeks. A similar pace of purchase was seen in late December 2020, just before the start of the strong bull move in 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/a0822c18-2f5d-4b49-8deb-41cce8d3222b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data showed that the assets under management in Bitcoin-focused funds dropped by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-see-4th-consecutive-weekly-outflows-as-institutions-diversify-holdings-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $20 million last week}}}\uc2 , its fourth successive weekly decline. Over the past month, Bitcoin funds have witnessed cumulative outflows of $67.8 million.\par \par \uc2 The data was not all \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  because multi-asset funds attracted cumulative inflows of $7.5 million last week and $11.9 million over the past month.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin break out of its range and lead the crypto markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin peeked above the overhead resistance at $42,451.67 on Aug. 1 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that bears are attempting to keep the range-bound action intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/e204ada6-2bbf-49e9-a528-77b92ccf1c89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($36,968) and the relative strength index (RSI) above 62 suggest that the sentiment is positive. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the price above $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will signal the start of a new uptrend. The first target on the upside will be a move to the overhead resistance zone at $50,000 to $51,500 where bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the $36,670 support. That will indicate that the BTC/USDT pair could extend its consolidation between $28,805 and $42,599 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on July 31, invalidating the descending triangle pattern. The bears sold at higher levels on Aug.1 as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick but the positive sign is that bulls did not allow the price to drop below the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3c1d6169-079a-4077-9ded-054a551d6aca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,273) and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls are in control. The ETH/USDT pair could now rally to the psychological level at $3,000 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears pull the price back below the 20-day EMA, it may trap the aggressive bulls. This could result in long liquidation, which may sink the pair to $2,000 and then to the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance at $340 on Aug. 1 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are attempting to defend this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/3a637736-befd-4c9e-ae82-b8fb10b7af38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the price dipped back below $340 on Aug. 1, the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. If the price consolidates between the moving averages and $340, it will improve the prospects of a break above $340.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective at $454.58 but the climb may not be easy because the bears will erect roadblocks at $380 and then again at $433.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the trendline. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the next stop could be $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the downtrend line on Aug. 1 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are defending the resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/086245c6-9bf4-4b2b-95b5-60c1b0b57c41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The marginally rising 20-day EMA ($1.27) and the RSI above 56 suggest that bulls have a slight advantage. If buyers can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to $1.50 where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge. If buyers can overcome this resistance, the pair could start its journey toward $1.94.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns down and plummets below $1.20. That could open the doors for a further slide to $1.14 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been consolidating near the overhead resistance at $0.75 for the past few days, which suggests that bulls are not booking profits as they anticipate the relief rally to extend further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/be50ffdc-1fcd-40d0-920b-b7ded6a3a317.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is above 63, suggesting the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive and sustain the price above $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern, which has a target objective at $1.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to sustain the price above $0.75, short-term traders may close their positions. That could drag the pair down to the moving averages. A break below this support will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $0.50 to $0.75 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the overhead resistance at $0.21 for the past few days. This suggests a state of uncertainty among the bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/64fa4299-7bb7-4a1b-beb3-3e7faac17e46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($0.20) and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. Usually, a tight consolidation near the stiff resistance resolves to the upside. If buyers thrust the price above the $0.21 to 50-day simple moving average ($0.22) resistance zone, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.28 and then to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls fail to clear the overhead hurdle, it could attract profit-booking. The pair could then gradually slide down to the critical support at $0.15. A bounce off this level may keep the pair range-bound between $0.15 and $0.21 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The $16.93 level had acted as a stiff resistance between June 22 to July 8 but the bulls propelled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above it on Aug. 1, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/5ac2b8e4-95cd-4ba1-b2d5-72c185c88a5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is just below the overbought territory, suggesting that buyers have the upper hand. If bulls flip $16.93 to support, the DOT/USDT pair may continue its journey to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears pull the price below $16.93, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($15.21), which may act as a support. If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will again attempt to resume the relief rally. A break and close below the 20-day EMA could result in a retest of $13.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) candlestick on Aug. 1 suggests that bears are defending the overhead resistance at $23.45, but the positive sign is that bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/7edc4f57-5730-4a81-8adc-60c5705987ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is close to the overbought zone, indicating that buyers have the upper hand. A break above $23.45 will clear the path for a possible rally to $30.\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the overhead resistance, the UNI/USDT pair is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA ($19.55). If the price rebounds off this support, it will improve the prospects of a break above $23.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/there-s-no-reason-not-to-hold-bitcoin-for-100-years-michael-saylor-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 There\u8217\'20\'19s no reason not to hold Bitcoin for 100 years, Michael Saylor says}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 50-day SMA ($498) and the overhead resistance at $546.83 for the past four days. A tight consolidation near a stiff resistance suggests that buyers are not closing their positions as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/d62b1768-8fa0-4d70-b7d8-2b68674f3220.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $546.83, the BCH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal setup has a target objective at $710.13. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, which suggests that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the pair could extend its range-bound action between $383.53 and $546.83 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $22.07 on July 30 but the bears are not allowing the buyers to have a runaway rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-08/32b5acb7-9eb3-4e75-85c1-fb4663c9ada9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to pull the price back below $22.07 but the bulls have held the support for the past three days. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $24, the LINK/USDT pair could rise to $26.48. A break above this resistance could clear the path for a possible rally to $32.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below $22.07, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($19.17). A strong rebound off this support will suggest that sentiment remains positive as traders are buying on dips. The bears will have to sink the price below the moving averages to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDgvNjMzYzQ3ZDMtZWE4NC00NzEwLTkwNGUtNGU1ZmEwYTk2MTE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210802eh82000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin records rare 10-day winning streak as BTC price taps $42K ceiling\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 483 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sees ten straight green candles as BTC price tries to crack $42,000 resistance.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) shot to new highs of $42,400 on July 31 in a surprise attack on range resistance which sellers failed to squash.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f6804ba6-e9c1-47fa-b2d4-26a8bb4e4b2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin seals 10 green candles in first since 2012\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD gaining for a tenth straight day across exchanges, reaching $42,420 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A subsequent cooling-off preserved most of the gains, with Bitcoin circling $41,900 at the time of writing, still up over 8% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 In trading circles, talk focused on a rare performance for the Bitcoin daily chart \u8212\'20\'14 ten green candles in a row, after all, last occurred in 2012.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has closed 10 straight green daily candles! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/6FEG4CgqLl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/6FEG4CgqLl}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Will Clemente (@WClementeIII) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1421259439521288194?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 31, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Even eight days of consecutive gains are a rarity, while nine have been seen only twice. Depending on the exchange, the data can be slightly different \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  saw 12 green candles one after another in May 2017, one \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/satsdart/status/1421207172684423175"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Regardless, conspicuous was on one hand Bitcoin's strength, and on the other the lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 A glance at short activity on major exchange \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  underscored the current mood, with hardly any trader willing to take on the risk of shorting the Bitcoin spot price at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/164afb73-6099-4850-9751-f4aa86f0e5e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD shorts 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitfinex\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "BTC just tapped 42k as resistance for the first time since the epic drop in May," popular trader Scott Melker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1421257764710592517"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "Time to pay attention."\par \par \uc2 Cracks appear in Bitcoin's ceiling\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-burns-bears-en-route-to-40k-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , $42,000 represents the final resistance hurdle in Bitcoin's multi-month trading range. Since coming down from all-time highs and falling through the level, which also represents the previous all-time from February, it has acted as a de facto unchallenged price ceiling.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-30-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Above, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1421411115599335426/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 orderbook data}}}\uc2  shows, little lies in Bitcoin's way \u8212\'20\'14 $45,000 or even $47,000 could easily be next, a hypothesis also supported by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-accelerates-among-whales-and-fish-with-btc-rallying-to-40k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whale investing behavior}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/bece9890-2757-4a44-8952-21e41b41bd87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell positions (Binance) as of July 31. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 According to the popular and historically accurate stock-to-flow Bitcoin price forecasting models, spot price should still be much higher \u8212\'20\'14 $94,839 on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, its creator, PlanB, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that a monthly close of at least $47,000 for BTC/USD in August would be enough for progress to remain on track.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvOTgyZWYxNjgtOTcwNy00ZDk2LTk4YzMtMDhlZDk2OGQyZWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210731eh7v0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 5 easy ways crypto investors can make money without needing to trade\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 1,277 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Want to get paid to HODL? Here are five easy ways crypto investors make money without trading.\par \par \uc2 Large price jumps and 100x gains get a lot of attention from pundits and influencers in the cryptocurrency community because they offer the hope of overnight riches.\par \par \uc2 In reality, these opportunities are few and far between. Not to mention, only a handful of traders actually manage to catch these waves and cash out in time to lock in life-changing money.\par \par \uc2 Fortunately, catching a large price surge is far from being the only way for crypto investors to make a buck, and the recent rise of decentralized finance (DeFi), nonfungible tokens (NFTs) and the slow march of mainstream \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  provides a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoin-roundup-data-shows-social-metrics-surge-ahead-of-defi-and-nft-price-rallies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 near endless stream of investment opportunities}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s have a look at five different ways crypto holders can make an easy buck without actually having to trade.\par \par \uc2 Staking\par \par \uc2 Staking, which rewards users for locking tokens on a protocol as collateral for transaction validation, is one of the best ways to earn a yield on assets held in a crypto-based portfolio.\par \par \uc2 In August, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-2-0-is-go-genesis-block-of-beacon-chain-winks-into-existence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Ethereum network will switch}}}\uc2  from a proof-of-work (PoW) consensus model to a proof-of-stake (POS) model, and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) holders who stake in the Eth2 contract can earn up to 5.83%.\par \par \uc2 Under this new PoS system, token holders actively participate in transaction validation by locking their coins in nodes on the network that then vie for a chance to verify transactions, create new blocks and receive the rewards that come along with it.\par \par \uc2 Data from Staking Rewards shows that a stake of 10 Ether currently results in a weekly earning of 0.0075 ETH, worth $17.96 at current prices, and a yearly earning of 0.3876 ETH which is currently worth $933.69.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/d14122f9-ad13-4f38-a5e9-11d7a0502982.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Calculated staking rewards for Ether. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.stakingrewards.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Staking Rewards}}}\par \par \uc2 The percentage yield for Ether decreases as more tokens are locked on the network so the final earnings may change.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the top five crypto assets by staked value are Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , Ether, Solana (SOL), USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot (DOT).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/282f586d-68d6-41c6-abd7-88e66ce692de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 5 crypto assets by staked value. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.stakingrewards.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Staking Rewards}}}\par \par \uc2 All things considered, staking provides one of the best low-risk opportunities in crypto to gain a bigger stack regardless of market sentiment or performance, while also helping to support the network through transaction validation.\par \par \uc2 Lend crypto for low-risk yields\par \par \uc2 The growth of the DeFi sector led to the development of a diverse crypto lending ecosystem, where users can deposit their cryptocurrencies to various lending protocols in exchange for rewards in the underlying token or in different assets like Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether and various altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Aave is the top lending protocol at the moment and the platform offers yield opportunities for tokens on the Ethereum and Polygon network with its native coin MATIC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/d52ee27d-cb1f-48b8-ac9e-f5291a5d14bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 7 Aave lending pools on the Polygon network. Source: Aave\par \par \uc2 The chart above shows the top seven lending pools available through the AAVE protocol on Polygon and rewards are paid in Wrapped MATIC (WMATIC), with the current deposit annual percentage yield (APY) being 1.92% and a yearly estimated APY of 6.1%.\par \par \uc2 Other top lending protocols include Curve (CRV), Compound (COMP), MakerDAO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/maker-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MKR}}}\uc2  ) and Yearn.finance (YFI).\par \par \uc2 Lending offers another low-risk way to earn a decent yield, in both bull and bear markets, on tokens that don\u8217\'20\'19t offer user-controlled rewards like staking.\par \par \uc2 Earn fees and tokens from providing liquidity\par \par \uc2 Liquidity provision is one of the primary components of a DeFi platform, and investors who choose to provide funds to emerging platforms are often rewarded with high percentage returns on the amount staked, as well as a percentage of the fees generated by transactions within the pool.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/70a5001e-d40b-4888-ac8e-92aba0733f1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Rewards for ETH-USDC liquidity pool on QuickSwap. Source: QuickSwap\par \par \uc2 As seen in the image above, providing liquidity to an Ether/USDC pool on QuickSwap will entitle an investor with a percentage of the $23,098 in total daily distributed rewards and a fee APY of 33.81%.\par \par \uc2 Ideally, long term investors would be wise to research the available pools on the market, and if a liquidity pair comprised of solid projects or even a stablecoin pair such as USDC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) looks appealing, it has the potential to be the blockchain version of a savings account that offers far better yields than can currently be found in any bank or legacy financial institution.\par \par \uc2 Maximize returns by yield farming\par \par \uc2 Yield farming is the concept of putting crypto assets to work in a way that generates the highest yield possible while minimizing risk.\par \par \uc2 As new platforms and protocols emerge, they offer high incentives to depositors as a way of mining for liquidity and increasing the total value locked (TVL) on the protocol.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b7b3af96-601e-494c-90f6-80becc1dbecd.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Rewards for STKGHST-WETH LP deposits on DinoSwap. Source: DinoSwap\par \par \uc2 The high yields offered are generally paid out in the native token of the platform as seen above, where a user has deposited a liquidity pool token for an STKGHS-WETH pair which has an APR of 189.2% and has so far generated a reward of 3.312 DINO.\par \par \uc2 For long investors who hold a portfolio filled with an assortment of tokens, yield farming is a way to gain exposure to new projects and obtain new tokens without having to spend new funds\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-dinoswap-s-dino-tvl-rose-above-330m-a-week-after-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s why DinoSwap\u8217\'20\'19s (DINO) TVL rose above $330M a week after launch}}}\par \par \uc2 NFT and blockchain gaming make \u8216\'20\'18play-to-earn\u8217\'20\'19 a reality\par \par \uc2 Blockchain gaming and NFT collecting is another way to produce a return on a crypto portfolio without spending new funds.\par \par \uc2 Axie Infinity is the most popular example at the moment, and the in-game play involves trading, battling, collecting and breeding NFT-based creatures known as Axies.\par \par \uc2 Playing Axie Infinity generates rewards in the form of Smooth Love Potion (SLP), an in-game token that is used in the Axie breeding process and also trades on major cryptocurrency exchanges. Users can swap SLP for dollar-based stablecoins or other large-cap cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Your Crypto Library, \u8220\'20\'1CToday, the average player earns between 150 to 200 SLP per day,\u8221\'20\'1D which, at current market value, is worth between $40 and $53.50.\par \par \uc2 In some parts of the world, that amounts to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/small-love-potion-slp-price-doubles-as-axie-infinity-user-growth-explodes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 income provided by a full-time job}}}\uc2 . For this reason, Axie Infinity has seen a massive uptick in user activity and new accounts in countries like Venezuela and Malaysia.\par \par \uc2 Crypto investing, lending, staking and play-to-earn blockchain games provide a much higher return on investment than traditional banks offer on savings and checking accounts. As the blockchain sector grows, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely that investors will continue to flock to platforms that offer high yields for engaging with the protocol.\par \par \uc2 Want more information about trading and investing in crypto markets?\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/finding-the-sweet-spot-traditional-financial-institutions-ready-for-defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Finding the sweet spot}}}\uc2  : Traditional financial institutions ready for DeFi\par \par \uc2 * NFT game creator {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nft-game-creator-flips-axie-infinity-virtual-land-for-9-200-gain-in-one-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flips Axie Infinity virtual land for 9,200%}}}\uc2  gain in one year\par \par \uc2 * How crypto can {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-crypto-can-modernize-the-world-of-lending"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 modernize the world of lending}}}\par \par \uc2 * A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-green-revolution-in-crypto-mining-industry-answers-wake-up-call"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 green revolution in crypto mining}}}\uc2 ? Industry answers wake-up call\par \par \uc2 * Here\u8217\'20\'19s why {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-dinoswap-s-dino-tvl-rose-above-330m-a-week-after-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DinoSwap\u8217\'20\'19s (DINO) TVL rose above $330M}}}\uc2  a week after launch\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvOWI1ZjE4MzUtMjg1Yi00ZTYyLTkzNjItNWE2YWQ4NjRiMWY0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210731eh7v00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/30: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,815 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders expect altcoins to move higher now that Bitcoin price finally pierced the $41,000 resistance.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins seem to be faltering near their respective overhead resistance levels. This suggests that some investors are continuing to sell at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 However, 21st Paradigm co-founder Dylan LeClair said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-otc-desks-buzz-as-analyst-warns-big-players-want-your-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on-chain data shows}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cbig transfer volumes from over-the-counter (OTC) desks over the last week.\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-57k-btc-leave-exchanges-in-one-day-dropping-bitcoin-reserves-to-pre-crash-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph also recently highlighted}}}\uc2  a historic 57,000 BTC outflow from exchanges on July 28.\par \par \uc2 Ecoinometrics also cited on-chain data to show that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-accelerates-among-whales-and-fish-with-btc-rallying-to-40k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 "whales" and \u8220\'20\'1Csmall fish'' accumulated Bitcoin}}}\uc2  when the price recovered from $29,400 to over $40,800 this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/6561aaaa-91ff-403f-9ba4-2076bb4c2b67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are also not to be left behind in their plans to accumulate more Bitcoin. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , which holds about 105,085 Bitcoin, said in its second-quarter report that the company intends \u8220\'20\'1Cto deploy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-pledges-to-buy-more-btc-despite-paper-loss-on-its-holdings-of-424-8m-in-q2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 additional}}}\uc2  capital into our \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy."\par \par \uc2 Wealthfront, a popular US-based robo-investment firm $25 billion in assets under management, announced that it would allow its clients to allocate up to 10% of their portfolio into Grayscale's \uc2 Bitcoin Trust\uc2  and the Grayscale Ethereum Trust.\par \par \uc2 With demand increasing from small investors and high-net-worth individuals, will cryptocurrencies stage a sharper recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on July 29, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears near the $40,000 mark. That uncertainty briefly resolved to the downside and if the price does not hold its recent surge above $40,000 the price could drop to $36,670.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/d066f496-5447-4469-84d0-500ddfeea846.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off $36,670, it will suggest that bulls have flipped this level into support.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will then again try to push the price above the overhead resistance zone at $41,330 to $42,451.67. This may not be easy because bears will try to defend this zone aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the zone, the BTC/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $36,670 and $42,451.67 for a few more days. A breakout and close above $42,451.67 will suggest the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The bears will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they can sink the price back below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) reached the downtrend line today but the bears are defending the resistance aggressively. The price could now drop to $2,200 where buyers may step in and arrest the correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/cf371eb2-57d6-4201-b0ca-4d574be52826.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,600 and then to $3,000. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move could sink the price to $2,000 and next to $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day simple moving average ($310) on July 29 but they could not challenge the overhead resistance at $340. This suggests that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/18781adf-4180-4d2e-b5a6-cffc671e22d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to take advantage of the lack of demand to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($305). A break of this support could result in a drop to the trendline and next to the July 20 low at $254.52.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead resistance at $340. If they pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $379 and next to $400.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to drive Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price above the 50-day SMA ($1.32) indicates that bears are aggressively defending the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/42d9ca8b-5b9f-4ac4-8375-cd9582fd7ec7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1.25), short-term traders may close their positions and that could drag the price down to $1.10 and later to $1. A break below $1 could result in long liquidation.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push the price above the downtrend line. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to $1.50 where bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have failed to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the $0.75 level for the past two days, which suggests that bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1ca57f71-c326-4a02-825d-a50a85ad2548.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If bulls do not allow the price to break below the 20-day EMA ($0.64), the XRP/USDT pair may rise above $0.75. That will complete a double bottom pattern, clearing the path for a possible rally to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages. The bears will then try to pull the price to $0.59 and then to $0.50. Such a move will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears have been defending the $0.21 resistance for the past few days but a minor positive is that bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that buyers are not closing their positions as they anticipate \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to move up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c59df853-a026-4aaa-a788-d7a020646c7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($0.20) and the RSI above 45 suggest a balance between supply and demand. This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if they can push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.23). That may clear the path for a rally to $0.28 and then $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.18, the DOGE/USDT pair may drop to $0.15. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it gives way, the pair may witness panic selling and drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($14.15) on July 27 but they have not been able to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($16.05). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/111ad058-0b1f-4d21-846e-1b128a310513.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the 50-day SMA today and the bears will now try to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $13. A break below this support could sink the pair to $10.37.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $16.93. If that happens, it will suggest a change in the short-term trend. The pair could then start its journey to $20 and later to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears have other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/4b8db0e9-9339-4bf8-a321-63a1428395e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level but stays above the 20-day EMA ($18.50), it will indicate that bulls are buying on dips. That will improve the likelihood of a break above the downtrend line, invalidating the descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 The UNI/USDT pair could then rise to $24 and if this level is crossed, the up-move may reach $30. Conversely, if bears pull the price below the moving averages, the pair may decline to $17.24 and then to the critical support at $13.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2021/07/30/who-takes-gold-in-crypto-blockchain-olympics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Who takes gold in the crypto and blockchain Olympics?}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at $546.83. This suggests that bears are attempting to defend the resistance of the range and extend the consolidation for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/fea650a8-30e4-4a8d-9a6f-7a04d193cb1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below the moving averages, the BCH/USDT pair could witness further selling and drop to $441.17. A break below this level will open the doors for a further slide to the critical support at $383.53.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls do not allow the price to drop below the moving averages, it will enhance the prospects of a break above $546.83. If that happens, the double bottom pattern will complete and the BCH/USDT pair could start its journey toward the target objective at $710.13.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although bulls pushed \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($137) on July 28, they could not clear the hurdle at the overhead resistance at $146.54. This indicates that bears have not yet given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f20486de-ccee-424c-a14a-63dcb9651fdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If sellers pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($130), the LTC/USDT pair could start its downward journey to the critical support at $103.83. Such a move will indicate that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above $146.54. If they succeed, the pair will complete a double bottom pattern, which has a target objective at $189.25.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvYThlYzBiYjYtOTUyYy00YTY0LTgyZTktMmFkYTUyMTY2Y2FmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210730eh7u000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 ADA\par \b \uc2 Cardano risks 60%-90% drop, warns trader with  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  painting a classic  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  pattern\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 902 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Spotted by veteran analyst Peter Brandt, the classic technical pattern can send \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  prices down by almost 60%.\par \par \uc2 Cardano is close to attaining the title of a fully-fledged smart contracts platform following a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critical upgrade in mid-July}}}\uc2 . The project's founder Charles Hoskinson confirmed that they recently processed the sales of more than $10 million worth of non-fungible tokens atop their public ledger.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, an NFT and DeFi Marketplace called the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-grows-closer-to-launching-smart-contracts-with-new-testnet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spores Network}}}\uc2 , which raised $2.3 million in a fundraiser, said it would deploy its services atop the Cardano chain for lower transaction costs, lower carbon footprints, and higher transaction throughput.\par \par \uc2 But the Ethereum rival's growth as a project might not lead to higher adoption for its native cryptocurrency, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , at least according to an analysis shared by Peter Brandt, the chief executive of global trading firm Factor LLC.\par \par \uc2 A 60%-90% crash ahead?\par \par \uc2 The veteran analyst shared a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a tweet published Friday. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1421079965508984844"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cited}}}\uc2  a classic technical pattern, known as Head and Shoulders, to predict a downside scenario for the Cardano token that is already up more than 600% on a year-to-date timeframe.\par \par \uc2 In detail, Head and Shoulders forms when the price forms three consecutive peaks atop a single support level, with a condition that the middle peak is higher than other two, which are typically of the same height. The price eventually breaks below the support levels\u8212\'20\'14also called neckline\u8212\'20\'14and falls by as much as the maximum height between the middle peak's top and the support level.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  visibly fits the description, as shown in the chart shared by Brandt.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/740f3856-4beb-4f8d-b0de-85482fcc7293.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano's head and shoulder setup. Source: TradingView.com, Peter Brandt\par \par \uc2 The analyst envisioned the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD exchange rate to drop as far as $0.12, down 90% from the pair's current bid near $1.26. A percentage-based calculation of the Head and Shoulders pattern marked its profit target near $0.35, down 60% from its neckline.\par \par \uc2 Brandt recalled his record of predicting market tops to add strength to his depressive Cardano prediction. For instance, one of his analyses from 2018, involving \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , corrected spotted a descending triangle setup following the altcoin's run-up from $4 to $420 during the 2017's bull run.\par \par \uc2 "I remember being scoffed at unmercifully when I identified this top in LTC/USD back in mid 2018," Brandt tweeted. "Hey Cardano trolls, take aim."\par \par \uc2 But can 2018 repeat?\par \par \uc2 The crash that followed the 2017 bull run originated primarily because of the so-called initial coin offering bust. A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-study-says-80-percent-of-icos-conducted-in-2017-were-scams"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 study conducted by Statis Group}}}\uc2  noted that more than 80% of blockchain startups that raised funds in Bitcoin, Ether, and other top coins of that time, failed to turn up a working product.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, a majority of them turned out to be outright scams that sold the raised crypto capital, thus creating a downward pressure on the entire market. \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Bitcoin, and Ether crashed by more than 80% in 2018 as the ICO FUD pushed investments out.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, the 2020 bull run came in the wake of macroeconomic blunders. The Federal Reserve's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-outlines-7-steps-to-more-fiscal-stimulus-and-higher-btc-prices"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 efforts to contain the economic aftermath}}}\uc2  of the Covid-19 crisis saw it launching an unprecedented quantitative easing program. As a result, near-zero interest rates and $120 billion worth of asset purchases sent investors looking for better alternatives in riskier markets every month.\par \par \uc2 As a result, Bitcoin boomed from below $4,000 in March 2020 to above $65,000 in April 2021. Meanwhile, altcoins, which tend to tail Bitcoin trends, surged likewise. Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was one among them; it is now trading more than 7,000% higher from its mid-March bottom.\par \par \uc2 The 30-day correlation between Bitcoin and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  stands near 0.85 above zero, per data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provided by Crypto Watch}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/waiting-for-alonzo-cardano-smart-contracts-creep-toward-full-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Waiting for Alonzo: Cardano smart contracts creep toward full launch}}}\par \par \uc2 Simon Kim, CEO of crypto venture fund Hashed, told Cointelegraph in March that the 2020-2021 crypto market is entirely different from the one from 2017-2018, noting that the market now is running on a completely different fundamental. He said:\par \par \uc2 "Firstly, various DeFi projects are creating value based on a clear business model. Secondly, we\u8217\'20\'19re seeing record active investment by institutional investors, and finally, various on-ramps and off-ramps, including not only \uc2 PayPal\uc2  and Visa but also large banks, are now emerging.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Rekt Capital, a pseudonymous market analyst, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1421028046266585088"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to close above its weekly close of $1.30 to confirm its long-term bull trend. Cointelegraph's Rakesh Upadhyay also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-28-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed out}}}\uc2  that a break above $1.33 would increase the Cardano token's potential to extend its upside target towards $1.90.\par \par \uc2 "Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and slides below $1.20, it will indicate that bears continue to sell at every higher level. That may result in a retest of the critical support at $1," Upadhyay warned, nonetheless.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNWZkMzk4ODEtNmE4Ny00ZGU3LWE5ODktY2NhYjEyMGUxOGM3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210730eh7u0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/28: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,917 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's defense of the $38,000 level and renewed interest from institutional investors could be a sign that the bull trend is resuming.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are attempting to break above their respective overhead resistance levels, indicating the return of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Data from Bybt shows that the Grayscale premium has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-premium-matches-bitcoin-price-crash-levels-as-unlocking-fear-fades"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbing}}}\uc2  and reached -5.88% on July 27, its closest level to zero since May 25. This suggests that institutional investors may have again started building positions via the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another institutional investment product showing a possible return of buyers is Canada\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Purpose Bitcoin ETF\uc2  whose assets under management rose to 1.1 billion Canadian dollars on July 27, its highest level since May 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/9dd41598-6dc1-4d7d-ac83-3c4e81637e94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Swiss private bank \uc2 Vontobel\uc2  said in its half-year financial report that its Bitcoin tracker certificate investment product had generated significant interest from clients. Vontobel CEO Zeno Staub said to Bloomberg that its wealthy clients have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vontobel-s-wealthy-clients-are-interested-in-crypto-says-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allocated}}}\uc2  a part of their wealth to cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Horizon Kinetics\uc2  co-founder Peter Doyle also told the Financial Times that the world economy is at an inflection point because of the pandemic and mounting debt. This \u8220\'20\'1Cmeans either default or currency debasement.\u8221\'20\'1D Therefore, Doyle said people should have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/7b-investment-firm-recommends-crypto-to-beat-currency-debasement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exposure}}}\uc2  to cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 With institutional interest returning to Bitcoin, could the rally continue or will bears again stall the recovery near overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long wick on the July 26 candlestick shows that bears aggressively sold near $40,550 but the positive sign is that bulls flipped the $36,670 level into support on July 27. This indicates a possible change in sentiment from sell on rallies to buy on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3bc93ce1-bd2f-42da-ae48-e163cc8cf1b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above $40,550 today but the wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears have not yet surrendered. They will again try to stall the recovery in the overhead resistance zone at $41,330 to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead zone, the BTC/USDT pair could again drop to $36,670. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that bulls are not waiting for a sharper dip to get in.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then consolidate between $36,670 and $42,451.67 for the next few days, improving the prospects of a break above the range. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the overbought zone, indicating that bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks below the moving averages. That will bring the large range between $42,451.67 and $28,805 into play.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on July 26 but the bears could not sink and sustain the price below the moving averages. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3c80e34c-280e-4767-aa43-ff32d4307699.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are close to completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has risen into the positive zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, the momentum may pick up. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and dips below the moving averages, the ETH/USDT pair could gradually drop to the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the July 26 candlestick suggests that bears sold at higher levels. They attempted to trap the aggressive bulls by pulling Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back below the downtrend line but the buyers did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/22e3f907-70e5-44ae-8a60-608fc073e2c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 20-day exponential moving average ($304) on July 27 and are attempting to push the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($312) today. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $340.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $340 will clear the path for a possible rally to $400 and then to $433. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could result in a fall to $254.52.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) July 26 candlestick suggests that traders are selling on rallies. The bears tried to pull and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.25) on July 27 but failed, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3d7cba33-4502-4070-8f32-1df0b4e35caf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This may have reinvigorated the buyers who are again trying to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.33). If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could gradually rise to $1.50. This level may pose a stiff challenge for buyers but if they can overcome it, the pair could start its northward journey toward $1.94.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and slides below $1.20, it will indicate that bears continue to sell at every higher level. That may result in a retest of the critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although bears successfully defended the 50-day SMA ($0.67) on July 26, they could not pull {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  back below the 20-day EMA ($0.62). This suggests that bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/e9aa2fd7-16cf-400f-bc03-239aa946fd6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sustained buying from the bulls today has pushed the XRP/USDT pair above the 50-day SMA for the first time since May 19. If buyers can clear the hurdle at $0.75, the pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This setup has a target objective at $1.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is attempting to turn up and the RSI has risen above 62, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $0.75, the bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may extend its consolidation between $0.50 and $0.75 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) July 26 candlestick suggests that bears are defending the 50-day SMA ($0.23) aggressively. The sellers attempted to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.20) on July 27 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/5e6eb9d0-dcb9-4bf2-96b0-e882f1a20b88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that buyers have not given up and will make one more attempt to push the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could start a relief rally that may reach $0.28 and then $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the 50-day SMA, several short-term traders may close their position. That could result in a break below the 20-day EMA, which may clear the path for a decline to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the $13 support on July 27 but failed, which suggests that bulls are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/8e7b1b23-9286-4401-b884-10a38a4e7645.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $16.93. This level may again act as stiff resistance but the flat 20-day EMA ($13.95) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA during the next correction, the prospects of a break above $16.93 will improve. That could signal the start of a sustained relief rally to $20 and later to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $13. That could result in a retest of $10.37.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on July 26, indicating that bears are aggressively defending this resistance. Although the price broke below the 20-day EMA ($18.25) on July 27, the bulls bought this dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/07059ff8-0e79-40b3-a7a3-15096c83b3e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now again attempt to push the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, it will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as aggressive bears are forced to cover their short positions.\par \par \uc2 That could open the doors for a possible rally to $24 and then to the critical overhead resistance at $30. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below $17.24, the UNI/USDT pair could start its downward journey toward $13.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-pares-gains-bitcoin-pushed-under-40k-as-fed-set-to-reveal-tapering-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum pares gains, Bitcoin pushed under $40K as Fed set to reveal tapering plans}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($504) on July 26 but the bulls defended the 20-day EMA ($471) on July 27. This suggests a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/2adf5738-ee42-4a5f-bb5b-97d712c6d651.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, indicating that bulls are attempting to make a comeback. A breakout and close above $546.83 will signal the start of a sustained relief rally as the BCH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern.\par \par \uc2 This up-move could face stiff resistance at $650.35 but if crossed, the rally could reach the pattern target at $710.13. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($138) on July 26 but the positive sign is that bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($128).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/38af2e7e-bdfe-48f7-b4f3-3a5a26224a93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance in the overhead zone between the 50-day SMA and $146.54. If the price turns down from this zone and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls drive the price above $146.54, the LTC/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $189.25. The RSI above 57 and the flat 20-day EMA points to a marginal advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNDc4OWI1ODEtZDI2YS00NTEzLWJkZTYtZGEwYjQyYjFmODNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210729eh7t0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price seeks higher low as trader forecasts $45K breakout within weeks\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 500 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price action deals with higher lows ahead of planned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC price breakout.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) traded steadily on Tuesday after a surge above $40,000 resulted in higher levels broadly holding.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/58d47175-8512-4271-af11-fbbe8d11c0f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 All eyes on Bitcoin higher lows\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hovering near $37,000, around 8.8% below the peak of Monday\u8217\'20\'19s gains.\par \par \uc2 Its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-40k-after-a-6-week-absence-but-on-chain-activity-is-somewhat-bearish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first trip above $40,000}}}\uc2  in six weeks, Bitcoin price action is now attempting to consolidate and form support at a higher low, Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin rejects at the range high, which isn't strange,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419924050311323652"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2  in a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  update Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe market has made a new higher high and is in search of a higher low. The levels that I\u8217\'20\'19m watching are $34,500\u8211\'20\'1335,800 and the area around $32,500.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A look at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1419931250303946752/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance confirmed the significance of those price points, with buyer support significantly in evidence only below $36,000. Sellers, on the other hand, remained clustered at $40,000 and above.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/587e7b33-6cbb-402e-8a72-1a3ac7888e5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of July 27. Source: Material Indicators/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 The area immediately after $40,000 remains a decisive hurdle to overcome for Bitcoin bulls, with analysts arguing that doing so would unleash the bull market continuation that so many continue to wait for.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDid people really expect 45-48k in one day?\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1419769329080471554"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reasoned}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou broke the downtrend on high volume, you broke back into the range and made a HH on the daily. You teleported to resistance, it could take 2 or 3x to break it but that\u8217\'20\'19s coming in the next weeks imo. Dips are for buying.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That scenario would place BTC/USD on track to reach $47,000 in August, the minimum \u8212\'20\'14 if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 controversial}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 monthly close predicted by stock-to-flow model creator PlanB.\par \par \uc2 Trader: \u8220\'20\'1CMost\u8221\'20\'1D altcoins have bottomed\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s comedown from local highs, meanwhile, spelled problems for altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-26-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, dipped 11% following a copycat move to highs of its own at $2,432 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/70423f8e-8820-453d-8571-e9235a6b4d97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Many major altcoins fared likewise, with 24-hour losses of 10% or more not uncommon at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe great part is that altcoins are following suit with Bitcoin and will most likely run towards their other side of the range too,\u8221\'20\'1D van de Poppe nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419613389295398913"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  in a hopeful forecast, repeating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-split-on-40k-chances-as-altcoins-eye-potential-80-150-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous conviction}}}\uc2  about the altcoin market.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis means 80\u8211\'20\'13150% run from the lows. I think most of them are bottomed.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvMmY2MmFiNjUtNzg0MS00NzlmLWJjNDQtOWI0OWFjM2JjOWNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210727eh7r0005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price seeks higher low as trader forecasts $45K breakout within weeks\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price action deals with higher lows ahead of planned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC price breakout.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) traded steady on July 27 after a surge above $40,000 resulted in higher levels broadly holding.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/58d47175-8512-4271-af11-fbbe8d11c0f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 All eyes on Bitcoin higher lows\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hovering near $37,000, around 8.8% below the peak of Monday's gains.\par \par \uc2 Its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-40k-after-a-6-week-absence-but-on-chain-activity-is-somewhat-bearish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first trip above $40,000}}}\uc2  in six weeks, Bitcoin price action is now attempting to consolidate and form support at a higher low, Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe said.\par \par \uc2 "Bitcoin rejects at the range high, which isn't strange," he explained in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419924050311323652"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter update}}}\uc2  Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "The market has made a new higher high and is in search of a higher low. The levels that I'm watching are $34,500-35,800 and the area around $32,500. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419924050311323652/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419924050311323652/photo/1}}}\uc2 "\par \par \uc2 A look at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1419931250303946752/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy and sell levels}}}\uc2  on major exchange Binance confirmed the significance of those price points, with buyer support significantly in evidence only below $36,000. Sellers, on the other hand, remained clustered at $40,000 and above.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/587e7b33-6cbb-402e-8a72-1a3ac7888e5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance) as of July 27. Source: Material Indicators/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 The area immediately after $40,000 remains a decisive hurdle to overcome for Bitcoin bulls, with analysts arguing that doing so would unleash the bull market continuation that so many continue to wait for.\par \par \uc2 "Did people really expect 45-48k in one day?" popular trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1419769329080471554"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reasoned}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "You broke the downtrend on high volume, you broke back into the range and made a HH on the daily. You teleported to resistance, it could take 2 or 3x to break it but that's coming in the next weeks imo. Dips are for buying."\par \par \uc2 That scenario would place BTC/USD on track to reached $47,000 in August, the minimum \u8212\'20\'14 if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 controversial}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 monthly close predicted by stock-to-flow model creator PlanB.\par \par \uc2 Trader: "Most" altcoins have bottomed\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's comedown from local highs meanwhile spelled problems for altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-26-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8216\'20\'18s Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market cap, dipped 11% following a copycat move to highs of its own at $2,432 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/70423f8e-8820-453d-8571-e9235a6b4d97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Many major altcoins fared likewise, with 24-hour losses of 10% or more not uncommon at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 "The great part is that altcoins are following suit with Bitcoin and will most likely run towards their other side of the range too," Van de Poppe nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1419613389295398913"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  in a hopeful forecast, repeating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-split-on-40k-chances-as-altcoins-eye-potential-80-150-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous conviction}}}\uc2  about the alt market.\par \par \uc2 "This means 80-150% run from the lows. I think most of them are bottomed."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvMmY2MmFiNjUtNzg0MS00NzlmLWJjNDQtOWI0OWFjM2JjOWNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210727eh7r0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,887 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are hopeful that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bounce from $29,000 to $40,000 and the strong rally seen in altcoins is a signal that the bull market has resumed.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) soared from $29,482.61 on July 21 to $40,000 today, its highest level since June 16. This sharp rebound shows a possible change in sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The bulls received a boost on Sunday, following the news from an anonymous source within Amazon proclaiming that the company is planning to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/amazon-plans-to-accept-bitcoin-payments-this-year-claims-insider"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accept}}}\uc2  Bitcoin payments by the end of 2021 and is exploring the launch of its own cryptocurrency by 2022.\par \par \uc2 This news seems to have sent the bears {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-burns-bears-en-route-to-40k-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scurrying}}}\uc2  to the exit, resulting in a short squeeze. Data from Bybt shows about $1.1 billion of liquidations in 24-hours on Monday, the most since May 18. The intensity of the squeeze was such that \u8220\'20\'1C$111,000,000 of shorts liquidated in 10 minutes\u8221\'20\'1D according to analyst William Clemente III.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f2735e64-a849-44b2-8cb6-c69762deee71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although institutional adoption of digital assets is on the rise, some still view crypto only as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-is-pure-trading-instrument-hedge-fund-ceo-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speculative}}}\uc2  asset. \uc2 Man Group\uc2  CEO \uc2 Luke Ellis\uc2  said that cryptocurrencies are \u8220\'20\'1Ca pure trading instrument\u8221\'20\'1D with \u8220\'20\'1Cno inherent worth in it whatsoever. It is a tulip bulb.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Can the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment sustain and attract further buyers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical levels on the upside and the downside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed above the 50-day simple moving average ($34,396) on July 25, which may have forced the short-term traders to cover their short positions. This could have resulted in a short squeeze today, pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $36,670.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f81a6425-17ff-4be5-acf0-ab1ffc6a87b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen close to the overbought territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $36,670, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance zone at $41,330 to $42,451.67 where they may encounter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 If bulls arrest the subsequent decline above $36,670, the pair could trade in the upper half of the large trading range between $30,000 to $42,451.67. A break above $42,451.67 will signal the possible start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could retest the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) struggled near the $2,200 level for the past two days but the long tail on the July 25 candlestick suggests that bulls purchased the dip. Sustained buying by the bulls has pushed the price above the $2,200 level today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3bde7d25-77b8-4c84-b8c9-756d11c08547.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line, which may again act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance but rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($2,081), it will indicate a change in sentiment. That will improve the prospects of a break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the downtrend line will clear the path for a possible rally to the psychological resistance at $3,000. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the bears have not given up and continue to sell on rallies.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line and are now attempting to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($314).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/2d06d2a9-b507-4a0e-8dc4-dc10ac00cabc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback. If they can sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair may soar to $380 and later to $433.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to sink the pair back below $280. If they manage to do that, the pair could continue its down move and retest the July 20 low at $254.52.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) candlestick on July 25 showed that bulls were buying the dips rather than closing their positions near the 20-day EMA ($1.24). The momentum picked up today and bulls have propelled the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/bd35ba8e-d4bd-41bb-9389-36942d930910.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.34), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. This level could act as stiff resistance but if the bulls arrest the next decline above the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could rally to $1.63 and then to $1.88. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level and slides below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $1.14 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s rebound had stalled near the 20-day EMA ($0.61) for the past three days but the bulls did not dump their positions. Renewed buying has pushed the price above the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c5ae3506-e1d3-43e2-90c5-1d4014568f57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen above 54, indicating that bears are losing their grip. If bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.68), the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $0.75 will complete a double bottom pattern, which could open the doors for a rally to $1.07. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could again drop to the critical support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although bears defended the 20-day EMA ($0.20) for the past three days, the bulls did not give up much ground. This suggests that bulls were not booking profits as they were anticipating \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3907b70f-63e1-4078-81b6-d3b79b9f1483.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.21 today but the bears may not give up easily. The sellers will again try to stall the recovery at the 50-day SMA ($0.24). If the price turns down from this level, the bulls will attempt to flip $0.21 into support.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the possibility of a break above the 50-day SMA increases. Such a move could open the doors for a likely rally to $0.28 and then to $0.33. Conversely, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could again drop to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) relief rally at the 20-day EMA ($13.92) for the past three days but they could not pull the price back below the $13 level. This shows that bulls were buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/5b4926b8-bdac-45ed-b291-9b85a314e5c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA today and the DOT/USDT pair could now rally to the overhead resistance at $16.93. This level may act as stiff resistance and if the price turns down from it, the pair could again drop to $13.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price above $16.93, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair could then start its northward march to $20 and later to the stiff overhead resistance at $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the downtrend line of the descending triangle pattern where bears may mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($18.17), it will suggest that bears are aggressively selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/706f7da7-ace1-40bd-9f7d-a94d583a91aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has climbed into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA has flattened out, suggesting that the selling pressure is reducing. If bulls push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern will be invalidated.\par \par \uc2 That could attract further buying, opening the doors for a rally to $25. If bulls can clear this hurdle, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to $30 where bears may pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-how-much-musk-and-saylor-s-tweets-influenced-crypto-prices-in-q2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s how much Musk and Saylor\u8217\'20\'19s tweets influenced crypto prices in Q2}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After struggling near the 20-day EMA ($465) for the past two days, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has resumed its recovery today. The altcoin could now rise to the overhead resistance at $538.11 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/2ea57707-ba23-4d16-866e-a783da076e7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen above 55 and the 20-day EMA has flattened out, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. A breakout and close above $538.11 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls as the BCH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $706.22. Alternatively, if the price turns down from $538.11, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the price above the overhead resistance. A break below the 20-day EMA could pull the price to $370.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to stall \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally near the 20-day EMA ($127) for the past two days but the bulls were in no mood to relent. They held their ground and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/02b06dbf-8604-4de5-84a1-dbce303a5f5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen into the positive zone and the 20-day EMA has flattened out, indicating that bears are losing their grip. If bulls drive and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($139), the LTC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $180.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 50-day SMA but does not break below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvMjI4ODQxNDUtZjk3Zi00ZDViLWJkYTItM2UzOWQ4OWJjYzUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210726eh7q000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Just HODL! Bitcoin and Ethereum outperform \u8216\'20\'18lower risk\u8217\'20\'19 crypto index funds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 669 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data from Delphi Digital shows holding BTC and ETH was more profitable than investing in weighted average market cap crypto and DeFi index funds.\par \par \uc2 In the past two decades, index and exchange-traded funds (ETF) have become some of the most popular forms of investing because they offer investors a passive way to gain exposure to a basket of stocks as opposed to investing in individual stocks which increases risk of loss.\par \par \uc2 Since 2018, this trend has extended to the crypto sector and products like the Bitwise 10 Large Cap Crypto Index (BITX) tracks the total return of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), Solana (SOL), Chainlink (LINK), Polygon (MATIC), Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) and Uniswap (UNI).\par \par \uc2 The ability to access multiple top projects through one weighted average market cap index sounds like a great way to spread out risk and gain exposure to a wider range of assets, but do these products offer investors a better return in terms of profit and protection against \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  when compared to the top-ranking cryptocurrencies?\par \par \uc2 Hodling versus crypto baskets\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital took a closer look at the performance of the Bitwise 10 and compared it to the performance of Bitcoin following the December 2018 market bottom. The results show that investing in BTC was a more profitable strategy even though BITX was slightly less volatile.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b8b986a9-7dfd-4dfd-a2da-4bc30ff49ded.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price vs. Bitwise 10. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.delphidigital.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Delphi Digital}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the report, \u8220\'20\'1Cindices aren\u8217\'20\'19t meant to outperform individual assets, they\u8217\'20\'19re meant to be lower-risk portfolios compared to holding an individual asset,\u8221\'20\'1D so it\u8217\'20\'19s not surprising to see BTC outperform BITX on a purely cost basis.\par \par \uc2 The index did offer less downside risk to investors as the market sold-off in May but the difference was \u8220\'20\'1Ctrivial\u8221\'20\'1D as \u8220\'20\'1CBTC\u8217\'20\'19s max drawdown was 53% and Bitwise\u8217\'20\'19s was 50%.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Overall, the benefits of investing in an index versus Bitcoin are not that great because the volatile nature of the crypto market and frequent large drawdowns often have a larger effect on altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCrypto indices continue to be a work-in-progress. Choosing assets, allocations, and re-balancing thresholds is a difficult task for an emerging asset class like crypto. But as the industry matures, we expect more efficient indices to pop up and gain traction.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ethereum also outperforms DeFi baskets\par \par \uc2 Decentralized finance (DeFi) has been one of the hottest crypto sectors in 2021 led by decentralized exchanges like Uniswap (UNI) and SushiSwap (SUSHI) and lending platforms like AAVE and Compound (COMP).\par \par \uc2 The DeFi Pulse Index (DPI) aims to tap into this rapid growth and the DPI token has allocations to 14 of the top DeFi tokens, including UNI, SUSHI, AAVE, COMP, Maker ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/maker-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MKR}}}\uc2  ), Synthetic (SNX) and Yearn.finance (YFI).\par \par \uc2 When comparing the performance of DPI to Ether since the inception of the index, Ether significantly outperformed in terms of profitability and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as evidenced by a 57% drawdown on Ether versus 65% for DPI.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/53aa47bd-a232-45fe-80d8-7abe507b9f2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether price vs. DeFi Pulse Index price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.delphidigital.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Delphi Digital}}}\par \par \uc2 While this is an \u8220\'20\'1Cimperfect comparison\u8221\'20\'1D according to Delphi Digital due to the fact that \u8220\'20\'1Cthe risk and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of DeFi tokens are higher than Ether\u8217\'20\'19s,\u8221\'20\'1D it still highlights the point that the traditional benefits seen from indices are not mirrored by crypto-based baskets.\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou could\u8217\'20\'19ve just HODL-ed ETH for a superior risk-return profile.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 For the time being, Bitcoin and Ether have proven to be two of the lower-risk cryptocurrency plays available when compared to crypto index funds that offer exposure to a larger number of assets.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvYTA2OWUwZjktY2QwMi00OTIxLWE3ZjUtZjZlOWYyMGRjOTJlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210724eh7o00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/23: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,855 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have held on to most of their recent gains, indicating that sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance near $32,500, suggesting that the ride higher may not be an easy one. However, a positive sign is that demand for cryptocurrencies remains strong and lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 A survey of 150 family office clients of \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  shows that 15% have already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/60-of-uber-rich-family-offices-considering-crypto-or-own-it-goldman-sachs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invested}}}\uc2  in crypto-assets and 45% want to take the plunge. The family offices manage more than $6 trillion in assets, meaning, even a small percentage of inflow from this sector could eventually boost crypto prices.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/8e488a3d-a57d-4d3f-ae34-280432e6caf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only the wealthy who are investing in cryptocurrencies. A recent survey by Gallup shows that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/number-of-investors-owning-bitcoin-has-tripled-since-2018-gallup-poll"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ownership}}}\uc2  among U.S. investors, with $10,000 or more invested in stocks, bonds, or mutual funds, has increased from 2% in 2018 to 6% as of June 2021.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  may soon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-will-reportedly-give-retail-wealth-clients-access-to-crypto-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allow}}}\uc2  its retail wealth clients to invest in cryptocurrencies. The bank\u8217\'20\'19s advisers may not be allowed to recommend crypto to their clients but they can execute trades requested by them.\par \par \uc2 All this shows that investor interest in the crypto sector continues to increase. Could this result in a sustained recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,569). The bulls did not give up much ground on July 22, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/ffa32e71-7a65-4490-92c1-670131d8dffb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has risen to just below the midpoint, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($34,352).\par \par \uc2 This level may attract selling from the bears but if bulls can overcome the resistance and push the price above it, the relief rally could rise to $36,670.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the 50-day SMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair to $28,000. If they succeed, the pair could witness panic selling, clearing the path for a possible drop to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the critical support at $1,728.74 rose above the 20-day EMA ($2,014) on July 22. This suggests that bears may be losing their grip. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen to the midpoint, indicating that bulls are attempting to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/0d7265b2-1cfa-4215-b929-731b7db895ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to challenge the 50-day SMA ($2,184) from where the previous relief rally had turned down on July 7. If the price turns down from this resistance once again, the bears will try to pull the price down to $1,728.74. A break below this support could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will signal a possible change in trend. The pair may pick up momentum on a break above $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to stall the relief rally in Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) near the downtrend line but a minor positive is that bulls have not given up much ground. The altcoin formed an inside day candlestick pattern on July 22, indicating indecision among bulls and bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b2a97fad-d79e-4f88-98ea-80f2913498d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the downtrend line and the 50-day SMA ($319), it will suggest a possible change in the short-term sentiment. The BNB/USDT pair could then rally to $380 and later to $433.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to pull the price down to $251.41. A break below this support will suggest that bears have absorbed the demand and the pair could then drop to the critical support at $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebound off $1 is struggling to rise and sustain above $1.19. This indicates the bears have not given up and are attempting to stall the recovery at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b93ec11d-f7cc-4d52-b068-df5ffd4e81bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1. A bounce off this level may keep the pair range-bound between $1 and $1.19 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($1.23) will clear the path for a possible rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The pair will turn negative and start a new downtrend if bears sink and sustain the price below $1. The next support to watch on the downside is $0.80 and then $0.68.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the critical support at $0.50 has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.61). This may prove to be a difficult hurdle for the bulls to cross as the altcoin has not closed above the 20-day EMA since May 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/fe731587-5728-4636-8cf1-9356bc624831.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.50. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the decline may extend to $0.45 and $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.70) and then to $0.75. A breakout and close above this level will suggest the start of a move back toward the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside day candlestick pattern on July 22, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The sellers are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $0.21 but the bulls are not giving up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/93d43158-cbf7-4e4b-9738-e6dbded50270.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the tight consolidation near the overhead resistance at $0.21 continues, it will indicate that bulls are not closing their positions as they anticipate a move higher. A breakout and close above $0.21 could open the doors for a move to the 50-day SMA ($0.25).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls fail to clear the hurdle at $0.21, the DOGE/USDT pair could again drop to $0.15. If the support holds, the pair may extend its stay between $0.15 and $0.21 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below $0.15 will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level at $13 on July 22 but they are facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($13.78). If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/e3944e2d-97ce-403d-9fe0-cdf8593355e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the psychological support at $10. If they succeed, the pair could resume its downtrend and drop to the next support at $7.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are losing their grip. That could result in a move to the overhead resistance at $16.93. A breakout and close above this level could start a sustained relief rally to $20 and then to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rebound has risen to the 20-day EMA ($17.85) where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f434a584-ca8e-4d72-8dbb-4fc077324ac6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price to the strong support at $13. A breakdown and close below this support will complete the descending triangle pattern, starting the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the UNI/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could start an up-move to $25 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-refreshes-record-high-as-axs-ascends-131-in-just-three-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Axie Infinity refreshes record high as AXS ascends 131% in just 3 days}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The rebound in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has reached the 20-day EMA ($461), which has acted as a stiff resistance in the past few days. The bears will again try to stall the relief rally at this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b7555b5c-0a56-476f-a8a1-642e838bf97d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USDT pair could again drop to the critical support at $370. A breakdown and close below this support will indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $538.11. If the price turns down from this level, the pair could remain stuck between the large range of $370 to $538.11 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $118 level on July 22, suggesting aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls will now try to extend the relief rally and push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($126).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/0873f664-23aa-430b-8daf-ff2d4af223d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, it will signal that the downtrend could be losing momentum. The LTC/USDT pair may then rally to the 50-day SMA ($142) where the bears could again mount a stiff resistance. A break above this resistance may indicate the start of a stronger relief rally.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA once again, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative. The bears will then make one more attempt to extend the down move. A break below $100 could open the doors for a fall to $70.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvMDllMDBmZmQtNTY0Ny00M2ExLWEzYTEtNzQ1NjhlNDZmMDZhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210723eh7n000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/21: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,774 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The strong recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins shows there is aggressive buying at lower levels but bears are unlikely to give up without a fight.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is leading the recovery in crypto markets today after the price rallied back above the $32,000 level. Sam Trabucco, a quantitative trader at Alameda Research, said the firm had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trading-firm-of-richest-crypto-billionaire-reveals-buying-a-lot-more-bitcoin-below-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased}}}\uc2  the dip in Bitcoin on July 20.\par \par \uc2 Trabucco said the sharp recovery in equity markets, fewer long liquidations in the crypto derivatives market and the possible end of FUD caused due to China mining ban and Grayscale unlocking could act as recovery catalysts that could boost the crypto rally further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/de55ea2c-49be-4c21-93d0-759a531097d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, analyst and podcast host Nebraskan Gooner {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rebounds-to-31-6k-but-warnings-of-another-btc-price-plunge-are-everywhere"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 views}}}\uc2  the recovery in Bitcoin as a shorting opportunity. Veteran trader Peter Brandt also expects Bitcoin to witness another downturn before a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The correction may open up opportunities for several new investors to enter the crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan director of asset and wealth management Mary Callahan Erdoes said in a recent interview with Bloomberg that several of the bank\u8217\'20\'19s clients want to invest in Bitcoin because they consider it as an asset class.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the levels where resistance may creep in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Aggressive selling by the bears pulled the price below $31,000 on July 19 and that was followed by another down move on July 20. However, the bulls purchased the dip below $30,000 today, resulting in a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b0afcfeb-4938-41f9-99ea-238d3a642172.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to stall the recovery at the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,643). If the price turns down from this resistance, the sellers will again try to sink the BTC/USDT pair below the critical support at $28,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend that could pull the price down to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could challenge the 50-day simple moving average ($34,599). A break above this resistance will be the first sign of strength and open the doors for a possible rally to $36,670.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the July 20 candlestick suggests that bulls purchased the dip to the strong support at $1,728.74. This is the third instance when Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has rebounded off this level since May 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/8475e60d-547a-4c76-b46f-e3ba810b1d40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rebound has gained momentum today and the buyers will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,008). If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($2,213) which could act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, the bears will again try to pull the price below $1,728.74. If they manage to do that, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend that may reach $1,536.92.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to clear the hurdle at the downtrend line to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the $251.41 support today which is a positive sign. This suggests that bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/dfb09ffa-0759-4d64-84e8-b1618d9b7df2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that bears are losing their grip. The BNB/USDT pair could then start its journey toward the overhead resistance at $433.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will indicate that bears are selling on rallies. The sellers will then again attempt to pull the price down to the critical support at $211.70. A break below this support could complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern and start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) plunged to the critical support at $1 on July 20 but the bulls aggressively purchased this dip, resulting in a strong rebound today. The relief rally could now reach the 20-day EMA ($1.25) where bears may offer a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/190036da-9200-4b3a-b7d1-af0acc216707.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA. If the momentum clears this hurdle, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, which could open the doors for a rally to $1.94.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $1. If that happens, panic selling may ensue and the pair could start its downward journey to $0.80 and then to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has bounced off the critical support at $0.50 today, indicating that bulls are attempting to defend this level aggressively. The rebound could rise to the 20-day EMA ($0.61), which is likely to act as a stiff hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/066d6a90-1aa9-472c-979e-502fe14ebee3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price once again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the price below the $0.50 support.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The next support is at $0.45 and then $0.40. Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are losing their grip. The pair may then rise to the overhead resistance at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has once again bounced off the $0.15 support today, suggesting that bulls are aggressively attempting to defend this level. The relief rally could now reach the overhead resistance at $0.21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/aac42aa8-638e-4164-ac10-4c135712efa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears will try to stall the rally at $0.21. If the price turns down from this resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair could again drop to $0.15 and remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout of $0.21 will be the first sign of strength and could result in a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.26). On the contrary, if the price turns down and plummets below $0.15, the pair may witness panic selling and could drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plummeted near the psychological level at $10 on July 20 where buying emerged. This has resulted in a strong recovery today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/e72df44f-1b22-46bb-9793-9dcf7d7c6216.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers may face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($14). If the price turns down from this resistance, bears will again attempt to sink the DOT/USDT pair below $10. If they succeed, the downtrend could extend to $7.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could move up to the 50-day SMA ($17.82). A breakout and close above this resistance will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $16.93 on July 19 and started its southward march toward the next critical support at $13 but the bulls had other plans. They purchased at lower levels today, resulting in a strong recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/6c885bff-48ea-4d65-8e53-e62c6a073581.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up-move could face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($17.89). If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears may fancy their chances and will again try to sink the UNI/USDT pair below $13.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend and slide to the psychological support at $10. Conversely, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may reach the downtrend line. A breakout of this resistance will indicate that bears are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/it-is-time-for-the-us-to-create-a-ripple-test-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 It is time for the US to create a \u8216\'20\'18Ripple test\u8217\'20\'19 for crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) dropped to $383.53 on July 20 from where it is attempting to start a relief rally. This suggests that bulls are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/ae6e127b-17be-4346-829a-165ee5129e53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The pullback could reach the 20-day EMA ($465) where bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the sellers will make one more attempt to sink the BCH/USDT pair below $370.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the decline could extend to the next support at $330. On the other hand, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $538.11.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $118 support on July 19, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The decline had pushed the RSI into oversold territory, suggesting that selling was overdone in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/185590ce-3a0c-43d4-a31b-3fd1f0caabe1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair has started a recovery today and may retest the breakdown level at $118. If bears flip this level into resistance, the pair could make one more attempt to resume the downtrend. A break below the $100 psychological support could start the next leg of the down move that may reach $70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push and sustain the price above $118, the pair could climb up to the 20-day EMA ($127) where bears may again try to stall the relief rally. If they succeed, the pair could again turn down but if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, a rally to the 50-day SMA ($145) is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvYjExNWI1YTYtMTk5NC00NjQ0LWFkNGUtMGY0MGQ4NGM4YTgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210721eh7l000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin investment product volumes fall to 38% of YTD average\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 359 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are quietly loading up on ETH, with Ether investment products recording their third consecutive week of inflows.\par \par \uc2 Institutions are continuing to sit on the sidelines of the Bitcoin markets, with BTC investment products volumes dropping to just 38% of its year-to year-to-date (YTD) average over the past week.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 July 19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flow Weekly report, Bitcoin investment products {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 generated}}}\uc2  roughly $3.9 billion worth of daily trade from July 12 to July 16, down substantially from 2021\u8217\'20\'19s average of nearly $10 billion.\par \par \uc2 However, the report\u8217\'20\'19s authors do not conclude the decline in trade activity is cause for alarm, with \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  noting that Bitcoin has experienced \u8220\'20\'1Csimilar seasonal dips in volumes during the summer months in recent years.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Institutional Bitcoin products also saw outflows of $10.4 million for the week, with investors now having net reduced their BTC exposure for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-cautious-as-crypto-products-post-weakest-volume-since-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nine of the past 10 weeks}}}\uc2 . Despite such, the volume of outflows witnessed during July have dwindled compared to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-selling-of-crypto-reaches-longest-streak-since-feb-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent months}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The largest outflow from Bitcoin products on record occurred between May 10 and May 14 \u8212\'20\'14 when institutional investors pulled {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-dump-btc-as-volume-soars-for-ether-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $98 million from the markets}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b9644ac7-9db6-429e-b772-5c185d0c9b8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flows by Provider: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 While institutional investors have continued to reduce exposure to BTC, Ether (ETH) investment products posted a third consecutive week of inflows this past week.\par \par \uc2 Roughly $11.7 million flowed into Ether products, bringing YTD inflows up to $973 million for 2021 so far. However, Bitcoin products dominate the institutional \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  products sector by YTD flows, receiving $4.1 billion from investors since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-documentary-featuring-vitalik-buterin-raises-1-9m-in-3-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum documentary featuring Vitalik Buterin raises $1.9M in 3 days}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) products saw the second-largest inflows behind Ether, with investors increasing \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure by $400,000. Ripple (XRP) and Polkadot (DOT)-tracking products also saw inflows of $300,000 each, followed by Stellar (XLM) with $200,000.\par \par \uc2 Despite recent bullishness, inflows to multi-asset products dwindled down to just $100,000 for the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvMDgzZTVhYjctZjZhNC00MDY2LWFmODYtM2VkMzlmMGMzNzkzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210720eh7k00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bears tighten their grip on Bitcoin price after BTC and altcoins fell below critical support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the immediate support at $31,000 today and that has resulted in selling across several major altcoins. Coincidently, the fresh push to the downside in Bitcoin has come a day after the much talked about unlocking of shares worth about 16,000 Bitcoin from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The sell-off in cryptocurrencies could also be due to the broader risk-off sentiment on concerns of rising Covid-19 cases. The Dow Jones Industrial Average {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/07/18/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  over 800 points on Monday, on track for its worst decline of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/46f6c3e08e9c7411ed92b6f9021b29fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  environment, positive statements are generally ignored. While speaking to CNBC on July 19, Grayscale CEO Michael Sonnenshein {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-100-committed-to-turning-gbtc-into-bitcoin-etf-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 projected}}}\uc2  a positive picture about the possibility of a Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) receiving regulatory approval.\par \par \uc2 Sonnenshein said it was only a matter of \u8220\'20\'1Cwhen\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cnot if\u8221\'20\'1D that one of the ETF applications will be greenlighted. He also said that GBTC would be transformed into an ETF when the conditions are right.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical levels on the downside that could attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the $31,000 support for the past four days but could not achieve a strong rebound off it. This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/bf963d851ecff91837ef842a4481a8ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have renewed their selling and pulled the price below $31,000 today. There is a minor support at $30,000 but if this support cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $28,000.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have turned down and the relative strength index (RSI) has slipped below 38, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may not let go of the $30,000 support easily. If they achieve a strong rebound off it and push the price back above $31,000, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. A breakout and close above the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,966) will be the first sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($2,034) as seen from the long wick on the July 18 candlestick. This suggests that negative sentiment prevails and bears are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f6e5a9bfb180e2407b61aa3a1503cec0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the price below the critical support at $1,723.74. If they manage to do that, the selling could pick up momentum and the ETH/USDT pair could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is $1,536.92 and if this level also fails to hold, the pair could slide to $1,293.18.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $1,728.74, the bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. A breakout and close above the 50-day simple moving average ($2,245) will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After staying close to the 20-day EMA ($307) for the past few days, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing renewed selling pressure today. The altcoin could now drop to the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/f8f9263a961ad562549a1d0eca80f748.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has slipped into the negative zone, indicating that the momentum has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If bears sink the price below the support zone, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $211.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone, the bulls will again try to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($327). If they manage to do that, it will be the first sign of a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) closed below the $1.19 support on July 16. The bulls tried to trap the bears and push the price back above $1.19 on July 18 but failed to sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears continue to sell at rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/a8be55a9d6c44088e2fb7e38945905a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have renewed their selling today. If sellers sink the price below $1.10, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the critical support at $1. This level has held on several occasions in the past few months, hence the bulls will again try to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound will indicate accumulation at the $1 support. On the other hand, if bears pull the price below $1, long liquidation may occur. That could open the doors for a further decline to $0.80 and then $0.68.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke below the $0.59 support on July 16. The bulls tried to push the price back above this level on July 18 but they could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears continue to sell at rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/32e5e1f2b2f0a39c0024ddcc497453f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has resumed the downtrend today and the next stop could be the psychological support at $0.50. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If buyers can push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($0.63), it will signal the start of a relief rally that may reach the 50-day SMA ($0.74).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if sellers sink the price below $0.50, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may slide to $0.45. If this level also fails to hold, the decline could extend to the next support at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.15 support on July 17 but the bulls could not clear the $0.21 resistance. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are defending the $0.21 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/16dd6032c19d599ae648614c520a888c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above $0.21 has attracted selling by the bears who will now attempt to pull the price below the critical support at $0.15. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the DOGE/USDT pair may slide to $0.10 and then to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.15, the pair may again rise to $0.21 and remain range-bound for a few days. A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.21) will be the first sign that buyers are attempting to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the critical support at $13 on July 16. The bulls attempted to push the price back above the level on July 17 and 18 but failed. This shows that the previous support has flipped to resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/7f93bfdfd5365894b1fae5d89da73483.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling has resumed today and the DOT/USDT pair could drop to psychological support at $10. This level may attract buying from the bulls and they will again try to push the price back above $13.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($14.48) will be the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. Alternatively, if bears sink the price below $10, the selling may continue and the pair could slide to the next support at $7.80.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) back above $16.93 on July 18 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears defended the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/27b9d1c47437acfb87ebb653acca9cdc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Renewed selling today has started the downward journey of the UNI/USDT pair toward the next support at $15. If this support also fails to hold, the decline could extend to the critical level at $13.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have defended this level twice before, hence the price may rebound off $13. A strong rebound will suggest aggressive buying at the level. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below $13, the next leg of the downtrend could begin. The pair could then drop to $10 and later to $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-warns-a-crypto-drop-is-coming-amid-ipo-filing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robinhood warns a crypto drop is coming amid IPO filing}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to arrest the decline in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) on July 17 and 18 but the failure to achieve a strong rebound indicates a lack of aggressive buying. The bears renewed their selling today and have pulled the price below the immediate support at $428.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/73c1c230940aff021c8ee391faf69711.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the price below $428, the pair could continue its slide and hit the critical support at $370. The buyers may attempt to defend this support and a strong rebound will indicate accumulation at lower levels. A break above the 20-day EMA ($475) will be the first sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a weak bounce off $370 will suggest that buyers are still not convinced that the pair has bottomed out. That could increase the possibility of a break below $370. If that happens, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to $330.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to rebound off the $118 support in the past few days indicates a lack of demand from the bulls. The bears have taken advantage of the situation and pulled the price below $118 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/cae0c82524a00718bbf7deece9858194.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below $118 will complete the descending triangle pattern. The bulls may attempt to stall the decline at the psychological level at $100 but if they fail, the decline could extend to the next support at $70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price recovers and rises back above $118, it will suggest buying at lower levels. The bulls will then again attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($130). If they succeed, it will signal the start of a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($148).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81ZjIxODI4YTU2NzExMzg5MDk1MjlhNmU2MGJkN2U2Yi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210719eh7j000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/16: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,008 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls defended the $31,000 level again, but data shows demand for BTC and altcoins is weak and this heightens the chase of further downside.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near $31,000, which makes it an important level to watch out for. Data from Glassnode shows that the $31,000 to $34,300 zone has seen strong {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bounces-off-31k-after-bank-of-america-greenlights-btc-futures-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interest}}}\uc2  from buyers and sellers as 9.93% of the Bitcoin supply has moved in this zone.\par \par \uc2 The failure of Bitcoin to rally quickly from strong support levels indicates weak demand. Proof of the current disinterest comes from BlackRock CEO Larry Fink, who said in a recent CNBC interview that investor demand for cryptocurrencies had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-signals-low-demand-for-crypto-from-long-term-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined}}}\uc2  recently. Fink said that during his last two weeks of business travel, not one question about Bitcoin and crypto investing was presented to him.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/66f53ef8-43d6-4750-b924-ecf90b4c2c37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another sign of reduced demand is that the 90-day inflow into the United States and Canada-based Bitcoin funds has plunged 93.49% from 191,846 BTC in January to 12,485 BTC, according to data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-outflows-from-canada-s-biggest-bitcoin-fund-see-btc-reserves-drop-by-50"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 collected}}}\uc2  by ByteTree Asset Management.\par \par \uc2 In an interview with CNBC on July 14, DoubleLine CEO Jeffrey Gundlach said that Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doubleline-ceo-sees-bitcoin-buy-moment-at-23k-predicts-us-dollar-will-drop-pretty-substantially"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop}}}\uc2  under $23,000 due to the head-and-shoulders trading pattern, which \u8220\'20\'1Clooks pretty convincing.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin break below the support and start the next leg down or is it due for a rebound? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading near the $31,000 support for the past two days. The failure to rebound sharply off this critical support is a weak sign as it suggests a lack of strong demand at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b14f57b4-395d-4290-985c-e738f4e650a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below $31,000 could open the doors for a drop to the next support at $28,000.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the $31,000 to $28,000 zone with strength, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The bulls will then try to push the price above the moving averages. A breakout and close above the 50-day simple moving average ($35,084) will be the first sign of a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below $28,000, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the BTC/USDT pair could slump to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally on July 14 could not rise above the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,097). This suggests that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally. The biggest altcoin could now drop to the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/8dbdfe5c-2589-41c1-8aff-975c2281e156.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is below 41, indicating that bears are in control. If bears sink the price below $1,728.74, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 That could signal the resumption of the downtrend with the next support at $1,536.92 and then $1,293.18.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the $1,728.74 support, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the moving averages. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($313) for the past few days. Although the price dipped below the 20-day EMA on July 14, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/11507270-a423-4eec-965c-3bb5de41e4e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($329) on July 15 but failed. This shows the bears have not yet given up and are aggressively defending the 50-day SMA. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 50-day SMA will be the first sign of strength. The bulls will then try to push the price to $379.58 and later to $400. On the contrary, a break below the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone will signal advantage to the bears. That could pull the price down to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebound off $1.19 on July 14 could not climb back above $1.28, suggesting that bears are defending this level aggressively. The price turned down from $1.28 on July 15 and plunged below $1.19 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1c71375a-9460-4096-ac08-7384ff251e8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are again attempting to stall the decline and start a relief rally. A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($1.32) will be the first sign of strength. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.44).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears sustain the price below $1.19, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could continue its decline to $1.10. A break below this support may retest the critical support at $1. This level has held on several occasions since Feb. 26, hence the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $1 will indicate accumulation at lower levels but the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance at $1.19. If the price turns down from this level, the possibility of a break below $1 increases. If that happens, the pair could start a new downtrend with the next support at $0.80.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the $0.59 support for the past two days but have not been able to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests a lack of urgency among traders to buy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/efe66dea-b37c-4851-8192-f9177aa0fcb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 suggest that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below $0.59 could pull the price down to the critical support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.50 with strength, the bulls will again try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.65). If they succeed, the pair could rise to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears sink the price below $0.50, the pair could drop to the next support at $0.45 and later to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has continued to drift lower toward the critical support at $0.15. This level had held on two previous occasions, hence the bulls will again try to defend it aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/4cecf3a8-15cf-4746-a4d6-105ed59d7ea5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.15, the bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.22). If they can pull it off, it will suggest the start of a relief rally that may reach the 50-day SMA ($0.27).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $0.15, the selling could intensify as traders rush to the exit. That could result in a fall to $0.10 and later to $0.07. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that the possibility of a breakdown is higher.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to drive Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back above $14.50 in the past two days indicates a lack of demand at higher levels. That resulted in further selling today, sinking the altcoin below the critical support at $13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c6388c44-a374-4c9a-ab24-8cc32d257732.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is near the oversold territory, suggesting that bears are in command. If the price sustains below $13, the DOT/USDT pair could decline to the next support at $10.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may try to arrest the decline at the psychological level at $10 but any relief rally is likely to face resistance at $13. If the bears flip this level into resistance, the possibility of a drop to $7 increases. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($15.38).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) attempt to rebound off the $16.93 support on July 14 did not find buyers at higher levels. The altcoin turned down on July 15 and broke below $16.93 today but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c1813113-e2ad-426e-97a5-e23d0141d898.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $16.93, the bulls will again try to push the price to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price sustains below $16.93, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $15 and later to the critical support at $13. Both moving averages have turned down and the RSI has dipped below 40, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $13, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. This could resume the downtrend with the next support at $10 and then $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-passes-32k-with-traders-wary-of-relief-rally-if-resistance-stays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price passes $32K with traders wary of 'relief rally' if resistance stays}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) back above $475.69 on July 14 but failed. This suggests that bears have flipped the $475.69 level to resistance. The altcoin turned down and resumed its down move on July 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/18faacbf-c86a-47e5-a115-8ba0fb87df71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $428. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the BCH/USDT pair above $475.69. If they succeed, the pair may rise to $538.11. A breakout of this resistance will indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues its down move and breaks below $428, the pair could drop to the psychological level at $400 and then $370. The declining moving averages and the RSI below 36 suggest that bears are in control. A break below $370 could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $118 support on July 14 fizzled out at the downtrend line on July 15. This suggests that bears are defending the downtrend line aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3feac9d3-5522-4190-9c3c-7315df3e8f90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 36 suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink and sustain the price below $118, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to the $104.92 to $100 support zone.\par \par \uc2 This zone may attract buyers but if bulls fail to propel the price back above $118, the selling might continue. A break below $100 could extend the decline to the next support at $70. This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvZmFiMGM3OWMtZmZkZS00NGU4LTgxMTQtMjI1NTVhZTM3ZWZjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210716eh7g000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/14: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,958 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are bouncing off strong support levels, indicating possible accumulation by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has once again held the critical support area at $31,000 today, indicating accumulation at lower levels. This led some analysts to speculate that traders were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sell-off-continues-as-btc-nears-31k-ahead-of-powell-s-speech"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling}}}\uc2  their holdings to investors with a low history of selling in anticipation that \u8220\'20\'1Ca supply shock\u8221\'20\'1D to occur when the re-accumulation process completes.\par \par \uc2 Another sign of strong hands entering the crypto market was seen when Capital International Group, a $2.3 trillion asset manager, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/capital-international-group-purchases-12-2-stake-in-microstrategy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased}}}\uc2  a 12.3% stake in \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , which many believe to be a sort of Bitcoin proxy stock because it holds 105,084 Bitcoin on its books. This acquisition suggests the asset manager is taking indirect exposure to Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/4bc1f354-c7c6-4248-b756-9a8b43c5a13c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The United States Consumer Price Index (CPI) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-community-divided-on-whether-bitcoin-is-an-inflation-hedge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged}}}\uc2  0.9% in June 2021 over the previous month and 5.4% from a year earlier, this is the fastest pace in nearly 13 years. However, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to respond positively to the spike in inflation has ignited a debate on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s billing as an inflation hedge. News outlet Fortune said this made Bitcoin a doubtful hedge against inflation.\par \par \uc2 In a bear phase, the markets usually tend to overlook the triggers in the short term. During such a period, the smart money continues to accumulate and eventually, the price action catches up with fundamentals. Therefore, writing off Bitcoin with only a few months of data may not be the right thing to do.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical support and resistance levels, which may signal the start of the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick today indicates that bulls are defending the $31,000 level aggressively. However, buyers will face a stiff resistance from the bears at the 20-day exponential moving average ($33,973).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/6b0d2bbe-e0d7-45e3-b8b4-875589e50e73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below $31,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could challenge the next critical support at $28,000. This may be a make-or-break level for the bulls because if it cracks, the selling may intensify. The next major support on the downside is $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could reach the 50-day simple moving average ($35,361). A breakout and close above this level will be the first indication that sellers are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 That will also increase the possibility of a break above $36,670. If that happens, the pair could start its journey toward the $41,330 to $42,451.67 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($2,135) from July 9 to 12 may have attracted selling by short-term traders. That pulled the price below the psychological level at $2,000 on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b4ee1dba-8bf8-45f1-8d5d-cbe5f5c1906a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears could not sustain the selling pressure and sink the price to the critical support at $1,738.74. This is a positive sign as it shows buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now once again try to propel the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price to $1,728.74. A break below this support could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($313) on July 13, indicating that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are not willing to give up and are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/39485e87-f1c7-4ac9-bfdc-010e731013e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($331) to signal strength.\par \par \uc2 That will clear the path for an up-move to $379.58 and later to the stiff overhead resistance at $433. On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, the bears will try to pull the BNB/USDT pair below the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone. If they succeed, the decline could extend to $251.41 and then to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1.35) from July 9 to 12 may have resulted in profit-booking by short-term traders. That pulled the price below the $1.28 support on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/01c01e64-f62d-40de-b283-b0094781b757.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the support at $1.19. However, the 20-day EMA has started to slope down and the RSI has tumbled below 42, suggesting that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $1.28, it will indicate selling on minor rallies and that will increase the prospects of a decline to $1.10 and then $1. Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal strength. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.46).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has gradually drifted down to the horizontal support at $0.59. This is an important level for the bulls because if they fail to defend it, the bears will attack the June 22 low at $0.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/77a85de3-79db-43c4-8c48-d18959c5c01a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The declining moving averages and the RSI below 40 suggest that bears are in command. A break and close below $0.50 will open the doors for a possible decline to $0.45 and then to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.66). If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.75. A breakout and close above this level will signal strength.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $0.21 support on July 12, which suggests that supply exceeds demand. The failure of the bulls to defend $0.21 clears the path for a retest of the critical level at $0.15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/329bd8cd-94dc-4b01-9742-586da59abdef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The descending moving averages and the RSI below 36 indicate that bears are in control. If bears pull the price below the $0.15 support, the selling could intensify and the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 However, the $0.15 level has held on two previous occasions, hence the bulls may again try to defend it aggressively. A strong bounce off it could push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.21. A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.23) will signal that bulls are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) tight consolidation between $14.50 and $16.93 ended with a breakdown on July 13, which shows that supply exceeds demand. That pulled the price down to the critical support at $13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/482e9431-aa19-4635-92c7-f6778b09f228.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 37 indicate that bears are in control. A break and close below the $13 support will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The next support is the psychological level at $10.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the price above $14.50. If they succeed, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $16.93. If this happens it could set the stage for a strong relief rally.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($19.81) on July 12, which indicates that bears have overpowered the bulls. There is a minor support at $16.93 but if the level gives in, the altcoin could drop to $15 and then to $13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/2c20e510-344e-450a-8f5b-37d62f766d83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has dropped into the negative zone, indicating the path of least resistance is to the downside. A breakdown and close below $13 will complete a descending triangle pattern, suggesting the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level or $15, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will invalidate and the UNI/USDT pair could move up to $25 and then $27.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brazilian-securities-regulator-approves-ether-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Brazilian securities regulator approves Ether ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) between $475.69 and $538.11 resolved to the downside on July 13. This suggests that supply exceeds demand as bulls are not confident that a bottom has been made.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/ec6990ab-24f5-4d85-8b86-e2a3187b2c00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting an advantage to the bears. If the price sustains below $475, the BCH/USDT pair could gradually drop to $428 and then to the next major support at $370.\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to push the price back above $475.69. If they manage to do that, it will indicate buying at lower levels. A breakout and close above $538.11 will be the first sign of the start of a stronger relief rally.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a descending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakdown and close below $118. The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/83754f4b-756f-4226-a3f1-98b47989da62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, both moving averages are sloping down gradually and the RSI is below 40, suggesting that bears are in control. Any relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this level and breaks below $118, the LTC/USDT pair could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is the psychological level at $100 but if it cracks, the decline could extend to $70. On the contrary, if the bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the pattern. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($154) and later to $180.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNjVlZjg5MGUtYzVlYy00MGYxLWFjMTktMTFkYTk3NzdlMzYzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210714eh7e000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares weekly report\par \b \uc2 Institutions cautious as crypto products post weakest volume since October\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 356 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 While North American institutional investors reduce exposure to BTC, their European counterparts are injecting capital into the markets.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors are yet to regain confidence in the crypto markets, with weekly crypto investment product volume dropping to its lowest level since October 2020.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Monday "\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly" report, $1.58 billion worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  products changed hands between July 5 and July 9.\par \par \uc2 Crypto investment products also saw outflows of $4 million for the week, with roughly $7 million exiting Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  )-tracking products. However, European Bitcoin products saw inflows overall, suggesting some investors believe the worst of 2021\u8217\'20\'19s bear market may be behind us.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) products also saw minor inflows of $800,000 for the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/51a16d0a-23af-46b2-b281-e052868ceab0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Capital flows for institutional crypto products: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest data suggests institutional investors are sitting on the fence after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/turning-bullish-institutions-are-net-buyers-of-crypto-for-the-first-time-in-5-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous week\u8217\'20\'19s brief \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  recovery}}}\uc2  that saw $63 million injected into BTC and ETH products combined.\par \par \uc2 Institutional Bitcoin products have now posted outflows for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-selling-of-crypto-reaches-longest-streak-since-feb-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 8 of the last 9 weeks}}}\uc2 . Sophisticated investors also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-turn-bearish-on-eth-as-record-50m-exits-ether-investment-products"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offloaded Ether exposure}}}\uc2  last month, with outflows totaling $64.3 million since the week ending on June 6.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-under-33k-but-on-chain-data-hints-at-btc-accumulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price falls under $33K, but on-chain data hints at BTC accumulation}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite investors appearing cautious on BTC and ETH, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  notes that multi-asset products have continued to see inflows as institutions spread their risk across the sector, posting inflows of $1.2 million.\par \par \uc2 Multi-asset products have seen year-to-date (YTD) inflows of $362 million, and now represent 16.5% of assets under management (AUM) of multi-asset funds. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  wrote:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile the inflows remain relatively small in comparison to Bitcoin and Ethereum, the data does imply that investors are increasingly looking to diversify their \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Investors also showed interest in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), with inflows totaling $600,00 last week. Despite the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-woes-continue-as-clear-junction-pulls-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 regulatory scrutiny aimed at Binance}}}\uc2 , Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) products saw inflows of $400,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNzdkMDIzMzEtMTRlNy00NmIxLTlkMzEtZTYzZDlkNGU0YTU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210713eh7d0005v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,859 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is drifting lower, pulling altcoins to critical support levels and testing the resolve of traders who were looking for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) roof has been shifting lower in the past few days, which is a negative sign because it shows that bears are selling on every minor rally. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness is affecting the major altcoins as most are gradually drifting lower.\par \par \uc2 Joel Kruger, a Forex strategist at LMAX, recently said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt would be foolish to rule out the possibility for a drop back {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/strong-bitcoin-accumulation-spotted-as-btc-price-refuses-to-fall-below-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 below}}}\uc2  the June low, and we think there would be a risk in that scenario where the Bitcoin price could revisit the old record high area around $20,000.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/05b97d7b-b96e-46f0-b58b-06b07f7c46e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fundamentals {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/countdown-to-grayscale-s-big-btc-unlock-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seem}}}\uc2  to be improving. The network hashrate had taken a big knock due to China's recent crackdown on miners, but it is gradually coming back on track according to data from various on-chain sources. This shows how the network has balanced itself without the need for assistance from any external agency.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price follow the hashrate higher or will negative sentiment prevail? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been struggling to rise above the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,245). This is a negative sign as it shows that bears are aggressively defending this resistance. The price has turned down from the 20-day EMA today and the bears will now try to pull the price down to $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/ec409eb8-c27b-4428-936f-8ed2f43dfb3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down again and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped below 45, indicating that bears are attempting to gain the upper hand. A break and close below $31,000 will be the first sign of the possible resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The selling could intensify further if the $28,000 support cracks. That could result in long liquidation, which may pull the price down to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate accumulation by the bulls. A break above the 50-day simple moving average ($35,594) and the $36,670 resistance zone will signal strength.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers have been struggling to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($2,17) for the past three days, which indicates stiff resistance from the bears at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c30d0805-519e-4e05-ae4a-85d56f938129.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers are currently attempting to sink the ETH/USDT pair below the psychological support at $2,000. If they manage to do that, the pair may drop to $1,728.74. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls are attempting to make a comeback. The buyers will then try to thrust the price above the 50-day SMA ($2,339).\par \par \uc2 This level may act as a stiff resistance but if the pair climbs above it, the next stop could be the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past five days. This tight consolidation suggests that bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA ($313) and bears are defending the 50-day SMA ($333).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/d64f2cba-a5e3-4ba4-a79c-659b3a4a96c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, this tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $379.58. If bulls clear this hurdle, the up-move could reach $433.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone. A break below this zone could pull the price down to the critical support at $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($1.37) and the horizontal support at $1.28 for the past three days. This tight consolidation suggests that both the bulls and the bears are waiting for a clear direction before placing large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/4394b5dd-c7e9-426a-843a-bd4fc863f130.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are nearly flat and the RSI is above 44, indicating an equilibrium between buyers and sellers. This advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the $1.28 support gives way. That will clear the path for a possible drop to $1.20 and then $1.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $1.28, the bulls will try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.47) and then to the downtrend line. A break above this resistance will be the first sign that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to stay above the $0.21 support, which suggests a lack of buying as traders are not confident of a rally. This increases the possibility of a break below $0.21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/cc31910b-dacd-4dcb-9543-43e0bd7bafd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the next important level at $0.15. A break below this support could result in panic selling. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 38 indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to propel the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair may recover to the 50-day SMA ($0.28) and then to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.67) and the horizontal support at $0.59. This suggests that bears are selling on minor rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f9a812a6-83a7-4534-8d19-5cad49a2a2ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink and sustain the price below $0.59, the XRP/USDT pair could retest the critical support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls because if it cracks, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. To negate this possibility, the bulls will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA and the horizontal resistance at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) range has shrunk further and the price is stuck between $14.50 and $16.93. The negative sign is that the price has been trading near the support of this consolidation, indicating that bulls are in no hurry to buy at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/19d124b8-8114-4500-b318-e366cf796113.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($16.37) is sloping down marginally and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. If bears sink the price below $14.50, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $13.\par \par \uc2 This is an important support to watch out for because if it gives way, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $14.50, the bulls will again try to clear the hurdle at $16.93. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($19.59).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages. The bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA ($20.21) but have not been able to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($22.07). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/066fcb1e-f067-47bc-a0b6-7824a7c6e1c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. A breakout and close above the 50-day SMA will tilt this advantage in favor of the bulls. That could clear the path for an up-move to $25 and then $27.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips and closes below the 20-day EMA, it will signal advantage to the bears. The UNI/USDT pair could then drop to the next support at $16.93. If this support also cracks, the decline may extend to $15.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/synthetix-hits-one-month-high-as-snx-rallies-25-ahead-of-layer-2-exchange-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Synthetix hits one-month high as SNX rallies 25% ahead of layer 2 exchange launch}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($512) and the horizontal support at $475 for the past four days. This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/6914a0b3-2f3f-496b-bcaf-8ba2df2f81fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA continues to slope down gradually and the RSI is below 41, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If bears sink the price below $475.69, the short-term bulls may dump their positions. That could pull the price down to $428.\par \par \uc2 If this support also cracks, the BCH/USDT pair may drop to the critical support at $370. Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $475.69, the bulls will try to propel the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair may rise to $538.11.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above this resistance will be the first sign of strength. The pair could then move up to the 50-day SMA ($578) and later to $650.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($139) for the past few days but the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the bears to sustain the price below the critical support at $118.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/5e6a74e6-c327-47bf-ab6a-7f65ee293a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels. The RSI has been trying to rise above 46 and if that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($156) followed by a rally to $180. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to $118. A breakdown and close below this support could signal the resumption of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvOGExYzg0ZGYtOTJhNC00ZjBlLTk2NTktMzhiYmMzNTQ1ZjU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210712eh7c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/9: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,000 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical indicators and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s tightening price range suggest that a sharp, trend-changing breakout in BTC and altcoins is brewing.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, Fan Yifei, the deputy governor of the \uc2 People\u8217\'20\'19s Bank of China\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-s-central-bank-worried-about-stablecoins-risk-to-financial-systems"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  that stablecoins like Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pose \u8220\'20\'1Crisks and challenges to the international monetary system, and payments and settlement system\u8221\'20\'1D. Fan did not even spare Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and called it a tool for speculation and a possible threat to \u8220\'20\'1Cfinancial security and social stability.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Other than the FUD from China, several traders have been focusing on the unlocking of a large amount of Bitcoin at the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  as a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. However, market analysis by crypto trading firm QCP Capital said the event {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-will-likely-shrug-off-530m-gbtc-unlock-in-july-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 won\u8217\'20\'19t}}}\uc2  have any \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant impact on the overall market outside of GBTC itself.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/abfa4b9a-f177-411d-93bd-f2e82ec23f39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On a more positive front, analyst William Clemente said that more than 50,000 new Bitcoin entities are coming on-chain a day and it is not only retail that has been buying. According to Clemente, whales have started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-bitcoin-entities-near-all-time-high-as-analyst-heralds-positive-whale-activity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating}}}\uc2  and their overall holdings have increased by 65,429 BTC.\par \par \uc2 The big question for traders remains whether to buy in the current zone or wait for a further fall. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the possible path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading in the lower half of the $31,000 to $42,451.67 rectangle for the past few days. This is a negative sign as it shows that demand dries up at higher levels and bears are not waiting for a sharp rally to initiate short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1b57d682-9296-43dd-ad43-bf4b6baa42c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($34,440) has started to turn down again and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped below 46, suggesting that bears have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the BTC/USDT pair below the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone. However, it is unlikely to be easy because the bulls will mount a strong defense at the zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level or rebounds off $31,000, the buyers will again try to push the price to $36,670. A breakout of this resistance will be the first indication of strength. That will clear the path for an up-move to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 But if the $28,000 support collapses, panic selling may ensue as stops of traders who have been accumulating above $31,000 may hit. The next support on the downside is $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day simple moving average ($2,350) on July 7 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. That may have attracted profit-booking by short-term traders and shorting by aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/235a138d-00b5-45b2-acb5-f0ec23e86124.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair dropped below the 20-day EMA ($2,203) on July 8 but the positive sign is that the bulls are aggressively defending the support at $2,000. If buyers thrust the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. A break above this level will be the first indication that the correction may be ending.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $2,000. If they succeed, the pair could drop to the next critical support at $1,728.74. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up and the decline could extend to $1,536.92.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) hit a wall at the 50-day SMA ($231), which suggests that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The sellers will now try to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($312).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/4e58e2e3-c52e-4594-b726-0269780933ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the $276.40 to $264.26 support zone. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rises from the current level or rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to $379.58 and then to $433.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below $264.26, the next stop could be $211.70. A break below this level will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure to rebound off the 20-day EMA ($1.38) between July 5 to July 7 indicated a lack of buying in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). Due to this, the short-term traders may have booked profits on July 8, which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/36d4a522-d3f1-40ca-b32b-084b32807165.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has rebounded off the $1.28 support today. The bulls will now try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($1.47) and drive the pair to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the pair below $1.28. If that happens, the pair may drop to the critical support at $1. This remains the level to watch on the downside because a break below it could result in long liquidation. If that happens, the pair may drop to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $0.21 support on July 8. However, the positive sign is that the bulls did not dump their positions on the break but bought the dip. This indicates accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/ced75046-ad2d-4657-ac17-98b34b034803.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.24). Such a move will be the first indication that buyers are attempting to a comeback. Above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.29) and then to the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that buying dries up at higher levels. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price to the critical support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to propel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($0.68) in the past few days shows that demand dries up at higher levels. Traders who were anticipating a break above the 20-day EMA seem to be liquidating their positions, resulting in a break below the $0.63 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/cb19019d-d2c7-498b-a4d3-5fbf24705e19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not push and sustain the price above $0.63 quickly, the bears will try to capitalize on the advantage and pull the price below $0.58. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 A break below this level may result in panic selling. The next support on the downside is at the support line of the descending channel. This negative view will be nullified if the price turns up and breaks above $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $16.93 on July 7 but they could not sustain the higher levels. The bears dragged the price back into the $13 to $16.93 range on July 8. This suggests that bears are not willing to let go of their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/9b4937f7-0f5a-41c1-b978-91f7e99a3db7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to break the immediate support at $14.50 and pull the price down to $13. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $13, the downtrend could resume and the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the psychological support at $10. This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $17.66.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($22.03) on July 6 and 7 but they could not sustain the breakout. This suggests the bears sold at higher levels and tried to trap the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1075fcd5-847e-4b21-9fb4-a05f8d4071cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The price has rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($20.21) today but the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could start its northward march to $30. On the other hand, if the pair drops below the uptrend line, it will signal that bears have the upper hand. The pair could then slide down to $15 and then $13.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-a-miracle-and-better-than-gold-says-apple-co-founder-wozniak"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is a miracle and better than gold, says Apple co-founder Wozniak}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $475.69 and $538.11 for the past few days. Usually, such a tight consolidation near the resistance results in a breakout to the upside but that has not yet happened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/0c474943-6571-4991-b8b9-51230175c00e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above the overhead resistance may attract profit-booking from short-term traders. That could result in a break below the tight range. If that happens, the BCH/USDT pair could decline to $428.43 and later to $370.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($518) is sloping down marginally and the RSI is below 44, which suggests the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $538.11. That could open the doors for a rally to $650.35.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($34.43) on July 7 but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at the downtrend line. The bears sold at this resistance and pulled the price back below the moving averages on July 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1ff14940-1839-4520-80f9-126d26701bc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the support at $31.36. If buyers push the price above the moving averages, the SOL/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. A breakout of this resistance may result in a rally to $44.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the pair may trade between $31.36 and the downtrend line for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers. The bears may gain the upper hand if the $31.36 support cracks. That could result in a decline to $26.65.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNWViZDkwMzItNmVjZC00MTE4LTgxNTEtYmM0ODJiNWE1YTk5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210709eh790008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/7: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,942 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical indicators for Bitcoin and several major altcoins are signaling that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) range-bound action seems to be increasing the confidence of institutional investors looking to resume investing in cryptocurrencies. Proof of this comes as \uc2 Marshall Wace\uc2 , a London-based hedge fund, announced plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/marshall-wace-hedge-fund-giant-to-reportedly-dive-into-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invest}}}\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space, according to sources at the Financial Times.\par \par \uc2 A survey of wealth managers and institutional investors already holding crypto, from the U.S., U.K., France, Germany, and the UAE {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/survey-40-of-institutional-crypto-investors-intend-to-buy-a-lot-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that 82% of the respondents expect to increase their investments in digital assets by 2023.\par \par \uc2 The research shared with Cointelegraph claims that only 7% of the participants plan to reduce their exposure to crypto, while 40% plan to \u8220\'20\'1Cdramatically increase their holdings.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/7d7ab2ff-9c96-4e96-8dd6-cba75f549a3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 More evidence of institutional interest was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/turning-bullish-institutions-are-net-buyers-of-crypto-for-the-first-time-in-5-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  in a report from \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  which revealed a total institutional inflow of $63 million into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds. The buying was broad-based as all individual digital assets with dedicated funds witnessed inflows for the first time in nine weeks.\par \par \uc2 However, the arrival of institutional investors is unlikely to result in a sharp upswing in crypto prices in the short term. This is because institutions gradually accumulate their desired exposure before boosting prices higher.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the levels that will suggest the start of a possible uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been holding Bitcoin above the trendline for the past few days. A breakout and close above $36,670 will complete an ascending triangle pattern that could result in a move to the overhead resistance at $42,451.67.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3578a671-de6a-4c14-a04e-144ed3549e71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance at $42,451.67. If the price turns down from this level, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $36,670. If buyers can flip this level into support, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That will increase the possibility of a break above $42,451.67. Such a move will suggest that the correction has ended and the pair is ready to start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the trendline, the pair may drop to $31,000. This is an important level to watch out for because the bears have not been able to manage a close below it.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will indicate that the bears have absorbed the demand. A break below $28,000 could result in panic selling, opening the gates for a drop to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have sustained Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,219) for the past three days, which indicates that the sentiment is turning positive. The buyers are currently attempting to push and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($2,369).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1130abb6-8790-4d6b-86c1-dc62dea0ec04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from it but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, then the possibility of a break above the downtrend line increases.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could open the gates for a move to $2,990.05. A break above this resistance will suggest that the correction is over.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then drop to $2,000 and then $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($312) on July 6, which suggests that the demand is picking up. The bears may now try to defend the 50-day SMA ($333) aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/45f30396-e65d-4f9b-8f18-923009963fa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) above 53 indicate the bulls are back in the game. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $379.58 and then $433.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and plummets below $264.26, it will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls and are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then drop to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($1.39) for the past three days but the bulls have not been able to challenge the 50-day SMA ($1.49). The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/3b52c5e6-da67-4bae-808b-7ee0f3f6c08d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This equilibrium will shift in favor of the bulls if they propel the price above the 50-day SMA. That could result in a move to $1.60 and then to the overhead resistance at $1.94. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $1.20. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. However, if the $1.20 support cracks, the pair could drop to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.25) on July 5 but the bears have not been able to sink the price below the $0.21 support. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/c3e57fe7-0173-48a8-a78d-f9a7877d9dbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if bulls do not drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the selling may resume. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 41 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.21 could open the doors for a decline to $0.15. This is an important support for the bulls because a break below it could result in panic selling. The DOGE/USDT pair could then drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may rally to the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been sandwiched between $0.63 and the 20-day EMA ($0.70) for the past few days. This tight-range trading suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. Therefore, traders seem to be avoiding large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/490334de-3aae-4a2f-8457-9593f6e89a98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, this consolidation in the small range is unlikely to continue for long. Soon, the price may start a decisive move. If bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and the overhead resistance at $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.93 and later to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price plummets below $0.63, the bears will try to pull the price down to $0.58 and then to $0.50. A break below the psychological level at $0.50 will suggest the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $16.93 and the 20-day EMA ($17.07). If they succeed, the altcoin could rally to the 50-day SMA ($20.43) where the bears are again likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/8a4f3e5c-794a-42a7-acc9-a889467b0bb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, following the breakout, if buyers arrest the next decline at the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a possible change in sentiment. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI above 45, signal that bulls are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 50-day SMA, the DOT/USDT pair may start its northward march toward $26.50. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and slides below $13.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 20-day EMA ($20.11) on July 5, which indicates a possible change in sentiment. The buying continued on July 6 and the bulls pushed Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($22.20). There was a weak attempt by the bears to stall the relief rally at this level but that has been overcome by the buyers today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/7c5ad071-a9de-4379-bdae-bc2bebb34b3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 56, indicating that buyers have the upper hand. There is a minor resistance at $25 but if this level is crossed, the UNI/USDT pair may rise to $27 and then $30.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and the bears pull the pair below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the bears have trapped the aggressive bulls, opening the possibility of a fall to $16.93 and later $13.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-battles-35k-as-traders-agree-volatile-btc-price-move-incoming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin battles $35K as traders agree volatile BTC price move incoming}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the overhead resistance at $538.11 for the past few days. A tight consolidation near a stiff resistance usually results in a break above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/fec781a4-52b7-4d4f-82c9-5e93e5a07eae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($524) and the RSI above 46 indicate the bulls are trying to make a comeback. If buyers propel the price above $538.11, the BCH/USDT pair could start its upward journey to $650.35 and then $800.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA ($596) and breaks below $475.69, the pair may drop to $370. Such a move may keep the pair range-bound between $370 and $538.11 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) had been trading between the 50-day SMA ($34.67) and the horizontal support at $33 for the past few days. This showed that the bulls were not dumping their positions near the 50-day SMA and were buying on dips below $33.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/f6498cbd-cc5a-4508-9e40-daf3c769fe7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain the price below $33 attracted buying and the bulls have driven the price above the 50-day SMA today. The SOL/USDT pair could now rally to the overhead resistance zone at $41.75 to $44.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has changed from sell on rallies to buy on dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above $44. If that happens, the pair could start a new uptrend. The bears may gain the upper hand on a break below $31.36.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvY2ExYTllOWUtYmEyYy00OWQ1LWI5YWEtN2M4MTA4MzQzYTNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210707eh77000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/6: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,831 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are booking notable gains but traders remain cautious as Bitcoin price trades in the lower segment of its current range.\par \par \uc2 The weekend rally in cryptocurrencies was led by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) but this move was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/an-even-bigger-mining-difficulty-drop-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not supported}}}\uc2  by huge trading volumes. According to on-chain analysts at CryptoQuant, the low trading volume suggests that \u8220\'20\'1Cwhales are staying low without much action.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, Bitcoin has successfully held the $30,000 support for two weeks, which suggests that accumulation is taking place at lower levels. The Crypto Fear and Greed Index rose to 29 on July 5, its highest level in about three weeks. This suggests that aggressive investors may have started bottom fishing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/86bd9ff4-eb69-4f4b-9cce-cec24e4eb766.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls successfully hold the $30,000 level in Bitcoin for a few more days, trading interest is likely to increase further. Institutional investors usually do not buy in a falling market and wait until prices stabilize. Once that happens, the volume is likely to pick up and a stronger recovery may be expected.\par \par \uc2 However, if support levels crack, the sentiment will sour further and institutions may prefer to remain on the sidelines until a bottom is confirmed. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and spot the critical support levels on the downside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Bitcoin above the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,851) on July 4 but they could not clear the hurdle at the 50-day simple moving average ($36,338). This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/24de2444-374c-4e06-a7e8-dee443e09486.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA going forward, the bears will try to pull the BTC/USDT pair to the $31,000 support. The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint signal that there is a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance will shift in favor of the bears if they can sink the price below $31,000. That could result in a drop to the $28,000 support. If this level cracks, the pair could witness panic selling.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises from the current level or rebounds off $31,000, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $36,670. If they manage to do that, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance zone at $41,330 to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the moving averages. This shows that bears are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($2,410) and the bulls are trying to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,196).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/6116e5aa-1e8d-4afc-bb9d-990ccbc2d4cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, this tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This level may again act as a resistance but if crossed, the next stop could be $2,990.05.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $2,000. This is an important support because a break below it will invalidate the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair may then slide to the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($308) but the positive sign is that the bulls are not giving up much ground. This suggests that buyers anticipate the altcoin to make an upward dash.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/1fc046a3-2cc3-4f22-a513-2b99f137d458.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($341). The bears may try to stall the recovery at this resistance but if the bulls can absorb the supply, the pair could start its journey to $433.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to push the price above the 20-day EMA, short-term traders may close their positions. If the pair breaks below $264.26, a retest of the support at $211.70 may be on the cards.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($1.39) on July 3 but the bulls could not drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.51). This suggests that bears are in no mood to relent and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/fac562a0-6210-4256-a66d-ace8565c975c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the traders who bought during the recent relief rally may bail out of their positions. This could pull the price down to $1.20. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start its journey toward $1.94. Conversely, if bears sink the price below $1.20, the pair could retest the critical support at $1. A break below this level will be a huge negative and may start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) had been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.26) for the past few days but the bulls could not push the price above it. This suggests that bears aggressively defended this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/9bf6d5e3-2dea-4a24-a453-791c26395aef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls seem to have given up and are closing their position today. If the bears sink the price below $0.21, the selling could intensify further and the DOGE/USDT pair may retest the critical support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 41 indicate advantage to the bears. The selling could pick up momentum below $0.15, which could result in a drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off $0.21 and breaks above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 In a downtrend, the bears aggressively defend the 20-day EMA ($0.70) and that is what has happened in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 . Even after repeated attempts in the past few days, the bulls could not propel the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/68c1e25a-69cf-476d-838a-10a50afd526b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 42 suggest that bears are in command. If bears sink the price below $0.63, XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.58 and then to the critical support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price rebounds off the support and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will clear the path for a rally to the 50-day SMA where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $13 and $16.93 for the past few days. A tight consolidation near the support is a negative sign as it shows that the bulls are not able to overcome the supply and push the price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/b11b7d25-36cb-4223-9620-1c526dfb5eec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI has turned down from 41, suggesting that bears are in control. If the sellers sink the price below $13, the DOT/USDT pair could witness sharp selling, which may pull the price down to $10 and then $7.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls again defend the $13 support, the pair could extend its stay inside the tight range for a few more days. A breakout and close above $16.93 will be the first indication that demand exceeds supply.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($19.53) on July 4 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above it. This suggests that bears are trying to trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/92f9f78a-bbbc-4e3b-8304-2e6371fdcbda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. If the bulls do not allow the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and the buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 That will increase the possibility of a break above the 50-day SMA ($22.65). If that happens, the UNI/USDT pair could start its northward march to $25 and then $27. Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $16.93, the pair may drop to $15.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-growth-could-affect-credit-markets-rating-agency-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stablecoin growth could affect credit markets, rating agency warns}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts in the past few days, the bulls have not been able to push Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $538.11. This suggests that bears are unwilling to let go of their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/a11f6e8c-2cd4-4cca-81ca-96b3ab7c572c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($526) has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped below 43, suggesting the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price below the immediate support at $475.69. If they succeed, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to $428.43 and then to $370.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be nullified if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the support and rises above $538.11. If that happens, the pair could extend its relief rally to $650.35 and then to $735.53.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($144) on July 4, which suggests that bears are aggressively defending this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-07/00f552f6-429c-49ef-9030-df2e8ef208a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the 20-day EMA today. If bears pull the price below $130.60, the LTC/USDT pair could retest the critical support at $118. If this level also breaks down, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern, opening the doors for a down move to $100 and then $70.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the support and breaks above the downtrend line of the triangle. Such a move could create an opening for an up-move to $200.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvYzIwYmE3NjMtZjNhYy00MjI0LThmNDItMWZmYWUxYmI1YzI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210706eh76000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 $30B  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  now staked as Alonzo smart contract excitement builds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 300 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano remains the most capitalized cryptocurrency in terms of staked value, ahead of Ethereum, Solana and other smart-contract protocols.\par \par \uc2 More than $30 billion worth of Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been staked in anticipation of a major milestone in the network\u8217\'20\'19s evolution \u8212\'20\'14 one that could set the stage for wider network adoption and a more considerable price appreciation for the cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Roughly 71.7% of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s circulating supply, worth roughly $31 billion at today\u8217\'20\'19s prices, have been staked across 2,665 active pools, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pooltool.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to data provider PoolTool. On Thursday, the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was $1.34, having gained 4%.\par \par \uc2 At current values, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the fifth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Cardano remains far and away the most capitalized cryptocurrency in terms of staked value. Industry data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.stakingrewards.com/cryptoassets?page=1&sort=totalValueLocked_DESC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s staked value is a distant second at $12.2 billion. Solana, Polkadot and Algorand round out the top-five.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s staking allows users to earn passive income in the form of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  without having to lock up their assets for a certain period of time. By comparison, other protocols specify a minimum lock-up period for earning staking rewards.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/if-the-peer-review-system-is-broken-what-the-hell-is-the-point-of-cardano-s-reliance-on-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 If the peer review system is broken, what the hell is the point of Cardano's reliance on it?}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in anticipation of full smart contract implementation later this summer. As Cointelegraph reported, Input Output Hong Kong, better known as IOHK, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-leads-tepid-crypto-market-recovery-ahead-of-memorial-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched the Alonzo hard fork in May}}}\uc2 , paving the way for smart contract capability, possibly as early as August.\par \par \uc2 In a June 11 update that appeared on \uc2 YouTube\uc2 , IOHK {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y44eMfnlVwY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  that Alonzo now has the capacity to run smart contracts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDcvNzQ3MGJmZTYtNDhhZC00YTYyLWFiYjQtNGRmNmZhYzEzYzVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210701eh71000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/30: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,827 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are witnessing selling near key overhead resistance levels, but a shallow pullback may suggest further upside is in store.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price staged a mild resurgence at the start of this week but data from Glassnode suggests that its new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  investors who came late to the party and are dumping their positions in a panic.\par \par \uc2 This transfer of crypto assets from speculators or momentum chasers to long-term investors is a positive sign. This lays the groundwork for the start of the next bull run but it may not happen in a hurry.\par \par \uc2 At the moment, institutions are unlikely to buy aggressively and propel the price of Bitcoin higher because there is still a chance that they can accumulate at lower levels. Therefore, the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/ab3df4a2-5c83-4c0a-a410-ae9f023e4725.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to Forbes, New York Digital Investment Group\u8217\'20\'19s (NYDIG) partnership with enterprise payment company NCR may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nydig-set-to-bring-bitcoin-adoption-to-650-us-banks-and-credit-unions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 empower}}}\uc2  650 banks and credit unions in the U.S. to offer Bitcoin trading services to more than 24 million customers. This move is likely to attract several new investors to crypto, which is a long-term positive.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins witness selling pressure and break below their recent lows or will buyers propel the price above the local highs? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 20-day exponential moving average ($35,196) on June 29, which is a positive sign. This showed that traders were not booking profits at the 20-day EMA but were trying to push the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/183a1484-0e95-43b1-82ed-e454cd6259f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not allowed the price to sustain above the 20-day EMA. This suggests that sellers are defending the zone between the 20-day EMA and the 50-day simple moving average ($37,752).\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price down to $31,000 but the flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) above 45 suggest the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 A shallow pullback from the current level will enhance the prospects for a break above the 50-day SMA, clearing the path for a rally to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the $31,000 support. That could result in a decline to the critical support at $28,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($2,170) on June 29, indicating strength. However, the bears did not waste time and have pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA today. This suggests that sellers are not willing to let go of their advantage easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a6877efe-463c-4115-8395-9e6fcd65ca5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not allow the price to dip below $2,000, the ETH/USDT pair will once again try to rise above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bears will try to stall the rally at this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $2,000, the pair may again drop to the $1,728.74 support. Repeated retests of a support level tend to weaken it. If the price slips below $1,728.74, the selling may intensify and the pair may drop to $1,536.92.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($315). The bears will now try to pull the price below the immediate support at $264.26. If they succeed, the altcoin could drop to the critical support at $211.70.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/86e68f18-01c2-4454-8a9b-9cbba968caa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price again rebounds off $264.26, the buyers will try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could move up to the 50-day SMA ($369) and then to $433.\par \par \uc2 This level may act as a strong resistance and if the price turns down from it, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pierced the 20-day EMA ($1.38) but the buyers could not sustain the price above it. That suggests the bears are attempting to defend this resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d280e1c0-b1ee-4e4d-9ac2-a902759befa1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below $1.30, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $1.20. The bulls are likely to buy this dip and again attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.57).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the $1.20 support, the pair could slide to $1. This is an important support to watch out for because a break below it could result in long liquidation while a rebound off it could extend the range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) had been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($0.27) for the past three days but the bulls could not push the price above it. This may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders, pulling the price lower today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/8dd3429d-987e-4f7e-a9ed-4032f0059110.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the $0.21 support, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.15. This is the last major support before panic selling could drag the price down to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the $0.21 support, it will suggest that bulls are trying to form a higher low. The buyers will then make one more attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.33), which is just above the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s pullback has hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.73). This suggests that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies to the overhead resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/69eaf7c1-8f55-4341-bc5c-8c2cd780192b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price below $0.58. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the psychological level at $0.50. This is an important support to watch out for because if it gives way, the decline could extend to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the pair turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.58 and rises above $0.75. Such a move will suggest that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.93) and later to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the $16.93 resistance, suggesting that bears are selling on every minor rally. The bears will now try to pull the price to the $13 level. If the price rebounds off this support, the altcoin may extend its consolidation between $13 and $16.93.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/3f4516c7-85eb-4013-81ea-a5937d228a77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 38 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink the price below $13, the DOT/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend that may reach $10 and then $7.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($18.20). That could result in an up-move to the 50-day SMA and then to $26.50. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the $18.60 resistance but could not clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($19.49). This suggests that bears continue to sell Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) on rallies to the strong resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/dd1a67b8-a77c-49dc-90a2-1c95e3314a80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $15. A bounce off this support may keep the pair range-bound between $15 and the 20-day EMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls regroup and push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($24.45). This level may again act as stiff resistance but if the bulls arrest the next decline above $18.60, the pair may rally to $30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coincidence-bitcoin-saw-its-highs-and-lows-on-turnaround-tuesdays-in-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coincidence? Bitcoin saw its highs and lows on 'Turnaround Tuesdays' in June}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($537), which is just below the horizontal resistance at $538.11. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d59a78a0-cc9b-4581-8c5c-28ca0b528632.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to $428.43 and then to $370. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $370 and $538.11 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 However, the flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI above 41 suggest the selling pressure is reducing. If bulls propel the price above $538.11, the pair could pick up momentum and rise to the 50-day SMA ($690).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($147). This suggests the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies to strong resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e6db6f7f-5580-4cf0-ba5e-116d7d0f9262.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make another attempt to sink the LTC/USDT pair below the $118 support. If they manage to do that, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. This could intensify selling and pull the price down to $100 and later to $70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $118 and breaks above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could open the gates for a rally to $225.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNTQ3ZmVjN2QtNmFmNS00MjVjLWEwODQtM2EyYTdiMDU2NjBkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210630eh6u000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/28: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,860 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins are looking to capitalize on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound trading below the 20-day moving average.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to stage a relief rally but analysts at \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  believe that the short-term setup looks challenging. However, the analysts also pointed out that the crypto markets had started a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-short-term-setup-is-challenging-jpmorgan-strategists-warn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 healing}}}\uc2  process.\par \par \uc2 A sign of this 'healing process' was seen when the crypto markets did not react negatively to the news that the United Kingdom\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Financial Conduct Authority{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uk-financial-watchdog-orders-binance-to-halt-regulated-activity-in-the-country"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 banned}}}\uc2  Binance Markets Limited from undertaking \u8220\'20\'1Cany regulated activity in the UK.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cbf41be7-6063-4d8a-b49a-51abaeb52b63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 When a market reacts negatively to bad news, it is a sign that weaker hands are panicking and dumping their positions. On the other hand, a muted reaction to negative news indicates that investors are not falling prey to FUD, which is a sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 The crypto sentiment may have received a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-vows-to-spearhead-mexico-s-first-bitcoin-friendly-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost}}}\uc2  due to the strong support for Bitcoin from Mexico\u8217\'20\'19s third-richest man Ricardo Salinas Pliego. The billionaire tweeted that he recommended the use of Bitcoin and was also working with his bank to make it the first in Mexico to accept Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 With the sentiment turning positive, can Bitcoin pull the crypto sector higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is again facing resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($35,252) but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. The positive divergence on the relative strength index suggests that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/da775bdd-1686-4604-97bd-acba49a9155f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($38,603). This level may act as a resistance but if the bulls can push the price above it, the pair may rise to $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to defend the $42,451.67 level aggressively. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce off this support will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and that will increase the possibility of a break above $42,451.67.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears may pull the price to the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone. A break and close below this zone could intensify selling and clear the path for a decline to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) again bounced off the $1,728.74 support on June 26, indicating accumulation at that level. The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,178). If they manage to do that, the biggest altcoin could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/73b574e3-7f99-4112-9b80-7caebb7bd11b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, this is not going to be easy because the downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears are at an advantage. The failure to break and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA could attract another round of selling.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $1,728.74, the selling could pick up momentum as traders who may have purchased the recent dips could rush to the exit. The ETH/USDT pair could then start the next leg of the downtrend that may reach $1,536.92.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from just below the 20-day EMA ($320) on June 25 but the bears could not pull the price down to the critical support at $211.70. This suggests that bulls are trying to form a higher low at $264.26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/adc3ce5d-c56d-428a-bd9b-39d545cc7aa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 42 suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the price below $264.26. If they do that, the pair could drop to the critical support at $211.70.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below this support may start the next leg of the downtrend that could stretch to $126.75. On the other hand, if the bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($383) and then to $433.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($1.39) and $1.20 for the past four days. This suggests that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low at $1.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0c377d03-f1bb-4c42-ae3f-fba52ff8d785.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.58). This level may act as a resistance but if the buyers can propel the price above it, the pair may rally to $1.94.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is above 45, suggesting that bulls have a good chance to make a comeback. This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $1.20. That could pull the price down to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) could not rise above the 20-day EMA ($0.27) on June 25 but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground in the past two days. This suggests a lack of aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/05bb4f7c-dfa6-44b0-a300-c0c79bd35549.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not allow the price to drop below $0.21, the possibility of the DOGE/USDT pair breaking above the 20-day EMA increases. The pair will again face stiff resistance at the neckline of the head and shoulder pattern.\par \par \uc2 A break above it will be the first indication that the correction may be over. On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.21, a retest of $0.15 is likely. A break below this level could start the next leg of the downtrend to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears do not seem to be willing to wait for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  to reach the 20-day EMA ($0.74) before shorting. This suggests that the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders expect further downside from the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/8de8583c-c791-4eea-a922-f4e190c3ab2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink the price below the psychological support at $0.50, the selling could intensify and the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the support line of the descending channel. This level may act as a support but the extent of the pullback will give clarity whether the correction is over or not.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push the price above the $0.75 resistance, it will signal strong buying at lower levels. The pair could then move up to the 50-day SMA ($0.96) and then to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is currently stuck in a tight range between $13 and $16.93. A tight consolidation near a critical support indicates weakness and it usually resolves in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9e521934-a681-426b-8d8f-f78f0c834c0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears are in control. A break and close below $13 could open the doors for a further decline to $10 and then to $7.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls can push the price above the 20-day EMA ($18.72), it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The DOT/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range of $15.10 to $18.60 for the past few days. The bulls are currently trying to push the price above this range and the 20-day EMA ($19.86), but it is not going to be easy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/ef016e41-ba7e-4e5b-bf0d-acd49df9c64b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears are in control. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will try to sink the UNI/USDT pair below $15.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair may challenge the critical support at $13. A break below this level could extend the downtrend to $10 and later to $7.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls propel and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($25.24). This level may act as a resistance but if the bulls can push the price above it, the rally may reach $30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-ever-mining-difficulty-drop-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biggest ever mining difficulty drop: 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) to the breakdown level at $538.11. This is an important resistance to watch out for because the 20-day EMA ($543) is just above it. Therefore, the bears will try to defend the resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/63a9f908-2f10-41f0-b42a-6958d668eabd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 43 indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will once again try to pull the BCH/USDT pair to $370.\par \par \uc2 This is an important support and if the price rebounds off it, the pair may consolidate between $370 and $538.11 for a few days. Conversely, a break below $370 could start a decline to the next support at $300.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $118 support on June 26 but the bounce lacks strength. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/aa7a8142-8a70-497a-b9e8-59cad861886d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($148), the sellers will try to pull the price below the $118 to $104.92 support zone.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern, which could result in a fall to $70. Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can push the price above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be invalidated. That could start an up-move to the 50-day SMA ($192) and later to $166.45.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNGQ5MTc1YzUtMGVhMy00NjMyLWIzY2MtOTJhZGY4YzUxZjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210628eh6s000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, MATIC, KLAY\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,739 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation in the current range could create trading opportunities for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , SOL, MATIC and KLAY over the coming days.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. core personal consumption expenditure (PCE) price index {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dollar-plunge-while-s-p-500-rallies-after-us-inflation-hits-3-decade-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  0.5% in May, below market estimates of 0.6%. However, when compared year-over-year, the PCE index surged to 3.4% recording its largest gain since 1991.\par \par \uc2 While the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  expects inflation to be transitory, analysts at BofA differ in their estimation. The bank {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/u-inflation-likely-remain-elevated-092404961.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipates}}}\uc2  U.S. inflation to remain high, in the 2% to 4% range, for the next two to four years and believes the Fed will hike rates in the next six months, barring a financial market crash.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cc3e6311-13a8-468d-81d4-321bfc7e68a8.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If inflation remains elevated, investors are again likely to focus on Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to hedge their portfolios. A \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report published on June 21 said it was unsure of inflation in the next five years but believed "adding Bitcoin and other real assets as a prudent measure to protect portfolios from the tail-risk of out-of-control inflation."\par \par \uc2 Although near-term risk remains, select cryptocurrencies could offer short-term trading opportunities to traders. During a bear phase, traders may focus on booking profits at regular intervals instead of waiting for windfall rallies. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may turn short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped to the $28,000 to $31,000 support zone on June 26 but the positive sign is that the bulls again bought this dip. This suggests that buyers are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/1a6b46bf-faff-4856-a4f0-83b84f5aa41a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($35,148). If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) is also pointing to a possible relief rally.\par \par \uc2 A break above the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a move to the stiff overhead resistance zone at $40,000 to $42,451.67. The 200-day simple moving average ($43,505) is just above this zone, hence the bulls may find it difficult to climb above it.\par \par \uc2 This points to a possible consolidation between $28,000 and $42,451.67 for the next few days. The longer the price trades in this range, the stronger will be the next breakout from it. The trend will favor the bears if they can sink and sustain the price below $28,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/8da16a76-4cf2-4977-b099-6b3b09edfa5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls are attempting to form a higher bottom at $30,000. The 20-EMA has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting that the sellers are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the price above the 20-EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 200-SMA. A breakout of this resistance could attract further buying that may push the price to $40,527. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $30,000.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $1 support on June 22, indicating strong accumulation near this level. However, the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.39) on June 24 and 25, suggesting that bears are defending the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c211de8b-c7aa-4c85-b639-cfc7846935d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may witness a long liquidation if the bears sink and sustain the price below $1. That could pull the price down to $0.68 and then to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls can thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the short-term trend has tilted in favor of the bulls. The pair could then rise to $1.60 and then to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.94.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/48fa7db4-b781-4298-9583-da0ba671e6a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages on the 4-hour chart have flattened out and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. If the bulls push the price above $1.40, it will indicate the possibility of a short-term bottom formation. The pair could then attempt to rally to $1.60 and then to $1.88.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or $1.40 and plummets below $1.20, it will suggest a lack of buyers at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) June 22 candlestick shows that traders are aggressively defending the 200-day SMA ($20). However, the relief rally could not scale above the 20-day EMA ($33), indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b9c2490f-775b-4532-b4f1-6ccf636dcf63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to form a higher low at $26.65. If they can push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could pick up momentum and move up to the downtrend line and then to $44.\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears will have other plans. They will try to defend the 20-day EMA and sink the price below $26.65. If this support cracks, the pair may drop to $21.10.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips. The pair could then consolidate between $21.10 and $44 for the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/f29cd089-8df2-4103-b66d-0214fb006a52.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA on the 4-hour chart has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers. This balance may tilt in favor of the bulls if they push and sustain the price above $33.\par \par \uc2 Such a move could clear the path for a move to the downtrend line and then to $42. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or $33, The bears will try to break the support at $26.65. If that happens, the advantage may tilt in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($1.29) for the past few days but the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip to the May 23 low at $0.74. This suggests a lack of sellers at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/083f730b-a66a-4d78-8c3c-4c48e7342558.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/MATICUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls regroup and push the price above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the correction may be over. The MATIC/USDT pair could then rise to $1.71 and later to the psychological resistance at $2.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears may have other plans. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that sellers have the upper hand. If they sink the price below $0.92, the pair may drop to the $0.74 to $0.68 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively. A strong bounce will suggest accumulation at lower levels and the bulls may then try to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/52d4552f-0be8-46f8-8503-11bd536cccd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/MATICUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line. The downsloping 20-EMA and the RSI in the negative zone indicate advantage to the bears. If they sink the price below $1, the pair may drop to $0.92.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $1, the bulls will make one more attempt to drive the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, it will suggest that bulls are trying to make a comeback. The pair may pick up momentum on a breakout and close above $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/absolutely-right-to-think-of-bitcoin-as-the-new-gold-mexico-s-3rd-richest-man"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 'Absolutely right' to think of Bitcoin as the new gold \u8212\'20\'14 Mexico's 3rd richest man}}}\par \par \uc2 KLAY/USDT\par \par \uc2 Klaytn (KLAY) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($1.02) for the past many days but the RSI is showing a positive divergence. This indicates that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0df30626-d96a-48e4-b828-b8f1c01f7a17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 KLAY/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/KLAYUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will be an indication that a trend change is possible. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the recovery in the $1.24 to $1.29 zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone but does not dip below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. A breakout of the resistance zone could attract buyers who may then challenge the 200-day SMA ($1.51).\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 200-day SMA will indicate that the downtrend may be over in the short term. This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $0.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9c886c00-2496-431d-8e6b-648a5ffe1fcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 KLAY/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/KLAYUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the KLAY/USDT pair is trading inside a descending channel. The bulls had pushed the price above the channel and the 200-SMA but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-EMA, the pair may again try to rise above the channel and the 200-SMA. If that happens, the pair may start a new uptrend that could reach $1.62.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair breaks below $0.86, the decline could extend to $0.72.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNjJmMTZlYjEtMGM1My00NmU1LTgzMzQtNGM4OGZjYzhjZDczLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210627eh6r000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/25: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,921 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Sellers are jumping on top of every breakout from Bitcoin and altcoins, indicating that the bears are in no hurry to let go of their advantage.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price remains jittery and throughout this week, every relief rally is being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sheds-2-5k-amid-warnings-of-a-repeat-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sold}}}\uc2  into. This is a classic bear \b \highlight22\uc2 market reaction\b0 \highlight\uc2  and may not end in a hurry. However, the current price action should not worry investors because the longer the time spent in a bottoming formation, the stronger the base for the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 In a recent note to investors, \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fair value may remain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-have-no-appetite-for-bitcoin-at-this-price-level-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 between}}}\uc2  $23,000 and $35,000 over the medium term. The bank pointed out that outflows from crypto Bitcoin funds since the fall on May 19, show a lack of demand from institutional investors. Another reason that may be capping Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is the massive unlocking of Bitcoin from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  fund at the end of the six-month lock-up period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/f51e4be9-a319-49d2-b2f0-08369f6d0292.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 None of the events of the past few days have changed the long-term view of Bitcoin. Jason Urban, the co-head of trading at Galaxy Digital said that Bitcoin may \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bulls-on-parade-galaxy-digital-and-alameda-pundits-tip-market-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 see something north of $70,000 by the end of the year}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Although not a game-changer, the Purpose Bitcoin exchange-traded fund has seen an average inflow of 86.15 Bitcoin between May 15 and June 24, according to Glassnode data. This has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/world-s-first-bitcoin-etf-adds-3m-per-day-throughout-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boosted}}}\uc2  the ETF\u8217\'20\'19s assets under management to 21,114 BTC. This shows that smart investors are gradually chipping away instead of trying to time the bottom.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical support levels that could be touched if the downtrend continues.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone has turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($35,788) today. The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate an advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a5c021a6-e824-4aeb-b699-4b290e1eebcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now make one more attempt to sink the price below the support zone. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could start the next leg of the down move and plummet to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls will not give up easily. They are likely to defend the support zone aggressively. If the price rebounds off this zone once again, the bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could continue its consolidation between $28,000 and $42,451.67 for the next few days. A breakout and close above this range will be the first sign that the downtrend may have ended.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $1,728.74 support fizzled out at $2,045 on June 23. This suggests a lack of buyers at higher levels. Both moving averages have turned down and the RSI is near the oversold zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/bd221881-41f8-422c-9229-4a50f0d791fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the $1,728.74 support, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $1,536.92 and then $1,293.18. The deeper the fall, the longer it will take for the bulls to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again rebounds off $1,728.74, it will suggest that the bulls are defending this level aggressively. A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA ($2,248) will be the first indication that a bottoming formation may have started.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the $211.70 support is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($332). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/094ca957-bfe0-42d5-aeb3-b746b92a85be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now make one more attempt to sink the price below the $211.70 support. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $200 and then $126.75.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the $211.70 support, it will suggest strong accumulation by the bulls at this level. If the buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $433. A breakout and close above this resistance will be the first sign that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $1 support on June 22 but the bulls seem to have hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($1.42). This suggests that the bears have not thrown in the towel yet and are trying to maintain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d6eb038d-e6e8-43f3-8ea0-e5c8ef5e83e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price down to $1. This is an important support to watch out for because it has not been broken on a closing basis since Feb. 23. Therefore, a break below $1 may result in a long liquidation.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop to $0.68 and if the selling intensifies, the decline could even extend to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls will have other plans. They will again try to defend the $1 support. If they succeed, the pair may break out of the 20-day EMA and rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($1.61).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.15 support on June 22 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.28) today. After the sharp relief rally of the past three days, the bears are likely to defend the zone between the 20-day EMA and the neckline aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/4984e3c8-4b17-4ee4-bcf1-45aae56e000c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance zone, the bears will try to pull the price back to $0.15. A break and close below this level will suggest that traders sold their positions during the current rally. The DOGE/USDT pair could then drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls defend the next drop to the $0.21 support, it will signal strength. A breakout and close above the neckline will be the first sign that the pair\u8217\'20\'19s correction could be over and a bottoming formation may begin.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the $0.50 support in the past few days could not even reach the breakdown level of $0.75. This suggests a lack of urgency among the traders to buy at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/85843efc-2d72-4f7a-867c-f4f94730afe6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears may now sell aggressively and try to pull the price below the psychological level at $0.50. If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could decline to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls buy the next dip to the $0.50 support, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to suggest that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebound off $13 has been weak as the bulls have not even been able to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($20). This suggests that traders are in no great hurry to buy at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0a1d93aa-ef57-47fe-8c73-4838ce585ed3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 36 indicate that bears have the upper hand. If bears pull the price below $13, the DOT/USDT pair may resume the downtrend and plummet to $10 and later to $7.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $13 and rises above $17, the pair may rise to the 20-day EMA. A breakout and close above this resistance will open the doors for a move to $26.50. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may consolidate between $13 and $26.50 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rebound off $13 hit a wall at $18.60 on June 24. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fbbdd0f5-f684-4b46-9d7f-c7b9ed5c88e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the $13 support. If they manage to sustain the price below the support, the UNI/USDT pair could witness further selling. That may result in a decline to $10 and then to $7.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls again defend the $13 support, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($20). If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($26) and then to $30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-agrees-to-speak-with-twitter-ceo-jack-dorsey-at-bitcoin-event"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk agrees to speak with Twitter CEO Jack Dorsey at Bitcoin event}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to thrust Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level at $538.11, which suggests a lack of urgency among the bulls to accumulate at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/41a58637-d7fa-4d73-8b75-7a11ed1b0cdc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is near the oversold territory, suggesting that bears are in command. The sellers will now try to cement their advantage by sinking the price below the $370 support.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to the psychological support at $300 and then to $270. Contrary to this assumption, if the price again rebounds off $370, it will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($565). If that happens, the pair may rally to the 50-day SMA ($782).\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $118 support lacks strength. This suggests that traders are not convinced that a bottom has been made. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7e340259-2e20-4cf3-9fcf-8fda8134f5f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $118, the LTC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside is $100 and if this psychological level also cracks, the decline may extend to $70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $118 once again, the bulls will again try to push the price to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest that the sellers are losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($206).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvMjczOTQ5NzAtNDhiMi00ODU2LTkxY2QtMDBlYmY0NWE2YzE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210625eh6p000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 XRP price will fall to new lows vs. Bitcoin if this famous chart pattern plays out\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 719 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The popular Head and Shoulder pattern is statistically among the most accurate trend indicators. XRP bulls should watch out.\par \par \uc2 Ripple blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s native token, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , could make a full \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price swing against Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), per a classic technical indicator.\par \par \uc2 Dubbed as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investopedia.com/terms/h/head-shoulders.asp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Head and Shoulders}}}\uc2  (H&S), the pattern develops when an asset forms three peaks atop a common baseline. The outside peaks, known as Shoulders, are close in height, while the middle one, called the Head, is the highest.\par \par \uc2 The H&S pattern is completed when the asset breaks below its baselines support, with high volumes, confirming a negative breakout. The so-called neckline also serves as the most common entry point for \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders as they target deeper downside levels. Though not every time, an H&S pattern\u8217\'20\'19s profit target comes to be equal to the distance between the pattern\u8217\'20\'19s high point and its neckline.\par \par \uc2 All-time low ahead\par \par \uc2 Peter Brandt, CEO of Factor LLC \u8212\'20\'14 a global trading firm he established in 1980 \u8212\'20\'14 sees the XRP/BTC instrument painting an H&S pattern. In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterLBrandt/status/1408237396450320387"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweet}}}\uc2  published early Friday, Brandt raised speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator might prompt XRP to turn into \u8220\'20\'1Ca tidal wave\u8221\'20\'1D against Bitcoin. The veteran trader added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCompletion of the [H&S pattern] would set [XRP/BTC] target at all-time-lows.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d948923c-015d-4a44-946d-76eefc2745db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP has broken below the H&S neckline with strong volumes. Source: TradingView, Peter Brandt\par \par \uc2 The total distance between the H&S pattern\u8217\'20\'19s top and its baselines comes out to be around 1,794 satoshis. Meanwhile, the neckline support coincides with 2,120 satoshis. Therefore, the profit target in XRP/BTC\u8217\'20\'19s case is (2,120\u8211\'20\'131,794) \u8212\'20\'14 i.e., 326 satoshis.\par \par \uc2 Support levels ahead\par \par \uc2 But as XRP/BTC approaches its record low levels, the pair would still need to pass through a series of strong support levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/f70038f3-8733-4441-9953-691097e9d08e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP tests 200-day simple moving average as its first line of support. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/BTC exchange rate bounced off its 200-day simple moving average (200-day SMA; the saffron wave) support at 1,696 satoshis. Should the pair sustain above the wave, the likelihood of retesting the H&S neckline around 2,120 satoshis is high. Meanwhile, a close above 2,120 satoshis would invalidate the H&S structure.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, breaking below 200-day SMA exposes XRP/BTC to the next line of support near 1,555 satoshis. The level was instrumental in pushing the pair up by more than 170% in November 2020. Nonetheless, its Volume Profile shows a weaker trading activity in recent history, raising possibilities that it won't be able to handle strong selling volumes as the H&S breakout accelerates.\par \par \uc2 The last line of defense, per the Volume Profile indicator, sits at 847 satoshis, more than twice above the H&S profit target of 326 satoshis.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD\par \par \uc2 Against the United States dollar, XRP continued trending lower in its months-old descending channel pattern, while promising short-term upside opportunities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/4ea0eb7f-00df-4afa-ba62-f4ea48c8cdc3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP bounced off its lower descending channel support on June 22. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USD rebounded by up to 44.53% after testing the Channel\u8217\'20\'19s support trendline on Tuesday. The pair\u8217\'20\'19s move uphill had it test $0.69 as its interim resistance as bulls targeted an extended push toward $0.78.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-23-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-doge-dot-uni-bch-ltc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 6/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\par \par \uc2 Reclaiming $0.63 is cool but $0.79 will be the real test.\par \par \uc2 Let's see if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  allows price to even get close to $0.79 in the short term... {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/PhHR7OJCQQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/PhHR7OJCQQ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Posty (@PostyXBT) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PostyXBT/status/1408328604472287232?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 25, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The $0.69 level has served as the resistance between November 2020 and April 2021. Meanwhile, the $0.78 level capped XRP/USD from extending its downside bias throughout May 2021.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvZjA1NTVkNjEtNzljNi00MWUzLThiMTYtMDgwNzAzMmM3N2UzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210625eh6p0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/23: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,828 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The swift rebound in Bitcoin and altcoins indicates strong accumulation occurring at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-below-30k-to-6-month-lows-watch-these-next-price-support-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  below $30,000 on June 22, which may be a final sign of capitulation. Data from Skew suggests that if Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price does not recover sharply in the next few days, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-heading-for-worst-quarter-since-start-of-2018-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decline}}}\uc2  in the current quarter could be the second-worst quarter since 2014.\par \par \uc2 Bull and bear phases are part and parcel of every asset class. All the legacy markets have witnessed several bear phases with massive drawdowns in the past. However, after the bear phase ends, a new bull market begins and long-term investors are usually rewarded with strong gains. The crypto markets are presently witnessing a similar bear market correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/03049ef0-acfd-4904-adb5-c0ebc04e2e4a.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Every bear market is caused due to events that create fear and panic among market participants. However, unless the long-term fundamentals change, the smart investor should use the corrections to buy. Glassnode data suggests that long-term Bitcoin holders are using the current decline to accumulate Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 It is impossible to time the bottom because it will be confirmed only in hindsight. Therefore, capitulations to strong support levels during panic selling may be viewed as buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s June 22 candlestick shows strong buying in the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone. This was the fourth instance when buyers defended the support zone, hence this becomes an important area to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/539b3dee-b1b0-45fe-93ac-a70b45ee4944.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which suggests the sellers may be losing their momentum.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($36,260), the BTC/USDT pair could spend some more time between the $28,000 and $43,351.67 range. The longer the time spent inside this range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are selling on relief rallies. A break below $28,000 may result in panic selling, dragging the price to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the triangle on June 18 and reached the critical support at $1,728.74 on June 22. The bulls purchased this dip and are attempting to stage a relief rally, which may hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($2,325).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9632b81d-979d-4e4b-9d30-c508c50e8770.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the ETH/USDT pair below the $1,728.74 support. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the down move that may reach $1,536.92 and then $1,293.18.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($2,812).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $291.06 support on June 21 but the bears could not break the next support at $211.70. The long tail on the June 22 candlestick indicates strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cd97eb63-ad6f-44ae-aa63-843f8f6637d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push and sustain the price above $291.06, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to defend this resistance aggressively.\par \par \uc2 However, the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, suggesting the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If the bulls can pierce the downtrend line, the pair could rally to $433.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the bears will again try to pull the pair below the $211.70 support. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $200 and later to $126.75.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped to the critical support at $1 on June 22 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are defending this level aggressively. However, repeated retests of a support level weaken it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/6c7833f0-005d-4d04-a84d-7cdb3a32be26.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1.44) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the sellers will again try to break the $1 support.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could witness long liquidation and a drop to $0.80 and then to $0.68 may be on the cards. Alternatively, if the bulls push the price above the moving averages, the pair may rally to $1.94.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  dived below the $0.75 to $0.65 support zone on June 20, indicating aggressive selling by traders. The break below the May 23 low at $0.65 has extended the lower highs and lower lows pattern for the coin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/22d7aa8b-60af-43e6-a6ac-c338b2767fb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price turns down from $0.75, it will suggest that bears have flipped this level into resistance. That could pull the price down to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls propel and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.80), it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to $1.07. A break above the descending channel will suggest that the downtrend is over.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged sharply on June 21 and broke below the $0.21 support. The price has rebounded off the $0.16 support but the bulls have an uphill task ahead of them.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cfd1079a-a352-45a6-b07d-7f292dd8aaf4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.29) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. Any relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA and then at the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from either overhead resistance level, the DOGE/USDT pair could retest the $0.16 support. A breakdown and close below this level could attract further selling and the pair could decline to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls can drive and sustain the price above the neckline, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup did not find support at lower levels. That could open the doors for a rally to the 50-day SMA and then to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to stall Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) decline near the May 23 low at $13.63. However, the bulls are unlikely to have it easy as the relief rally could face selling near the 20-day EMA ($21).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/f8ecebdb-723a-4338-8f73-8d4e00350041.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 A break below $13 could open the gates for a further fall to the psychological support at $10 and then to $7.50. This negative view will be nullified if the bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) declined close to the May 23 low at $13 but the long tail on the June 22 candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend this level. The relief rally could now reach the 20-day EMA ($21.72).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d491c131-76ec-452d-b942-0b4c8b610aa4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the sellers will make one more attempt to sink the UNI/USDT pair below the $13 support.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could extend the decline to $10 and then to $7. On the contrary, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will be the first signal that the downtrend could be over. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($27.59).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-34k-as-bloomberg-likens-30k-support-to-4k-in-2020-btc-price-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin holds $34K as Bloomberg likens $30K support to $4K in 2020 BTC price crash}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) fell to $387.61 on June 22 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bulls are attempting to defend the $370 support. The altcoin could now rise to the breakdown level at $538.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/6ec31dd1-6ba4-44a3-b90f-ef8719a07484.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from $538.11, the BCH/USDT pair could retest the support at $370.\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below this level could clear the path for a fall to $300 and then $270. Alternatively, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($585), the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($822). Such a move will suggest that the pair may have hit a bottom.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the May 23 low at $118.03 on June 22. However a minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip and have pushed the price back above $118.03 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/98bdafbd-cc62-46af-b20b-ccc03b79ee9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair could now rise to the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will attempt to sink and sustain the pair below the $118.03 support. If they manage to do that, the descending triangle pattern will complete.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could attract further selling and may result in a further decline to $70. This negative view will be invalidated if the bulls drive the price above the downtrend line. That will indicate strong buying at lower levels and the pair may then rally to the 50-day SMA ($215).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNjU5NTlmNmItMmE1Ni00Y2FkLWI5NmYtNDBiODUxMGNlYWM0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210623eh6n000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/21: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, BCH, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,905 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are reaching critical support levels, but instead of buying the dip, traders are waiting to see if any \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals emerge.\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  environment, traders latch on to every bit of negative news and make that a an excuse to sell. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dropped over $1,000 within a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dips-to-32-5k-on-consistent-new-china-fud"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 few}}}\uc2  minutes as news hit the stands that the third-largest Chinese bank, the Agricultural Bank of China, will not allow the use of its services for crypto transactions.\par \par \uc2 Although the bank later deleted its anti-crypto statement, the damage was already done. Similarly, traders have latched on to the news that the Chinese crackdown on Bitcoin miners and this has resulted in the hash rate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hashrate-hits-8-month-low-as-chinese-miners-power-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropping}}}\uc2  to an 8-month low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9ce5e57b-7bdf-4fe2-90a3-fa8aff28f0ce.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While this may be a negative in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-s-3rd-largest-bank-rugs-btc-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short term}}}\uc2 , several analysts believe this is a positive development for the long term. \u8220\'20\'1CThe \u8216\'20\'18China-dominated\u8217\'20\'19 Bitcoin mining era may be coming to an end,\u8221\'20\'1D said Alex Gladstein, chief strategy officer of the Human Rights Foundation. As mining activity shifts to other user-friendly jurisdictions, the network is likely to flourish.\par \par \uc2 Among all the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news and price action, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has disclosed the purchase of 13,005 Bitcoin at an average price of $37,617. This takes the firm\u8217\'20\'19s total holding to 105,085 Bitcoin at an average price of just over $26,000 per Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Will \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s purchase attract other institutional investors and result in a relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin completed the dreaded death cross on June 19 and this seems to have attracted further selling from the bears. The sellers have pulled the price down to the critical support at $31,000 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/843c8dae-8dc4-4e02-8cb8-84c5af9aa6af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls had successfully defended the $31,000 support on May 23 and again on June 8. Therefore, the level may again attract buying from the aggressive bulls. The relative strength index (RSI) is attempting to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which is another positive sign.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $31,000, the BTC/USDT pair will attempt to rise to $42,451.67. This could keep the pair range-bound between these two levels for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the rally is likely to face resistance at the 50-day simple moving average ($41,904). If the pair turns down from this resistance, the bears will again try to sink the price below $31,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could decline to $28,000 and if this support also cracks, the next stop could be $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the symmetrical triangle pattern on June 18. This indicated that the consolidation of the past few days has resolved in favor of the bears. Sustained selling has pulled the price down to the 200-day SMA ($1,870).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/96a0b2ab-7ec3-4235-a972-a19f9b6b31cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to defend the zone between the 200-day SMA and the May 23 low at $1,728.74. If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will again try to push the price back into the triangle. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that buyers are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 However, the 50-day SMA ($2,869) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped below 35, suggesting that bears are in command. If bears sink the price below the support zone, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $1,536.92 and then to $1,293.18.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on June 18 and the bears are currently attempting to sink the price below the $291.06 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fd7d43c6-280c-477d-b2ee-05673e2ade43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could challenge the 200-day SMA ($261). This is an important support to watch out for because the bulls had aggressively defended this support on May 21.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 200-day SMA, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. A break above this resistance could clear the path for an up-move to $379.58 and then $433.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 200-day SMA, the pair could drop to $200 and then to $126.75.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/classic-bearish-chart-pattern-forms-for-bitcoin-as-btc-price-tumbles-to-32k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Classic \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  chart pattern forms for Bitcoin as BTC price tumbles to $32K}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has dropped below the critical support at $1.33 today. If bears sustain the price below this level, the altcoin could continue its decline and reach the next major support at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/2308597c-fdf2-4e78-b7e3-61461a4cbcbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the $1 support aggressively as the 200-day SMA ($0.98) is just below this level. If the price rebounds off this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $1.33 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. A break below the 200-day SMA could open the doors for a further fall to $0.80 and then $0.68.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 50-day SMA ($1.62).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  bounced off the 200-day SMA ($0.72) on June 20 but the bulls could not sustain the price above $0.75. Renewed selling has pulled the price back below the 200-day SMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7d35359f-a39b-48bf-ae5c-32f2ff183efa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $0.65, the selling could intensify and the XRP/USDT pair may drop to the next support at $0.43. The downsloping 50-day SMA ($1.09) and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that sellers are in command.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $0.65, the buyers will make one more attempt to push and sustain the price above $0.75. If they manage to do that, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then rise to $0.93 and then to $1.07.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the neckline of a large head and shoulders pattern on June 18 and has continued lower. The bulls will now try to defend the $0.21 support aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/afa698ab-0278-40e6-8dd9-88344752dc25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.21, the bulls will attempt to push the price back above the neckline. If they succeed, it will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The DOGE/USDT pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.39).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $0.21, the pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.15). The bulls may again try to stall the decline at this level but if they fail, the pair may drop to the next major support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support line of the triangle on June 20 but the bulls pushed the price back into the triangle. However, the sellers are in no mood to relent and they have again pulled the price below the support line today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/195d6464-4193-4055-81f4-c225e2f2b6a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 50-day SMA ($28.22) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. The DOT/USDT pair could now drop to the critical support at $15, which has not been breached on a closing basis since Jan. 16.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the bulls will attempt to defend the $15 support aggressively. A strong rebound off this level could push the price to $20 and then to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this resistance will be the first sign of strength.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink the price below $15, the pair could witness further selling and decline to the next major support at $7.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 200-day SMA ($22.20) on June 18. The failure of the bulls to defend this critical support indicated that supply exceeds demand. The buyers tried to stage a recovery on June 20 but failed to push the price above the 200-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a6d78082-4e4a-40cc-982f-0690d3c20203.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That resulted in renewed selling today. The downsloping 50-day SMA ($28.63) and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that bears are in command. If the sellers sink the price below $16.49, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $13.04.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the $13.04 support aggressively. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair could consolidate between $13.04 and $21.50 for a few days. On the contrary, a break below $13.04 could pull the price down to $10.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has plunged below the $538.11 support, completing the descending triangle pattern. There is a minor support at $468.13 but if this support cracks, the selling could intensify further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/33049587-bfd6-4ed9-87c6-2eb7638a0eb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA ($844) has been sloping down and the RSI is trading near the oversold territory, indicating advantage to the bears. If the sellers sink the price below $468.13, the BCH/USDT pair could slide to $400 and then $370.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns up and quickly rises above the 200-day SMA ($609). Such a move will suggest that the bulls aggressively bought at lower levels. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line on June 18, indicating a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy at that level. The failure to push the price back above the support line in the past two days has attracted further selling today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/43d07fc5-2ff1-4d01-8503-7f490a93d2a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 50-day SMA ($222) and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in control. The LTC/USDT pair could now retest the May 23 intraday low at $118.03. This level may act as a strong support but if the bears sink the price below it, the pair may drop to $100 and then to $70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $118.03, the bulls will try to push the price to the downtrend line. A breakout and close above this level will be the first indication of strength. A trend change may be signaled after the bulls propel and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvMTE4Y2Q5ZmItY2Y5OS00NmNjLThhMzItYzFhYjI5MjZkMjNlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210621eh6l000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , THETA, XMR, AMP\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,764 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin price remains in the current range, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , THETA, XMR and AMP could bounce higher over the coming days.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s plans to advance its timeline for rate hikes to 2023 has led to profit-booking in the U.S. stock market, gold, and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). The markets received a second {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hawkish-fed-comments-push-bitcoin-price-and-stocks-lower-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jolt}}}\uc2  on June 18 after James Bullard, the president of the United States Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis, warned th the first rate hike could come as soon as 2022.\par \par \uc2 Now crypto analysts are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-hit-450k-in-2021-135k-is-worst-case-scenario-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 divided}}}\uc2  on the next move from Bitcoin. Josh Rager believes Bitcoin may have hit its cycle top at $64,500 and Robert Kiyosaki, author of "Rich Dad Poor Dad," believes Bitcoin can plummet to $24,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/dc2ee6a8-67e7-4912-be84-5499fb473c0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, PlanB, the creator of the stock-to-flow Bitcoin price forecasting model, has retained his \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on Bitcoin. His best-case scenario for Bitcoin is a massive rally to $450,000 while his \u8220\'20\'1Cworst-case scenario\u8221\'20\'1D also paints a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target at $135,000 by the end of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dips-below-34k-as-grayscale-starts-giant-btc-unlocking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price dips below $34K as the day of Grayscale's giant BTC unlocking draws near}}}\par \par \uc2 Citing recent on-chain data, other analysts have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bulls-hesitate-to-buy-the-dip-after-bitcoin-price-falls-close-to-35k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed}}}\uc2  out that long-term holders have been buying Bitcoin in the past few days.\par \par \uc2 Can buying by the long-term investors offset selling from the speculators? What do the technicals project, a short-term recovery or a further fall? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been range-bound between $31,000 and $42,451.67 for the past few days. The price turned down from $41,330 on June 15 and the bears pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($37,439) on June 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cc38809e-10bf-48a1-a4b5-46d66a82afd6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the price to the support of the range at $31,000. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) below 41 suggests that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, the BTC/USDT pair rebounded off $31,000 on two previous occasions on May 23 and June 8, hence the bulls will again try to defend this level. If they succeed, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $31,000, the pair could drop to $28,000 and then to $20,000. Such a move will be a huge negative and it could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/429d698a-0712-471c-b2fc-5f98eeb4c2f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the $34,600 support on the 4-hour chart. If they manage to sustain the price below this level, the pair is likely to drop to the $31,000 support. The downsloping 20-EMA and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $36,457, it will suggest that traders accumulated at lower levels. The pair may then rise to the 50-simple moving average and later to the $41,330 to $42,451.67 resistance zone. A breakout of this zone will suggest that the correction is over.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $1.33 and $1.94 for the past few days. The rebound off the support on June 12 fizzled out at the 20-day EMA ($1.52) on June 15, indicating the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/58fbcc93-7849-46a4-9626-a1a9db530024.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the $1.33 to $1.24 support zone. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slump to the critical support at $1. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 42 suggest that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls again defend the support zone, it will suggest demand at lower levels. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. A breakout and close above $1.94 will indicate that bulls are back in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/db179480-ff10-45ef-82fb-31b909daddb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the bears pulled the price below the $1.33 support today but the failure to sustain the lower levels suggests accumulation on dips. The buyers will now try to propel the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. Such a move could catch the aggressive bears off guard and result in a short squeeze that may propel the price to $1.74 and then $1.88.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and sustains below $1.33, the pair will complete the descending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $0.78.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed THETA above the resistance line of the descending channel on June 17 but they could not cross the hurdle at $10.47. This shows that bears have not thrown in the towel yet and are attempting to fake the breakouts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/2af511d9-302a-4fc4-8be7-716c9f0a32a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has dipped below the 20-day EMA ($8.65) today, suggesting that the short-term trend has turned in favor of the bears. However, the bulls are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the decline at $7.33.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support and rises above the moving averages, it will indicate strong demand at lower levels. The buyers will then make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at $10.47.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the THETA/USDT pair could start a rally to $13.20. This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $7.37. Such a move could result in a decline to $6 and then to $4.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/30f83d48-409d-491e-9505-be455b2ae525.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the formation of a head and shoulders pattern. This setup has a target objective at $7.02.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are trying to push the price back above the neckline. If they do that, the short-term bears who may have initiated short positions on the break of the neckline may get trapped.\par \par \uc2 This could result in short covering and the pair may rally to $9.19. A break above this resistance may open the doors for a rally to $10.10 and then $10.47.\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT\par \par \uc2 Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/monero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on June 19 and the bears will now try to sink the price to the support at $225. This is an important support to watch out for because the bulls have repeatedly defended this level in the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/1f6c29ea-82ca-4516-ae0b-64d6c02e4608.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $225, buyers will make one more attempt to drive the price above the downtrend line. If they do that, the XMR/USDT pair may challenge the 50-day SMA ($312) and then rise to $347.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink the price below the $225 support, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could attract further selling, resulting in a drop to $175 and then $124.69.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/30399c60-6d69-49c1-9a5a-71632b805013.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XMRUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that bulls made several attempts to push and sustain the price above the $283 resistance but failed. This shows that the bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The sellers pulled the price below the trendline of the ascending triangle today, but they could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests strong buying on dips. The bulls will now try to push the price above the moving averages and challenge the $283 resistance.\par \par \uc2 If buyers can thrust the price above this level, the ascending triangle pattern will complete and the pair could rally to $316.23 and then to the pattern target at $341.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if bears sink and sustain the price below the trendline. Such a move could open the doors for a drop to $225.\par \par \uc2 AMP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Amp broke above the stiff overhead resistance at $0.076 on June 14 and hit an all-time high at $0.12 on June 16. However, profit-booking on June 17 has started a correction that has dropped to the breakout level at $0.076.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/59493704-4d4c-471b-bae3-70b346adb10e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AMP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AMPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls flip the $0.076 level to support, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are accumulating on dips. The buyers will then try to push the price back toward the all-time high at $0.12.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the resumption of the uptrend. The AMP/USDT pair could then rally to $0.185.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below $0.076, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.07), which may again act as a strong support. However, if this support cracks, the pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.05)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/3c0a604c-10a3-4b11-bc29-fe0e250823fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AMP/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/AMPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The correction from the all-time high was arrested at the $0.076 support as the bulls defended the level aggressively. However, the buyers are struggling to push the price above the $0.095 resistance, indicating that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 50-SMA and form a higher low in the short term. If they succeed, the pair may rise to $0.095. A breakout and close above this resistance could open the doors for a rally to the all-time high. This positive view will invalidate if the pair breaks and closes below $0.076.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvMjRkMGRjOWQtNWM3Yi00OGFmLWI1ODgtNWQwMzYwMDM3NzRiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210620eh6k000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/18: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,898 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders expect further downside from Bitcoin and altcoins after BTC dropped below a key support level at $36,000.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  updated their inflation expectations for this year from 2.4% in March to 3.4% in their latest meeting that concluded on June 16. To tame inflation, the Fed plans to undertake two rate hikes before the end of 2023.\par \par \uc2 This news has boosted the U.S. dollar index DXY to its best level since mid-April. Gold\u8217\'20\'19s price, which generally has an inverse correlation with the dollar, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slips-below-39k-as-fed-sends-gold-to-6-week-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  to a 6-week low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e000a3ad-7dfa-41c3-9688-703c5bbaea75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The U.S. equity markets have also not been spared. The Dow Jones Industrial Average index is on track for its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/06/17/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worst}}}\uc2  weekly performance since January this year. This shows the short-term sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are closing their positions to hoard cash.\par \par \uc2 This has also put {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-after-fed-shifts-interest-rate-hikes-forward-amid-inflation-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brakes}}}\uc2  on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery. However, Pantera Capital chief executive Dan Morehead said in the monthly newsletter published on June 14 that Bitcoin has been \u8220\'20\'1Cthis \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pantera-ceo-crypto-market-panic-is-subsiding-now-s-the-time-to-buy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cheap}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D relative to its trend 20.3% of the past 11 years.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/joining-the-ranks-bitcoin-s-correlation-with-gold-and-stocks-is-growing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joining the ranks: Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correlation with gold and stocks is growing}}}\par \par \uc2 Santiment data shows that Bitcoin whales, holding between 100 and 10,000 Bitcoin, have been on a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/millionaire-whales-gobble-up-90-000-bitcoin-over-past-25-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buying}}}\uc2  spree, lapping up about 90,000 Bitcoin in the past 25 days. They now hold about 48.7% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply.\par \par \uc2 Can the buying from the whales arrest the decline in Bitcoin and will the buying in altcoins resume? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $41,330 on June 15 and the selling has dragged the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($38,060) today. This suggests the short-term recovery may have ended and the bears will now try to sink the price to $34,600.36 and then $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e9c16ea8-67e0-4f3b-a8f8-836ec14dfa3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has turned down from the overhead resistance at 55 and dropped into the negative territory, indicating the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BTC/USDT pair rebounds off the $31,000 support, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. That may keep the pair range-bound between $31,000 and $42,451.67 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $42,451.67 to indicate that the downtrend may have ended. On the other hand, a break below $31,000 will suggest the resumption of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($2,528) on June 15 and the bears have pulled the price below the support line of the symmetrical triangle today. This suggests that supply exceeds demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/41bfc839-4e34-47b2-96a1-0fe6ce243ac6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USDT pair breaks below $2,180, the next stop could be $2,079.94 and then $1,728.74. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rises from the current level or the support and breaks above the resistance line of the triangle. Such a move will suggest that bulls are back in command and a new uptrend is likely.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($367) for the past few days. This suggests the sentiment remains negative and traders could be using the rallies to close their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/721d3def-4ea4-4c6c-a9b2-601ec93b2db5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI at 42 indicate the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sustain the price below the trendline, the selling may intensify and the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $257.40 and then $211.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears fail to sustain the price below the trendline, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $433.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the correction is over and the pair may start its journey to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $508.38.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($1.62) on June 15, indicating that the bears are trying to dominate proceedings. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/92e4e75b-c1c5-46a9-b239-1bda56628797.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price to the $1.33 support. A break and close below this level will clear the path for a further fall to the next critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $1.33, it will suggest that buyers are accumulating near this level. That could keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair range-bound between $1.33 and $1.94 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will gain the upper hand after the price breaks and closes above $1.94. Such a move could push the pair to the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has failed to rebound off the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern in the past two days, which suggests a lack of demand at current levels. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.33) and the RSI below 41 suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a996a9f2-cd20-4ed5-98b9-fcd5f2622c24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the neckline, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.21. The bulls may defend this support aggressively but if this level cracks, the selling may intensify and the pair could decline to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.21, the bulls will try to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.40) and then to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  continues to trade below the 20-day EMA ($0.91), suggesting a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will now try to pull the price below the critical support at $0.75 while the bulls will try to defend the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/907ca300-9a0f-4f87-84ce-91b090962e07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair could move up to the 20-day EMA. A breakout of this resistance could keep the pair range-bound between $0.75 and $1.07 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 indicate advantage to the bears. If the pair slips below $0.75, the next stop is likely to be $0.65. If this support cracks, the selling may intensify and the pair could drop to $0.56 and then to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 15 and broke below the 20-day EMA ($23.57) on June 16. The altcoin has now dropped to the support line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0b7262d2-5562-4620-9289-1ae9844828fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line, the DOT/USDT pair may continue to consolidate inside the triangle for a few more days. However, the downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the triangle, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The first support on the downside is $15. A break below this level could open the doors for a further fall to $8.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will be back in the game after they push and sustain the price above the triangle. Such a move will signal that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($24.16) on June 15, indicating selling on rallies. The bulls defended the $21.50 support on June 17 but the failure of the buyers to build upon the recovery shows a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/29826c3c-7506-474b-aa37-c543a520202c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $20, the selling may intensify and the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $16.49 and then to $13.04. Such a move will suggest that traders sold their positions in the recent recovery to $30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the pair rebounds off the $20 support, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will then attempt to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may rise to $30.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to defend the support line on June 17 but they could not push \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) price above the 20-day EMA ($176). This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0c8fd596-ab19-43e8-9a44-3069deba8730.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate advantage to the bears. If sellers sustain the price below the support line, the LTC/USDT pair could start its journey toward the May 23 low at $118.03. If this support also gives way, the selling may intensify and the pair may plummet to $70.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will be the first sign of strength. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($230). A break above this level will suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($648) on June 15, indicating that bears are selling on every minor rally. The price action of the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakdown and close below $538.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b895cb92-475e-4e2b-a107-4af169e4e9aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink and sustain the price below $538.11, the BCH/USDT pair could resume its down move. The pair could then drop to $400 and later to $370.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $538.11 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying by the bulls. The pair could then rally to $800 and then to the 50-day SMA ($872).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNGJmNGMwNjgtZmIzZS00Y2Q5LWEyMjctYzVkYjJhMDg4MzI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210618eh6i000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Crypto IRA integrates \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Custody as trade volumes top $1.5B\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 354 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Retirement planners' funds will now be protected by \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Custody cold storage.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency IRA and 401(k) provider iTrustCapital has integrated \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Custody into its platform, offering retirement planners more robust security for their \b \highlight22\uc2 digital-asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investments.\par \par \uc2 The integration means iTrustCapital clients will have their assets secured by \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Custody\u8217\'20\'19s cold storage, offering another layer of protection from attacks. \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  Custody maintains both SOC1 Type II and SOC2 Type II certifications, which means it undergoes regular financial audits.\par \par \uc2 Assets held with iTrustCapital are also backed by a commercial crime insurance policy valued at $255 million, the company said.\par \par \uc2 The added protection applies immediately to all current iTrustCapital IRA and 401 (k) clients.\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  is an industry stalwart when it comes to custodying digital assets. As Cointelegraph reported, the digital currency exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-custodies-11-of-entire-crypto-capitalization"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 custodied more than 10% of the combined crypto market capitalization}}}\uc2  as of March 2021.\par \par \uc2 Todd Southwick, iTrustCapital\u8217\'20\'19s CEO, said his firm has onboarded \u8220\'20\'1Cthousands of new active monthly users,\u8221\'20\'1D with total assets under management topping $1 billion earlier this year. Total trade volumes have also topped $1.5 billion since the start of 2021.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGoing forward we\u8217\'20\'19re well-positioned to capitalize on the growing demand for investors to include digital assets and physical gold in their retirement accounts,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2020/02/10/from-director-of-the-united-states-mint-to-the-very-first-bitcoin-ira-customer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 From Director of the United States Mint to the Very First Bitcoin IRA Customer}}}\par \par \uc2 The iTrustCapital platform allows U.S.-based investors to incorporate cryptocurrency investments into their retirement portfolios. The platform currently supports purchases of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Chainlink (LINK), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polkadot (DOT) and many other cryptocurrencies, as well as physical gold and silver.\par \par \uc2 Investors have seen the price of Bitcoin and other digital currencies surge to new highs this year. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-managers-hold-a-record-57b-worth-of-crypto-according-to-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Growing institutional adoption}}}\uc2  and the presence of more secure onramps to digital assets mean more retirement planners are looking to dabble in the emerging asset class. This trend is likely to continue as investors explore inflation-beating strategies in the wake of the Covid-19 pandemic.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvZTU5MjZmOWYtYjNkYS00MDE4LTkwZGYtNTFlMDE3OTI3NGU5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210617eh6h000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/16: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,910 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent rejection at $41,000 could extend the current range-bound action for a few more days and altcoins are expected to follow suit.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from just above the $41,000 mark on June 15, suggesting that traders are halting their purchases at higher levels. Traders seem to be hesitant to take large bets until the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/56ce9fae-6c5d-4a27-83c8-7a40271a9ecc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 releases}}}\uc2  its latest economic projections and the timeline of the proposed rate hikes today.\par \par \uc2 However, Jurrien Timmer, the director of global macro at Fidelity Investments {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bottom-is-in-says-fidelity-exec-as-crypto-market-exits-extreme-fear"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believes}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin has bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign comes from a Q2 retail investment survey of high-frequency {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investors-more-bullish-than-ever-despite-50-price-crash-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traders}}}\uc2  by the crypto firm \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2  that shows 81% of the participants are confident about the future of cryptocurrency.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/43911070-c011-4625-b12c-eb74cbf1aaa2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another survey of 100 chief financial officers at hedge funds by Intertrust Global shows that about 98% of the respondents expect hedge funds to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/98-of-cfos-say-their-hedge-fund-will-invest-in-bitcoin-by-2026-study"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invest}}}\uc2  7.2% of their assets in cryptocurrencies by 2026.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/within-five-years-us-hedge-funds-expect-to-hold-10-6-of-assets-in-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Within five years, US hedge funds expect to hold 10.6% of assets in crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Given that there are large amounts of funds ready to flow into cryptocurrencies, another massive fall is unlikely. However, that does not mean a new bull market will start in a hurry. Most major cryptocurrencies may enter a bottoming formation before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the critical levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been sustaining above the 20-day exponential moving average ($38,274) for the past three days but the bulls have not been able to thrust the price above the 200-day simple moving average ($42,678). This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0047eb39-3811-4799-9551-2aff714a1920.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $31,000 where buying may emerge.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $31,000 will indicate that the pair may extend its consolidation for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and buyers drive the price above the 200-day SMA. Such a move will be the first sign that the correction may be over. If bulls sustain the price above the 200-day SMA for three days, the pair could rally to $51,483.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break below $31,000 will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls and the downtrend may resume.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a symmetrical triangle for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are buying near the support line of the triangle while the bears are selling near the resistance line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/03218cf8-68b7-4593-9833-2815624c6f8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above or below the triangle may result in a strong trending move but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the triangle, it will indicate that the correction may be over. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally toward its pattern target at $3,684.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below the support line, the downtrend may resume. The bulls will try to stall the decline at the 200-day SMA ($1,831) but if this support also cracks, the next target objective is $1,347.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the trendline and the 20-day EMA ($372) for the past few days. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 44 suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/3ee7686c-4373-4cd6-8277-66a9697800e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the trendline, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($253). A break and close below this support could intensify the selling, and the pair could extend the decline to $200.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could challenge the overhead resistance at $433. A breakout and close above this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective at $609.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $1.33 and $94 for the past few days. The altcoin rebounded off the support on June 12 but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.58).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b574f56e-9fa6-428f-94fd-2aa92abd6668.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bears. If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1.33.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could drop to the next critical support at $1. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively. A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the pair may consolidate inside the large range of $1 and $1.94 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $1.94. A breakout of this resistance will increase the possibility of the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($0.34) for the past few days but the bears have not been able to sink the price below the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. This suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/4f8b8fc7-7d63-49c3-9377-ad010ce7f140.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the downside. The bears will make one more attempt to sink and sustain the price below the neckline.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its downward journey to the critical support at $0.21 and then to the 200-day SMA ($0.14). This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading between $1.07 and $0.75 for the past few days. The failure of the bulls to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.93) in the past few days suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d1692857-e9bf-4ec8-b107-f74046a4d34f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price down to the support at $0.75. The 200-day SMA ($0.72) is just below the support, hence the bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 However, if the selling intensifies and bears sink the price below the 200-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could start a deeper decline to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $1.07. A breakout and close above this resistance will indicate the downtrend may be over. The pair could then rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 14 but the bulls could not thrust the price above it. This suggests that the bears have not given up yet and are selling on rallies to the resistance line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c6ffc3b0-ba0f-4c13-a29c-d224dcc39c47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($23), the DOT/USDT pair could extend its stay inside the symmetrical triangle for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint also signals a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the triangle will be the first indication that the correction may be over. The pair may then rally to $31.28 and then to the pattern target at $39.78. Conversely, if bears sink the price below the support line, the pair may start the next leg of the downtrend that may open the doors for a decline to $15.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($24.79) on June 15, which suggests the sentiment remains negative and the bears are selling on rallies to overhead resistances.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fe0ac0bd-11c4-4e53-898c-d08e44092a3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price below the 200-day SMA ($21.87). If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $16.49 and then $13.04 as traders who have purchased in the past few days may rush to the exit.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 200-day SMA, the buyers will try to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may rally to $30.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the pair may remain range-bound between $21.50 and $30 for a few more days. A breakout and close above $30 will suggest that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($180) on June 15, which shows that bears are selling on rallies. The 20-day EMA continues to slope down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating an advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fafc1a01-a8fe-4f37-8383-64b57a4dfa0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the price below the support line. If they do that, the LTC/USDT pair could retest the May 23 low at $118.03. A break below this level could result in panic selling that may drag the price down to $70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the support line, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $225. A break above this resistance could attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not propel Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line for the past two days, indicating that bears are defending the 20-day EMA ($662) aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7e8004f6-df97-4d90-82f3-fcb29d9f6def.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sustain the price below the 200-day SMA ($603) and challenge the $538.11 support. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the descending triangle will complete and the BCH/USDT pair could resume its down move.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is at $400 and then $370. Conversely, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $864.28 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvYzFkYThhMzgtMTQyNS00NzVmLTlmNTQtZWQ5ZTQ5NWZjODNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210616eh6g000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin investors more  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  than ever despite 50% price crash: Survey\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Greg Thomson \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Steve Ehrlich\uc2  said it was encouraging to see continued faith in the cryptocurrency market despite the recent crash.\par \par \uc2 Despite Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the wider cryptocurrency market experiencing one of its worst crashes in recent memory, investors are apparently more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  than ever regarding the future fortunes of Bitcoin and a host of altcoins.\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s according to the results of a Q2 retail investment survey conducted by crypto firm \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2 , which polled 3,671 high-frequency traders on the Voyager platform.\par \par \uc2 The survey\u8217\'20\'19s findings revealed that 81% of respondents are more confident in the future of cryptocurrency, even after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/life-style/gadgets-and-tech/bitcoin-price-crash-latest-crypto-2021-b1836265.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 violent price crash}}}\uc2  in April and May, which saw Bitcoin and others lose more than 50% of their value.\par \par \uc2 Many coins have since recovered significantly, although the market still remains uncertain. Despite this, 87% of the survey\u8217\'20\'19s respondents said they planned to increase their crypto holdings over the next quarter \u8212\'20\'14 an increase on the 80% who said the same in Q1.\par \par \uc2 Some 39% of respondents said they expected the Bitcoin price to fall between $56,000 and $70,000 by the end of Q3 2021, while 28% predicted a Bitcoin price between $41,000 and $55,000. The percentage of respondents who believed Bitcoin would reach a price of $71,000 stood at 18%, down from the previous survey\u8217\'20\'19s figure of 20%.\par \par \uc2 Notably, more than nine out of 10 of those polled said they thought the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  would eventually approve a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-begins-formal-review-of-fidelity-skybridge-bitcoin-etf-applications"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETF}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 an exchange-traded fund that crypto proponents believe will boost the value of Bitcoin through exposing it to institutional investment.\par \par \uc2 Among the altcoins that respondents said they were most \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned out to be the most popular. Some 55% said they were \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Cardano above any other altcoin, with \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) coming in second (11%), followed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-releases-new-whitepaper-for-smart-contract-computations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink}}}\uc2  (LINK) (6%) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/polkadot-dot-and-kusama-ksm-skyrocket-in-price-after-attracting-30m-in-funding"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot}}}\uc2  (DOT) (6%).\par \par \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Steve Ehrlich\uc2  said it was encouraging to see continued faith in the cryptocurrency market despite the recent crash. Ehrlich suggested the results of the survey indicate that most investors view the recent market dip as a buying opportunity, rather than a portent of worse to come.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe fact that the vast majority of our large sample size of investors are more confident in the future of cryptocurrency, shows how people see May\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in many crypto-assets as a buying opportunity,\u8221\'20\'1D said Ehrlich.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur findings show that 87% of investors are looking to increase their crypto holdings in the next quarter, a much higher percentage compared to the last survey we conducted in April,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvMDA4N2EyMTQtOTNmYi00NjAzLWEwNDgtY2I5NTE1NTUyYzg0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210615eh6f0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/14: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,883 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s surge above $40,000 and the breakouts from select altcoins may be signals that the bottoming process has begun.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the psychological resistance at $40,000 following a series of positive news flow over the past week. The first bit of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news that impacted the price of Bitcoin was a tweet from Tesla CEO Elon Musk who said the carmaker wil {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-40k-and-no-demand-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accept}}}\uc2  Bitcoin payments if more than 50% clean energy is used by Bitcoin miners with a \u8220\'20\'1Cpositive future trend.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another piece of news that may have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-40k-as-paul-tudor-jones-slams-fed-inflation-claims"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boosted}}}\uc2  the recovery in Bitcoin was Paul Tudor Jones' suggestion that 5% of every investment portfolio have exposure to Bitcoin, which is equal to that of gold, cash and commodities. Jones was al critical of the U.S. Fed\u8217\'20\'19s view that the current rise in inflation numbers is transitory.\par \par \uc2 The recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news is proof that the current drop has not altered the fundamentals of Bitcoin. Therefore, as the price stabilizes, Bitcoin may again attract institutional investment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7c49ae8b-bc98-46a2-9da0-efac1beefdbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-could-hold-more-than-4b-in-bitcoin-after-latest-private-offering-and-crypto-purchase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 completed}}}\uc2  its $500 million offering of secured notes, which the company plans to use for buying Bitcoin. After deducting various expenses, the business intelligence firm is left with $488 million that will be used to purchase Bitcoin. This will add to the company's existing stack of 92,079 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sell-pressure-may-hit-zero-in-july-thanks-to-grayscale-s-giant-16k-btc-unlocking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin sell pressure may hit zero in July thanks to Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s giant 16K BTC unlocking}}}\par \par \uc2 With demand likely to return, could Bitcoin lead the recovery in the crypto markets? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up on June 13 and soared above the resistance line of the developing descending triangle pattern. This move invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. The buyers have continued their purchase today and pushed the price above $40,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7e2d6792-b462-4d27-b84b-7b08843a2ca1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day simple moving average ($36,779) has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive territory, indicating that the selling pressure has reduced.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could now attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($44,571), which may act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance but finds support at the 20-day SMA, it will suggest the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the 50-day SMA will signal a possible change in trend and the pair could then rally to $51,483. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair turns down and plummets below the $34,600.36 support. Such a move will suggest that traders are dumping their positions on minor rallies.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dropped below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on June 12 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b6337948-0884-4a17-927f-50a1f40efcdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rebounded off the trendline on June 13 and the bulls are now trying to push the price above the 20-day SMA ($2,581). If they succeed, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the triangle and the 50-day SMA ($2,940) will indicate that the downtrend is over. The pair could then move up to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,806.91.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below $2,200. That could open the doors for a fall to $2,079 and then $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the trendline on June 13 and the bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day SMA ($364). This suggests that the bulls are defending the trendline aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fda7b0a9-215d-42e8-ad97-4b6150ffb355.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the price above the 20-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair may move up to $433. This level may act as a resistance but if the bulls can push the price above it, the ascending triangle pattern will complete.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $609. The gradually rising 20-day SMA and the RSI above 46 suggest the buyers are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the trendline, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. The pair could then drop to $291.06 and then to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the trendline on June 11 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls are buying on dips. The altcoin rose above the trendline on June 13 and the bulls are currently trying to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/77d473e9-6d95-4247-a4ca-2a00b84a8730.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $1.94 where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge. However, a breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the correction is over.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, the pair could again drop to $1.33. A break below this support will indicate weakness and the pair could then plummet to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to rebound off the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. This suggests the bulls are attempting to defend this support. If buyers push the price above the 20-day SMA ($0.34), the altcoin could start its journey to the 50-day SMA ($0.40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a310be8c-5d11-4703-8019-a41a5fcd0d4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are again likely to mount a stiff resistance at the 50-day SMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the neckline and remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattening moving averages and the RSI just below 46 points to a range-bound action in the near term. This neutral view will invalidate if buyers push the price above $0.45 or bears sink the pair below the neckline.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading below the 20-day SMA ($0.92) for the past few days but the bears have not been able to sink the price below the $0.75 support. This suggests that bulls are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/dcc5e193-18ce-4297-8666-1cc25dad5a42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA is flattening out and the RSI is above 44, indicating the bulls are trying to make a comeback. A breakout and close above the 20-day SMA will be the first sign of strength. It will indicate that traders have resumed their purchases.\par \par \uc2 That could push the price to $1.10 where the bears will try to defend the level aggressively. However, if buyers thrust the price above this level, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.19). This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $0.75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/97fff04b-acc9-4d0f-8cc5-970ca6b29083.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day SMA ($22.98) and the RSI above 48 points to a possible range-bound action in the short term. However, if bulls push the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the DOT/USDT pair may start a relief rally to $31.28 and then to $41.40.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the resistance line, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the pair below $19.50. If they succeed, the pair could start its journey toward the next critical support at $15.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is trading between the $21.50 support and the $30 resistance for the past few days. Although the bears pulled the price below $21.50 on June 12 and 13, they could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls purchased the dip below $21.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b01f056e-3c36-40e4-bd6f-8f1220975654.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the downtrend line. This shows that the bears have not thrown in the towel yet. If the price turns down from the current level, the sellers will make another attempt to sink the UNI/USDT pair below the $21.50 to $20.23 support.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could drop to $16.49 and then $13.04. Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push the price above the downtrend line, the pair may move up to the 20-day SMA ($25.45).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day SMA, it will suggest the sentiment remains negative. However, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day SMA, the pair could rise to $30.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has failed to break above or below the symmetrical triangle as the bulls are buying on dips to the support line and bears are selling at the resistance line. If the price reaches the apex of the triangle without breaking out, the pattern will be invalidated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/eaabea98-9937-4e24-8708-ab708d050a24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the resistance line. If they succeed in sustaining the price above the triangle, it will suggest that buyers are back in the game. That could open the doors for a move to $225 and then to the 50-day SMA ($237).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the LTC/USDT pair below the support line. If that happens, the pair could drop to $140 and then to $118.03.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending triangle pattern for the past few days, which will complete on a breakdown and close below $538.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/8df39d53-0ce9-4236-960a-ae8c580b73d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the BCH/USDT pair could witness aggressive selling and may drop to $400 and then to $370. The gradually downsloping 20-day SMA ($656) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls propel the price above the downtrend line. Such a move could catch several aggressive bears off guard and may result in a short squeeze, pushing the price to the 50-day SMA ($894).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNDVkMzU0MGUtNTQ2OS00Yzc3LTk2NjQtNzA1M2I2NmMzOGQ1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210614eh6e000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/11: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,850 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most altcoins could be gearing up for a few days of range-bound action as bulls buy on dips and bears sell on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above the critical $40,000 to $42,000 resistance zone is keeping crypto traders on tenterhooks. Some analysts view the sharp rebound from $31,000 level as a sign of accumulation at lower levels while others believe the failure to cross above the overhead resistance indicates that Bitcoin is still not out of the woods yet.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s cryptocurrency market analysts, led by global market strategist Nikolaos Panigirtzoglou, pointed out that after the recent fall, the Bitcoin futures market has shifted from contango to backwardation for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-points-to-weak-bitcoin-futures-as-signal-for-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first time}}}\uc2  since 2018. The analysts believe this is a warning of a possible bear market, similar to the one seen in 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9b7308b3-0fae-424c-aaa0-d1c53a2ba8b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price remains subdued, one of the fundamental reasons to own Bitcoin received a shot in the arm when the U.S. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-boon-as-us-inflation-hits-13-year-high-wages-fall-to-lowest-in-21st-century"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflation}}}\uc2  numbers rose to their highest levels since 2008. If inflation remains high, institutional investors may consider investing in Bitcoin to hedge their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-eye-crucial-38k-level-as-btc-price-action-consolidates-higher"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders eye \u8216\'20\'18crucial\u8217\'20\'19 $38K level as BTC price action consolidates higher}}}\par \par \uc2 What are the levels that may suggest the downtrend could be over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the resistance line on June 10 but the bears have not been able to sustain the price down below the 20-day exponential moving average ($36,604). This suggests that buyers are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/ab85cf9a-bd90-433f-964a-86654972f544.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the resistance line, it will nullify the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it traps several aggressive bears who are forced to close their short positions, resulting in a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 That could result in a rally to $42,451.67 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($45,271). Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $42,451.67, the BTC/USDT pair could correct to $31,000 and consolidate in this large range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The trend will shift in favor of the bears if the pair turns down from the current level and breaks below the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($2,581) on June 9 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The price again turned down on June 10, suggesting that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7d5503d8-a57b-4e1e-9a7b-7b149888db45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could witness renewed selling that could pull the price down to $2,079 and then to $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) has been taking support near 40, suggesting a range-bound action in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the pair may move up to the 20-day EMA and then extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. A breakout and close above the 50-day SMA ($2,929) will suggest the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($358) on June 9 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on June 10. However, the positive thing is that the bulls successfully held on to the trendline support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/06d4c42c-174c-49bc-9178-e28f1b7cd05a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to propel the price above $378.77. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $433. A breakout and close above this resistance could push the price to the 50-day SMA ($478).\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above this level will suggest the downtrend could be over. This positive view will be negated if the price turns down from the current levels or the overhead resistance and plummets below the trendline. That could pull the price down to $291.06 and then to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.61) on June 10, indicating that the sentiment remains negative. The bears will now try to sink and sustain the price below the trendline support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fd9e2897-4a51-4bee-85cf-dfde34bdd4de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the developing ascending triangle pattern will invalidate. This could result in a drop to $1.24 and then to the critical support at $1. A strong rebound off $1 could keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above $1.63, the pair could rally to $1.94. A breakout and close above this resistance will signal that bulls are back in command. That could result in a retest of the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on June 10, suggesting that bears are selling on every minor relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fa9acf1b-b9e1-4d37-8618-f9b587e05fe9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the neckline, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern that could result in a drop to $0.21. The bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds strongly off this level, the DOGE/USDT could retest the neckline. If the price turns down from this resistance, the possibility of a break below $0.21 increases. That could result in a drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages. That could open the gates for a rally to $0.47.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.93) on June 10 but the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This indicates that bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cefd7800-2621-4a93-b0e3-461f24cf676e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is trying to sustain above 40, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.10.\par \par \uc2 A break above this resistance could challenge the 50-day SMA ($1.20). This view will invalidate if the price fails to break above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that bears are not willing to relent. That could result in a drop to the $0.75 to $0.65 support zone.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back into the ascending channel on June 10 but failed. This shows that bears are selling at higher levels. The bears will now try to sink the price below $19.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/be243acd-f6e6-494a-9376-b5ff3ef5c247.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could start its decline to $17.50 and then to the critical support zone at $15 to $13.63. A bounce off this zone could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($22.81), a retest of $26.50 is possible. A breakout and close above this overhead resistance could result in a rally to $31.28.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($25.58) on June 9 and 10 but failed. This shows the bears have not thrown in the towel yet. The sellers will now try to sink the price below the $21.50 to $20.46 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/682ce626-ab61-46f7-89fd-48dc17d561d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand and the UNI/USDT pair could be on its way to $16.49 and then $13.04.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $21.50, the pair may again try to rise above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, a move to $30 is likely. If the pair turns down from this resistance, the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $30 to signal the end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($176) for the past few days but the bulls have not been able to push the price above it. This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d801cca6-8784-4483-ae35-26ff1ebe1340.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the LTC/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($241). The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is attempting to sustain above 40, suggesting the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the triangle. That could sink the pair to $118.03 and then to $100.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears near the critical level at $616.04. The bulls are buying the dip below $616.04 but the bears are defending the 20-day EMA ($667).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a8c90b25-ac8c-4e90-94c3-b15b5df77549.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out but the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting the bulls are trying to make a comeback. A breakout and close above the downtrend line will indicate that demand exceeds supply. That may result in a rally to the 50-day SMA ($905).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are selling on every minor rally. A break below $542.63 will open the gates for a further fall to $468.13.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvY2VmNzYyMGYtNjVjNS00ZTBmLWE2YTAtZTZiMmIyZjRiNzg0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210611eh6b000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/9: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, SOL, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,829 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rebound from its recent swing low suggests traders are aggressively accumulating BTC and altcoins on major dips.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone believes that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is more likely to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-gains-6-as-bloomberg-analyst-favors-40k-over-20k-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally}}}\uc2  to $40,000 than slump to $20,000. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook seems to be shared by traders as Bitcoin initiated a sharp recovery today.\par \par \uc2 On-chain data also suggests that long-term holders (LTH) have again started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-is-fragile-but-on-chain-data-points-to-fresh-accumulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating}}}\uc2  Bitcoin after booking profits during the rally from $10,000 to $64,000.\par \par \uc2 The total number of Bitcoin held by these long-term holders is 2.3 million more than what they held at the peak of the 2017 bull market. This shows the veteran traders remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the future prospects of Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d018387d-9588-4fdd-adbe-4ad4633ea805.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 ' Monday \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D report shows institutional investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-141m-outflow-from-bitcoin-products-signals-institutions-are-bearish-on-btc-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pulled}}}\uc2  out $141 million from Bitcoin investment products last week. However, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) products witnessed net inflows, suggesting money is exiting Bitcoin and entering select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 However, the outflow from Bitcoin products is minuscule compared to the massive $4.2 billion that was pumped into them in 2021. This shows that most investors have held their positions despite the recent fall.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine whether the correction is over or if the prices could fall further.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the trendline of the symmetrical triangle on June 7, indicating the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bears. However, the long tail on the June 8 candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/4b7fb9ed-5dc6-4cea-874a-0b46f5de1a12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their purchase today, which seems to have trapped the aggressive bears who may have sold on June 7. However, the BTC/USDT pair is still not out of the woods yet because the relief rally is likely to face resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($37,925).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The next leg of the downtrend could begin after the bears sink the price below the $31,000 to $28,000 support zone. Such a move may open the doors for a decline to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the relative strength index (RSI) has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close above the 20-day EMA, which could extend the relief rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($45,896).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether once again turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 7, indicating the bears are aggressively defending the zone between the resistance line and the 50-day SMA ($2,927).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/acc82b3d-a72b-46c4-98d1-24971331172e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the June 8 candlestick shows the bulls are buying on dips to the support line of the symmetrical triangle. This suggests the ETH/USDT pair could remain stuck inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start after the price breaks above or below the triangle. The buyers will have to propel the price above the 50-day SMA to gain the upper hand. Alternatively, a break below $2,079.94 could signal advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the trendline on June 8 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The long tail on the daily candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the trendline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c3442aa9-e0d4-4e3e-8418-4c799c79b59d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA ($389), the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $433. A breakout and close above this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective at $608.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the trendline, it will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls. That could result in a drop to $257.40 and then to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano dropped below the 50-day SMA ($1.57) on June 8 but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. The long tail on the June 8 and June 9 candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/cabdb9af-4f69-4427-9a74-17a1c9db7711.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance will shift in favor of the bears if the price breaks below the trendline. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop to $1.24 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.64), the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $1.94. A breakout and close above this level could push the pair to the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.36) on June 7 and fell to the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. The bulls are trying to defend this level as seen from the long tail on the June 8 candlestick and the strong rebound today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/144db495-34eb-4d7f-b359-32b5428b5c69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, unless the bulls push the price above the moving averages quickly, the bears will once again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the neckline. If they succeed, the pair could decline to $0.21 and then to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The marginally downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a minor advantage to the bears. This negative view will invalidate if the bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.39). The pair could then move up to $0.47.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP broke below the $0.88 support on June 7, suggesting supply exceeds demand. However, the long tail on the June 8 candlestick indicates that bulls are trying to defend the $0.75 to $0.65 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/ddbb1cd2-d70a-4d87-8340-b09cf7e4cf1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.99) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears are in control. The relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the possibility of a break below the support zone increases.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.45 and then to $0.39. Conversely, if the bulls push the price above $1.10, it will suggest the buyers are back in the game and a rally to the downtrend line is possible.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($24.99) on June 7 and broke below the trendline of the ascending channel. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/4a083a71-0030-4599-940c-82edf5f06397.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push the price back into the channel within the next few days, further selling could be expected. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the DOT/USDT pair breaks below $19.60, the next stop could be the critical support at $15. Conversely, if the pair re-enters the channel, it will suggest strong accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the resistance line of the ascending channel will signal that bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the $21.50 support on June 8 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bulls are defending the $21.50 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e5b21b92-ebe2-4d32-a4b4-fc11a161b517.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($26.81). If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $30. This level may act as a stiff resistance and if the price turns down from it, the pair could remain range-bound between $21.50 and $30 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment is negative and traders are selling on every minor rally. That will increase the possibility of a break below $21.50. If that happens, the pair could start its journey toward $16.49 and then $13.04.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $43.38 on June 7 but the bears could not pull the price below the trendline. The altcoin rebounded off the trendline on June 8, indicating strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/201eb089-c369-41d9-945f-01655a27b43d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust and sustain the price above $43.38, the SOL/USDT pair could move up to the 78.6% retracement level at $49.97. Such a move will suggest the recent correction is over. A break above $49.97 could clear the path for a retest of the all-time high at $58.38.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will nullify if the price turns down and plummets below the trendline. A break below $33.60 could result in a decline to $25.70.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $616.04 support on June 7, suggesting the bears are in command. However, the long tail on the June 8 candlestick indicates that bulls are trying to defend the $500 to $468.13 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/11f6f45e-dc08-40ee-b557-db0fbe43be45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $616.04, the BCH/USDT pair could make one more attempt to rise above the downtrend line. If that happens, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($917).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, then the bears may challenge the critical $468.13 support. A break below this level could extend the decline to the next support at $400.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvMzFlOGRmY2YtNTk2Yy00ZTU4LWExOGMtM2IzNjcwMDgxOTVkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210609eh69000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Record $141M outflow from Bitcoin products signals institutions are  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  on BTC: \uc2 CoinShares\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 405 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Weekly outflows from institutional Bitcoin products have hit an all-time of $141 million, while trade volume is also down 62% compared to May.\par \par \uc2 The latest report from analytics firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  shows that outflows from institutional Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) investment products continue to surge.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Monday \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , institutional investors are continuing to reduce Bitcoin exposure, with BTC investment products seeing a record outflow of $141 million this past week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/99c5d04a-ae32-4a83-941d-3542ca4df547.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Capital flows for crypto investment products. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 The data follows heavy institutional selling amid May\u8217\'20\'19s dramatic crypto market meltdown, with institutions having withdrawn nearly $100 million from crypto products between May 10 and May 16 before outflows briefly slowed toward the end of last month.\par \par \uc2 Trade volume for BTC products is also sharply declining, with the first week of June seeing a 62% drop in trade activity compared to May\u8217\'20\'19s weekly average.\par \par \uc2 Despite describing institutional sentiment toward BTC as having turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since early May, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  highlighted the outflows represent less than one-tenth of 2021\u8217\'20\'19s inflows:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe outflows represent 8.3% of the net inflows seen this year and remain minimal on relative terms to the outflows seen in early 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Since the start of 2021, more than $4.2 billion in capital has flowed into Bitcoin products, with BTC currently representing 65.9% of all capital locked in crypto investment products.\par \par \uc2 The declining institutional demand for BTC has again coincided with increasing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-cautiously-re-enter-crypto-funds-while-eth-vehicles-show-strength"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional appetites for Ether}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) representing more than 26.8% of the combined assets under management currently locked in crypto investment products after receiving inflows of $33 million this past week.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  also noted investors are seeking exposure to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) investment products are attracting interest, with XRP\u8217\'20\'19s inflows totaling $7 million \u8212\'20\'14 its largest weekly inflow since April \u8212\'20\'14 and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s inflows tagging $4.5 million.\par \par \uc2 According to data from CoinGecko, Ether continues to have usurped Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s status as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-sails-past-btc-s-daily-volume-as-grayscale-eth-trust-trades-at-11-premium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most-traded non-stablecoin crypto asset}}}\uc2  in the broader crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 Roughly $37.4 billion worth of Ether traded hands over the past 24 hours \u8212\'20\'14 second only to stablecoin Tether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) $75.5 billion in daily trade. By comparison, Bitcoin has processed $32.9 billion in 24-hour trade volume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvZDI1MmUxODgtYTUzOC00MjlhLTkxMTMtY2IyNzQwZTA1NmI1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210608eh680005s\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Record $141M outflow from Bitcoin products signals institutions are  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  on BTC: \uc2 CoinShares\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 404 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Weekly outflows from institutional Bitcoin products have hit an all-time of $141 million, while trade volume is also down 62% compared to May.\par \par \uc2 The latest report from analytics firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  shows that outflows from institutional BTC investment products continue to surge.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 June 7 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , institutional investors are continuing to reduce Bitcoin exposure, with BTC investment products seeing a record outflow of $141 million this past week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/99c5d04a-ae32-4a83-941d-3542ca4df547.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Capital flows for crypto investment products: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 The data follows heavy institutional selling amid May\u8217\'20\'19s dramatic crypto market meltdown, with institutions having withdrawn nearly $100 million from crypto products between May 10 and May 16, before outflows briefly slowed towards the end of last month.\par \par \uc2 Trade volume for BTC products is also sharply declining, with the first week of June seeing a 62% drop in trade activity compared to May\u8217\'20\'19s weekly average.\par \par \uc2 Despite describing institutional sentiment towards BTC as having turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since early May, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  highlighted the outflows represent less than one-tenth of 2021\u8217\'20\'19s inflows:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe outflows represent 8.3% of the net inflows seen this year and remain minimal on relative terms to the outflows seen in early 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Since the start of 2021, more than $4.2 billion in capital has flowed into Bitcoin products, with BTC current representing 65.9% of all capital locked in crypto investment products.\par \par \uc2 The declining institutional demand for BTC has again coincided with increasing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-cautiously-re-enter-crypto-funds-while-eth-vehicles-show-strength"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional appetites for Ethereum}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 with Ether representing more than 26.8% of the combined assets under management (AUM) currently locked in crypto investment products after receiving inflows of $33 million this past week.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  also noted investors are seeking exposure to Ripple (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) investment products are attracting interest, with XRP\u8217\'20\'19s inflows totaling $7 million \u8212\'20\'14 its largest weekly inflow since April \u8212\'20\'14 and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s inflows tagging $4.5 million.\par \par \uc2 According to data from CoinGecko, Ether continues to have usurped Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s status as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-sails-past-btc-s-daily-volume-as-grayscale-eth-trust-trades-at-11-premium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 most-traded non-stablecoin crypto asset}}}\uc2  in the broader crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 Roughly $37.4 billion worth of Ether traded hands over the past 24 hours \u8212\'20\'14 second only to stablecoin Tether\u8217\'20\'19s $75.5 billion in daily trade. By comparison, Bitcoin has processed $32.9 billion in 24-hour trade volume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvZDI1MmUxODgtYTUzOC00MjlhLTkxMTMtY2IyNzQwZTA1NmI1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210608eh6800007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/7: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, ICP, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,922 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are likely to remain under pressure for a few days but lower levels could attract buying.\par \par \uc2 United States Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-doesn-t-care-about-el-salvador-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 defended}}}\uc2  President Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s latest massive spending package while speaking to Bloomberg. Yellen said it would be \u8220\'20\'1Ca plus\u8221\'20\'1D for society even if it resulted in a higher interest rate environment.\par \par \uc2 If rates inch higher, traders will explore the best possible options to hedge their portfolios. While gold is down about 2.5% year-to-date, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is still up 22% during the same period, even after the massive plunge in May.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s outperformance may not go unnoticed and several institutional investors are likely to make it a part of their portfolio along with gold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/78ed5c3a-bb80-4933-8721-c4dd97a422d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 London-based asset management firm Ruffer booked a profit of more than $1 billion on an investment of $600 million in Bitcoin. Ruffer\u8217\'20\'19s investment director Hamish Baillie in an interview with The Times said the company bought in November and sold its \u8220\'20\'1Clast tranche in April.\u8221\'20\'1D Baillie said institutional investors, including Ruffer, are likely to continue buying Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that Bitcoin is likely to attract huge institutional interest at lower levels, which may act as a strong floor. The larger the purchases by institutions at lower levels, the higher the price is likely to rally during the next bull phase.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine their next possible trending move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped to the trendline of the symmetrical triangle on June 5 but the bears could not break this support. The bulls successfully defended the trendline for the past two days and are attempting a rebound off it today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b8d403ae-e666-4f6c-83fc-e4625b54b08c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push the price above the resistance line of the triangle to gain the upper hand. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could extend the relief rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($46,784).\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 50-day SMA will be the first indication that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the triangle, the pair could witness panic selling. That may pull the price down to the critical support zone at $30,000 to $28,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 4 but the shallow correction shows the bulls are buying on dips. The price has risen back above the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,743) and the bulls are challenging the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d107a6a0-ed96-4d95-867b-22a3a85b18c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the triangle and the 50-day SMA ($2,918), it will suggest the start of a rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,362.72. This level may act as stiff resistance but if the bulls arrest the next decline above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slides below $2,550, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. A bounce off this support could extend the stay of the pair inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the support line of the triangle. Such a move could clear the path for a decline to $2,180.53 and then $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $433 on June 4 and the bears thwarted another attempt by the bulls to clear the resistance on June 5. This suggests the bears are aggressively defending the $433 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/1c8fbfc3-50cd-4efd-872d-c67a29114f35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the price traded below the 20-day EMA ($398) for the past two days, the bears could not sink the BNB/USDT pair to the trendline. This suggests that bulls may be regrouping to make another assault at the $433 level.\par \par \uc2 If buyers succeed in driving the price above this resistance, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($492) and then to the 78.6% retracement level at $589.04.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and drops below $365, the pair may correct to the trendline. A break below this support will suggest the bears are back in the game.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.88 on June 3 but the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA (1.67). This suggests the sentiment is turning positive and the bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/5c83a11d-5c97-489b-8f87-8f8dfaa14f92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now have to push the price above $1.94 to gain the upper hand. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /UDST pair could rally to the all-time high at $2.47. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest aggressive selling at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($1.56) and $1.94 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $1.33. That could open the doors for a further slide to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) had formed a Doji candlestick pattern on June 5 and 6 near the 20-day EMA ($0.37), indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c4dcedb5-884e-4877-84d8-a0a447ea5cbd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $0.35, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the neckline of a large head and shoulders pattern. A breakdown and close below the neckline will be a huge negative as that could increase the possibility of a drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 However, the moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a few days of range-bound action. If the price turns up from the neckline, the pair could rise to $0.47 and remain stuck between these levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $0.47 will be the first sign of strength. It will clear the path for a northward march toward $0.59.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($1.03) and $0.88 for the past few days. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 44 indicate advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/734633b5-2922-43d0-ba12-e1bf67fbf468.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $0.88, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.79 and then to the May 23 low at $0.65.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls propel the price above $1.10. If that happens, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.23) and then to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This is an important resistance to watch out for because a break above it will suggest the downtrend is over.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending channel for the past few days. The altcoin is attempting to bounce off the trendline of the channel and rise above the overhead resistance at $26.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/33ed662b-a5dd-42ad-bc32-9d8c004cfe94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($31.68) and then to the resistance line of the channel. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair may continue to trade inside the channel.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls thrust the price above the channel, the momentum could pick up. That will also suggest an end to the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies to the moving averages. A break below the trendline of the channel will increase the possibility of a drop to $18.41 and then to $15.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($27.64) on June 4 but the bulls did not allow the price to drop below $25. This suggests a positive sentiment because traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/26258de0-3b29-43f8-90f8-2ef47f2cd2b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and the overhead resistance at $30, the UNI/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($32.79). This level may again act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls arrest the next decline at the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment has turned positive. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to the 78.6% retracement level at $38.15.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $21.50. Such a move will suggest the bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) is struggling to rebound off the $103.71 support for the past two days, which indicates a lack of buyers even at these levels. This increases the likelihood of a break below the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d6fa4cd4-3ae3-45de-8f7e-1fbc72623dc3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the ICP/USDT pair could drop to the all-time low at $86.01. This is an important support to watch out for because if this level cracks, the pair could extend its decline to $60.\par \par \uc2 The negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $120. That will indicate strong buying at lower levels. A break above $136.60 could open the door for a rally to $168.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently trading between the downtrend line and the support at $616.04. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($747) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/569b43f9-6bf5-449c-b672-86bffcfea6b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the $616.04 support, the bears will try to pull the price down to the May 23 support at $468.13. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the decline could extend to $400.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest buyers are attempting to make a comeback. The BCH/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($930).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvN2U1OTA5NmUtMDNkNC00YjA3LWJmYTEtMmJmNDYyY2M4ZjcyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210607eh67000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, ETH,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,851 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is on the verge of a trend defining move and if bulls succeed, ETH, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , SOL and THETA could rally higher.\par \par \uc2 When the sentiment in the market turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , every bit of negative news, however insignificant, pulls the price down as traders panic sell. This is what happened after China\u8217\'20\'19s social media giant, Weibo, suspended a number of crypto-related accounts and triggered fears that a wider crackdown could occur.\par \par \uc2 In other news, a note from \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said their meetings with 25 chief investment officers of long-only and hedge funds revealed Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/bitcoin-drops-amid-weibo-crypto-065155001.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 least}}}\uc2  favorite asset for investment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/f7e44d95-83b8-4040-878f-38b0af869437.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the news may be negative in the short term, it is unlikely to change the long-term story of Bitcoin. As the price corrects, several institutional investors are likely to consider crypto investments to hedge their portfolio against the possible surge in inflation in the United States.\par \par \uc2 From the perspective of most traders, Bitcoin's current decline continues to represent a buying opportunity for the longer term.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may outperform in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($39,127) on June 3 but is finding support near the trendline of the triangle. This shows that bulls are buying on dips, and bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/ccb35be7-7e53-479a-9400-c137992dcc53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start after the price escapes from the triangle. If the bulls propel and sustain the price above the resistance line, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($47,198) and then to the pattern target at $52,622.90.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the trendline of the triangle, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. That could result in a drop to the $30,000 to $28,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 If this zone cracks, the selling could intensify as several traders who bought recently may exit their positions. That may pull the price down to $20,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/54e06934-c0ee-4573-8a8c-91bf18407684.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages on the 4-hour chart have flattened out, and the relative strength index (RSI) is oscillating roughly between 40 and 60, indicating an equilibrium between buyers and sellers.\par \par \uc2 However, this state of uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long and the price is likely to break above or below the triangle in the next few days. If the price breaks out and sustains above the triangle, it will suggest the setup acted as a reversal pattern.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the triangle, it will suggest that the current consolidation was a temporary halt in a strong downtrend. It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout, hence traders may wait for the break to happen before considering fresh positions.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($2.908) on June 4 and re-entered the symmetrical triangle. However, the positive thing is that bulls did not give up much ground, indicating strong buying near $2,550.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/daa24841-502a-4ef6-8d3e-e2ba24f8e025.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers drive the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair may again challenge the 50-day SMA. A breakout and close above this resistance could clear the path for a move to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,362.72.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA once again, it will suggest that bears are defending the resistance aggressively. A break below $2,550 could pull the price down to the support line of the triangle. A break below the triangle will be the first indication that the bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d6504166-ab45-4af7-ab06-3b5ef3dc1129.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the formation of an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $2,906. If that happens, the pair could rally to $3,600 and then to the pattern target at $4,083.26.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the trendline of the triangle. The bears will then try to pull the price down to $2,200 and then to the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a large range between $1.94 and $1 for the past few days. The altcoin turned down from the resistance on the range on June 4 and has dropped to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/45b7df3a-0cf7-4e9b-877e-68530c3d2ccb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the zone between the 20-day EMA ($1.66) and the 50-day SMA ($1.55). If the price rebounds off the current levels, it will suggest the sentiment is turning positive and traders are buying the dips to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $1.94 will indicate the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. If the price sustains above this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $2.47. A break above this resistance will indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA. The bears will then try to pull the price down to the $1.33 to $1.22 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/fc585780-9f49-4e43-89c8-e231ccdfef03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the formation of an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $1.94. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $2.88. However, it is unlikely to be a straight dash to the target because the bears may mount a stiff resistance at the current all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a possible drop to the trendline of the triangle. A break below this support will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and that may result in a drop to $1.36 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to stall Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) relief rally at the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $43.38. However, the sellers haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($36.39), which indicates the sentiment has turned positive.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.191601193.2059850684.1622946520-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for SOL on June 1, before the rally picked up momentum..\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/3c9a2671-1f26-4959-8726-35a31c13dde7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. SOL price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.191601193.2059850684.1622946520-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen from the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for SOL flipped green on June 1 when the price was close to $32.10.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score has consistently remained in the green since then and the price of SOL has rallied to $43.33 today, recording a 35% gain in five days. This shows how the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score gave an early indication of a counter trend rally even as other tools would have been \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b6d46e1a-0a3b-4de1-9d33-affd271d9f08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair rebounded off the 20-day EMA on June 4 and has bounced off the 50-day SMA ($39.42) today. This suggests the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above $43.38, it will indicate the downtrend is over. The pair could then rally to the 78.6% retracement level at $49.97 and then to the all-time high at $58.38. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting the buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and slumps below the trendline. The pair could then decline to $25.58 and later to $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/d7d800b5-de70-4312-99d9-19f3d37df78c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages on the 4-hour chart have turned up and the RSI is trading in the positive territory, suggesting the bulls are making a comeback. The up-move may pick up momentum if buyers thrust the price above $43.38.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks the 20-EMA, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. The pair could then drop to the 50-SMA and then to the trendline. A break below the trendline will indicate that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 THETA is trading inside a descending channel. The bulls attempted to push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the channel on June 4 and 5 but failed. This suggests the bears are defending this resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a7b5d912-6c97-4784-82ac-6ca6d92d0420.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($8.19) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating the bulls have a slight advantage. If the THETA/USDT pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will make one more attempt to propel the price above the channel.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest the downtrend could be over. The pair could then start an up-move to $13 and later to the all-time high at $15.88. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could result in a decline to $6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c206795b-5eaa-4389-9c5f-362511942e3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the pair has turned down from the resistance line of the channel on two occasions. However, the bears have not been able to sink and sustain the price below the 20-EMA, indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the pair rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the channel. If they manage to do that, the next leg of the uptrend may begin.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the 20-EMA, the pair could slide down to the 50-SMA. A break below this support will suggest the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNzVjMmIwMjMtMzFjYi00NDMzLWFmYWYtYzE1ZmM5MTY3NjkzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210606eh66000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/4: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, ICP, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Continued selling at overhead resistance levels suggests that Bitcoin and altcoins could remain range-bound in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone believes Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is more likely to turn up and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/discounted-bitcoin-more-likely-to-hit-100k-than-20k-in-2021-says-bloomberg-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally}}}\uc2  to $100,000 rather than correct to $20,000. In the June edition of the Bloomberg Galaxy Crypto Index report, McGlone said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correction had not dented its foundation and it was "stronger, greener and less extended" than in April.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin has yet to witness a surge in demand, data from Coinshares show crypto funds have turned the corner and after two weeks of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-cautiously-re-enter-crypto-funds-while-eth-vehicles-show-strength"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows}}}\uc2 , investors have pumped $74 million into cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) products were leading the inflows with $47 million being pumped into them. Altcoins such as Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) each experienced more than $3 million in inflows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/497c1183-2f97-48e7-ba1d-332eca135189.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Novice traders seem to be in a hurry for the next leg of the bull move to begin. However, that is unlikely to happen quickly because after the recent market reset, the transfer of assets from weaker hands to stronger hands will take time. The reactions to Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s tweets show some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-slumps-2k-on-musk-s-in-the-end-tweets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 froth}}}\uc2  still remains.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market may remain volatile as long-term investors are accumulating on lower levels but stopping their purchases at higher levels. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies and determine the critical support and resistance levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 3 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($39,856). This suggests the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/7e210ef4-ed82-4c36-9729-44fda0265b4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price back into the triangle and they will now try to sink the price below the support line of the triangle. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the critical support zone at $30,000 to $28,000.\par \par \uc2 If this zone cracks, panic selling may set in and that could result in a drop to the next major support at $20,000. Such a deep fall could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close above the 20-day EMA. That will suggest the sentiment has improved and bulls are buying at higher levels. The rally could then extend to the 50-day simple moving average ($48,192).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on June 3 but the bulls could not push the price above the 50-day SMA ($2,895). This may have attracted selling from short-term traders and the price dipped back into the triangle today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/64af27ea-7c4c-48af-aef1-5ccbe5820930.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a few days of consolidation. The pair could remain stuck inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the 50-day SMA will signal the start of an up-move that could reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,362.72. Conversely, a break below the triangle may result in a retest of the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally hit a wall near the overhead resistance at $423.83 on June 3. This suggests the bears are defending this level and the bulls will have to push the price above it to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9b98af34-620d-4ccf-a6ae-d55cfcdd0ca2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BNB/USDT pair rebounds off the trendline, it will suggest the formation of an ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a breakout and close above $433. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $586.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($400) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action. This view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the trendline. That could open the doors for a drop to $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano turned down from just under the $1.94 resistance today, suggesting the bears are defending this level aggressively. However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are buying on dips to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/2f12de74-d961-4c3c-89c9-783ab3d483b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now make one more attempt to drive the price above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could pick up momentum and challenge the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sink the price below the trendline, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to $1.59 and then to $1. A strong rebound off this support will suggest the pair could trade inside the large range between $1 and $1.94 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.44 on June 2, suggesting that traders are closing their positions on rallies. The bears have pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.37) today, indicating weakness.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/c0be15ef-729b-4694-9b69-1c2f339264a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the DOGE/USDT pair continues its slide and breaks below the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern, the selling could intensify. The bulls may try to arrest the decline at $0.21 but if they fail to do so, the pair may drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will nullify if the price bounces off the neckline and rises above $0.47. Such a move will indicate the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat and the pair could then rally to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s failure to rally above the 20-day EMA ($1.06) suggests the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. If the bears sink the price below the trendline, the decline could extend to $0.79 and then to $0.65.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e5beaa6d-b391-41c5-aaa6-dff36eb61967.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 44 suggest the bears have the upper hand. A break below $0.65 could clear the path for a drop to $0.56 and then to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the trendline, it will signal strength. If the bulls push and sustain the price above $1.10, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.27) and then to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Polkadot rose above $26.50 on June 3, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggested selling by traders at higher levels. The altcoin has turned down today and broken below the $26.50 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/be921f80-2c74-4263-ac3e-bd1f58585f0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price down to the trendline. If this support holds, the DOT/USDT pair could again rally to $26.50. If the bulls sustain the price above this resistance, the pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($32.64).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the trendline, the pair could drop to the $15 support. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair could remain range-bound between $15 and $26.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($26.45) and the RSI below 46 also point to a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($28.14) today, indicating the bears are aggressively defending this resistance. The sellers will now try to pull the price down to the support at $21.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/0c7d4aac-22b9-4243-b2af-f911b84b3c77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend $21.50 aggressively as they had done on May 30. A strong rebound off this support will confirm the formation of a higher low. The UNI/USDT pair could then remain range-bound between $21.50 and $30 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will be negated if the bears sink the price below $21.50. That will suggest the sellers have overpowered the buyers, resulting in a drop to $16 and then to $13.04.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break above $30 could push the price to the 50-day SMA ($33.27) and then to the 78.6% retracement level at $38.15.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading in a tight range between $103.71 and $120 for a few days, Internet Computer (ICP) broke above the overhead resistance on June 3. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bears used this rally to sell and trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/642136ae-2f2d-47bf-a6ba-0360a100bc02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ICP/USDT pair turned down sharply today and the bears are now trying to pull the price below the $103.71 support. If they succeed, the pair could drop to the all-time low at $86.01. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair could decline to $60.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls defend the $103.71 support, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will have to sustain the price above $120 to signal the possibility of a consolidation between $103.71 and $168.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line today, indicating the bears are defending this level aggressively. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($780) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/6bf3c5aa-0a11-4845-bec0-ecd8b165c657.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $616.04, the altcoin could drop to $468.13. This level may act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will make one more attempt to propel the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BCH/USDT pair could rally to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $919.60. A break above this resistance could open the doors for a rally to the 50% retracement at $1,059.07.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvZjViMjU0ZGQtNjFkMS00ZjM0LWIyM2YtNjI1ZjgyZDVmYTNlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210604eh64000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Filecoin\par \b \uc2 Filecoin ignores Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin FUD as FIL price rockets by 17%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 652 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The FIL token emerged as one of the top performers in the cryptocurrency market even as traders mass-dumped other assets.\par \par \uc2 FIL, the native crypto asset of the Filecoin network, was among the best performing digital assets Friday as it maintained its gains against a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 The FIL/USD reached an intraday high of $102.109 at around 3:00 am UTC \u8212\'20\'14 up more than 37% on a 24-hour adjusted timeframe. The pair underwent a sharp correction later on profit-taking sentiment but sustained its 24-hour gains by staying upward of 17%.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, Filecoin\u8217\'20\'19s top rivals Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) were down more than 6% and 7%, respectively, as of 9:45 am UTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/05e0e9e8-1906-43d0-967e-095e0d6f40a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Filecoin attempts to post solid rebounds following its recent downside moves. Source: FILUSD on TradingView\par \par \uc2 Almost all the top-cap digital assets posted losses after Elon Musk, CEO of Tesla, tweeted a cryptic breakup meme with a hashtag #Bitcoin and a broken heart emoji.\par \par \uc2 According to the firm\u8217\'20\'19s securities filing released in February, Tesla had added $1.5 billion worth of BTC to its balance sheet. However, Musk\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-slumps-2k-on-musk-s-in-the-end-tweets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mysterious tweet}}}\uc2  on Thursday night raised fears that Tesla was going to or has already unloaded its entire Bitcoin investment.\par \par \uc2 And you didn't sell, right?\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jay_OKEX_CEO (@JayHao8) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JayHao8/status/1400629754647126016?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 4, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped from around $39,500 to as low as $36,250 within a day. Meanwhile, the assets that remain positively {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 correlated}}}\uc2  to the benchmark cryptocurrency also plunged in tandem. That included the second-largest cryptocurrency Ether, followed by its top-most rivals Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and even Musk\u8217\'20\'19s favorite \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b5e3413d-77c4-484c-b41d-fd1d63405b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin takes all its top rival down after Musk\u8217\'20\'19s tweet. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 On the whole, the cryptocurrency market capitalization lost more than $128 billion in the previous 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Why did Filecoin survive the bloodbath?\par \par \uc2 No major event took place in Filecoin\u8217\'20\'19s decentralized file storage ecosystem this week. The last major announcement from the project\u8217\'20\'19s team came on May 27, wherein it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Filecoin/status/1397951624920899587"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CHyperDrive Network Upgrade\u8221\'20\'1D that proposes to boost its storage onboarding rate by 10\u8211\'20\'1325 times than the current rate.\par \par \uc2 Filecoin traders ignored the said update \u8212\'20\'14 the FIL/USD exchange rate plunged 4.36% on May 27 and 6.45% in the next session. Meanwhile, the pair traded choppily between May 20 and Wednesday in a tightening consolidation range, even as other tokens logged wild intraday price fluctuations.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/379097a8-7991-4d31-b2bc-f29c40f78d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Filecoin underwent a technical \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout after consolidating inside a Triangle pattern. Source: FILUSD on TradingView\par \par \uc2 Filecoin\u8217\'20\'19s under-performance against rival tokens also pushed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Relative Strength Index}}}\uc2  (RSI), a technical indicator to measure an asset\u8217\'20\'19s price momentum, just near oversold territory. Traders typically increase their exposure in the assets that appear undervalued per the RSI readings \u8212\'20\'14 below 30. FIL/USD\u8217\'20\'19s RSI was 35.96 before its latest price jump.\par \par \uc2 So, it appears Filecoin attracted traders owing to its perceivable undervaluation compared to other top digital assets. That provided a short-term hedge to traders attempting to offset their risks against the Musk-led crypto market decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}\uc2  (USDT) flexing relative strength to market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Wsueca6biU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Wsueca6biU}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cheds (@BigCheds) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BigCheds/status/1400646238329098246?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 4, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 FIL also displayed a similar strength against Bitcoin. The FIL/BTC exchange rate jumped by nearly 40% after opening the Thursday session at 18,286 sats. The pair corrected lower by around 8.25% in the early London session Friday. Still, they maintained intraday profits, showing that traders were in no hurry to go back to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Strong volume spikes on both FIL/USD and FIL/BTC charts also indicated a renewed interest in the trading instruments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNDI4MWJhNzgtNDkxNy00ZGQyLWE2Y2MtODUyYmZkNTc3ZWI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210604eh640008l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Filecoin\par \b \uc2 Filecoin ignores Elon Musk's Bitcoin FUD as FIL price rockets by 17%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 653 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The FIL token emerged as one of the top performers in the cryptocurrency market even as traders mass-dumped other assets.\par \par \uc2 FIL, the native crypto asset of the Filecoin network, was among the best performing digital assets Friday as it maintained its gains against a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 The FIL/USD reached an intraday high of $102.109 at around 0300 UTC, up more than 37% on a 24-hour adjusted timeframe. The pair underwent a sharp correction later on profit-taking sentiment but sustained its 24-hour gains by staying upward of 17%.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, Filecoin's top rivals Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) were down more than 6% and 7%, respectively, as of 0945 UTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/05e0e9e8-1906-43d0-967e-095e0d6f40a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Filecoin attempts to post solid rebounds following its recent downside moves. Source: FILUSD on TradingView\par \par \uc2 Almost all the top-cap digital assets posted losses after Elon Musk, the founder/CEO of Tesla, tweeted a cryptic breakup meme with a hashtag #bitcoin and a broken heart emoji.\par \par \uc2 According to the firm's securities filing released in February, Tesla had added $1.5 billion worth of BTC tokens to its balance sheet. However, Musk's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-slumps-2k-on-musk-s-in-the-end-tweets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mysterious tweet}}}\uc2  on Thursday night raised fears that Tesla was going to or has already unloaded its entire Bitcoin investment.\par \par \uc2 And you didn't sell, right?\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jay_OKEX_CEO (@JayHao8) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JayHao8/status/1400629754647126016?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 4, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped from around $39,500 to as low as $36,250 within a day. Meanwhile, the assets that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain positively correlated to the benchmark cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  also plunged in tandem. That included the second-largest cryptocurrency Ether, followed by its topmost rivals Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), and even Musk's favorite \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/b5e3413d-77c4-484c-b41d-fd1d63405b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin takes all its top rival down after Musk's tweet. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 On the whole, the cryptocurrency market cap lost more than $128 billion in the previous 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Why did Filecoin survive the bloodbath?\par \par \uc2 No major event took place in Filecoin's decentralized file storage ecosystem this week. The last major announcement from the project's team came on May 27, wherein it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Filecoin/status/1397951624920899587"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  "HyperDrive Network Upgrade" that proposes to boost its storage onboarding rate by 10-25 times than the current rate.\par \par \uc2 Filecoin traders ignored the said update \u8212\'20\'14 the FIL/USD exchange rate plunged 4.36% on May 27 and 6.45% in the next session. Meanwhile, the pair traded choppily between May 20 and June 2 in a tightening consolidation range, even as other tokens logged wild intraday price fluctuations.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/379097a8-7991-4d31-b2bc-f29c40f78d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Filecoin underwent a technical \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout after consolidating inside a Triangle pattern. Source: FILUSD on TradingView\par \par \uc2 Filecoin's under-performance against rival tokens also pushed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Relative Strength Index}}}\uc2  (RSI), a technical indicator to measure an asset's price momentum, just near an oversold territory. Traders typically increase their exposure in the assets that appear undervalued per the RSI readings \u8212\'20\'14 below 30. FIL/USD's RSI was 35.96 before its latest price jump.\par \par \uc2 So it appears, Filecoin attracted traders owing to its perceivable undervaluation compared to other top digital assets. That provided a short-term hedge to traders attempting to offset their risks against the Musk-led crypto market decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}\uc2  (USDT) flexing relative strength to market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Wsueca6biU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Wsueca6biU}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cheds (@BigCheds) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BigCheds/status/1400646238329098246?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 4, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 FIL also displayed a similar strength against Bitcoin. The FIL/BTC exchange rate jumped by nearly 40% after opening the Thursday session at 18,286 sats. The pair corrected lower by around 8.25% in the early London session Friday. Still, they maintained its intraday profits, showing that traders were in no hurry to go back to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Strong volume spikes on both FIL/USD and FIL/BTC charts also indicated a renewed interest in the trading instruments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvNDI4MWJhNzgtNDkxNy00ZGQyLWE2Y2MtODUyYmZkNTc3ZWI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210604eh640005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/2: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, UNI, ICP, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,884 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 June 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins are picking up steam as the relief rally in Bitcoin and Ether gains traction.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) active supply \u8212\'20\'14 coins that have moved in the past two years or earlier \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pre-2019-bitcoins-now-make-up-just-44-of-the-btc-active-supply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  to a five-month low of 44.5% on June 2, according to data from Glassnode. This indicates that investors who had purchased Bitcoin more than two years ago are not keen to sell after the 40% drop.\par \par \uc2 Even miners, who sold during the May correction have since reversed their decision. The outflows from miner addresses are at the lowest level in seven months, which suggests that miners are holding on to their Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/957d374f-72ca-41de-b3a3-1b4591bb2d4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt believes that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/veteran-trader-peter-brandt-sees-bitcoin-crashing-further-after-may-s-50-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 correction}}}\uc2  could extend below $30,000. Brandt said that every 50% fall in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s history has stretched to 70%. He also highlighted that according to past precedence, Bitcoin is unlikely to hit a new all-time high within seven months of a 50% correction.\par \par \uc2 However, PlanB, creator of the stock-to-flow-based Bitcoin price models, believes a further sharp fall below $30,000 is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bull-run-starting-to-look-like-2013-after-record-red-monthly-candle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unlikely}}}\uc2 . He also remains positive on the prospects of Bitcoin hitting a new all-time high this year.\par \par \uc2 At the moment, analysts are divided in their opinion on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to trade inside a symmetrical triangle pattern as the bulls and the bears battle it out to establish their supremacy. Although the symmetrical triangle generally acts as a continuation pattern, it is difficult to predict with certainty until the price breaks out of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/59c8dcc3-dbb6-4496-9382-fcf22e4a3ff8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the BTC/USDT pair breaks below the triangle, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up. There is a minor support at $28,000 but if that also cracks, the pair could retest the $20,000 level.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the triangle. If that happens, it will suggest that bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($49,201).\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls propel the price above it, the pair will signal that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,762) on June 1 but the positive sign is that the bulls did not give up much ground. This suggests that the buyers did not hurry to close their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/17b8628f-eca5-4991-a813-fab1e2fa92a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has risen near the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure has reduced.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive and sustain the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could start a relief rally that may reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,362.72 and then the 78.6% retracement level at $3,806.91.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the triangle, the pair may consolidate inside the triangle for a few more days. A breakdown and close below the triangle will indicate advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the 20-day EMA ($399) but it could face stiff resistance at $423.83. If the price turns down from this overhead resistance, the bulls will try to arrest the decline at the trendline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a2a9f3b0-1148-4c39-b550-4d9bf875ddce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest the bulls are attempting to form a higher low. This will increase the possibility of a break above $423.83. The BNB/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($505). A breakout of this resistance will suggest the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the trendline, it will suggest the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then retest the critical support at $211.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on June 1 and the bulls are trying to extend the relief rally above $2 today. The 20-day EMA ($1.64) has started to turn up and the RSI is trading above 54, suggesting that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/a45de470-3353-4bee-aa64-16a4fd931e56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers succeed in pushing the price above $2, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $2, the bears will try to pull the price back below the downtrend line. If that happens, it will suggest that buying dries up at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($1.52).\par \par \uc2 A breakdown and close below the 50-day SMA could attract further selling and the pair may drop to $1.33 and later to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on May 31 and cleared the 20-day EMA ($0.37) hurdle today. The RSI has jumped into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up, suggesting the bulls are making a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e7097846-6f53-4ac3-8511-457ded5be1d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $0.47, the DOGE/USDT pair could pick up further momentum and rise to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.47, the pair could correct to the 20-day EMA. If this support holds, it will suggest the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above $0.47.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $0.28 and then to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($1.07) on June 1 but met with stiff resistance from the bears. However, the buyers did not give up much ground, indicating strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/1047dd53-33ca-4047-8fe6-019085f0ad81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to thrust and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could start its relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.30) and then to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the pair could again drop to the $0.88 to $0.80 support zone. A break below this zone could result in a retest of the May 23 low at $0.65.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is inching towards the overhead resistance at $26.50. The price had turned down from this resistance on May 28, hence the bears are again likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/8af18605-df21-4cf9-8aae-5658361097a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the DOT/USDT pair turns down from $26.50 but bounces off the trendline, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 That could result in the formation of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a breakout and close above $26.50. The pattern target of this setup is $35.91.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below the trendline, the pair could drop to the support at $15. A strong rebound off this support will suggest a few days of range-bound action between $15 and $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($28.41) on June 1 but the positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to drift down. The buyers are again trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/6bcf07c2-4988-4b1b-af35-4e3c9446c2ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it. The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has risen above 48, indicating the selling pressure has reduced.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and $30, the UNI/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($33.67). A breakout of this resistance could signal an end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and plunges below $25.94, the bears will attempt to pull the pair down to $21.50. A breakdown and close below this support will suggest that the bears have reasserted their supremacy.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) remains weak as the bulls have not been able to push the price back above $120 in the past five days. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying even at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/e9ab0de1-0f43-4a2c-aa22-7d8350745310.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the price below the $103.71 support, the ICP/USDT pair could resume its downtrend and challenge the May 19 low at $86. If this support cracks, the pair may drop to $60.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls propel and sustain the price above $120, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. That may clear the path for an up-move to $168.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, a few days of range-bound action is likely. The pair could pick up \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum on a breakout and close above $168.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose above $685.36 on May 31. The bears tried to pull the price back below the level on June 1 but they could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests buyers are trying to form a higher low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-06/9145c38b-c95b-43e7-9d5e-131b7d143006.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($801). If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the BCH/USDT pair below the $685 to $600 support zone. If they succeed, the pair could retest the May 23 low at $468.13.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the momentum could pick up and the pair may rally to the 50-day SMA ($958). This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can thrust the price above it, the rally may extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,198.53.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDYvM2QxYzE4YjYtNDQ1OS00NzhhLWE1MmEtYWNjOTdiYThkNmIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210602eh62000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/31: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, DOT, UNI, ICP, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,892 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are attempting to start a relief rally, suggesting traders have decided to start buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) massive drop in May 2021 is among its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/worst-month-for-btc-price-in-10-years-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worst}}}\uc2  monthly performances, according to data from Bybt. The decline has divided the crypto community, with long-term investors considering the fall as a buying opportunity while short-term traders are dumping their positions out of fear.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode data suggests that long-term HODLers and miners are using the current weakness to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-accumulation-uptrend-can-create-a-2013-style-btc-price-double-pump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulate}}}\uc2  Bitcoin. This transfer of Bitcoin from weaker hands to stronger hands is a positive sign because long-term investors are unlikely to panic and dump their holdings on every bear market correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/76c38c8f-1c8b-47f1-85c1-bb94f17a30f0.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In April, the U.S. personal consumption expenditures price index soared by 3.1% compared to a year ago, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nypost.com/2021/05/28/key-inflation-indicator-rises-to-highest-level-since-1992/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 biggest}}}\uc2  increase over 12 months since July 1992. This indicates that inflation is knocking on the doors. Several institutional investors may use the current correction to add Bitcoin to their portfolios as it is an uncorrelated asset and many consider it as a good hedge against inflation.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, a sharp plunge below $30,000 looks unlikely. However, that does not mean a new bull market will start in a hurry. The price is likely to remain volatile and range-bound before the start of a sustained uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is in a downtrend. The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index in negative territory suggest the bears have the upper hand. However, the bulls have other plans as they are trying to start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/5055e10e-004c-4801-a38d-61d761406e67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern. If the bulls push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the pair could start a move to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $44,750 and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($50,161). Such a move will suggest that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the resistance line of the triangle, the pair could extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. A breakdown and close below the support line of the triangle will indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The bears could then pull the price down to $30,000 and if this level cracks, the selling may intensify and the pair could drop to $28,000 and then $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has rebounded sharply off the support line of the symmetrical triangle as traders attempt to put a higher low. The price could now challenge the resistance line of the triangle where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0ea51b73-5070-4076-a918-8b486a6bec36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the 61.8% retracement level at $3,362.72. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels. A break above $3,362.72 may signal an end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($2,756) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest the sellers have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line of the triangle, the bears will try to sink the price below the support line of the triangle. If they succeed, the pair may retest the May 23 panic low at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $306.61 support on May 29 but the bears could not sustain the selling pressure at lower levels. The altcoin quickly bounced back above $306.61 on May 30, suggesting accumulation on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/778c56f8-f279-485c-b1f2-355acc289cd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($400), which is likely to act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears will then try to pull the price down to $211.70. On the contrary, if the bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and the $428 resistance, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($512).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 50-day SMA ($1.51) on May 29 but the bears could not capitalize on the breakdown. The altcoin bounced back above the 50-day SMA on May 30, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/e4bc9e4a-6be3-41d1-ab23-4a7190504221.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($1.61) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance will tilt in favor of the buyers if they can push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $1.94 and if this level is crossed, the next stop could be a retest of the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will once again try to break the $1.33 support. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $1.24 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  below the $0.88 support on May 29 but they could not sustain the lower levels. The altcoin bounced back above $0.88 on May 30, indicating strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/faeeb2e7-f54e-4da8-9d93-d16cbd80d286.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.08), it will suggest that a short-term bottom has been made at $0.65. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.32) and later to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the bears will try to pull the price back below $0.80. If they manage to do that, the pair may challenge the $0.65 support.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has reduced due to lack of aggressive buying or selling by traders. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating the bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3510bcd2-be17-40d4-ae7f-c485a47be94e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20day EMA ($0.36), the bears will try to pull the price below the critical support at $0.21. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. The pair could then correct to $0.10 and then $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.47. A breakout of this resistance could result in a rally to $0.59.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is trying to rebound off the support at $17.50. This is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are not waiting for a dip to $15 to buy. The altcoin could rise to the $26.50 level, which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/dcf2524e-0cc0-45b9-a2c5-83e86543e1e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 40 suggest the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from $26.50, the DOT/USDT pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move could start if the buyers push the price above $26.50. That could result in a rally to $31.28 and then to the 50-day SMA ($33). Alternatively, the next leg of the downtrend could start if the bears sink the price below $15.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is in a downtrend but the bulls are trying to form a higher low at $21.50. The price rebounded off this support on May 30 and the bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($28.27) and the overhead resistance at $30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0ec1a4f3-b362-4a92-b6af-8ec10b0cb3c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest the downtrend could be over in the short term. The UNI/USDT pair may then rally to the 50-day SMA ($33.94). This level may act as stiff resistance but if the bulls can clear the hurdle, the pair could rise to $38.15.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA suggests the bears have the upper hand but the RSI above 44 suggests the bulls are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will nullify if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $21.50. Such a move could result in a decline to the May 23 low at $13.04.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) broke below the $120 to $168 range on May 28 but the bears have not been able to pull the price below the immediate support at $103.71. The price is stuck between $103.71 and $120 for the past three days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/aafa2518-84dc-4c2c-8773-eaa0ab09464c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This tight-range trading indicates indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the uncertainty resolves to the downside, the ICP/USDT pair could challenge the May 19 low at $86.01. A break below this support could pull the price down to $60.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls push and sustain the price above $120, it will suggest a lack of sellers at lower levels. The pair could then gradually move up to $168. A breakout and close above $168 could start a relief rally that may reach the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $243.08.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to rise above $685.36. If bulls sustain the price above this overhead resistance, the altcoin could rise to the 20-day EMA ($821), which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/fcdc09a5-962a-4db2-825b-6a88a0669c97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally. If the bears sink the price below $600, the BCH/USDT pair could fall to $468.13.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that demand exceeds supply. That could start a rally to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $919.60 and then to the 50% retracement level at $1,059.07.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMDdiMmE2YjMtMjdlOC00NzNiLWE4ZDgtMzZjMzVkYTFmZDY2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210531eh5v000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/28: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, ICP, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,878 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Each breakout from Bitcoin and altcoins is being met by selling near the 20-day moving average, a signal that the market could be in for more downside.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week billionaire investor Carl Icahn\u8217\'20\'19s told Bloomberg that he is considering {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-carl-icahn-says-he-may-drop-up-to-1-5b-into-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 entering}}}\uc2  crypto in a big way but this hardly made any difference to crypto prices. This is just another hint that the underlying sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that crypto markets are not reacting positively to favorable news.\par \par \uc2 However, this does not mean that the bulls have stopped buying. While speaking to Cointelegraph, S2F Capital managing partner and chief investment officer Micah Spruill said that on-chain data shows Bitcoin whales, owning between 1,000 and 10,000 ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), and retail traders holding between 0.1 and 1 Bitcoin, are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-enters-a-wait-and-see-phase-as-bitcoin-struggles-below-40-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating}}}\uc2  at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Accumulation by large players near the lows is a positive sign as it indicates they are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/1d2db165-0b9c-4439-ae6c-df5943b25bda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tumbles-to-36k-as-ark-s-cathie-wood-addresses-btc-regulatory-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speaking}}}\uc2  at Consensus 2021, ARK Investments CEO Cathie Wood said that emerging market central banks may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/currencies/news/cathie-wood-central-banks-bitcoin-btc-cryptocurrencies-japan-india-china-2021-5-1030475547"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy}}}\uc2  Bitcoin to protect their balance sheets \u8220\'20\'1Cbecause they know their currencies are going down and that they will be under attack as reserves go down.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Traders should keep a close watch on the fundamentals of Bitcoin and the crypto sector because that will drive long-term price action. In the short term, traders' sentiment plays a major role in deciding the trend.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine whether crypto prices have bottomed out or not.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s pullback could not even reach the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $41,269, which suggests that traders are closing their positions on minor rallies. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($42,780) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory suggest that bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a46bbfcb-698c-4a91-a8b5-3cc9e77c0f15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BTC/USDT pair plummets below $34,000, the decline could extend to the critical support at $30,000. The bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the buyers will again try to push the price above the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $48,231. Such a move will suggest that the pair may have bottomed at $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $30,000, the selling could intensify as the stops of the dip buyers are likely to get hit. There is a minor support at $28,000 but if that cracks, the next stop could be $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $2,738.74 on May 26 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,888). This suggests traders are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f7072eac-19b5-47fe-940f-35e7dddf8840.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $2,378.54, the ETH/USDT pair could decline to $2,079.94. A break below this support could result in a retest of the May 23 low at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level or the support and breaks above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest a change in sentiment and the pair could then rally to the 61.8% retracement level at $3,362.72.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally hit a wall at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $395.09. A shallow pullback after a sharp decline suggests the bears are unrelenting and they are shorting even on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/cad592ae-2c58-4e54-b387-77e9946579c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently trying to pull the price below the $306.61 support. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $257.40 and then to $211.70. A strong bounce off this support may keep the pair range-bound between $211.70 and $395.09 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($427), the relief rally could extend to the 50-day SMA ($521). This level may act as a resistance but if the bulls arrest the next decline above $428, it will suggest the downtrend could be over.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($1.63) on May 26 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price turned down from $1.83 and the bears have pulled the altcoin below the $1.55 support today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a8d781eb-889b-4d4d-86af-aff99f34a473.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sustain the price below $1.43, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $1.24 and then to the critical support at $1. If the price rebounds off $1 once again, the pair could remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and rises above $1.58, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above $2. If they manage to do that, the pair could challenge the all-time high at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to build upon the breakout from the downtrend line suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears resumed their selling on May 27 and have pulled \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/9effdbba-c97b-426d-a7c5-2c7a6d25e417.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.29, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $0.25 and then to $0.21. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $0.15 and then $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, indicating the bears are in control. This negative view will invalidate if the price reverses direction and breaks above the $0.43 to $0.47 overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s relief rally hit a wall at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.05. This suggests the sentiment is negative and traders are in a hurry to close their long positions on a shallow pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/923a0bcf-7ce6-4b35-a18a-3a917f0ead0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains below $0.88, the bears will try to pull the price down to $0.65. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1.14) and the RSI below 40 suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 A break below $0.65 could open the doors for a further decline to $0.56. On the contrary, if the bulls defend the $0.88 support, the XRP/USDT pair may rise to the 20-day EMA. A breakout of this resistance could result in a rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.34) and the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) reached the critical overhead resistance at $26.50 today but the bulls could not drive the price above it. This suggests the bears are defending this level aggressively. If bears pull the price below $19.65, the altcoin could drop to $15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/4b3542c1-4937-481a-8add-6809418de4e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 39 suggest the bears are in command. A break below $15 will suggest the start of a new downtrend. Conversely, if the bulls defend the $15 level, the DOT/USDT pair may consolidate in a range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level or $15 and breaks above $26.50. Such a move could push the pair to $31.28. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Internet Computer (ICP) has been trading inside the tight range of $120 and $168 for the past few days. Today, the bears are attempting to sink the price below the support of the range at $120.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/d38d9853-3712-48af-9bc6-033e95af3c64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ICP/USDT pair could drop to the all-time low at $86.01. If this support also cracks, the pair could decline to the next target objective at $60.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls defend the $120 support, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. A breakout and close above $168 will be the first indication that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 On a breakout and close above $168, the pair could rally to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $243.08.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA ($29.58) on May 26 but the bulls could not propel the price above it. This shows the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/408dfdd2-3bde-4089-93d8-c80b202e9a31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls have not given up yet. They will make one more attempt to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($34.27).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the price down. If the sellers sink the price below $24.40, the pair could drop to $21.50 and then to $18.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) had been trading above the $685.36 support for the past three days but the bulls could not push the price to the 20-day EMA ($876). This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a4e599d1-836f-4efb-adbc-912a9c836d0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $685.36, the bears will try to sink the price to the May 23 low at $468.13. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $802, the bulls will try to propel the price to the 20-day EMA. A breakout and close above the moving averages will suggest the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvM2U2NmM3MDctYjhjNC00MGVjLTg1NzAtODgzYzRlYzEzMjI2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210528eh5s000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/26: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, ICP, UNI, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,880 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Dip-buyers catalyzed a strong relief rally in Bitcoin and altcoins but decreasing volumes and overhead resistance suggest the market is losing momentum.\par \par \uc2 A strong bull market tends to attract speculators and newbie traders who hop on to the rally with an aim to get rich quickly. In their eagerness to earn huge profits, traders throw caution out of the window and take on excessive leverage. While this strategy is fruitful during the asset\u8217\'20\'19s up-move, sharp corrections wipe out most accounts due to the use of massive leverage.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recent market drop below $30,000 caused the Bitcoin futures open interest to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-blasts-past-40k-again-ethereum-nears-3k-is-a-bigger-crypto-rally-looming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plummet}}}\uc2  from $27 billion to $11 billion. This suggests that several leveraged traders would have taken a huge hit. Although painful, these corrections reduce greed and the asset transfers from weak hands to strong hands who venture out to buy when the sentiment is negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c86e5d0f-1e28-4038-ac96-24dcb1bf4f93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While many investors are watching the price behavior of Bitcoin to gauge whether the downtrend is over, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has gradually been covering ground quickly. According to CoinGecko, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s 24-hour trade volume at $60 billion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-sails-past-btc-s-daily-volume-as-grayscale-eth-trust-trades-at-11-premium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overtook}}}\uc2  Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s at $50 billion.\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign in favor of Ether is that the \uc2 Grayscale Ethereum Trust\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-sails-past-btc-s-daily-volume-as-grayscale-eth-trust-trades-at-11-premium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading}}}\uc2  at an 11% premium to Ether's spot price, indicating strong demand from institutional investors. In comparison, the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  price still trades at a discount to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that traders should keep an eye on both Bitcoin and Ether to confirm that a bottom is in place. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot any signs of a bottoming formation.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the downtrend line on May 24, which suggests strong buying at lower levels. The bears tried to pull the price back below the downtrend line on May 25 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/15ac723c-7b30-4fa3-bea3-81404affd038.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally rose to $40,841 today but the long wick on the candlestick suggests selling at higher levels. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($43,967) and the relative strength index (RSI) below 38 suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to pull the price down to $34,000. This is an important support to watch because if it cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the critical support at $30,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to gain the upper hand. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s pullback has risen above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $2,738.74 today, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels. However, the bears are trying to stall the relief rally near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/38445ee0-7000-46b8-bd2d-5e8ab4117587.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to resume the downtrend. The first support on the downside is $2,378.54 and then $2,079.94. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair could remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 But if the bears sink and sustain the price below $2,000, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the critical support at $1,728.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,936), the pair could rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,362.72. Such a move will indicate the short-term downtrend is over.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After hesitating near the $348.70 resistance on May 25, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) cleared the hurdle today. This has opened the gates for a move to $428. However, the bears may not give up easily and they are likely to mount a stiff resistance between $428 and the 20-day EMA ($444).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/e1ecc797-0237-4885-a4e2-9bc5f1489636.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $428 but does not break the $348.70 support, the BNB/USDT pair could start an up-move that could reach the 50-day simple moving average ($523) and then to $600.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and slips below $348.70, the pair could correct to $257.40. Such a move will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels and that could delay the confirmation of a bottom.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on May 25 as the bears defended the 20-day EMA ($1.64). The uncertainty resolved to the upside today and buyers have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/ac53d515-09df-4280-bc50-b69d5d7c240f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $2 and then to the all-time high at $2.47. A break above this resistance could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. However, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $2, the pair could drop to $1.55. A strong rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $1.55 and $2 for a few days. A wider range could develop if the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1.47).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 A tough battle is waging between the bulls and the bears near the downtrend line. Although the bulls had pushed \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on May 25, they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/bf5c1675-8c41-42cd-aab5-81395aae65d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears pull the price back below the downtrend line, it will suggest selling on every minor rally. The bears will then try to sink the price to $0.25 and then retest the panic low formed on May 19 at $0.21.\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the RSI below 46 suggest the bears are in control. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $0.47.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the $0.88 resistance on May 24, suggesting the start of the relief rally. The bears tried to sink the price back below $0.88 on May 25 but failed. This indicates the bulls are trying to flip $0.88 to support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/dd1163db-16d8-43de-b559-a5975bfc5311.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($1.19), which is likely to act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will again try to break the $0.88 support.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could retest the May 23 low at $0.65. If this support also cracks, the pair could extend the decline to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls successfully defend the $0.88 support during the next dip, the pair could rise above the moving averages and rally to the downtrend line. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $26.50. This level may act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls can scale this wall, the altcoin could rally to the 20-day EMA ($30.42).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/eb1a8512-f251-48d1-a385-ff7dcf96cf79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest bears are in command. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the price back below $26.50.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $20 and then to $15. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $15 and $26.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break below $15 will favor the bears while a break above $31.28 will indicate the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the initial slide, Internet Computer (ICP) has been consolidating in a tight range for the past few days. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/e4095edd-abd6-4564-b359-2cd5985d78b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ICP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ICPUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside and the bears sink the price below $103, the ICP/USDT pair could retest the all-time low at $86.01. A break below this level could resume the downtrend with the next target at $60.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls propel the price above $168.57, the pair may rally to $186.06 and then to $222.34. A break above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $243.08 could signal that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply on May 24, suggesting strong buying by the bulls at lower levels. The relief rally could now reach the 20-day EMA ($29.59), which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/383885b5-99c5-45bb-ae36-f24c696ed232.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to $21.50. A strong rebound off this support will suggest the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($34.25). This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $21.50. The next support on the downside is $16.49 and then $13.04.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $685.36 resistance on May 24 and the bulls flipped the level into support on May 25, which is a positive sign. If the bulls push the price above $800, the altcoin could rally to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/9f6a7881-9c6a-4ee6-bc2b-21cdc85d0912.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($908) and the RSI below 43 suggest advantage to the bears. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to $685.36.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off this support will suggest the sentiment has turned positive and the traders are buying on dips. That will enhance the prospects of a break above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below $685.36, the pair could drop to $538.11 and then retest the May 23 low at $468.13.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMDBkMTA2MDUtZTFkYS00YTE5LTlkYjctMTYxYmU5ZWE1MDEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210526eh5q000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 UK ad organization bans crypto exchange\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18time to buy\u8217\'20\'19 Bitcoin advert\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 388 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that ads like Luno's should mention that Bitcoin investment is highly risky due to its extremely volatile nature.\par \par \uc2 A major advertising industry organization in the United Kingdom has ruled on an ad campaign telling people \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 The Advertising Standards Authority, a self-regulating ad organization, officially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/luno-money-ltd-g21-1101558-luno-pte-ltd.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halted}}}\uc2  an advertising campaign by cryptocurrency exchange Luno for being misleading and irresponsible.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe ads must not appear again in the form complained about,\u8221\'20\'1D the ASA said Wednesday, noting that ads like this should mention that Bitcoin investment is highly risky due to its extremely volatile nature.\par \par \uc2 Shown across the \uc2 London Underground\uc2  network and on London buses this year, Luno\u8217\'20\'19s ad posters contained an image of Bitcoin saying: \u8220\'20\'1CIf you\u8217\'20\'19re seeing bitcoin on the Underground, it\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7879102c-6cc3-4e89-bb81-a0af66c0571d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Financial Times}}}\par \par \uc2 The ASA said that it had received several complaints regarding Luno\u8217\'20\'19s ad, with people stressing that their posters failed to illustrate the risk of Bitcoin investment. \u8220\'20\'1CWe considered that consumers would interpret the statement \u8216\'20\'18it\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy\u8217\'20\'19 as a call to action and that the simplicity of the statement gave the impression that bitcoin investment was straightforward and accessible,\u8221\'20\'1D the ASA said.\par \par \uc2 Instead, Bitcoin investment is \u8220\'20\'1Ccomplex, volatile, and could expose investors to losses and considered that stood in contrast to the impression given by the ad, that investment was simple and conventional,\u8221\'20\'1D the authority wrote.\par \par \uc2 The ASA said that Luno agreed not to post its Bitcoin ads in their current form again and promised to ensure that future ads would carry a proper risk warning.\par \par \uc2 The latest regulatory action comes against the backdrop of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-ever-monthly-btc-price-drop-5-gyrations-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extreme \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  on crypto markets}}}\uc2 , with Bitcoin dropping from its all-time high above $64,000 to around $31,000 in mid-May.\par \par \uc2 As previously reported by Cointelegraph, crypto advocates have been distributing more Bitcoin ads around the world. Last September, the Bitcoin Association of Hong Kong launched the \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin Tram\u8221\'20\'1D ad campaign in Hong Kong, with some ads {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hong-kong-s-btc-association-pushes-bitcoin-tram-ad-campaign"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 placed right in front of HSBC headquarters}}}\uc2  and showing the words \u8220\'20\'1Cbe your own bank.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMzIyM2E1OTItOTBmNC00NjNjLTllYWMtNzdlMTg5MmMxNjJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210526eh5q0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 UK ad organization bans crypto exchange's \u8216\'20\'18time to buy\u8217\'20\'19 Bitcoin advert\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 388 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that ads like Luno's should mention that Bitcoin investment is highly risky due to its extremely volatile nature.\par \par \uc2 A major advertising industry organization in the United Kingdom has ruled on an ad campaign telling people \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 The Advertising Standards Authority, a self-regulating ad organization, officially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/luno-money-ltd-g21-1101558-luno-pte-ltd.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halted}}}\uc2  an advertising campaign by cryptocurrency exchange Luno for being misleading and irresponsible.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe ads must not appear again in the form complained about,\u8221\'20\'1D the ASA said Wednesday, noting that ads like this should mention that Bitcoin investment is highly risky due to its extremely volatile nature.\par \par \uc2 Shown across the \uc2 London Underground\uc2  network and on London buses this year, Luno\u8217\'20\'19s ad posters contained an image of Bitcoin saying \u8220\'20\'1CIf you\u8217\'20\'19re seeing Bitcoin on the Underground, it\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7879102c-6cc3-4e89-bb81-a0af66c0571d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ft.com/content/1f317c2b-cb5f-4ebd-abfe-0dc5725d5538"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Financial Times}}}\par \par \uc2 The ASA said that it received several complaints regarding Luno\u8217\'20\'19s ad, with people stressing that their posters failed to illustrate the risk of Bitcoin investment. \u8220\'20\'1CWe considered that consumers would interpret the statement \u8216\'20\'18it\u8217\'20\'19s time to buy\u8217\'20\'19 as a call to action and that the simplicity of the statement gave the impression that bitcoin investment was straightforward and accessible,\u8221\'20\'1D the ASA said.\par \par \uc2 Instead, Bitcoin investment is \u8220\'20\'1Ccomplex, volatile, and could expose investors to losses and considered that stood in contrast to the impression given by the ad, that investment was simple and conventional,\u8221\'20\'1D the authority wrote.\par \par \uc2 The ASA said that Luno agreed not to post their Bitcoin ads in their current form again and promised to ensure that future ads would carry a proper risk warning.\par \par \uc2 The latest regulatory action comes against the backdrop of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-ever-monthly-btc-price-drop-5-gyrations-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extreme \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  on crypto markets}}}\uc2 , with Bitcoin dropping from it\u8217\'20\'19s all-time high above $64,000 to around $31,000 in mid-May.\par \par \uc2 As previously reported by Cointelegraph, crypto advocates have been distributing more Bitcoin ads around the world. Last September, the Bitcoin Association of Hong Kong launched the \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin Tram\u8221\'20\'1D ad campaign in Hong Kong, with some ads {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hong-kong-s-btc-association-pushes-bitcoin-tram-ad-campaign"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 placed right in front of HSBC headquarters}}}\uc2  and showing the words \u8220\'20\'1Cbe your own bank.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMzIyM2E1OTItOTBmNC00NjNjLTllYWMtNzdlMTg5MmMxNjJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210526eh5q0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 investment products\par \b \uc2 Institutions dump BTC as volume soars for Ether funds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Samuel Haig \par \uc2 278 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Institutional investors appear to be dumping BTC exposure in favor of Ether and other altcoins.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\u8217\'20\'19 weekly \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows\u8221\'20\'1D report has revealed last week saw the largest outflow of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) in the report\u8217\'20\'19s history as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-hints-tesla-may-offload-btc-goes-to-war-with-crypto-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Twitter account again wreaked havoc}}}\uc2  in the crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 The May 17 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  notes $98 million exited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-made-up-97-of-total-crypto-inflows-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin investment products}}}\uc2  last week, equating to 0.2% of total assets under management. \u8220\'20\'1CWhile small, this marks the largest outflow we have recorded,\u8221\'20\'1D CoinShares noted.\par \par \uc2 Amid the tumultuous market conditions for Bitcoin, institutional investors appear to have ramped up their accumulation of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and other alternative cryptocurrencies, with the report identifying inflows to crypto asset investment products of $48 million when excluding Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Ether represented more than half of the flows to altcoin investment products with $27 million. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT also saw increased inflows of $6 million and $3.3 million, respectively.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares also notes that May is shaping up to be the first month in which investment volume for institutional Ether products has outpaced that of Bitcoin products. The report stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe data impl[ies] that investors have been diversifying out of Bitcoin and into altcoin investment products.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products saw a net outflow of $50 million, marking the first week to post a net outflow {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-inflows-into-crypto-hit-lowest-levels-since-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 since October 2020}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The institutional pivot toward Ether and altcoins reflects recent trends in the broader crypto asset ecosystem, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-dominance-falls-to-three-year-low-of-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin market dominance sinking to a three-year low}}}\uc2  of roughly 40% as of Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvN2NlZTVmNGQtMTU1MC00NTI2LWIyOGQtNmFhMzg0Y2EyNzU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210518eh5i0005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/17: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, BCH, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,855 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders appear disinterested in buying Bitcoin at the current levels, suggesting that further downside could be in store for BTC and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) plummeted to an intraday low near $42,000 today, dropping 35% from its all-time high at $64,849.27. Over the weekend the selling intensified as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-tweets-btc-price-bottom-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 news}}}\uc2  that Tesla may have sold its Bitcoin holdings made waves, and even after this was proven to be untrue, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market dominance had still been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-dominance-falls-to-three-year-low-of-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pulled}}}\uc2  down to a three-year low below 40%.\par \par \uc2 While this decline in Bitcoin may have scared new investors, stock-to-flow creator PlanB said the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-tweets-btc-price-bottom-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 performance}}}\uc2  of the current bull phase is still better than the 2017 bull run. PlanB also warned investors to expect several 30% dips during Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s climb to a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/4bbfbb44-1ed0-4214-b771-972178ad1976.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the long-term story remains intact, the sharp \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves in Bitcoin on every minor negative news tidbit suggest nervousness among investors. The lack of a sharp recovery even after Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/05/16/elon-musk-suggests-tesla-is-dumping-bitcoin.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clarification}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1CTesla has not sold any Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D suggests investors are not buying aggressively on positive news.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness stall the altcoin season or is Bitcoin getting ready for a sharp relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern on May 16 but the bears could not achieve a close below it. By the end of the day, the price rebounded and closed above the neckline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/22a7adb2-f504-48f0-9504-301f15e7b083.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the selling resumed today and the bears have pulled the price below the neckline. If the BTC/USDT pair closes below the neckline, the head and shoulders pattern will complete.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not push the price back above the neckline quickly, the selling is likely to intensify further. The pair could then start its decline toward the pattern target at $31,653.73.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($52,265) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the oversold territory indicate the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Any pullback is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA. This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $60,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is correcting the sharp uptrend of the past few days. The price dipped below the 20-day EMA ($3,431) today but the bulls are trying to arrest the decline near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,195.98.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/9f82642b-f4cb-4b09-ad9f-a7b04e24c68e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $3,600, the bulls will try to push the price to $4,200. However, the 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has dropped near the midpoint, suggesting the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers fail to defend the $3,195.98 support, the decline could extend to the next support at the 50-day simple moving average ($2,709). Such a deep fall is likely to delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($520) for the first time since Dec. 13. The 20-day EMA ($585) has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped below 42, suggesting the bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8ec6676c-851c-49fe-88e7-f5a090bb225a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the current recovery turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are closing their positions on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below $480. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair may drop to $428 and then to $348.70.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a breakout and close above $615. Such a move will suggest that the correction is over and the pair may be ready to resume the uptrend. A breakout and close above $691.77 could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $796.64.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. It reached a new all-time high at $2.34 on May 16 where profit-booking set in. If the price breaks below $1.95, the altcoin may drop to the 20-day EMA ($1.71).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/d95306f3-c6de-434b-8e31-f092cdd2e1c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that supply exceeds demand and that may pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($1.39).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $2.34, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may resume its uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $2.82 and then $3. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 63 indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.46). If they succeed, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) could move up to $0.59 where the bulls are likely to encounter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3e79b9b9-9a86-473f-bda2-466885a2da91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.59, the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA increases. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.35. A strong rebound off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $0.35 and $0.59 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls drive the price above $0.59, the pair may retest the all-time high at $0.73. A breakout of this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $0.83 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the support line of the symmetrical triangle today, indicating buying at lower levels. The buyers will now try to propel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/ad3f3b5c-8a83-40a3-9781-5ca0c1caa9cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the 52-week high at $1.96.This level may act as stiff resistance but if the bulls can overcome it, the pair may rally to $2.68.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($1.43) and the RSI above 53 do not signal a clear advantage to the bulls. If the price turns down from the resistance line of the triangle, the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if the price breaks below the triangle. That could result in a decline to $0.88.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the $44 overhead resistance on May 14 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the breakout level at $44 on May 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c6d9b6a4-9354-4206-b164-ce4d4185b2cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($39.34) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break below $32.50 could open the gates for a decline to the critical support at $26.50. A bounce off this support will suggest accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above $44, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and the bulls continue to buy at lower levels. That will increase the possibility of a retest of the all-time high at $49.78.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($1,178) on May 15. The bulls attempted to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on May 16 but failed to sustain the higher levels. This led to further selling today and the price dipped to the psychological level at $1,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/461bfd8b-0c5b-43dc-9748-726aafe0b8f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the support at $1,000. However, any relief rally from the current level is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1,170) and then at $1,362.74.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the BCH/USDT pair may remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate if the pair continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($922). Such a move could open the doors for a further decline to $700. The trend may favor the bulls on a break and close above $1,362.74.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to build upon the breakout of the ascending broadening wedge formation could have attracted aggressive profit-booking from short-term traders. This pulled \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) to the 20-day EMA ($308) on May 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f43efcf9-8f4f-40d8-b34a-ed4db61d8ef7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls attempted a recovery on May 13 and 14, the rebound fizzled out at $339.10. The selling resumed on May 15 and sent the LTC/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Today, the bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($270). However, the 20-day EMA has started to slope down and the RSI is below 45, suggesting the bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If the pair breaks below the 50-day SMA, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to the support line of the wedge. This negative view will be negated if the bulls push the price above $340.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the ascending channel today but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price back into the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/2734fd6a-e5d9-4c9d-b929-a387596de9bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($37.72) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative territory, suggesting the bears have a slight advantage. If the price closes below the channel, it will indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The UNI/USDT pair could then drop to the $27.50 to $25 support zone and then to $20. This negative view will invalidate if the buyers propel the price above $40.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvNzViYzkyMzQtZWRmZC00NGY4LTlhYTctMjQxOGVjNDFkYzNjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210517eh5h000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 altcoins\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin market dominance falls to three-year low of 40%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Martin Young \par \uc2 346 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance has slumped to a three-year low of 40% after the combined altcoin capitalization tagged record highs near $1.5 trillion last week.\par \par \uc2 While {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-hints-tesla-may-offload-btc-goes-to-war-with-crypto-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin tumbles in response to Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Twitter account yet again}}}\uc2 , altcoin dominance has surged to its highest level in roughly three years.\par \par \uc2 As of this writing, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) represents 40.3% of the combined crypto asset capitalization \u8212\'20\'14 the lowest it has been since June 2018, according to CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hit a market dominance low of 33% in January 2018 when it was cooling from its previous peak, while the altcoins were just hitting theirs. It is currently not far off its second-lowest level of 36% of three years ago in May 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/6189c6c1-ae3c-4095-9c05-eac4d4831796.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 The combined capitalization of altcoins is currently sitting at $1.25 trillion after establishing all-time highs of almost $1.5 trillion last week.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has recently seen its dominance surge, with Ether\u8217\'20\'19s capitalization creeping up to roughly half of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s to represent a crypto market dominance over 19%. Ether also represents 32% of the combined altcoin market cap.\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) ranks third, representing 4% of total crypto capitalization, followed by Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) with 3.3% and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) with 3%. By contrast, Binance Coin exerts a 6.7% dominance over the altcoins markets, with Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s dominance coming in at 5.5% and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  representing 5%.\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk may have deepened Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s loss of dominance by hinting that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-hints-tesla-may-offload-btc-goes-to-war-with-crypto-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tesla may be offloading its BTC holdings}}}\uc2  in a tweet on Monday, triggering a 15% crash over 18 hours.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin is now down 35% from its April 14 all-time high, several altcoins have seen weaker pullbacks, with Ether currently down 24% from its Wednesday peak of $4,350.\par \par \uc2 Some markets are rallying in spite of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  meta-trend, with Cardano rallying to tag all-time highs of $2.45 on Sunday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvOWI0OTBkOTUtYThiOC00Y2JlLWJmYTQtMTkzNTkzYjJiMzFiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210517eh5h0008k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Elon Musk tweets BTC price bottom? 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,142 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is feeling the pain from Elon Musk as price action stays \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is nearing $40,000 this week as \u8220\'20\'1CDogefather\u8221\'20\'1D Elon Musk deals out pure pain to hodlers \u8212\'20\'14 what\u8217\'20\'19s next?\par \par \uc2 After a traumatic weekend for many crypto investors, Monday is setting the stage for the next chapter in the wild 2021 bull market.\par \par \uc2 Cointlegraph takes a look at five factors that could shape what Bitcoin and altcoins do next.\par \par \uc2 Musk tweet hits key Bitcoin technical level\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s all about one man yet again this week: Elon Musk. In characteristic fashion, the Tesla and SpaceX CEO caused uproar on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  when he came out \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD sold off {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-doesn-t-care-about-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immediately}}}\uc2  on news that Tesla was halting BTC payments for its products, but for Musk, this was not enough.\par \par \uc2 Further tweets over the weekend, including criticism of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decentralization and how he \u8220\'20\'1Cbelieves in crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D added fuel to the fire.\par \par \uc2 It was a hint that Tesla may already be planning to sell its holdings, however, that caused the most misery. Bitcoin fell to near $42,000, retesting this previous all-time high level before steadying as Musk stressed that no sale had occurred.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTo clarify speculation, Tesla has not sold any Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1394170030741413888"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/74786c77-da21-4cb9-b5d1-e606cfe969a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with \uc2 Twitter\uc2  events highlighted. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 With Musk versus the cryptocurrency community beginning to look like a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-hints-tesla-may-offload-btc-goes-to-war-with-crypto-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 full-on war}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin is thus unsurprisingly volatile as all eyes remain on the \uc2 Twitter\uc2  battlefield.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, Bitcoin was trading at around $44,800, still down 8.7% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 As analyst Alex Krueger noted, however, the clarification tweet may be unwittingly acting as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1394176041732673540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 local bottom signal}}}\uc2 , as Musk posted it just as BTC/USD hit a key 61.8 Fibonacci retracement level.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CElon Musk must be an outstanding technical analyst,\u8221\'20\'1D he commented.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHis \u8216\'20\'18Tesla has not sold any Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19 tweet was posted exactly at Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s key technical level, the 61.8 fib ($42,845).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BTC dominance falls below 40%\par \par \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s activities have had a detrimental impact on Bitcoin and altcoins alike.\par \par \uc2 Despite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doge-surges-as-elon-musk-says-he-s-working-with-devs-to-improve-efficiency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continuing to praise}}}\uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), even the meme-based token failed to avoid losses over the weekend, with the majority of large-cap altcoins following Bitcoin down.\par \par \uc2 There were some less significant losses, such as those of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which on Saturday was still bucking the overall downtrend to even post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-smashes-2-resistance-as-bullish-signals-enter-for-bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time highs}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In terms of bearishness, however, nothing shows how much the average Bitcoin holder is suffering like market dominance.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s overall market capitalizatio share {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-dominance-falls-to-three-year-low-of-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dipped below 40%}}}\uc2  for the first time since June 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7fa63cee-71c3-4226-9fd6-fab7a1f617b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin market cap dominance chart. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Already on the way out, dominance was dealt a significant blow thanks to the recent Bitcoin price pressure, while altcoins, such as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), benefitted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Bitcoin dominance is still falling,\u8221\'20\'1D popular Twitter trader The Moon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheMoonCarl/status/1393548742696095745"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe alt season is not over yet. But my gut feeling is that the end is near!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fundamentals provide calm\par \par \uc2 For all the nerveracking price action, meanwhile, nothing provides a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  counterpoint to the current Bitcoin narrative than its network fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 Even after its dip to $42,000, Bitcoin is more attractive than ever for miners, and its network security is, therefore, also more solid than ever before.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-fundamentals-meet-4k-ethereum-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , both the hash rate and difficulty have staged a miraculous recovery in recent weeks, reclaiming all-time highs after a miner washout caused its own brief price crash.\par \par \uc2 The weekend proved to be no different, with the weekly average hash rate topping 180 exahashes per second for the first time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c812d026-57c1-4fea-822f-b6d288c03883.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 7-day average hash rate chart. Source: Blockchain.com\par \par \uc2 The difficulty is still on track to increase by over 10% at the next automated readjustment in 11 days\u8217\'20\'19 time. The previous readjustment on Friday, at 21.5%, was the largest positive shift since June 2014.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s mining difficulty hitting an all-time high just after \uc2 tesla\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement is a chef\u8217\'20\'19s kiss,\u8221\'20\'1D Alex Thorn, head of firmwide research at crypto merchant bank Galaxy Digital, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/intangiblecoins/status/1392810287183585280"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 Dollar bounces at support\par \par \uc2 Taking a break for crypto-specific triggers, the wider macro picture may yet provide some inspiration for price trajectory.\par \par \uc2 After plunging late last week, the strength of the United States dollar is returning. The U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) is bouncing off familiar support \u8212\'20\'14 surges in its strength tend to provide {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bounces-at-50k-amid-4-month-highs-for-dxy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 teething problems}}}\uc2  for BTC/USD.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/806e297d-85a3-43e1-b157-fd81136764bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At the same time, stocks are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in China but performing averagely in Europe and the United States. The coronavirus, with localized peaks in some jurisdictions but fewer cases in others, joins the melting pot.\par \par \uc2 Among traders, however, it is inflation that is a key issue. A broad global rebound from the time of lockdowns and other restrictions creates problems for those attempting to engineer it \u8212\'20\'14 specifically, the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and other central banks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe global economic recovery is well under way; that\u8217\'20\'19s what\u8217\'20\'19s fueling the inflation fears,\u8221\'20\'1D Olivier d\u8217\'20\'19Assier, Qontigo head of APAC applied research, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2021-05-16/asia-stocks-to-open-firmer-currencies-steady-markets-wrap?srnd=premium-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 After stock markets\u8217\'20\'19 rip roaring year, he added, appetite for profit taking will be understandably increasing.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin still beats its last bull market\par \par \uc2 Is it 2013 or 2017 in terms of the Bitcoin bull market?\par \par \uc2 Among the industry\u8217\'20\'19s best-known names, there is no hint of bearishness \u8212\'20\'14 all that remains to do is analyze the nature of the current retracement and compare it to years past.\par \par \uc2 This week, stock-to-flow creator PlanB notes that for all the Musk drama, Bitcoin is still performing better than during its 2017 run to $20,000. This despite the $42,000 dip officially being Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s biggest this bull cycle and since the cross-asset crash of March 2020.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday feels like 2017 bull market (esp. during the fork war),\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1394043310365421581"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  on Monday, invoking memories of the birth of Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s not a straight line to the next ATH, but a lot of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  (multiple -30% dips). HODL.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/cdfe64d2-1613-40b3-b704-177e2dc4ad83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD stock-to-flow chart as of May 17, 2021. Source: Digitalik\par \par \uc2 Calling for calm and zooming out is a key feature among seasoned Bitcoiners. As Cointelegraph reported last week, stock-to-flow remains unviolated by Musk or any other episode of downward \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1394188938399600641"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accompanying survey}}}\uc2 , meanwhile, revealed that a majority of 35,000 respondents believe that BTC/USD will still hit $100,000 this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMjBkZWZkZWYtMTRlMC00ZjYxLWE1ZTQtYTRiOGZhMzRmNGE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210517eh5h0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Elon Musk tweets BTC price bottom? 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,139 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is feeling the pain from Elon Musk as price action stays \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is nearing $40,000 this week as \u8220\'20\'1CDogefather\u8221\'20\'1D Elon Musk deals out pure pain to hodlers \u8212\'20\'14 what\u8217\'20\'19s next?\par \par \uc2 After a traumatic weekend for many crypto investors, Monday is setting the stage for the next chapter in the wild 2021 bull market.\par \par \uc2 Cointlegraph takes a look at five factors which could shape what Bitcoin and altcoins do next.\par \par \uc2 Musk tweet hits key Bitcoin technical level\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s all about one man yet again this week: Elon Musk. In characteristic fashion, the Tesla and SpaceX CEO caused uproar on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  when he came out \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD sold off {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-doesn-t-care-about-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immediately}}}\uc2  on news that Tesla was halting BTC payments for its products, but for Musk, this was not enough.\par \par \uc2 Further tweets over the weekend, including criticism of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decentralization and how he \u8220\'20\'1Cbelieves in crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D added fuel to the fire.\par \par \uc2 It was a hint that Tesla may already be planning to sell its holdings, however, that caused the most misery. Bitcoin fell to near $42,000, retesting this previous all-time high level before steadying as Musk stressed that no sale had occurred.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTo clarify speculation, Tesla has not sold any Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1394170030741413888"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  on Monday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/74786c77-da21-4cb9-b5d1-e606cfe969a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with \uc2 Twitter\uc2  events highlighted. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 With Musk versus the cryptocurrency community beginning to look like a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-hints-tesla-may-offload-btc-goes-to-war-with-crypto-twitter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 full on war}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin is thus unsurprisingly volatile as all eyes remain on the \uc2 Twitter\uc2  battlefield.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, Bitcoin was trading at around $44,800, still down 8.7% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 As analyst Alex Krueger noted, however, the clarifitication tweet may be unwittingly acting as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1394176041732673540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 local bottom signal}}}\uc2 , as Musk posted it just as BTC/USD hit a key 61.8 Fibonacci retracement level.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CElon Musk must be an outstanding technical analyst,\u8221\'20\'1D he commented.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHis \u8216\'20\'18Tesla has not sold any Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19 tweet was posted exactly at Bitcoin's key technical level, the 61.8 fib ($42,845).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BTC dominance falls below 40%\par \par \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s activities have had a detrimental impact on Bitcoin and altcoins alike.\par \par \uc2 Despite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doge-surges-as-elon-musk-says-he-s-working-with-devs-to-improve-efficiency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continuing to praise}}}\uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), even the meme-based token failed to avoid losses over the weekend, with the majority of large-cap altcoins following Bitcoin down.\par \par \uc2 There were some less significant losses, such as those of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which on Saturday was still bucking the overall downtrend to even post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-smashes-2-resistance-as-bullish-signals-enter-for-bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time highs}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In terms of bearishness, however, nothing shows how much the average Bitcoin holder is suffering like market dominance.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s overall market cap share {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-dominance-falls-to-three-year-low-of-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dipped below 40%}}}\uc2  for the first time since June 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7fa63cee-71c3-4226-9fd6-fab7a1f617b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin market cap dominance chart. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Already on the way out, dominance was dealt a significant blow thanks to the recent Bitcoin price pressure, while alts such as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) benefitted.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Bitcoin dominance is still falling,\u8221\'20\'1D popular Twitter trader The Moon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheMoonCarl/status/1393548742696095745"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe alt season is not over yet. But my gut feeling is that the end is near!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fundamentals provide calm\par \par \uc2 For all the nerveracking price action, meanwhile, nothing provides a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  counterpoint to the current Bitcoin narrative than its network fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 Even after its $42,000 dip, Bitcoin is more attractive than ever for miners, and its network security is therefore also more solid than ever before.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-fundamentals-meet-4k-ethereum-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , both hash rate and difficulty have staged a miraculous recovery in recent weeks, reclaiming all-time highs after a miner washout caused its own brief price crash.\par \par \uc2 The weekend proved to be no different, with weekly average hash rate topping 180 exahashes per second (EH/s) for the first time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c812d026-57c1-4fea-822f-b6d288c03883.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin 7-day average hash rate chart. Source: Blockchain\par \par \uc2 Difficulty is still on track to increase by over 10% at the next automated readjustment in 11 days\u8217\'20\'19 time. The previous readjustment on May 14, at 21.5%, was the largest positive shift since June 2014.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s mining difficulty hitting an all-time high just after \uc2 tesla\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s announcement is a chef\u8217\'20\'19s kiss,\u8221\'20\'1D Alex Thorn, head of firmwide research at crypto merchant bank Galaxy Digital, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/intangiblecoins/status/1392810287183585280"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par \uc2 Dollar bounces at support\par \par \uc2 Taking a break for crypto-specific triggers, the wider macro picture may yet provide some inspiration for price trajectory.\par \par \uc2 After plunging late last week, the strength of the U.S. dollar is returning. The U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) is bouncing off familiar support \u8212\'20\'14 surges in its strength tends to provide {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bounces-at-50k-amid-4-month-highs-for-dxy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 teething problems}}}\uc2  for BTC/USD.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/806e297d-85a3-43e1-b157-fd81136764bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) 1-day candle chart. Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 At the same time, stocks are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in China but performing averagely in Europe and the U.S. Coronavirus, with localized peaks in some jurisdictions but fewer cases in others, joins the melting pot.\par \par \uc2 Among traders, however, it is inflation that is a key issue. A broad global rebound from the time of lockdowns and other restrictions creates problems for those attempting to engineer it \u8212\'20\'14 specifically, the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and other central banks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe global economic recovery is well under way; that\u8217\'20\'19s what\u8217\'20\'19s fueling the inflation fears,\u8221\'20\'1D Olivier d\u8217\'20\'19Assier, Qontigo head of APAC applied research, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2021-05-16/asia-stocks-to-open-firmer-currencies-steady-markets-wrap?srnd=premium-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 After stock markets\u8217\'20\'19 rip roaring year, he added, appetite for profit taking will be understandably increasing.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin still beats its last bull market\par \par \uc2 Is it 2013 or 2017 in terms of the Bitcoin bull market?\par \par \uc2 Among the industry\u8217\'20\'19s best-known names, there is no hint of bearishness \u8212\'20\'14 all that remains to do is analyze the nature of the current retracement and compare it to years past.\par \par \uc2 This week, stock-to-flow creator PlanB notes that for all the Musk drama, Bitcoin is still performing better than during its 2017 run to $20,000. This despite the $42,000 dip officially being Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s biggest this bull cycle and since the cross-asset crash of March 2020.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday feels like 2017 bull market (esp. during the fork war),\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1394043310365421581"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  on Monday, invoking memories of the birth of Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt's not a straight line to the next ATH, but a lot of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  (multiple -30% dips). HODL.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/cdfe64d2-1613-40b3-b704-177e2dc4ad83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD stock-to-flow chart as of May 17, 2021. Source: Digitalik\par \par \uc2 Calling for calm and zooming out is a key feature among seasoned Bitcoiners. As Cointelegraph reported last week, stock-to-flow remains unviolated by Musk or any other episode of downward \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1394188938399600641"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accompanying survey}}}\uc2  meanwhile revealed that a majority of 35,000 respondents believe that BTC/USD will still hit $100,000 this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMjBkZWZkZWYtMTRlMC00ZjYxLWE1ZTQtYTRiOGZhMzRmNGE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210517eh5h0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano smashes $2 resistance as  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\uc2  signals enter for Bitcoin price\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 419 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano is beating Bitcoin and Ethereum with new \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price record highs.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token neared $2.40 on May 15 as a select few altcoins bucked the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  mood to steal the spotlight from a weak Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/51d12ac3-15d9-42b5-bda6-c89a729885d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: Tradingview\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in price discovery as $2.50 nears\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD climbing through the weekend to hit a record $2.38.\par \par \uc2 Traders had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-nears-2-nano-jumps-125-in-firm-shrug-to-bitcoin-bears-and-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspected}}}\uc2  that the long-awaited $2 would come into play in the short term, with Cardano bulls taking down resistance in one fell swoop overnight on Friday.\par \par \uc2 With $2 out of the way, price discovery mode was activated, which delivered the new all-time highs before a consolidation period began at around $2.30.\par \par \uc2 As such, Cardano was giving even previously successful altcoins such as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) a run for their money as most tokens saw losses on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 "$\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now narrowing the gap between $ETH & Altcoin Market Cap," popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1393508454027825158"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now up +80% compared to ETH and Altcoin Market Cap which have both rallied +150%."\par \par \uc2 PlanB on BTC price: I'm "excited"\par \par \uc2 Joining Cardano were only a handful of major cap altcoins, these led by Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/matic-network-matic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) which delivered 24-hour gains of 24% and weekly returns above 130%.\par \par \uc2 Others, such as \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ), delivered mild losses in line with the general trend. Bitcoin, having {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-held-up-very-well-despite-biggest-exchange-inflow-since-march-2020-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recovered}}}\uc2  some of its lost ground after falling 20% earlier in the week, stayed near the lower end of its trading range without managing to reclaim $50,000.\par \par \uc2 On short timeframes, however, fellow trader Scott Melker nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1393549303373783041"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals for Bitcoin's relative strength index (RSI) \u8212\'20\'14 something which could deliver more solid progress in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 For PlanB, creator of the stock-to-flow family of BTC price models, the RSI behavior was "typical" and comparable to the ranging seen before BTC/USD hit all-time highs in late 2017.\par \par \uc2 "Bitcoin relative strength index (RSI): we are at the typical mid-bull-cycle drop in RSI (yellow circles), in between 2013 and 2017," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/100trillionUSD/status/1393571337399152641/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  alongside an accompanying chart.\par \par \uc2 "Excited about next couple of months."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/77ed3fc9-c311-4abb-8240-6c0425f04dff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin RSI chart vs. months between block subsidy halvings. Source: PlanB/ Twitter\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMzRlY2JjOGMtYWZmNC00NmFlLThmYzQtMjZiNTE2ZGNiNDAyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210515eh5f0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, BCH, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,956 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is showing signs of topping out but many altcoins remain strong, a signal that the decoupling between the two is likely to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear and Greed Index has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fear-grips-bitcoin-as-crypto-market-sentiment-drops-to-lowest-levels-since-april-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dipped}}}\uc2  to levels not seen since April 2020, indicating that traders are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-to-46k-altcoins-sell-off-as-report-claims-binance-is-under-investigation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nervous}}}\uc2  about Tesla backtracking on accepting Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) payments, Bitcoin's multi-week technical weakness and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-is-reportedly-under-investigation-from-irs-and-justice-department"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. regulator's supposed investigation}}}\uc2  into the business operations of Binance exchange.\par \par \uc2 This nervousness also led to a massive {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-held-up-very-well-despite-biggest-exchange-inflow-since-march-2020-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflow}}}\uc2  of 30,000 Bitcoin to the exchanges, the highest number since the March 2020 crash. This suggests some traders are booking profits on their long positions. CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju said that whales have continued to send more coins to exchanges than usual, implying that near-term bearishness may not be over yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/376d4a8c-0359-427e-bf97-65ecf136419b.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, popular statistician Willy Woo believes that recovery after the Elon Dump has started and analyst William Clemente also painted a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-held-up-very-well-despite-biggest-exchange-inflow-since-march-2020-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive}}}\uc2  picture as he said that \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin held up very well\u8221\'20\'1D given the \u8220\'20\'1Clargest day of exchange inflows since the March crash last year\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The short-term picture is uncertain with analysts divided in their opinions, but what does the long-term picture project? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the weekly charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s uptrend has been facing stiff resistance at the 100% Fibonacci extension level at $60,959.64. Although the bulls had pushed the price above this resistance, they could not sustain the breakout, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/512fb31b-5178-4293-9d71-8f4fa466e114.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has formed a head and shoulders pattern, which will complete on a breakdown and close below the neckline. If that happens, the pair could drop toward the pattern target at $28,939, which is just above the 50-week simple moving average ($27,335).\par \par \uc2 The 20-week exponential moving average ($47,444) is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has formed a negative divergence, indicating signs of weakening momentum.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls drive the price above the $60,000 to $64,849.27 resistance zone. The pair could then rally to the 161.8% Fibonacci extension level at $80,803.39.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend but the large moves in the past two weeks indicate frenzied buying, which usually ends in a topping formation. The RSI has risen above 88, indicating the rally is over-extended in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f48f60f4-b536-49c0-a696-5f33370b58c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to face stiff resistance in the zone between the 161.8% Fibonacci extension level at $4,052.21 and the all-time high at $4,374.67.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the ETH/USDT pair is likely to find strong support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $3,195.98. Due to the uptrend, the bulls are likely to buy the dip and attempt to resume the up-move.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $5,000 and then to the 261.8% Fibonacci extension level at $5,759.94.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the pair drops below $3,195.98, the next stop could be the 50% retracement level at $2,831.88 and then the 61.8% retracement level at $2,467.78.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The uptrend in Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has hit a wall at the 161.8% Fibonacci extension level at $680.03. However, the bulls are not willing to let go of their advantage as they have purchased the dip to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $513.45. This suggests the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/758248bb-ac30-461d-8824-02ae2bf0bea2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can thrust and sustain the price above $680.03, the BNB/USDT pair could resume its uptrend toward the 200% Fibonacci extension level at $796.64 and then to the 261.8% extension level at $985.30.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance once again, the pair could witness profit-booking that may pull the price down to the 50% retracement level at $458.37 and then to the 61.8% retracement level at $403.29.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few weeks. The large weekly ranges show increased trader activity as both the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves are exaggerated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c18a44b4-a795-4eb0-b636-a1e5f471c1ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on last week\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed aggressive profit-booking at higher levels. However, the bears could not capitalize on the opportunity and keep the pair down as the bulls bought the dips this week, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par \uc2 When the bulls buy the dips and bears sell at resistance, the asset usually enters a range-bound action and the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  drops. In this case, the DOGE/USDT pair may consolidate in a large range between $0.35 and $0.73 for the next few weeks.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 After a sharp up-move from $0.33 to $1.48, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) had been range-bound between $1 and $1.48 for several weeks. A consolidation near the highs is a positive sign as it shows that traders are buying on dips and not dumping their positions on corrections.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/dc5dd2d6-8314-4431-a2b5-5ca58aa08b6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair broke out of its consolidation phase last week, indicating that the bulls have overpowered the bears. The rally could now reach the 100% Fibonacci extension level at $2.14. If the bulls can thrust the price above this resistance, the next target is the 138.2% extension level at $2.60.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought territory, indicating that the bulls are in control. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and drops below the breakout level at $1.48. If that happens, the pair could drop to the 20-week EMA ($1.06).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  spent considerable time trading between $0.21 and $0.78. Generally, the larger the time spent in a range, the stronger is the eventual breakout from it. When the price broke above $0.78, the altcoin soared to $1.96 within two weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8b0cb90b-a2a6-43bc-90fb-d160d6faa9d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, vertical rallies are rarely sustainable and that is what happened. Since reaching a high of $1.96, the XRP/USDT pair has been witnessing volatile moves, which has resulted in the formation of a symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 After the large range moves of the past few weeks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to drop and the pair may enter a tight range trading once again. The rising 20-week EMA and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $1.76, the pair may rally to $1.96 and then resume the uptrend that may reach $2.63. This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks below $1.20. This could pull the price down to $1 and then to the breakout level at $0.78.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $26.50 and $44 for the past few weeks. Several attempts by the bulls to resume the uptrend failed to attract buyers at higher levels. Due to that, the price again re-entered the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/474191b1-3f15-446c-a5c1-76fa68dd367f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to drop below $26.50. This suggests accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the $44 to $48.36 resistance zone, the DOT/USDT pair may resume its uptrend and march toward the target objective at $63.68. The rising 20-week EMA ($30) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below $26.50. Such a move could signal the start of a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) has been consistently making higher highs and higher lows for the past few months, indicating an uptrend. The altcoin has been facing profit-booking above $1,430 as seen from the long wick on the previous week and this week\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7b38c607-5b8b-41a5-9673-a09e9934c7b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the bulls purchased the drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,113.61 this week. This suggests that traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push the price above $1,430, the BCH/USDT pair could retest $1,638.08. A break above this resistance could start the next leg of the up-move that may reach $2,050.21.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $1,638.08, the pair may remain range-bound for a few weeks. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $951.60.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few months and it has consistently stayed above the 20-week EMA ($219). The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/b37f9ae3-19ef-481e-8665-1b341bc91f4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Last week, the bulls pushed the price above the 2017 high at $370, which is a positive sign. The bulls followed it up with a new all-time high at $412.76 this week but they could not sustain the higher levels and profit-booking set in.\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair has again dipped below the breakout level of $370, suggesting the markets have rejected the breakout. If the price sustains below $370, the pair could gradually correct toward the 20-week EMA.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest that bulls remain in control and the pair may then gradually move up to $370. A break below the 20-week EMA will suggest a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and it has been trading inside an ascending channel for the past few weeks. Although the price had dipped to the support line of the channel this week, the long tail on the candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3aa3d698-2ee3-4c48-aa07-e25bdd2cd323.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT weekly chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers push the price above $45, the UNI/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach the resistance line of the channel at $56.50.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the channel could signal a pick up in the momentum and the next target objective is the 138.2% Fibonacci extension level at $68.89.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below the support line of the channel, the pair could drop to $25 and then to $16.84.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvYmRmNjU5MzYtYzUxNS00YzQxLWE5NWUtYmY2MjNmMmY4MjcwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210514eh5e000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/13: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, XRP, DOT, BCH, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,893 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains on slippery ground and the completion of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  candlestick pattern signals that further downside is possible for BTC and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Tesla CEO Elon Musk tweeted on May 13 that the company will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-loses-6-in-an-hour-after-tesla-drops-payments-over-carbon-concerns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stop}}}\uc2  accepting Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) payments for its vehicle purchases, citing \u8220\'20\'1Crapidly increasing use of fossil fuels for Bitcoin mining and transactions, especially coal.\u8221\'20\'1D Shortly after the announcement, Bitcoin price dropped by 17% to hit a new local low at $46,000.\par \par \uc2 While Musk\u8217\'20\'19s decision is a short-term blow to the sentiment of the market, it is unlikely to change the course of the crypto markets altogether because the institutional demand for cryptocurrencies remains high. Proof of this came yesterday as \uc2 Cowen Inc\uc2 ., a 103-year-old bank, announced that it had partnered with Standard Custody and Trust Co. to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investment-bank-cowen-set-to-offer-institutional-grade-crypto-custody"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enter}}}\uc2  the crypto custody business.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a35d11ad-0834-4289-bbf5-106f96ba54bd.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another indication of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gemini-s-crypto-custody-tops-30b-as-analyst-predicts-coinbase-shares-will-fall-to-100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing}}}\uc2  institutional interest in crypto is the sharp rise in \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto under the custody\u8221\'20\'1D of Gemini crypto exchange. The Winklevoss twins\u8217\'20\'19 led exchange now has $30 billion worth of crypto under custody.\par \par \uc2 The long-term picture for cryptocurrencies remains strong but the short-term price fluctuations may cause large drawdowns to portfolios. Hence, traders should watch the price action closely and follow their trading rules without getting sucked into trades driven by emotions.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the trends and the path of least resistance for the next move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, which will complete on a breakdown and close below the neckline of the setup. The sharp fall on May 12 and today had pulled the price down to the neckline but the bulls are attempting to defend the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/eaa0ff23-529c-4e72-b8a0-889f6616caec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day exponential moving average ($54,958) has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) has dipped into the negative zone, indicating the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the neckline, the H&S setup will complete. This pattern has a target objective at $31,653.73. However, it may not be a straight dash lower as the bulls will try to stall the decline at $42,500 and then $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls sustain the price above $46,985, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $52,323,21 where the bears are again likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  engulfing pattern on May 12 as the price reversed direction after hitting a new all-time high at $4,374.67. However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the sentiment remains positive and bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/635c390d-3a5f-4bf6-bcc6-e75b6abfa263.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is near the overbought zone, suggesting that bulls are in control. The buyers will now try to push the price above the all-time high. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to $5,000 and then $5,723.66.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($3,348), it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. That could pull the price down to $3,000 and then the 50-day simple moving average ($2,552).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance near the $680 level. Repeated failures to rise and sustain above this level may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders on May 12, which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($593).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/55d95bad-f13c-49d2-9f4b-a5d4c3a3473a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. If the bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair may retest the $680 resistance.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $771. Conversely, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may gradually drop to the 50-day SMA ($496) and then $440.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 After sustaining above the breakout level at $1.48 since May 6, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the $1.83 overhead resistance. This suggests the bulls have overpowered the bears and the uptrend has resumed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8b9d0d9b-e3f9-4198-b07c-928abb42621f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1.52) and the RSI above 66 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can sustain the price above $1.83, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the next target objective at $2.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $1.83, the pair may extend its range-bound action for a few more days. A break and close below $1.48 will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls and the pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($1.32).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.43) on May 11 but the higher levels met with selling pressure as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The selling resumed on May 12 and the bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/26cd855c-0876-4fff-ad8c-af489a8c5952.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to defend the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.38 but they are facing stiff resistance at $0.45. If the price turns down and plummets below $0.35, the DOGE/USDT pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.25).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $0.45, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then rise to $0.55 where the bulls are likely to encounter stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may consolidate between $0.45 and $0.55 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to sustain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the downtrend line for the past few days, indicating strong resistance by the bears. That may have resulted in short-term traders dumping their positions, pulling the price down to the 50-day SMA ($1.20).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/33fcbcc8-2b3b-47f3-8cdc-0e3de36a018a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will again try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the downtrend line and the overhead resistance at $1.66. If they manage to do that, the pair could retest the 52-week high at $1.96.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($1.41) has started to turn down and the RSI is trading in the negative zone, suggesting a minor advantage to the bears. If the sellers can sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair may decline to $1.01 and then $0.88.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has repeatedly failed to break above the $42.28 overhead resistance, suggesting the bears are defending the level aggressively. However, the bulls continue to buy at lower levels as they have not allowed the price to sustain below $32.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/091d6eca-4069-498a-9b2f-96ff3120a884.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint indicate the DOT/USDT pair could remain stuck between $32.50 and $42.28 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $42.28 could push the price to an all-time high at $48.36. This level may again act as stiff resistance but if the bulls drive the price above it, the pair may resume its uptrend toward the target objective at $58.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below $32.50, the pair may drop to $26.50. A strong bounce off this level will suggest the pair may extend its stay inside the large $26.50 to $42.28 range for a few more days. A break below $26.50 could suggest the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) rose to a new 52-week high at $1,638.08 on May 12 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. That resulted in aggressive profit-booking by traders, pulling the price down to the 20-day EMA ($1,213).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c913987a-81e1-4be8-89a1-98e534c98c73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  engulfing candlestick pattern on May 12 suggests a possible trend reversal. If the bears can break and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,054.41 and then to the 50-day SMA ($867).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price recovers and sustains above $1,213.51, the pair may enter a range-bound action for a few days. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint also suggest a few days of consolidation.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to sustain above the resistance line of the ascending broadening wedge formation on May 12 could have attracted strong selling by traders. That dragged the price down to the 20-day EMA ($313).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/bcfe4305-d0c6-4653-b450-8e3a08f8d184.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sustain the price below $300, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($260) and then to the support line of the wedge. A break below the wedge could signal the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may attempt a recovery, which is likely to face stiff resistance near $340. A break above the resistance line of the wedge will suggest that the correction has ended.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside an ascending channel. The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($38.35) on May 10 but they could not break the 50-day SMA ($34.50) support, which shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/4319e668-8478-48a7-9091-fdb4eac04dc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the up-move on May 12 but they could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This indicates traders are selling their positions on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Buying near the 50-day SMA and selling at higher levels suggests a range-bound action for a few days. The next trending move may start if the bulls push and sustain the price above $45. Conversely, a break below the support line of the channel could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvZDhlZjQzYWMtN2E4ZC00NDgzLWIwN2EtMDc5OTY5MGFmNjgxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210513eh5d000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano nears $2, Nano jumps 125% in firm shrug to Bitcoin bears and Elon Musk\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 346 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Nano are hitting new all-time highs this week.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  token, the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, hit new all-time highs on May 13 as bulls refused to follow the broad market downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7c2a3aa6-746c-4726-b238-bc148204e3d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  wows weary traders\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirmed new record highs for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD on May 13, with the pair touching $1.96.\par \par \uc2 The move is impressive and brings Cardano within inches of the psychologically significant $2 landmark.\par \par \uc2 The altcoin had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-out-vs-bitcoin-as-ada-price-discovery-nears-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-out-vs-bitcoin-as-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -price-discovery-nears-2}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-out-vs-bitcoin-as-ada-price-discovery-nears-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 followed many other large-cap cryptocurrencies higher}}}\uc2  in previous weeks, but May 13 showed a surprising resilience to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as most tokens {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-fails-to-build-50k-support-as-traders-eye-lower-levels-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fell in line with a reversal in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD starting 2021 at just $0.16, excitement was clear among traders.\par \par \uc2 "Thanks for playing," Filbfilb, co-founder of trading suite Decentrader, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/cryptotraider/5347"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  to Telegram subscribers.\par \par \uc2 Filbfilb highlighted equally \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  behavior and prognosis for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  against Bitcoin. The U.S. dollar high brought \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC back to a resistance level last tested in June 2018.\par \par \uc2 Buzzword "energy" sees Nano steal the show\par \par \uc2 Despite its progress, however, the day's hottest gains did not belong to Cardano, but Nano (NANO), which traded up by a maximum of 125% before consolidating near $14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/55ad2ef2-116d-496c-b3c6-3b2062194d19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 NANO/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The fallout of Tesla dropping Bitcoin for payments was still proving to be a boon for some altcoins at the time of writing \u8212\'20\'14 and which blockchain could boast energy-saving advantages was the topic of endless debate.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/which-green-cryptocurrency-is-tesla-likely-to-add-for-payments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/which-green-cryptocurrency-is-tesla-likely-to-add-for-payments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/which-green-cryptocurrency-is-tesla-likely-to-add-for-payments}}}\uc2 , the possibility remains that Tesla could adopt a different cryptocurrency, one that suits its mantra on eco-friendly business.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMGQ3ZTdkMjEtYzIzNi00NTMzLTg3Y2UtZDM1Y2EwMTBiZmYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210513eh5d000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano nears $2, Nano jumps 125% in firm shrug to Bitcoin bears and Elon Musk\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 311 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano and Nano are hitting new all-time highs this week.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), the fourth-largest cryptocurrency, hit new all-time highs on May 13 as bulls refused to follow the broad market downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7c2a3aa6-746c-4726-b238-bc148204e3d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: Tradingview\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  wows weary traders\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirmed new record highs for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD on Thursday, with the pair touching $1.96.\par \par \uc2 The move is impressive and brings Cardano within inches of the psychologically significant $2 landmark.\par \par \uc2 The altcoin had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-out-vs-bitcoin-as-ada-price-discovery-nears-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 followed}}}\uc2  many other large-cap cryptocurrencies higher in previous weeks, but Thursday showed a surprising resilience to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as most tokens fell in line with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-fails-to-build-50k-support-as-traders-eye-lower-levels-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reversal}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD starting 2021 at just $0.16, excitement was clear among traders.\par \par \uc2 "Thanks for playing," Filbfilb, co-founder of trading suite Decentrader, summarized to Telegram subscribers on the day.\par \par \uc2 Filbfilb highlighted equally \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  behavior and prognosis for Cardano against Bitcoin. The USD high brought \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC back to a resistance level last tested in June 2018.\par \par \uc2 Buzzword "energy" sees Nano steal the show\par \par \uc2 Despite its progress, however, the day's hottest gains did not belong to Cardano, but Nano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/nano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NANO}}}\uc2  ), which traded up by a maximum of 125% before consolidating near $14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/55ad2ef2-116d-496c-b3c6-3b2062194d19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 NANO/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: Tradingview\par \par \uc2 The fallout of Tesla dropping Bitcoin for payments was still proving to be a boon for some altcoins at the time of writing \u8212\'20\'14 and which blockchain could boast energy-saving advantages was the topic of endless debate.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/which-green-cryptocurrency-is-tesla-likely-to-add-for-payments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the possibility remains that Tesla could adopt a different cryptocurrency, one which suited its mantra on eco-friendly business.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMGQ3ZTdkMjEtYzIzNi00NTMzLTg3Y2UtZDM1Y2EwMTBiZmYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210513eh5d000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BCH, LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,878 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum's increasing dominance has kept traders focused on altcoins but Bitcoin's struggle to hold above $59,000 could send the entire market tumbling.\par \par \uc2 The astronomical rally in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is not showing any signs of slowing down. The bulls easily cleared the overhead {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-continues-wild-run-eth-price-breaks-4-000-for-the-first-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hurdle}}}\uc2  at $4,000 today, which also pushed the biggest altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market dominance to over 19%.\par \par \uc2 It is not only Ether that is witnessing sharp buying from traders. \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) have also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-price-hits-400-all-time-high-but-ltc-rally-at-risk-of-overheating"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risen}}}\uc2  new all-time highs, suggesting a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-smashes-new-all-time-high-following-14-gain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 broad-based}}}\uc2  altcoin rally.\par \par \uc2 However, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) seems to have lost its momentum as it continues to struggle near the $60,000 mark. That has pulled its market dominance to below 44% for the first time since July 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c8d77b51-a5f9-4905-9a85-e64f55996693.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the recent underperformance of Bitcoin has not {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-could-trade-for-250k-within-five-years-morgan-creek-capital-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shaken}}}\uc2  the long-term bulls. Morgan Creek Capital Management founder and CEO \uc2 Mark Yusko\uc2  recently said in an interview with CNBC that Bitcoin will rival the \u8220\'20\'1Cmonetary value\u8221\'20\'1D of gold.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf gold\u8217\'20\'19s monetary value is $4 trillion, then digital gold should move up to that total,\u8221\'20\'1D Yusko added. That means Bitcoin will have to rise to $235,000 in the future to fulfill Yusko\u8217\'20\'19s prediction.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the critical support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been sandwiched between the moving averages and the $58,966.53 resistance for the past two days. This tight range trading suggests a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/ba1a9251-06ec-4816-829e-637516dc7dac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $52,323.21. The bulls will try to defend this support and if they succeed, the pair could extend its consolidation between $52,323.21 and $58,966.53 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day exponential moving average ($56,611) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance may shift in favor of the bulls if the price sustains above $58,966.53. That could result in a march to the all-time high at 64,849.27. A break above this resistance may signal the resumption of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below $52,323.21 may indicate the start of a deeper correction to $46,985. A break below this support could trigger panic selling.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s rally has continued unabated. After forming a Doji candlestick pattern on May 9, the bulls have asserted their dominance today and pushed the price to a new all-time high. The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI above 83.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/ea6f63f3-db4a-4aa4-bd5e-cea64174704a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A deeply overbought level on the RSI indicates a buying frenzy as traders fear missing out on the rally. Generally, such rallies top out after the last bull has purchased. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to $4,528.97 and then to the psychological level at $5,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum fading could be a correction that lasts for more than three days. A break below the 20-day EMA ($3,173) will signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose to a new all-time high at $691.77 today but the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above the breakout level at $680. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/b52889d3-7f1f-4538-b736-f4b4599781af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate that buyers are in control, but the negative divergence on the RSI suggests the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. A break and close below the 20-day EMA ($599) could be the first sign of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push and sustain the BNB/USDT pair above $680. If they succeed, the pair could embark on a journey toward $760 and then $808.57.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a sharp dump on May 9 but the bulls aggressively defended the 20-day EMA ($0.44) as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. However, the buyers could not extend the recovery today and the price has resumed its journey toward the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a39e5f33-b0fe-4058-a593-bd92e00e4a35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually flattening out and the RSI has declined below 58, indicating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the DOGE/USDT pair again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. if that happens, the pair could drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.38.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has repeatedly broken above the downtrend line since May 6 but the bulls have not been able to sustain the breakout. This suggests that traders may be using the rallies to lighten their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/49546e8a-1780-498c-bfb6-262b9b6c1777.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $1.66 to enhance the prospects of a retest of the 52-week high at $1.96. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($1.45) and the RSI above 56 indicate a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will nullify if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that supply exceeds demand. The XRP/USDT pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($1.16).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano made a large outside day candlestick pattern on May 9, indicating strong buying at the breakout level of $1.48. However, the bulls have not been able to sustain the momentum today and the altcoin has formed an inside-day candlestick pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/205f8197-62f2-4fb2-8286-202c691282ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will signal strength and that could enhance the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1.45) and the RSI in the overbought territory also indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. A break above $1.83 may open the doors for a rally to $2 and then $2.25.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1.45), it will indicate a bull trap. That could pull the price down to $1.28 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the moving averages and the $42.28 overhead resistance. This tight range trading near the stiff resistance is a positive sign as it shows that traders are in no hurry to dump their long positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a9428711-7ffe-4751-887f-3790970c9f59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can thrust and sustain the price above $42.28, it will suggest that demand exceeds supply. That could result in a rally to the all-time high at $48.36 where the bears are again likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 However, if the buyers push the price above $48.36, the DOT/USDT pair could start its journey to $58.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the pair could drop to $34.36 and then to $32.56. If that happens, the pair may extend its stay inside the $26.50 to $42.28 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance near the 52-week high at $1,600.89 as seen from the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If the price slips below $1,400, the altcoin could drop to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,263.10 and remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8f380e27-519c-4142-91ef-8434b013af08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break below $1,263.10 and the advantage will shift in favor of the bears if the BCH/USDT pair slips below the 20-day EMA ($1,134).\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level or from $1,400 and breaks above $1,600.89, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend, which has a target objective at $2,147.36.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  surged above the resistance line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern on May 9, indicating a pick-up in momentum. The altcoin hit a new all-time high at $412.76 today but the long wick on the candlestick suggests profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f6939d33-8c70-4872-8356-709613be08d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USDT pair rebounds off the breakout level, it will suggest that the bulls are buying every minor dip. That will increase the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend with the next target at $463.31 and then $500.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price re-enters the wedge, it will suggest that the breakout on May 9 was a bull trap. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($309). A strong rebound off this level will suggest the sentiment remains positive while a break below the 20-day EMA will clear the path for a drop to the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the ascending channel on May 5 but could not build up on the breakout. After hesitating for a few days, the bulls made a decisive up-move on May 9 and pushed the altcoin to $52.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/07823412-c829-4206-9d05-202981f937c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls again failed to sustain the rally and the bears are trying to pull the price back into the ascending channel. If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair may drop to the 20-day EMA ($43).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls may make one more attempt to resume the uptrend. On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest the current breakout was a bull trap. The pair could then drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvYmExOGQ2ODItMzU2Zi00OTU2LThmYzItZGQwZTA1ZTJjYTJhLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210510eh5a000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Litecoin\par \b \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price hits $400 all-time high, but LTC rally at risk of overheating\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s tenth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization is worth 215 percent more than it was at the beginning of this year.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has broken the $400 mark, reaching a new all-time high price of $414 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The problem with buying \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  is that it has become too expensive in a very little period. The world\u8217\'20\'19s 10th-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization is worth 215% more than it was at the beginning of this year, soaring from $124.42 to a new record high of $413.90.\par \par \uc2 Its massive rally has beaten traditional markets on a year-to-date timeframe, with many independent analysts now predicting the move to extend toward $500.\par \par \uc2 Rotational trading\par \par \uc2 Eye-popping returns in the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  market came on the heels of a broad upside move in the cryptocurrency market. The silver crypto\u8217\'20\'19s top altcoin rivals, including Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-smashes-new-all-time-high-following-14-gain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and many others, posted better profits, with \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), a joke cryptocurrency, rising by more than 17,000% YTD at one point.\par \par \uc2 Jason Lau, chief operating officer of OKCoin \u8212\'20\'14 a San Francisco-based crypto service business \u8212\'20\'14 highlighted a brewing inverse correlation between \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 , noting that the DOGE/USD exchange rates dropped by 12% in the period that saw the LTC/USD exchange rates popping higher by 12%.\par \par \uc2 So\u8230\'20\'26 are people rotating from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24DOGE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOGE}}}\uc2  (-12%) into {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}\uc2  (+18%)?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/DQmWqXu5fp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/DQmWqXu5fp}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/l3GH2cSbic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/l3GH2cSbic}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jason Lau (@jasonklau) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jasonklau/status/1391603775471640578?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 10, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  Dominance Index, a metric that measures \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s strength against the rest of the cryptocurrency market, increased from 0.96% on Sunday to as high as 1.11% on Monday. That further reflects a sentimental shift to the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  markets as other alternative cryptocurrency rallies show signs of cooling off.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/231ced8b-84c9-4bf1-9575-a3446cdc9c28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  Dominance Index recovers amid rotational trading. Source: LTC.D on TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  is now grappling with the same overvaluation risks that caused \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price to crash {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogefather-elon-musk-jokingly-calls-token-a-hustle-as-price-falls-under-0-50"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by as much as 33%}}}\uc2  in the previous sessions. At the core of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  analogy lies a classic momentum oscillator indicator, dubbed as the Relative Strength Index (RSI), that has historically predicted potential price reversals in global markets. It now tells the same story about \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  overbought?\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USD daily chart shows its RSI at an inflection level near 79.02. That is 9 points above the overbought threshold, which has earlier led to price corrections.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/ece99d95-aec0-48ec-9864-828422e58b95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price\u8217\'20\'19s response to higher RSI levels in recent history. Source: LTCUSD on TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 Typically, a short-term trend reversal in the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  market \u8212\'20\'14 when its RSI tops out \u8212\'20\'14 leads the price to test the 20-day exponential moving average (the green wave) as interim support. Meanwhile, an extended sell-off prompts traders to treat the 50-day simple moving average (the blue wave) acting as the primary downside target.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, a potential pullback following the recent explosive move risks sending LTC/USD to $252\u8211\'20\'13$310 based on current moving average valuations.\par \par \uc2 Macroeconomic catalysts\par \par \uc2 Away from technicals, the macroeconomic catalysts continue to support cryptocurrency markets on the whole.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/@DV_Chain/charles-schwab-report-millenials-would-rather-buy-bitcoin-than-disney-netflix-stocks-7b0112f568d6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 study}}}\uc2  conducted by \uc2 Charles Schwab\uc2  showed that more than 51% of Millennials and Generation Z investors would more likely invest in cryptocurrencies than traditional stocks. Their interests in the emerging digital assets sector have surged in the wake of inflation and dollar devaluation fears, especially as the central banks around the world respond to the coronavirus pandemic with easing monetary policies.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 , for instance, has clarified that it would continue its $120-billion monthly asset purchase program while maintaining benchmark rates near zero at least until 2023. That has reduced the opportunity costs of holding traditional safe havens like bonds and dollars among regional investors.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the correlation between Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  stands near 0.40, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  collected from Crypto Watch.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvNGM1ZDA4ODYtMjhmYS00MTBmLTk1NzYtODNiZDhlMDc3ZDYzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210510eh5a0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LTC, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,770 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Binance Coin, Cardano, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and Chainlink have formed \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  patterns while Bitcoin is still stuck in a predictable range below $59,000.\par \par \uc2 Over the past week, several traders bought \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) leading up to Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Saturday Night Live appearance as they expected a pump. However, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-dumps-following-mention-from-elon-musk-on-saturday-night-live"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mention}}}\uc2  of \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  during the monologue by Musk did not produce the rally traders were looking for and professional traders may have dumped their positions on novice traders who were expecting a breakout.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  dumped to an intraday low at $0.41 today, losing over 34% from the previous day\u8217\'20\'19s close. Since then, the meme coin has been trying to stage a recovery and has risen to $0.54. The sharp fall in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  price shows that buying the hype, without any major fundamental reason, could result in stomach-churning \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/de8b2051-3b0b-4794-a1f2-e6968cb56a2d.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) extended its up-move further, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-closes-in-on-4k-as-shiba-inu-shib-steals-dogecoin-s-thunder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 faltering}}}\uc2  just below $4,000, while Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) again fell short of the $60,000 mark, indicating strong selling on every minor rally. A few days of range-bound action in Bitcoin is a positive sign as it may set the stage for the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 With Ether leading the altcoin charge, let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may outperform in the short term.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the downtrend line on May 8 but the bulls are finding it difficult to clear the hurdle at $58,966.53. The immediate support on the downside is at the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average ($56,387), the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above $58,966.53.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a88ea79e-b59e-40e6-87d5-4d62ebbd9f95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could start its journey toward the resistance line of the ascending channel at $67,000. The price has turned down from the resistance line on two previous occasions, hence the bears will again try to defend this level. The momentum will pick up after the buyers push the price above the channel.\par \par \uc2 However, the flattish moving averages and the relative strength index close to the midpoint show a lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. If the bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $52,323.21.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level will suggest buying at lower levels and that could result in a range-bound action between $52,323.21 and $58,966.53 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other contrary, a break below $52,323.21 may open the doors for a fall to the support line of the ascending channel and then to $46,985 where buyers may step in to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0caa487c-dffe-4289-a7bd-2f3e14c9d80c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the bears are defending the $58,966.53 overhead resistance. If they can sink the price below the 50-simple moving average, the pair could drop to $55,000 and then to $52,323.21.\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. However, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $58,966.53, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the target objective at $65,012.18.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend and the moving averages indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. Although the negative divergence on the RSI is flashing a warning sign, the setup will not come into play until the price retreats and shows weakness.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/83a07f4d-d083-4fc6-ae5a-b6ab83434e37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls thrust the price above $680, the BNB/USDT pair may start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $808.57. This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($592).\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the short-term traders may dump their positions, resulting in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($466). This is an important support to watch out for because the price has not closed below the 50-day SMA since Dec. 13, 2020. A break below $428 may signal that a top is in place.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f08c5c45-34d2-4605-adb3-0a5335b7d8b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the pair is stuck between $600 and $680. The 20-EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating the bulls have the upper hand. If the bulls can push and close the price above $680, the pair may rally to $760.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and slips below the moving averages, the pair may correct to $600. A bounce off this level could extend the consolidation for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) had been stuck between the $1 to $1.48 range for the past many weeks, before breaking out on May 6. This suggests the equilibrium between the bulls and the bears resolved in favor of the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0f4968ce-f7cb-4c30-806d-d2fc41f739ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That does not mean the bears have given up yet. They attempted to pull the price back below $1.48 on May 7 and today. However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls have successfully flipped $1.48 into support.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers sustain the price above $1.74, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $2 and then $2.25. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will nullify if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA ($1.42). Such a move could trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in a drop to $1. A rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/6cee707c-280b-48c3-97f4-eec663ea63ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages on the 4-hour chart are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating the bulls are in control. If the buyers sustain the price above $1.75, the momentum may pick up.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair may drop to the 20-EMA and then to the $1.48 support. A bounce off this support could result in a tight range trading between $1.48 and $1.75. The short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment may nullify if the bears sink the price below the 50-SMA.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside an ascending broadening wedge pattern. Although the bears have been defending the resistance line of the wedge for the past few days, the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0c10cf70-e799-4ac4-81d3-33b6210b9b66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive and sustain the price above $372.53, the LTC/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend which could reach $400 and then $463.31. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the resistance line, the short-term traders may dump their positions. That may result in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($298). A break below this support could open the gates for a decline to the 50-day SMA ($247).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/5efacc53-5dfe-4836-9668-34d97c701e5f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the pair is consolidating between $330.50 and $372.50. The bears have successfully defended the overhead resistance and are pulling the price toward the 20-EMA. If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will make another attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-EMA could pull the price down to $330.50. A rebound off this support may extend the stay of the pair inside the range for a few more days. On the other hand, a break and close below $330.50 could signal the start of a deeper correction. The first support is at the 50-SMA and then $290.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend and it had hit a new all-time high at $51.96 on May 7. During a strong uptrend, corrections are shallow and the price tends to consolidate in a tight range before resuming the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3b463108-2cd8-4158-bcfc-24cafeb4704a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the May 7 candlestick showed selling at higher levels and that was followed by an inside-day candlestick pattern on May 8, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($42) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $51.96, the LINK/USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $66.74.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks the $46 support, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce off this support will suggest the sentiment remains positive. However, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate the short-term momentum has weakened and a drop to the 50-day SMA ($35) is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/aa42acc9-b197-4e12-96ce-6ee6373a6e41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the price has broken out of the $46 to $50 range. This suggests the start of the next leg of the uptrend, which has an immediate target at $54. The 20-EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is above 67, indicating the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down and slips below $50, it will indicate the markets have rejected the higher levels. That may result in further selling that could pull the price down to the 50-SMA. A break below this level will suggest advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvYmFjZGEwMTQtMmY3Ny00ZmFlLWIyMWItNDI0MGRhYjBjNzcyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210509eh590008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Alt season\par \b \uc2 Alt season rush: Ethereum and DeFi get in shape for another hot summer\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anirudh Tiwari \par \uc2 1,798 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Alt season is here? ETH, DOGE and other altcoins rally to new highs as DeFi and Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s London hard fork promise further growth.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins like Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) are spearheading a new alt season that seems to have taken off with a bang. Since a rising tide usually lifts all boats, there are several other cryptocurrencies that are benefiting from this growing interest in altcoins. Ether, however, may be the one generating the waves.\par \par \uc2 The price of ETH, the flagship altcoin, increased more than 65% over 30 days to finally break through the $3,500 barrier on May 6. This takes the yearly gains for the token to over 1,500%, as it was trading in the $215 range this time last year. The price surge led its market capitalization to go beyond $400 billion for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph asked {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain/joshua-frank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joshua Frank}}}\uc2 , CEO of The TIE, about the social media trends around Ether and what the cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s gains mean for altcoins. He answered: \u8220\'20\'1CMany investors consider Ethereum a proxy for the alt-coin market, and tweet volume continues to increase exponentially since July 2020. [...] Tweet volume over 24 hours recorded an incredible 59,000 as Eth continues to push all-time highs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/5777a2b6-96e8-49e5-b306-aa1559c7499a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 In percentage terms, Ethereum Classic \u8212\'20\'14 a continuation of the original Ethereum blockchain \u8212\'20\'14 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/three-reasons-why-the-other-ethereum-has-pumped-130-in-the-last-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seen its value increase even more}}}\uc2  than the more popular coin of its sister blockchain. According to CoinGecko, ETC\u8217\'20\'19s price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/ethereum-classic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gained}}}\uc2  nearly 400% in seven days to hit an all-time high of $167 on May 6. The Ethereum Classic blockchain sprang into existence after most developers migrated to the now more popular Ethereum blockchain following a hack on The DAO\u8217\'20\'19s smart contracts in 2016, which cost the protocol $50 million in ETH.\par \par \uc2 The dominance of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has also dropped when compared with the 70% range it was resting in at the start of the year. It has been declining since, reaching a year-to-date low of 45.70% on May 6. The dominance metric essentially compares the market cap of BTC with that of all other cryptocurrencies combined.\par \par \uc2 BTC dominance usually decreases when altcoins instead dominate the interest of crypto investors. The only time {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-market-dominance-from-66-to-33-and-up-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the metric has ever been lower}}}\uc2  than its current level was just before the cryptocurrency market crash in 2018 when investors were desperately looking for alternatives to Bitcoin, as the flagship cryptocurrency had dropped by over 60% at the time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/81661764-8a88-43d5-9b66-e713476838c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Eric Anziani, chief operating officer of cryptocurrency exchange Crypto.com, explained to Cointelegraph why he believes Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance is decreasing this time: \u8220\'20\'1CThe price action acts in tandem with investors\u8217\'20\'19 psychology, dominant narratives in the space, and therefore moves in cyclical patterns.\u8221\'20\'1D He added further:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs the narrative around institutional adoption of Bitcoin has tapered off somewhat, investors have begun to turn to blockchains and protocols other than Bitcoin. [...] Although Bitcoin is a very sound store-of-value, the market as a whole is realizing how pivotal altcoins and their respective projects are to the future of crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This change in market dynamics is evident in the derivatives markets as well. On May 5, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/flippening-record-10b-ethereum-futures-volume-briefly-outpaces-bitcoin-s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether futures volumes briefly surpassed those of Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . The futures premiums for ETH have normalized at 25%, after peaking at 45% during mid-April.\par \par \uc2 This indicates that optimism is not nearly close to its peak despite ETH pushing to new highs on a daily basis, thus signaling that there is still room for growth when prices are compared with market sentiment.\par \par \uc2 London hard fork will lead to faster DeFi growth\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price surge essentially happened after the Ethereum blockchain underwent its Berlin upgrade on April 15. The hard fork {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-breaks-away-several-factors-power-eth-all-time-high-push"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 incorporated four Ethereum Improvement Proposals}}}\uc2  that were voted on by the developer community. Two of these addressed gas costs for specific transaction types, and while they reduced the costs for some types of transactions, they increased them for \u8220\'20\'1Cop-code transactions,\u8221\'20\'1D which could be used for denial-of-service attacks. The other two proposals expanded the categories of transaction logic.\par \par \uc2 James Beck, director of communications and content at ConsenSys \u8212\'20\'14 a blockchain technology company backing Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s infrastructure \u8212\'20\'14 told Cointelegraph: \u8220\'20\'1COne of the nice effects of the Berlin hard fork was that gas prices for DEX aggregators became much cheaper. For example, using MetaMask\u8217\'20\'19s swap feature is now resulting in 40,000 GWEI decrease to trade tokens.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ethereum is the most prominent blockchain used in the decentralized finance markets, and its price often goes hand in hand with DeFi\u8217\'20\'19s growth. At the time of writing, the total value {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 locked}}}\uc2  in DeFi is at a new high of just over $82 billion. The TVL in DeFi has been rapidly growing since the beginning of the year and has nearly doubled since the start of February. Flora Sun, managing director of Binance X \u8212\'20\'14 crypto exchange Binance\u8217\'20\'19s developer initiative \u8212\'20\'14 opined on the reason for this growth:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s a lot of innovation in DeFi protocols these days. In the past, lending and DEX were the main DeFi protocols, but now starting with AMM, there are various types of DeFi that meet various needs, like vaults and insurances. DeFi still offers a much higher yield than traditional finance, so naturally, it is attracting a lot of crypto liquidity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Automated market makers, or AMMs, are now integral to the DeFi ecosystem. As the name suggests, an AMM is an automated trading model that decentralized exchanges use instead of the order books used by traditional, centralized exchanges. When protocols use AMMs to supply liquidity pools, it means that the price of the assets is calculated by a fixed, predetermined mathematical formula based on the supply of the two tokens involved in the trade/swap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/they-see-eth-rollin-why-did-ether-price-reach-3-5k-and-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 They see ETH rollin\u8217\'20\'19: Why did Ether price reach $3.5K, and what\u8217\'20\'19s next?}}}\par \par \uc2 According to ConsenSys\u8217\'20\'19 quarter-one DeFi report, only 1% of all Ethereum addresses are currently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://consensys.net/reports/defi-report-q1-2021/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 using}}}\uc2  DeFi platforms. Thus, the room for adoption seems to be immense as more investors look to prioritize decentralization in their portfolios. The report also reveals that in the first quarter of 2021, nearly 51% of the total fees paid were on the Ethereum blockchain \u8212\'20\'14 more than double those of the Bitcoin blockchain. The decentralized exchange Uniswap by itself took nearly half the amount in fees taken by Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, another improvement proposal for Ethereum, EIP-1559, has been greenlit by the developer community as a part of the London hard fork that\u8217\'20\'19s scheduled to happen in July. Anziani further spoke on the hard fork:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis upgrade will begin burning transaction fees, naturally reducing Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s rate of inflation. If network usage is high enough, Ethereum may even become deflationary. This is a highly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  development that the market has just begun to price in.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Ether has shown a low level of global leverage across exchanges, which means that ETH holders are dealing more in spot holdings than indulging in the use of leverage to long Ether. Frank opined on what this might mean: \u8220\'20\'1CThis indicates that holders intend to either hold Eth in their wallets and/or use Eth to interact in the eco-system with DeFi or other protocols rather than use leverage as a purely speculative play to profit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/eb1c3ec8-2578-4d77-b1aa-896b3fca892b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Other alts grow as well\par \par \uc2 Due to the growth of DeFi, alternative platforms to Ethereum, like Binance Smart Chain and Cardano, have been seeing increased adoption by DeFi protocols and decentralized applications as people seek to avoid Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s high gas fees, which have become an issue for users all around. Since the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/whales-profit-as-high-ethereum-gas-fees-sideline-retail-defi-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gas-fee issue has persisted}}}\uc2  for a while, BSC and Cardano have accommodated some of 2021\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi growth. On the subject, Sun pointed out:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince BSC launched in September 2020, in 8 months, there are 500+ projects building on BSC and its ATH daily transaction volume has exceeded Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s by 450% and currently boasts of $56 billion in its DeFi ecosystem. All the projects building on top of BSC contribute to this growth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), the native cryptocurrency of both Binance Smart Chain and Binance Chain, has also quickly risen from trading in the $50 range on Feb. 1 to reaching an all-time high of $679.82 on May 3. That is a growth of over 1,200% in less than 100 days, leading BNB to rise to become the third-biggest cryptocurrency by market capitalization. According to CoinMarketCap, the token has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/binance-coin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market cap}}}\uc2  of nearly $100 billion as of the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  coin also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-breaks-out-vs-bitcoin-as-ada-price-discovery-nears-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leaped to a new all-time high of $1.70 on May 7}}}\uc2 . The cryptocurrency has grown more than 3,200% over the past year. Cardano has also announced various partnerships and launches over the past month. Despite this, Beck backs layer-two solutions over Cardano, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CMore DeFi users will flock to Layer 2 networks that are Ethereum compatible. DeFi developers are looking to move their applications and users on to layer 2 in order to take advantage of lower gas fees.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to L2 Beat, the TVL in layer-two solutions has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.l2beat.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  nearly twentyfold, from $38.4 million on Jan. 1 to around $718 million at the time of writing. It briefly even surpassed $1 billion in both March and April. Beck further stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSynthetix and dYdX have announced they have been ardently working on integrating with Layer 2 solutions. Synthetix has been working with Optimism for months now, while dYdX recently announced that their new cross-margined perpetuals are live on Starkware\u8217\'20\'19s STARK based roll-up solution. We expect this trend to accentuate for the rest of the year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Among the several coins seeing unprecedented gains \u8212\'20\'14 in addition to Ether and the native cryptocurrencies of Ethereum alternatives \u8212\'20\'14 the Shiba Inu-themed meme coin \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is the one catching the most mainstream media attention. It\u8217\'20\'19s getting so much attention that it could be the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-the-leading-indicator-for-alt-season"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leading indicator for alt season}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doge-as-internet-money-tiktokers-and-sports-fans-see-a-use-case-for-dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE as internet money? TikTokers and sports fans see a use case for Dogecoin}}}\par \par \uc2 The coin broke out from the $0.06\u8211\'20\'13$0.07 range on April 12 to reach its all-time high of $0.69 on May 5. DOGE is currently trading at around $0.71 and has posted year-on-year gains of over 35,000%. However, May 8 will be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/may-8-day-to-watch-for-dogecoin-amid-warning-doge-can-suffer-xrp-style-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critical day for DOGE}}}\uc2 , as Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s appearance on Saturday Night Live may dictate what lies ahead for the coin and, quite possibly, impact this alleged alt season as well.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMGUwZDUyMjctYzc2My00ODM5LTkzMDEtNmVkNDI0ZGRkMTkxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210508eh580002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, BCH, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,040 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins continue to rally higher and Bitcoin's repeat tests of the $58,000 level signal that bulls are building momentum.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  has started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-is-now-offering-bitcoin-derivatives"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offering}}}\uc2  its clients access to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) trading through non-deliverable forwards, according to Bloomberg Law. Max Minton, Goldman's Asia-Pacific head of digital assets, said that \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional demand continues to grow significantly in this space.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Even \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  plans to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/citigroup-considers-crypto-amid-surge-in-customer-demand-on-wall-street"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduce}}}\uc2  crypto-related services due to the increasing demand from asset managers and hedge funds. Although inquiries about Bitcoin surged in August 2020, the investment bank has been slow to jump into the crypto market. \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s global head of foreign exchange, Itay Tuchman told the Financial Times that \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto is here to stay and that we are just at the very beginning of the market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3668c26d-f603-4683-9765-d900fcfa413b.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors view dips as an opportunity to build their portfolio at favorable prices. These investors seem to be using the current correction in Bitcoin to buy. Glassnode data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/unprecedented-capital-inflows-into-bitcoin-remove-12k-btc-from-coinbase-in-an-hour"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  that 12,354 Bitcoin were withdrawn from \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , with the intention of possibly being held in cold wallets for the long term.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin seems to be in accumulation mode, altcoins have continued their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/altcoins-rally-as-bulls-pile-into-large-cap-tokens-and-layer-1-projects"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stellar}}}\uc2  run. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to ascertain whether the altcoins have room to run or is a correction around the corner.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance near the downtrend line but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the 20-day exponential moving average ($56,036). This indicates that traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/19bc6b87-8b3f-4252-ad2a-ebbb092a7a63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls drive the price above the downtrend line and the $58,966.53 resistance, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and challenge the all-time high at $64,849.27. A breakout and close above this level will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $52,323.21. A bounce off of this support will imply that the pair may consolidate between $52,323.21 and $58,966.53 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) just above the midpoint indicate the likelihood of a range-bound action in the short term. The possibility of a deeper correction will increase if the bears sink the price below $52,323.21.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend. The correction on May 4 was short-lived as the bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high on May 5 and followed it up with another up-move on May 6. This shows the momentum remains strong and traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/18f0231b-af00-4e39-90fd-b867cfa0f4c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers drive the price above $3,607.14, the ETH/USDT pair could continue its northward march toward the next target objective at $4,528.97.\par \par \uc2 However, after the recent run-up, the price is trading way above the 50-day simple moving average ($2,289), implying that the pair is over-extended in the short term. A break below the $3,165.30 support will be the first sign of a correction to the 20-day EMA ($2,886).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips as they anticipate the rally to continue. Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate exhaustion and result in a drop to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend but the negative divergence on the RSI signals that the momentum is weakening. The recovery on May 5 fizzled out at $656, suggesting that higher levels are attracting selling from traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/b961f8a9-199c-45b2-b99c-5373dce34d06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($579), the short-term traders may rush to the exit. That could intensify the selling and pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($451).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend. A break above $680 could clear the path for a rally to $808.57.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bears could not even drag the price down to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.49, implying that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/9723749d-2ee8-4af5-b151-f12e4d2208fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the $0.69 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its journey toward the target objective at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that traders are closing their positions on rallies. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may weaken if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.39).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the downtrend line on May 6 and May 7 but the long wick on the candlesticks suggests traders are booking profits at higher levels. The bears are currently attempting to pull the price back below the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7ac821bf-b248-4129-8a8a-4654aacfbc5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($1.43). The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will indicate the sentiment remains positive. If the buyers push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the pair may rise to $1.96. A breakout of this level could start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand. That could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($1.09).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) soared above the $1.48 resistance on May 6, which signaled the resumption of the uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price down today but the long tail on the candlestick suggests strong buying near the breakout level at $1.48.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/2434e557-4647-4252-a728-7e83839f482e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.36) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside. The first target on the upside is $2 and if that level is crossed, the uptrend may reach $2.25.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down from the current level and breaks below $1.48. Such a move could trap the aggressive bulls and result in a drop to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) reached the $42.28 overhead resistance on May 6 where the bears are trying to stall the up-move. The altcoin has formed an inside-day candlestick pattern today, which suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for DOT on May 5, prior to the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/720b47b9-f4cc-47f3-a233-4bdadec9454b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. DOT price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for DOT flipped green on May 5 when the price was $36.18, well before the indication of any rally.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score has largely remained in the green and DOT rallied to $42.47 on May 6, a 17% gain in two days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8df135e0-7c3d-4270-a716-481340607f04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $42.28 will suggest the bulls have overcome the resistance from the bears. That could push the DOT/USDT pair to the all-time high at $48.36. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down from $42.28, the pair may drop to the moving averages. A strong bounce off this support will indicate demand at lower levels and the bulls will make one more attempt to propel the pair to $48.36.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($37) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to the buyers. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will nullify if the bears sink the pair below $34.36. Such a move could result in a drop to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the strong surge on May 5 and 6, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) is currently witnessing profit-booking. The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,263.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/5fa77e8c-1da1-4aa5-8743-db47467bafe0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BCH/USDT pair rebounds off this level, it will suggest the sentiment remains positive and traders are accumulating at lower levels. The bulls will then try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $1,600.89. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $2,147.36.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the pair plummets and sustains below the breakout level at $1,213.51. That could result in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($1,030) where buying is likely to resume.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been facing selling near the resistance line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern for the past two days. Although the bears tried to start a correction on May 6, the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/4cebe5fc-8ca8-4b24-9310-23a857cf30c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can thrust and sustain the price above the wedge, the LTC/USDT pair is likely to race ahead to $400 and then $463.31. However, the rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI above 74, indicating the possibility of a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $318.87. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($286). If this support also cracks, the decline may extend to the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $44.90 on May 5, suggesting profit-booking at higher levels. The bears tried to pounce on the opportunity and sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($38.68) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/2d74054f-ef41-4252-8d0b-4f36c5897d08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick indicates strong buying at the 20-day EMA. This suggests the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The buyers will now try to push the price above $45.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will signal that correction is over and the pair is ready to climb to the resistance line of the channel at $51.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price again turns down from $45, the UNI/USDT pair may consolidate in a tight range for a few days. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign of weakness and that could result in a drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvZmI2ZjcyZTItZTBjYS00MjRjLWE1N2YtZDQyODk2YTRhOWE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210507eh57000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 QTUM\par \b \uc2 Qtum price rallies 160% as the project's focus on DeFi pays off\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 748 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 QTUM price hit a 3-year high above $35 as the team's focus on DeFi and staking attracts new users.\par \par \uc2 After rallying 1.510% in 2021, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nomics.com/assets/qtum-qtum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 QTUM}}}\uc2  price hit a $35.70 all-time high on May 7. This relatively obscure altcoin launched in September 2017 is a fork of the Bitcoin Core 0.13 version, but it also integrates the Ethereum virtual machine (EVM) and smart contract execution capability.\par \par \uc2 Following Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) April 23 crash down to $47,500, QTUM faced a 52% correction in 4 days before bottoming at $10. However, the situation for the altcoin improved on May 5 as QTUM initiated a 160% rally in two days, reaching the $35.70 peak.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/321559a9-be5d-42fb-99e9-eed6a583a970.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 QTUM price at Binance, USDT. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Qtum combines Bitcoin's transaction model with Ethereum smart contracts\par \par \uc2 The open-source platform's primary goal is to provide simple tools that anyone can use to create decentralized applications (dApps) while maintaining a high level of network security. The project opted for a slightly different Proof of Stake (POS) version to prevent malicious nodes, and a certain number of blocks are needed for the staking tokens to become valid.\par \par \uc2 Qtum blockchain supports smart contract programming languages beyond Solidity, besides having an on-chain decentralized governance protocol. Token holders vote on network parameters such as block size and base gas fee.\par \par \uc2 While Qtum blockchain features an on-chain governance system, it also has an off-chain process for approving and handling more significant protocol changes. The protocol has recently identified decentralized finance (DeFi) as a focus area and steps to attract new projects.\par \par \uc2 This strategy seems to be finally paying off, as the number of daily network transactions peaked on May 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3942b69b-757b-412d-91e6-940bd1d8797c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Qtum blockchain transactions per day. Source: qtum.info\par \par \uc2 Staking improvements and DeFi pivot send Qtum price higher\par \par \uc2 Offline staking was implemented in August 2020, and it has grown to more than half the staking activity on the Qtum blockchain. Investors who don't want to handle their own nodes can make a non-custodial delegation for their coins.\par \par \uc2 On March 17, Value Network announced plans to migrate away from Ethereum due to network congestion and high costs. It is now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blockchain-startup-offers-binary-options-that-deliver-fairer-terms-to-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moving to the Qtum smart contract and DApp platform}}}\uc2  and has received a development grant to accelerate the transition.\par \par \uc2 On March 31, Qtum founder Patrick Dai said that the protocol was working to enable smart contracts for Filecoin (FIL) through the Qtum network.\par \par \uc2 The network transitioned from a 128-second block average to a 32-second block average via a hard fork on April 30. The average four weeks that it took for an average-size staker to become valid now has been reduced to a single week.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum compatibility means increased interoperability\par \par \uc2 Interoperability is another reason for QTUM's recent rally. The team is developing Neutron, an agnostic interface that allows virtual machines to run on multiple blockchains. Moreover, its own DEX called QiSwap enables users to build DeFi applications and provide liquidity on top of the Qtum blockchain.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.32806647.87136234.1620053616-695798010.1596750453"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for QTUM on May 5, before the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historical and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points, including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements, and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a883fb50-d4ee-47a3-a6d3-72075c7dfc35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score vs. QTUM price (white). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.33174263.87136234.1620053616-695798010.1596750453"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score began to climb on May 5 and reached a high of 71. It's worth noting that the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score peaked roughly 24 hours before the price spiked 100% to a new all-time high at $35.70.\par \par \uc2 Qtum is aiming to compete with some serious smart contract contenders like Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nomics.com/assets/dot-polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), VeChain ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nomics.com/assets/vet-vechain-thor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VET}}}\uc2  ), and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nomics.com/assets/sol-solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and the project has an impressive $2.74 billion market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 However, for QTUM to increase its valuation, investors will likely want to see more decentralized applications and total value locked (TVL) on the network.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvN2U4ZjMyN2UtOTExMi00NDhiLTk0ZmItN2ZhODFlYmU2NDBhLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210507eh57000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin clips $58K as \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  stalls and adoption news fuels bulls\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 382 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is back at $58,000 with \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  suddenly losing steam.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) touched $58,000 on Thursday as the latest phase of its comeback seemed to come at the expense of altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7e8cb658-ea2d-4da7-a2f5-5d32933827db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin claws back lost limelight\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD\u8217\'20\'19s return to battle familiar resistance near old all-time highs on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The move builds on strength from earlier in the week. As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-back-above-57k-as-hundreds-of-us-banks-prepare-to-hodl-for-clients"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , Wednesday saw $57,000 and 5% daily gains.\par \par \uc2 As analysts began to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SalsaTekila/status/1390263634551521282"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 note}}}\uc2 , however, altcoins are facing increasing pressure from a newly invigorated Bitcoin, which just days before had been left in the shade by their performance.\par \par \uc2 Thursday, thus, saw 4.4% growth on BTC/USD, while Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), previously the week\u8217\'20\'19s high flyers, were both flat.\par \par \uc2 Other altcoins did manage to deliver impressive returns and beat Bitcoin on the day, notably Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), which were up 16% and 22%, respectively, at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGood start of the day: both ETHUSD and BTC bouncing from the expected levels,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Crypto Ed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1390217776766373890"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  about the state of the market.\par \par \uc2 The largest cryptocurrency thus again faced final resistance beginning at just under $60,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/a9e4fd4e-1648-4760-8822-a1ee575fddf5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD buy and sell levels (Binance). Source: Material Indicators\par \par \uc2 Bank BTC adoption strikes a chord\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had benefited from a major United States bank adoption announcement, which was followed by news that the largest e-commerce company in Latin America, \uc2 MercadoLibre\uc2 , had added $7.6 million of BTC to its balance sheet.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs part of our treasury strategy this quarter we purchased $7.8 million in bitcoin, a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  that we are disclosing within our indefinite-lived intangible assets,\u8221\'20\'1D a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/0001099590/000156276221000190/meli-20210505xex99_1.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filing}}}\uc2  with U.S. regulator the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  confirmed.\par \par \uc2 There are now six companies with at least $11.4 million in Bitcoin on their balance sheets, corresponding to at least 8,027 BTC. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , which only entered the market last August, is still by far the largest player with over 91,000 BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMjlmODdkNzctOTMzOS00ZjI3LWE1MjAtODFiYjI4ZThiNGE0LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210506eh560005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, LTC, BCH, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,067 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is trying to stage a comeback in order to catch up with the spectacular price action seen in Ethereum and other altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above $0.69 today and flipped XRP to become the fourth largest cryptocurrency with a market capitalization of over $88 billion at its highest point.\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital recently released a report titled \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 : The Most Honest Sh*tcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D and the document {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/only-whales-move-doge-data-suggests-major-dogecoin-wealth-gap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  the fact that no updates have been logged in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 GitHub\uc2  repository since 2017. Even the blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s network security is suboptimal with only 26% of the overall node count running fully synced notes, the report added.\par \par \uc2 There seems to be a massive mismatch between \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s fundamentals and its valuation. The meme coin\u8217\'20\'19s rally is an indication that traders are driven by greed and such phases of frenzy never end well. When the bubble {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/may-8-day-to-watch-for-dogecoin-amid-warning-doge-can-suffer-xrp-style-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bursts}}}\uc2 , several investors will be left nursing massive losses.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/eae3ed99-f6f4-4097-bb21-6a7a20e37c9d.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Moving away from the \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  frenzy, the latest CoinShares report shows weekly institutional {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-managers-hold-a-record-13-9b-worth-of-ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows}}}\uc2  of $489 million for various crypto products. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) accounted for the lion\u8217\'20\'19s share of the investments at $411.7 million.\par \par \uc2 This shows that institutional investors are viewing the current weakness in Bitcoin as a buying opportunity. The total crypto assets under management is at $64.7 billion, having risen about $7 billion in the past six weeks.\par \par \uc2 Will Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continue to pull altcoins higher or will Bitcoin make a comeback? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below the moving averages on May 4 but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. This suggests the bulls have not yet given up and they continue to buy on every dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/3817b1ce-1a25-4942-9ff2-a259c3bf1420.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the moving averages today and they will now try to challenge the downtrend line and the overhead resistance at $58,966.53. A breakout of this resistance zone will clear the path for a possible retest of the all-time high at $64,849.27.\par \par \uc2 However, the flattish moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the BTC/USDT pair stuck between $52,323.21 and $58,966.51 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The bears may gain the upper hand if the price turns down and plummets below $52,323.21. Such a move will suggest weakness and that could result in a decline to the critical support at $46,985.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether is in a momentum-driven uptrend. Generally, in such phases of melt-up, the asset may remain overbought for an extended duration and corrections can be sharp but are usually short-lived. After a one-day pullback on May 4, the bulls are trying to resume the up-move today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/2a5e2107-cbd0-410e-a67f-a37945054490.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $3,527.19, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $4,528.97. However, the farther the price moves away from the moving averages, the greater the risk of a massive correction. Therefore, traders should exercise caution.\par \par \uc2 If the price reverses direction from $3,500, it will indicate profit-booking at higher levels. The bears will then try to pull the price below $3,165.30, which could result in a decline to the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,731).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level will suggest the uptrend remains intact. The bulls then try to resume the up-move. Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest the pair has formed a short-term top.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) sharp correction on May 4 attracted buyers near the $600 mark. This suggests the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/70e0c930-9700-4c18-a2f0-aaac9c3e7616.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the buyers push the price above $680, the uptrend could resume with the next target objective at $808.57.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will nullify if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($567). Such a move will suggest that supply exceeds demand and the BNB/USDT pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($436).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  is in a strong melt-up. The bulls pushed the price above the $0.45 resistance on May 4, which resulted in a pick-up in momentum. The long wick on May 4 suggested profit-booking by traders near $0.61 but the bears could not maintain the selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 According to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2 , market conditions for DOGE have been favorable for some time.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c3a9c6a3-96e6-443b-a200-e91103702c1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. DOGE price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for DOGE flipped green on May 2 when the price was $0.38, well before the indication of any rally.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score has largely remained in the green and DOGE rallied to $0.69 today, an 86% gain in about four days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c597dc68-46f4-4ae1-abc1-54f9b8ad2988.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buying resumed today and the DOGE/USDT pair hit a new all-time high at $0.69. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests profit-booking at higher levels. The pair could now drop to the breakout level at $0.45. A break below this level could pull the price to the 20-EMA ($0.33).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls flip this level into support, the pair may again try to rise above $0.69. If that happens, the rally may extend to $0.84 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 Frenzied buying in an asset can result in strong rallies. However, traders should be careful and protect their capital with a trailing stop-loss because vertical rallies can quickly reverse direction, resulting in sharp losses.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  dropped below the 20-day EMA ($1.39) on May 4 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This shows the bulls are defending the 20-day EMA. The price has reached the downtrend line where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/8dbae9e5-8e4e-4592-a95a-75ce0dc822da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($1.05).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line, the up-move may resume and the bulls may try to push the price to $1.96. A breakout of this resistance will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($1.29) on May 4 but the bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($1.24). The buyers are currently trying to push the price toward the resistance of the range at $1.48.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/e71fcd5a-34bc-498a-969e-b56ad647bf84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to face stiff resistance near the $1.48 to $1.55 zone. If the price turns down from this zone, the pair could again drop to the moving averages and extend the stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair may gradually drop to $1.03. A strong bounce off this support will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips to the support of the range.\par \par \uc2 Until the bulls push the price above $1.55 or the bears sink the pair below $0.98, the range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the 20-day EMA ($36) on May 4 but the bulls did not panic and dump their positions. Rather, they bought the dip and have pushed the price back above the moving averages today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f1ec4b6b-bd25-478b-820c-adbb7cff77fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the price above $38.30, the DOT/USDT pair may rally to $42.28 and then to $48.36. However, the flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This indicates the pair is likely to hit a wall at $42.28. If the price turns down from this resistance, the range-bound action is likely to continue. The next trending move could start if the price breaks above $50 or plunges below $26.50.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $335.03 overhead resistance today, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The 20-day EMA ($271) has turned up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, suggesting the bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/d0d299bd-73d5-4aea-8ed0-fbc37783365b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the buyers push the price above the resistance line of the ascending broadening wedge pattern, the LTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $400 and then $463.31.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to stall the up-move at the resistance line. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could drop to $308 and then to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest the sentiment remains positive. The bulls will then make one more attempt to resume the uptrend. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After days of hesitation near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,012.29, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) soared above the $1,213.51 resistance today, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/0901c150-f8cf-42f7-b394-cdeb39900196.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls manage to sustain the price above $1,213.51, the BCH/USDT pair could rally to $1,410.42 and then $1,710.39.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $1,213.51, the pair could drop to $1,050. If the pair rebounds off this level, the bulls will make one more attempt to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, a break below $1,050 will suggest that supply exceeds demand and that could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($926).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $39.60 support on May 5, which shows the bulls are defending this level aggressively. If the buyers propel the price above $45, the next leg of the uptrend could begin. The target objective on the upside is a rally to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/b20884f1-535b-4a5d-b61e-f058f65daffb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($38.35) suggests the buyers have the advantage but the negative divergence on the RSI indicates the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bears are making a comeback. The UNI/USDT pair could then drop to the support line of the channel where buyers may emerge.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off this support will suggest buying at lower levels and the uptrend may remain intact. Conversely, a break below the channel will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvNzdhNTMzMWUtYjBkYS00OWIzLWE1ODEtYjBlMzk2MjE3MGJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210505eh55000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,993 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum and a handful of altcoins have charged higher while Bitcoin struggles to find enough momentum to clear the $58,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been the star performer among major cryptocurrencies in the past few days as its rally has continued unabated. The second-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization crossed the $3,300 today sending projects market cap to $381.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 Ether has now become the 24th largest asset in the world, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://8marketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vaulting}}}\uc2  the project above blue-chip names like \uc2 Mastercard\uc2 , \uc2 NVIDIA\uc2 , \uc2 Walt Disney\uc2 , \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  and \uc2 Home Depot\uc2 , according to data from Infinite Market Cap. This strong performance in Ether has also brought back murmurs of Ethereum flippening Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/58379ce6-fc7f-4f13-9fd3-c6f80ddf24eb.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, Ether has a lot of catching up to do if it wants to flip Bitcoin because its market dominance at 16.4% is much below Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 47%. Still, the rise of Ether is positive for the crypto sector because it is likely to attract the attention of institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 Fund managers will find it difficult to ignore the top two cryptocurrencies as their market caps surpass popular Wall Street names. This could continue to attract fresh money into the crypto sector and boost prices higher.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine their trend and the possible target objectives.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,915) today, suggesting that bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will now try to push the price to the $61,825.84 to $64,849.27 overhead resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7edfb575-3f92-42d3-87af-120fcdc5c2fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above $58,000. If the buyers fail to do that, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could start a correction to $52,323.21 and then to $50,460. A bounce off this level could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls defend the 20-day EMA, it will signal strength. If the buyers can sustain the price above $58,000, the pair could start a gradual climb to the overhead zone. The next leg of the uptrend may start after the pair rises above $64,849.27.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether had been trading inside an ascending channel for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above the resistance line of the channel on May 1, resulting in a pick-up in momentum. Ether could now rally to $3,513.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/477fe839-168f-4c68-861c-a11c1048731d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up suggesting that bulls have the upper hand. However, the RSI above 80 suggests the rally is overbought in the short-term and the ETH/USDT pair may soon enter a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not allow the price to re-enter the channel, it will suggest that traders are buying on dips as they expect the rally to continue. Conversely, if the bears sink and sustain the price below $2,850, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($2,586).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After forming a Doji candlestick pattern on May 1 and 2, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has resumed its uptrend today. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought zone, suggesting the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f896ea0b-c5b0-476e-a462-51305af29d51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $639, the BNB/USDT pair could start its journey toward the pattern target at $808.57.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $639, the bears will try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($552). A bounce off this support will keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price drops below the 20-day EMA, the pair could decline to the support line of the triangle and then to the 50-day simple moving average ($421).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  turned down from $1.66 and formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on May 2. That was followed by a Doji candlestick pattern today, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/78465f9f-22c3-4e98-a496-75ccc95ba837.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside, the XRP/USDT pair could correct to the 20-day EMA ($1.36), which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that traders are buying on dips. If the bulls thrust the price above $1.66, the pair could rise to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement at $1.73 and then retest the 52-week high at $1.96.\par \par \uc2 The marginally rising 20-day EMA and the RSI near 61 indicate the bulls have the upper hand. This positive view will invalidate if the pair breaks the 20-day EMA support. Such a move will suggest that traders are dumping their positions and that could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($1.01).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty following the inside-day candlestick pattern on April 29 resolved to the upside on April 30 and the bulls propelled \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the $0.34 resistance on May 1.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for DOGE on April 29, prior to the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c01f249f-17ea-4539-9fe2-85e23915d3d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs. DOGE price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.267995783.886607869.1619940692-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for DOGE flipped green on April 29 when the price was $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Since then, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score has largely remained in the green, barring a short-term dip below the 60 level. DOGE has rallied above $0.41 today, resulting in a 36% rally in roughly five days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/4a9ec90b-5a03-4101-810f-27b8fafa4580.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the bulls are in control. The DOGE/USDT pair could now retest the all-time high at $0.45.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls propel the price above this resistance, the uptrend could resume with the next target objective at $0.65.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks the 20-day EMA support,\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($1.27) for the past few days, suggesting the bulls are in no hurry to book profits. The altcoin remains on track to resume the up-move and reach the $1.48 to $1.55 resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/f7675bb5-5bf6-453e-bcb8-2c278f835345.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may hit a wall at the overhead resistance zone as the bears will once again try to reverse the direction and keep the price stuck inside the $1.03 to $1.48 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The marginally rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 56 suggest the bulls have the upper hand. If they can drive the price above the zone, the pair could start its journey to $2.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, the pair may drop to the support of the range at $1.03.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 After hesitating near the 50-day SMA ($36.94) on May 1 and 2, the bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above it today. However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows the bears have not given up yet and are selling on every rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/68a2832f-a7c6-433a-bc3b-e35065dbb009.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if they can push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA. That could open the gates for a move to $42.28.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, the DOT/USDT pair may drop to $32.50. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively but if the bears overpower them, the pair could drop to support of the range at $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit-booking at $44 on April 29 and entered a minor correction. However, the bulls succeeded in flipping the previous resistance at $39.60 into support, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/7a9bc29c-918e-4d45-8cbe-cd79e0cb3aea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The uptrend has resumed today and the UNI/USDT pair has risen to a new all-time high at $45. Although the RSI is still warning of a negative divergence, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($37.41) suggests the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the price above $44, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the ascending channel at $50. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will nullify if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After a one-day correction on May 2, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has started its northward journey today. This suggests the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and every minor dip is being purchased. The bulls will now try to push the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $286.02.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/88d54730-cd86-43d5-be1f-ccba66fa0286.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair could rise to the 78.6% retracement level at $307.58 and then to $335.03. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($257) and the RSI above 61 suggest that demand exceeds supply.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from $286.02 and slumps below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that traders are closing their positions on relief rallies. That could result in a drop to the 50-day SMA ($230).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,012.29 on May 1 but the correction was short-lived as the bulls purchased the dip on May 2. This suggests strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-05/c18017b4-b121-4cd7-972b-310cb73290cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows bears are selling on rallies above $1,012.29. If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $950.46, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($879).\par \par \uc2 A break below this level will suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and that will open the doors for a possible drop to the 50-day SMA ($703).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls succeed in sustaining the price above $1,012.29, the BCH/USDT pair could rise to $1,100.78 and then retest the 52-week high at $1,213.51. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 62, indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDUvMWU4MTMzZDgtYThjMC00ZTY5LWJlYjctM2Q1NmIyNGEyYmRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210503eh53000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,912 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After days of range-bound action, Bitcoin and many altcoins made a strong comeback today, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The recent weakness in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price did not see any panic selling by investors, suggesting the sentiment in the crypto sector remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . After Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) strong run in the past few days, Bitcoin played catch up today as it reclaimed the $55,000 level. This suggests investors continue to accumulate on dips.\par \par \uc2 Gaming-focused venture capital fund Bitkraft Ventures, with more than $400 million in assets under management, has tied up with crypto research firm Delphi Digital to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/400m-gaming-vc-fund-bitkraft-teams-up-with-delphi-on-blockchain-gaming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invest}}}\uc2  in crypto-assets and related projects.\par \par \uc2 The demand from institutions also seems to be picking up in Asia. To {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/our-man-in-shanghai-huobi-looks-to-become-grayscale-of-asia-yao-ming-s-nft-wine-and-chinese-crypto-investors-go-to-the-dogs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cater}}}\uc2  to this demand, Huobi Asset Management has launched four cryptocurrency-related tracker funds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/fc750f58-4ced-49f2-bc36-90812172182b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 To provide institutional clients with digital assets data and analytics, Fidelity has announced the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-launches-institutional-cryptocurrency-analytics-platform-sherlock"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch}}}\uc2  of Sherlock, a product similar to Bloomberg\u8217\'20\'19s Terminal, that will offer both fundamental and technical analysis research for the fund managers.\par \par \uc2 Along with new entrants, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-sees-up-to-52-revenue-surge-as-saylor-confirms-more-bitcoin-buys-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 existing}}}\uc2  investors are also looking to add to their crypto holdings. MicroStrategy CEO Michael Saylor said in a press release on April 30 that the company \u8220\'20\'1Cwill continue to acquire and hold additional bitcoin as we seek to create additional value for shareholders.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The resilience of Bitcoin and other major altcoins shows the markets have matured. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to determine the direction of the next possible trending move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After hesitating near the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,324) for the past two days, Bitcoin has soared to the 50-day simple moving average ($56,897) today. If the bulls propel the price above the 50-day SMA, an up-move to the $61,825.84 to $64,849.27 resistance zone is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8f29afe4-f33c-4e20-8efa-54074fd18342.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) above 53 suggest the selling pressure has subsided. However, the bulls may face stiff resistance at the current level and again at the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks the $52,500 support, it will suggest that bears are aggressively selling near the 50-day SMA. That could result in a retest of the $50,460 level and then $46,985.02.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start on a break above $64,849.27 or a slide below $46,985.02. Until then, volatile range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether formed a Doji candlestick pattern on April 29 and has made an inside-day candlestick pattern today, indicating hesitation near the resistance line of the ascending channel. However, if the bulls do not give up much ground, the uptrend is likely to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/6042fe8c-1632-487a-a3f3-c65c86b9a42d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout of the channel will suggest the momentum remains strong and that could result in a sharp rally to $3,000. The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to push the price above the channel within the next couple of days, the ETH/USDT pair may witness profit-booking. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($2,417). A break below the support line of the channel will signal a possible trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on April 29. This suggests the resumption of the uptrend. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $808.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9b120096-e32e-444e-a0a1-179c9fa63a6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate the bulls are in control. The buyers may face resistance at $638.57 but if the price does not dip back below the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair remains on target to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the short term if the price slips and re-enters the triangle. Such a move could keep the price in a consolidation for a few more days. The pair will signal a trend reversal if the price breaks and sustains below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on April 29, which has resolved to the upside today. The bulls have pushed the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.55, signaling strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/dfa264ef-fea7-422e-97d0-04370b36792a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the price above $1.55, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.73 and then retest the 52-week high at $1.96. The rising 20-day EMA ($1.29) and the RSI near 64 suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears pull the price back below $1.55, it will suggest profit-booking at higher levels. A break below the 20-day EMA will indicate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and that could keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit-booking on April 29 at $1.41 but the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($1.25). This is a positive sign and it keeps the altcoin on track to reach the overhead resistance at $1.48.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1366b677-6662-4454-8cc8-b4fb85559683.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the $1.48 resistance, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could extend its stay inside the range. The flattish moving averages and the RSI above 58 also point to a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate if the bulls push the price above the $1.48 to $1.55 overhead resistance zone. Such a move will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears and a new uptrend is likely. The next target objective on the upside is $2.\par \par \uc2 The bears could smell an opportunity if the price breaks and sustains below the moving averages. A break below $1.03 will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.34 on April 29 but the bulls are not giving up much ground, which is a positive sign. The inside-day candlestick pattern on April 29 and today suggests uncertainty among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/933b7b99-c17a-4163-8b95-243c39d81a74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.24) and the RSI above 62, indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls propel the price above $0.34, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.29, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound for a few days. The trend may turn in favor of the bears if the pair breaks and closes below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has formed a Doji candlestick pattern today, suggesting hesitation by the bulls to continue buying near the 50-day SMA ($36.91). However, if the bears fail to sink the price below $32.50 in the next few days, the buying is likely to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/7796c0fd-215a-4bae-825a-80448a2ed51c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above the 50-day SMA will clear the path for a possible move to $42.28. This level may again act as stiff resistance and if the price turns down from it, the DOT/USDT pair could remain stuck in the $26.50 to $42.28 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slips below $32.50, sellers may take charge and sink the pair to $26.50 where buying could emerge. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) pierced the resistance line of the ascending channel on April 28 but the bulls could not sustain the momentum. The price turned down and re-entered the channel on April 29, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/82afa1d4-95eb-4ff5-963b-1febd3fb9f58.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the RSI remains intact, which warns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be waning. If the price dips below $37.50, the UNI/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($35.67), which is an important support to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 A break below this support could result in a decline to the support line of the channel. Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will indicate buying on dips, increasing the possibility of a break above the channel. If that happens, the pair could rise to $50.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a minor correction on April 28 and 29 but the bulls did not allow the price to drop below the 20-day EMA ($251), This is a positive sign as it suggests that traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/04cdb73b-26ac-4be4-a852-8edcdf60ab35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $266.68, the LTC/USDT pair is likely to reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $286.02.This level may act as a major hurdle but if the LTC/USDT pair can climb above it, then a rally to $335.03 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is gradually moving up, suggesting the buyers are trying to gain control. This positive view will be negated if the price turns down and plummets below $246.96. Such a move could open the gates for a decline to the 50-day SMA ($226).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on April 29, which has resolved to the upside today. The bulls will now try to push the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,012.29\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9eee07f2-f41b-430b-bab0-4a757531642c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BCH/USDT pair could retest $1,213.51. The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($839) and the RSI above 63 suggest the bulls have a minor advantage.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level, it will indicate that bears are selling on rallies. They will then try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $686.75.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest the sentiment remains positive. The bulls may then make one more attempt to drive the price above $1,012.29.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvMjU1NDc2YjAtNDU0ZS00MDcxLTkzZjYtNDU1NTQxNzcxODU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210430eh4u000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Bullish \highlight\uc2  ETH/BTC pair revives the Ethereum 'flippening\u8217\'20\'19 discussion\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 566 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is clinging on to $53,000 while Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s increasing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum prompted renewed discussions of an ETH flippening.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the overall cryptocurrency market saw minor losses on April 29 as the market heads into the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-stalls-in-april-but-4-2b-options-expiry-may-revive-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expiry of $4.2 billion}}}\uc2  worth of ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) options contracts.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that since reaching a high above $56,400 on April 28, the price of Bitcoin has dropped more than 6% back down near the $53,000 support level while Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade above $2,700.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b8883618-297a-4958-885d-75c310d6167d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the lull in market activity, signs of mainstream cryptocurrency integration continue to emerge on a near-daily basis. Earlier today \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  announced that users can now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-offers-customers-a-way-to-purchase-crypto-using-paypal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchase up to $25,000}}}\uc2  worth of cryptocurrency per day using their \uc2 PayPal\uc2  account.\par \par \uc2 And it's not just financial institutions that are integrating blockchain technology to help achieve financial objectives. The government of Ethiopia {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/iohk-partners-with-ethiopian-government-to-revamp-education-system"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed a partnership}}}\uc2  with Input Output Hong Kong (IOHK), the research and development arm behind Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). The goal of the new partnership is to us blockchain technology to overhaul its education system.\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC starts to climb higher\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin continues to struggle below the $55,000 resistance level, the ETH/BTC pairing has started climbing higher in a move that was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-all-time-high-follows-reduced-gas-costs-and-defi-revival"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 predicted by multiple analysts}}}\uc2 , including Real Vision CEO Raoul Pal. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement in the ETH/BTC pair has also reignited conversations about Ether price evetually flipping BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/83d53bc1-27d4-44ba-a78a-b57f7da3ab5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 4-hour chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHBTC/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHBTC/}}}\par \par \uc2 According to \u201\'00\'C9lie Le Rest, partner at \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  management firm ExoAlpha, Ether has been getting stronger against Bitcoin since the end of March with the upcoming upgrade which includes EIP 1559 being \u8220\'20\'1Cseen as a strong catalyst of the recent ETH bull-run.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This increased momentum is a signal for Le Rest that the market may be in a \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the rumor, sell the news configuration that may drive the price up until EIP 1559 is released in July this year.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Le Rest said:\par \par \uc2 "Overall, this Ethereum upgrade is getting closer to ETH 2.0, with features like shifting from a proof-of-work to a proof-of-stake chain including a burning fee mechanism. Those upcoming features are a great incentive for investors to tag along, contributing to ETH's strong recovery against BTC, but it\u8217\'20\'19s still very early to put the flippening topic on the table again.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A few altcoins make gains\par \par \uc2 The slumping price of Bitcoin weighed down the wider cryptocurrency market on Thursday with a majority of altcoins experiencing minor losses.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d3263c13-c53a-4077-b504-28333a7637c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Some notable exceptions to the pullback include Syscoin (SYS), which at one point spiked 45% to $0.50 and the Binance Smart Chain-based Venus lending platform, whose XVS token rallied 30% to $97.90, just a dollar short of its all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Waves (WAVES), a multi-purpose blockchain platform, also experienced a 20% surge that lifted the token to a new record high at $23.43.\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $2.035 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 48.8%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvZGQyZDJlODItZjI0MS00MzQzLTlhNTMtOTE2YWM5MTVhMjFmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210430eh4t00008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 University of Wyoming\par \b \uc2 Your future at stake: Uni of Wyoming allocates $4M to staking three coins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Samuel Haig \par \uc2 448 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Profits generated by \uc2 University of Wyoming\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s staking pools will be invested into blockchain programs at educational institutions across the state.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 University of Wyoming\uc2  is allocating $4 million to running nodes and staking at least three cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 The news was shared to \uc2 Twitter\uc2  on April 28 by Caitlin Long, a Wyoming Blockchain and Fintech Select Committee appointee and founder of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avanti-financial-raises-37-million-to-launch-institutional-crypto-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avanti Bank & Trust}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 a local bank servicing the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  sector.\par \par \uc2 NEWS NOT REPORTED YET: State of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Wyoming?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Wyoming}}}\uc2  appropriated $4m for nodes/staking in at least 3 cryptocurrencies, run by Univ of Wyoming. This kickstarts program where gains from this pool, if matched by private donations, go to fund UWyo! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rothfuss?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @rothfuss}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/LDul3iGtS4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/LDul3iGtS4}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/KxFVm5YhLp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/KxFVm5YhLp}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Caitlin Long (@CaitlinLong_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CaitlinLong_/status/1387232109937397765?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 28, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://wyoleg.gov/2021/Enroll/HB0001.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 documentation}}}\uc2  posted by Long notes the University appropriated $4 million from the state\u8217\'20\'19s strategic investments and projects fund to establish, operate, and maintain \u8220\'20\'1Cnodes and staking pools for no less than three publicly tradable cryptocurrencies."\par \par \uc2 The revenues generated by the University\u8217\'20\'19s staking pools will first be mobilized to cover operational costs, and then to repay the $4 million to the state\u8217\'20\'19s investment fund. Once the investment has been repaid, profits from the University\u8217\'20\'19s staking will be distributed \u8220\'20\'1Cto support blockchain programs and activities at the university and community colleges throughout the state.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The expenditure of profits generated through staking is conditional on the University matching every $1 appropriated from the investment fund with at least $2 in either private donations or from the campus\u8217\'20\'19 reserve accounts.\par \par \uc2 Chris Rothfuss, the senate minority leader of the Wyoming Legislature and Chairman of the state\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wyomings-congressional-blockchain-committee-holds-first-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain and Fintech Select Committee}}}\uc2 , praised the committee\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cherculean effort\u8221\'20\'1D in getting the legislation passed.\par \par \uc2 Herculean effort by Blockchain Select Cmte Reps {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/itsmikeyin?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @itsmikeyin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JaredSOlsen?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @JaredSOlsen}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CyrusWestern?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CyrusWestern}}}\uc2  getting this across the finish line and on the books! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/2aXlF2cz8M"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/2aXlF2cz8M}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Chris Rothfuss (@rothfuss) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rothfuss/status/1387258841071423492?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 28, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Many \uc2 Twitter\uc2  users have responded to Long\u8217\'20\'19s post with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HukAleksandra/status/1387519977171951616"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speculation}}}\uc2  that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) may be one of the assets the University is intending to stake.\par \par \uc2 One commenter shared a link to information on a staking pool {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanostaking.info/pool/4929dea68812b55d3517becfc394bb96ae414e7551e00bb4d15ec1b8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 identified}}}\uc2  by CardanoStaking.info as being operated by the \uc2 University of Wyoming\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Advanced \uc2 Blockchain Lab\uc2 . As of this writing, the pool has minted less than 10 blocks, and has pledged roughly $60,000 worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In February 2020, IOHK, the company behind Cardano, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/iohk-donates-500-000-to-university-of-wyomings-blockchain-lab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 donated $500,000 worth of \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  to the university\u8217\'20\'19s blockchain lab to advance its research.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvMjM5MzViMGYtY2RlNy00Yzg0LWJhMGQtNzExZGI0YTM5Mzc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210429eh4t00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,952 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After a sharp relief rally, Bitcoin price encountered resistance near $55,000, leading to a short-term pullback in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has slowed down after its sharp relief rally over the past 48 hours, but Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in no mood to rest as it continues to chase new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 The biggest altcoin by market capitalization seems to have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-on-a-high-after-european-investment-bank-s-121m-digital-bond-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received a boost from the news}}}\uc2  of the launch of a 100-million-euro ($120.8 million) digital bond sale on its network by the \uc2 European Investment Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s institutional adoption has continued to expand. Japanese game developer Nexon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-gaming-giant-nexon-invests-100m-into-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-gaming-giant-nexon-invests-100m-into-bitcoin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-gaming-giant-nexon-invests-100m-into-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disclosed the purchase of 1,717 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  at an average price of $58,226, for a total consideration of about $100 million. Nexon president and CEO Owen Mahoney said the investment was done to protect shareholder value and maintain the purchasing power of cash assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/c0dac58e-323b-4916-a21d-5bceac3fe31a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only the Bitcoin purchases by companies that is catching investor\u8217\'20\'19s attention. \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-identifies-19-crypto-stocks-that-massively-outperformed-the-s-p-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-identifies-19-crypto-stocks-that-massively-outperformed-the-s-p-500}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-identifies-19-crypto-stocks-that-massively-outperformed-the-s-p-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto-related stocks have risen 43% this year}}}\uc2 , outperforming the S&P 500 by a wide margin, which is up over 13% year-to-date. This shows that legacy investors are piling into stocks closely related to cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/time-magazine-names-two-crypto-firms-in-top-100-most-influential-companies-list"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Time magazine has acknowledged the rise of crypto companies}}}\uc2 , naming \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and \uc2 Digital Currency Group\uc2  in its Top 100 Most Influential Companies list for 2021. While DCG was listed in the "disrupter" category, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  made the grade under the "titan" category.\par \par \uc2 Will the strengthening fundamentals result in price appreciation across the crypto market? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,260) on April 27, where it has encountered stiff resistance from the bears. The bears are trying to defend the 20-day EMA and will now attempt to sink the price toward $50,460.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/03bbff76-1cd7-4977-b6d3-79cdca208a7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will suggest that demand remains strong. That could result in a possible break above the 50-day simple moving average ($56,947). If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $61,825 and then to the all-time high at $64,849.27.\par \par \uc2 Even if the price drops to the $50,460 support but rebounds off it strongly, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. That will lead the bulls to make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the bears sink the price below the $46,985.02\u8211\'20\'13$50,460 support zone. That could result in a decline to the critical support at $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the 20-day EMA ($2,336) picked up momentum on April 26, and the bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high on April 27. That was followed by another up-move on April 28, but the Doji candlestick pattern suggests the rally may be tiring in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/730b88c6-700d-467f-a49a-b9dcd6db3770.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside will be $2,500, and if that breaks, the decline could reach the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce off of this support will suggest that traders are aggressively buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls pierce the resistance line of the ascending channel, the ETH/USDT pair could reach $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA could pull the price down to the support line of the channel. A break below this support could challenge the 50-day SMA ($2,041).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is gradually moving toward the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/a6b7e251-f94f-4999-926d-ba64a6d22c4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the triangle will indicate that demand exceeds supply, and that could result in the start of the next leg of the uptrend, which could reach $808.57.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the BNB/USDT pair stuck inside the triangle for a few more days. A breakdown and close below the triangle will signal a possible trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  surged above the 20-day EMA ($1.24) on April 26, suggesting that selling has exhausted in the short term. However, the altcoin is facing resistance at $1.46, just above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/714b4d42-d9a5-4945-8872-d11420b499e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the XRP/USDT pair declines below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could open the doors for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls defend the 20-day EMA and push the price above $1.46, the pair may rally to $1.55. A breakout of this resistance will suggest that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then retest the 52-week high at $1.96.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged above the moving averages on April 26, and the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders bought the dip to the 20-day EMA ($1.23). This is a positive sign, as it shows that buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/453e42b0-c686-4bcb-a02a-f292fc015ed3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now attempt a rally to $1.48 where the bears are likely to mount stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the pair is likely to drop to the moving averages and remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls drive the price above the $1.48\u8211\'20\'13$1.55 overhead resistance zone, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend, which has a target objective of $2.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 For \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), the inside day candlestick pattern on April 26 and a Doji candlestick pattern on April 27 showed indecision among the bulls and the bears. That uncertainty resolved to the upside on April 28, and the bulls pushed DOGE to the overhead resistance at $0.34.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d3cac267-13b1-4819-9669-9d24e4aa481d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls can clear the hurdle at $0.34, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its journey toward $0.42 and then to the all-time high of $0.45. The rising 20-day EMA ($0.23) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge at the $0.34 resistance. A dip below $0.29 may weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The bears will then smell an opportunity and try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support could result in a decline to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT relief rally is facing resistance near the 20-day EMA ($35.54), which suggests that sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will now try to sink the price back toward the critical support at $26.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/16cb8c13-99f4-4466-9c3d-d387b38b4f2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI turning down from the downtrend line suggest that bears are at an advantage. A break below the $26.50 support will complete a large head-and-shoulders pattern, which could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will indicate buying on every minor dip. That will enhance the prospects of a breakout of the moving averages, resulting in a rally to $42.28 and then a retest at $48.36.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap's UNI broke above the $39.60 overhead resistance and made a new all-time high on April 27. The up-move continued on April 28, and the bulls pushed the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/3393da66-9af8-4519-b22a-f35b4d4e221d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the UNI/USDT pair sustains above the channel, it will suggest strong momentum. The pair could then rally to $44.88 and then $50. The rising 20-day EMA ($34.50) and the RSI trying to break above the downtrend line suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to sustain above the channel, a drop to $38 is possible. If the bulls flip this level to support, the possibility of a break above the channel increases. This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down and slips below $35.20.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally rose above the 20-day EMA ($247) on April 28, suggesting the near-term selling pressure has eased. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/7bee4b04-7a42-4914-afb4-e5e9faf7f08a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair is facing resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $270.89. If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($224). This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the correction may deepen to $168.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls successfully defend the 20-day EMA, it will indicate demand at lower levels. The buyers will then try to push the price above $270.89 and reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $286.02.\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as stiff resistance, but if the bulls drive the price above it, the pair could be on track to retest $335.03.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on April 26, suggesting the start of a relief rally. The pullback is showing the first signs of resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $950.13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b968d35c-a87a-4008-92f9-ccc24e537a1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($815). If they succeed, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($661). Such a move will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA and breaks above $950.13, it will indicate that traders are buying on dips. That could push the price toward the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,012.29. A break above this level would tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvMDVjN2NkOWMtZWIzYi00ZjNkLTk3MDItODYzNjQ2OWVjZDViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210428eh4s000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,917 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After a sharp relief rally, Bitcoin price encountered resistance near $55,000, leading to a short-term pullback in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has slowed down after its sharp relief rally over the past 48-hours, but Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in no mood to rest as it continues to chase new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 The biggest altcoin by market capitalization seems to have received a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-on-a-high-after-european-investment-bank-s-121m-digital-bond-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost}}}\uc2  from the news of the launch of a 100-million-euro ($120.8 million) digital bond sale on its network by the \uc2 European Investment Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s institutional adoption has continued to expand. Japanese game developer Nexon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japanese-gaming-giant-nexon-invests-100m-into-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disclosed}}}\uc2  the purchase of 1,717 Bitcoin at an average price of $58,226, for a total consideration of about $100 million. Nexon president and CEO Owen Mahoney said the investment was done to protect shareholder value and maintain the purchasing power of cash assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/c0dac58e-323b-4916-a21d-5bceac3fe31a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only the Bitcoin purchases by companies that are catching investor\u8217\'20\'19s attention. \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-identifies-19-crypto-stocks-that-massively-outperformed-the-s-p-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto-related}}}\uc2  stocks have risen 43% this year, outperforming the S&P 500 by a wide margin, which is up over 13% year-to-date. This shows that legacy investors are piling into stocks closely related to cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Even Time Magazine has acknowledged the rise of crypto companies, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/time-magazine-names-two-crypto-firms-in-top-100-most-influential-companies-list"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 naming}}}\uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and the \uc2 Digital Currency Group\uc2  in their Top 100 Most Influential Companies list for 2021. While DCG was listed in the 'disrupter' category, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  made the grade under the 'titan' category.\par \par \uc2 Will the strengthening fundamentals result in price appreciation across the crypto market? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($55,260) on April 27 where it has encountered stiff resistance from the bears. The bears are trying to defend the 20-day EMA and will now attempt to sink the price toward $50,460.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/03bbff76-1cd7-4977-b6d3-79cdca208a7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will suggest that demand remains strong. That could result in a possible break above the 50-day simple moving average ($56,947). If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $61,825 and then to the all-time high at $64,849.27.\par \par \uc2 Even if the price drops to the $50,460 support but rebounds off it strongly, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. That will lead the bulls to make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the $50,460 to $46,985.02 support zone. That could result in a decline to the critical support at $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the 20-day EMA ($2,336) picked up momentum on April 26 and the bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high on April 27. That has been followed by another up-move today, but the Doji candlestick pattern suggests the rally may be tiring in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/730b88c6-700d-467f-a49a-b9dcd6db3770.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside will be $2,500 and if that breaks, the decline could reach the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce off this support will suggest that traders are aggressively buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls pierce the resistance line of the ascending channel, the ETH/USDT pair could reach $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA could pull the price down to the support line of the channel. A break below this support could challenge the 50-day SMA ($2,041).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is gradually moving toward the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/a6b7e251-f94f-4999-926d-ba64a6d22c4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the triangle will indicate that the demand exceeds supply and that could result in the start of the next leg of the uptrend which could reach $808.57.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the BNB/USDT pair stuck inside the triangle for a few more days. A breakdown and close below the triangle will signal a possible trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  surged above the 20-day EMA ($1.24) on April 26, suggesting that selling has exhausted in the short term. However, the altcoin is facing resistance at $1.46, just above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/714b4d42-d9a5-4945-8872-d11420b499e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the XRP/USDT pair declines below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could open the doors for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls defend the 20-day EMA and push the price above $1.46, the pair may rally to $1.55. A breakout of this resistance will suggest that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then retest the 52-week high at $1.96.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surged above the moving averages on April 26 and the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders bought the dip to the 20-day EMA ($1.23). This is a positive sign as it shows that buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/453e42b0-c686-4bcb-a02a-f292fc015ed3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now attempt a rally to $1.48 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the pair is likely to drop to the moving averages and remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls drive the price above the $1.48 to $1.55 overhead resistance zone, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend, which has a target objective at $2.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The inside day candlestick pattern on April 26 and a Doji candlestick pattern on April 27 showed indecision among the bulls and the bears. That uncertainty resolved to the upside today and the bulls pushed \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $0.34.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d3cac267-13b1-4819-9669-9d24e4aa481d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls can clear the hurdle at $0.34, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its journey toward $0.42 and then to the all-time high at $0.45. The rising 20-day EMA ($0.23) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge at the $0.34 resistance. A dip below $0.29 may weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The bears will then smell an opportunity and try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support could result in a decline to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing resistance near the 20-day EMA ($35.54), which suggests that sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will now try to sink the price back toward the critical support at $26.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/16cb8c13-99f4-4466-9c3d-d387b38b4f2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI turning down from the downtrend line suggest that bears are at an advantage. A break below the $26.50 support will complete a large head and shoulders pattern, which could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will indicate buying on every minor dip. That will enhance the prospects of a breakout of the moving averages, resulting in a rally to $42.28 and then a retest at $48.36\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $39.60 overhead resistance and made a new all-time high on April 27. The up-move has continued today and the bulls have pushed the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/3393da66-9af8-4519-b22a-f35b4d4e221d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the UNI/USDT pair sustains above the channel, it will suggest strong momentum. The pair could then rally to $44.88 and then $50. The rising 20-day EMA ($34.50) and the RSI trying to break above the downtrend line suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to sustain above the channel, a drop to $38 is possible. If the bulls flip this level to support, the possibility of a break above the channel increases. This positive view will invalidate if the pair turns down and slips below $35.20.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally rose above the 20-day EMA ($247) on April 28, suggesting the near-term selling pressure has eased. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/7bee4b04-7a42-4914-afb4-e5e9faf7f08a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair is facing resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $270.89. If the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($224). This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the correction may deepen to $168.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls successfully defend the 20-day EMA, it will indicate demand at lower levels. The buyers will then try to push the price above $270.89 and reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $286.02.\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as stiff resistance but if the bulls drive the price above it, the pair could be on track to retest $335.03.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on April 26, suggesting the start of a relief rally. The pullback is showing the first signs of resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $950.13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b968d35c-a87a-4008-92f9-ccc24e537a1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($815). If they succeed, the BCH/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($661). Such a move will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA and breaks above $950.13, it will indicate that traders are buying on dips. That could push the price toward the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1,012.29. A break above this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvMDVjN2NkOWMtZWIzYi00ZjNkLTk3MDItODYzNjQ2OWVjZDViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210428eh4s000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 DOGE\par \b \uc2 100 fascinating facts about crypto\u8217\'20\'19s last 100 days\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Samuel Haig \par \uc2 549 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s hash-rate has increased at 4.5 times the rate of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s since the start of the 2021.\par \par \uc2 Crypto data aggregator CoinMetrics has compiled a list of 100 insights into the recent performance of the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets \u8212\'20\'14 and the figures add up to a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture for the ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Released to celebrate the 100th issue of its \u8220\'20\'1CState of the Network\u8221\'20\'1D report, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.substack.com/p/coin-metrics-state-of-the-network-5d4?token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoyNTY5OTk5LCJwb3N0X2lkIjozNTY3OTM5NiwiXyI6IlRNZmIzIiwiaWF0IjoxNjE5NTYwNzA5LCJleHAiOjE2MTk1NjQzMDksImlzcyI6InB1Yi02MjY5Iiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.OS5hdRmOoth-t_IK7im5O_aK63BBP-gN9HTmDWKcWNI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 list}}}\uc2  notes that a $100 investment made into \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) 100 days ago would be worth $2,742 today \u8212\'20\'14 outperforming the same $100 investment in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) (which would be valued at $135 today), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) ($186), and Uniswap (UNI) ($401).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8c67c0a3-f482-4666-800d-8d8a6e6ea625.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Price performance of BTC, ETH, UNI, and DOGE over past 100 days: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 The report states that Bitcoin has seen $14.5 billion worth of \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.substack.com/p/coin-metrics-state-of-the-network-6e0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trusted trading volume}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D in 100 days, alongside $6.1 billion worth Ether, $2.4 billion worth of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , $2.3 billion worth of DOGE, and $1.3 billion worth of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) over the same period.\par \par \uc2 When looking at recently active addresses, veteran networks appear to still be the most popular \u8212\'20\'14 with nearly 611,000 active daily Ethereum addresses over the past 100 days and 1.12 million active Bitcoin wallets. Bitcoin set a new record for daily activity on April 14 with 1.36 million wallets engaging with the network.\par \par \uc2 Over the past 100 days, a total of 1.4 million addresses have engaged with the top DeFi protocols \u8212\'20\'14 Uniswap, Aave, Compound, MakerDAO and Synthetix \u8212\'20\'14 while the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  network has hosted 24.4 million active wallets.\par \par \uc2 Users are paying to access the Ethereum mainnet at an accelerated pace, with $2.3 billion of the $3.17 billion in total {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-high-gas-fee-crisis-won-t-be-solved-by-eip-1559-coin-metrics-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fees that have ever been generated by Ethereum}}}\uc2 , having been recorded since the start of 2021. By contrast, Bitcoin has generated roughly $2 billion in fees over the network\u8217\'20\'19s lifetime.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-transactions-fees-in-us-dollars-near-all-time-high-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The average Bitcoin transaction fee}}}\uc2  was $20.68 over the past 100 days, while Ethereum transactions averaged $16.68 over the same period. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s average transaction size of $30,000 has been almost double Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s $15,660 since the start of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Despite Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s impending transition to proof-of-stake, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/leaked-nvidia-rtx-3080-ti-gpu-shown-mining-ether-at-118-mh-s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s hash rate}}}\uc2  has grown at 4.5 times the rate of Bitcoin since the start of the year, with Ethereum up 89%, while Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hashing power has increased by 20%.\par \par \uc2 The report also notes the surging popularity of stablecoins, with Tether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) supply on Ethereum increasing from 13.5 billion to 24.4 billion this year. However, that was outshone by the amount of USDT on Tron, which grew from 6.8 billion to 26 billion. USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) expanded 234%, from 4.1 billion to 13.7 billion, and circulating Dai was up 192%, from 1.2 billion to 3.5 billion, since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt took about 2.5 years for stablecoin supply to grow from 1B to 10B. It took less than a year to grow from 10B to over 75B,\u8221\'20\'1D CoinMetrics wrote, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTotal stablecoin supply is on pace to pass $100 billion before the end of 2021.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYWNhYTA1ZDItNjBhMC00NGM4LTkwZjUtMjhmZTkzYzY5MDVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210428eh4s0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 DOGE\par \b \uc2 100 fascinating facts about crypto\u8217\'20\'19s last 100 days\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Samuel Haig \par \uc2 540 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s hash-rate has increased at 4.5 times the rate of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s since the start of the 2021.\par \par \uc2 Crypto data aggregator CoinMetrics has compiled a list of 100 insights into the recent performance of the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets \u8212\'20\'14 and the figures add up to a very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture for the ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Released to celebrate the 100th issue of its State of the Network report, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.substack.com/p/coin-metrics-state-of-the-network-5d4?token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoyNTY5OTk5LCJwb3N0X2lkIjozNTY3OTM5NiwiXyI6IlRNZmIzIiwiaWF0IjoxNjE5NTYwNzA5LCJleHAiOjE2MTk1NjQzMDksImlzcyI6InB1Yi02MjY5Iiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.OS5hdRmOoth-t_IK7im5O_aK63BBP-gN9HTmDWKcWNI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 list}}}\uc2  notes that a $100 investment made into \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  100 days ago would be worth $2,742 today \u8212\'20\'14 outperforming the same $100 investment in Bitcoin (which would be valued at $135 today), Ethereum ($186), and Uniswap ($401).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8c67c0a3-f482-4666-800d-8d8a6e6ea625.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Price performance of BTC, ETH, UNI, and DOGE over past 100 days: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 The report states that Bitcoin has seen $14.5 billion worth of \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmetrics.substack.com/p/coin-metrics-state-of-the-network-6e0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trusted trading volume}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D in 100 days, alongside $6.1 billion worth Ether, $2.4 billion worth of XRP, $2.3 billion worth of DOGE, and $1.3 billion worth of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) over the same period.\par \par \uc2 When looking at recently active addresses, veteran networks appear to still be the most popular \u8212\'20\'14 with nearly 611,000 active daily Ethereum addresses over the past 100 days, and 1.12 million active Bitcoin wallets. Bitcoin set a new record for daily activity on April 14 with 1.36 million wallets engaging with the network.\par \par \uc2 Over the past 100 days, a total of 1.4 million addresses have engaged with the top DeFi protocols \u8212\'20\'14 Uniswap, Aave, Compound, MakerDAO, and Synthetix \u8212\'20\'14 while the \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  network has hosted 24.4 million active wallets.\par \par \uc2 Users are paying to access the Ethereum mainnet at an accelerated pace, with $2.3 billion of the $3.17 billion in total {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-high-gas-fee-crisis-won-t-be-solved-by-eip-1559-coin-metrics-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fees that have ever been generated by Ethereum}}}\uc2 , having been recorded since the start of 2021. By contrast, Bitcoin has generated roughly $2 billion fees over the network's lifetime.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-transactions-fees-in-us-dollars-near-all-time-high-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The average Bitcoin transaction fee}}}\uc2  was $20.68 over the past 100 days, while Ethereum transactions averaged $16.68 over the same period. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s average transaction size of $30,000 has been almost double Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s $15,660 since the start of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Despite Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s impending transition to Proof-of-Stake, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/leaked-nvidia-rtx-3080-ti-gpu-shown-mining-ether-at-118-mh-s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum hash-rate}}}\uc2  has grown at 4.5 times the rate of Bitcoin since the start of the year, with Ethereum up 89% while Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hashing power has increased by 20%.\par \par \uc2 The report also notes the surging popularity of stablecoins, with Tether\u8217\'20\'19s supply on Ethereum increasing from 13.5 billion to 24.4 billion this year\u8212\'20\'14 however that was outshone by the amount of USDT on TRON, which grew from 6.8 billion to 26 billion. USDC expanded 234%, from 4.1 billion to 13.7 billion, and circulating DAI was up 192%, from 1.2 billion to 3.5 billion, since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt took about 2.5 years for stablecoin supply to grow from 1B to 10B. It took less than a year to grow from 10B to over 75B,\u8221\'20\'1D CoinMetrics wrote, adding:\par \par \uc2 Total stablecoin supply is on pace to pass $100 billion before the end of 2021.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYWNhYTA1ZDItNjBhMC00NGM4LTkwZjUtMjhmZTkzYzY5MDVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210428eh4s00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,931 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to come under pressure from sellers while Ether and BNB are attempting to buck the trend.\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin price crashed below $50,000, mainstream media {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/bitcoin-sinks-below-50000-cryptos-stumble-over-biden-tax-plans-2021-04-23/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  that the selling across the market could have been triggered by reports that the Biden administration proposed increasing the capital gains tax to 39.6% from the current 20% for people earning more than $1 million a year.\par \par \uc2 In other news, there was an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/turkish-police-detain-62-over-alleged-2b-thodex-crypto-exchange-fraud"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 apparent}}}\uc2  exit scam carried out by Thodex exchange owner Faruk Fatih \u214\'00\'D6zer, which has affected about 391,000 users of the Turkish crypto exchange. Rumors are afloat that the owner may have fled the country with nearly $2 billion worth of crypto assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/c6990cf4-2ccf-4c18-a258-74e3d77d5092.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. equity markets also sold off on April 22 as the tax hike rumors rattled investors but the S&P 500 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/04/22/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bounced}}}\uc2  back sharply today, indicating that market participants have discounted the news.\par \par \uc2 After the fall, the next big question on the minds of investors is whether the correction will deepen or is this the opportune time to open new positions.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the critical support and resistance levels that will indicate the start of a trending move.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The 50-day simple moving average ($56,793) has flipped to resistance and the bulls could not push and sustain the price above it on April 19 and April 20. That may have resulted in profit-booking by short-term traders, which pulled Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price below the psychological $50,000 mark today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/51f0d4d4-b14e-4d5a-9d1a-639b5d1e3615.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the oversold level, indicating a possible change in sentiment. This is the first time the RSI has plunged below 40 since the start of the bull trend in October of 2020.\par \par \uc2 If the bears can sustain the price below $50,460, the BTC/USDT pair could continue to slump towards the next critical level at $43,006.77 where buyers are likely to step in aggressively. The extent of the rebound from this level will give better insight into whether the correction has ended or not.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages. The next leg of the uptrend could start after the bulls push the price above $64,849.27.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above $2,545.84 on April 22 and hit a new all-time high at $2,645. However, the long wick on the daily candlestick shows that the bulls could now sustain the breakout. This may have trapped aggressive breakout traders, who might have been stopped out of their positions today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/35bb1674-30b8-4032-89d4-8c362bdb9593.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued and the ETH/USDT pair dropped to $2,102.24 today. However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls aggressively purchased the dip close to $2,040.77. This indicates the sentiment remains positive and the buyers are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The acid test for the bulls will be in the $2,500 to $2,645 resistance zone. If the price again turns down from this level, the pair could consolidate between $2,500 and $2,040.77 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break above $2,645 could resume the uptrend that may reach $2,745 and then $3,000. This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $600 to $638.56 resistance zone on April 21, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels. The sellers pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($479) today but could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/e407c30e-3c31-4b12-b3c8-cf5945b40708.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls continue to buy the dips to the 20-day EMA. The buyers will now again try to push the price to $600 and challenge the overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If they can thrust the price above $638.56, the BNB/USDT pair may start the next leg of the uptrend, which could reach $832.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance zone, the pair could remain range-bound for a few days. The first sign of weakness will be if the price dips and sustains below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could result in a drop to the 50-day SMA ($357).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to build upon the rebound off the 20-day EMA ($1.22) on April 21 shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. The bears pounced on this opportunity and broke the 20-day EMA today, pulling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.86.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d36d7257-2756-4963-8b1c-5926277116e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip today but they are likely to counter stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA increases. That could pull the price down to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $1.46. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. The bulls may be back in command if the price rises and sustains above $1.46.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Vertical rallies unless backed by strong fundamentals witness waterfall declines and that is what was seen in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) price. The altcoin broke the 20-day EMA (0.20) support today and dipped to $0.15, just above the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/fc820ff2-298a-4a4c-8b67-08ddd43ee489.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders purchased at lower levels today and the DOGE/USDT pair has risen above the 20-day EMA. If the bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may attempt to rise to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA and the RSI below 57 indicate the bulls have lost their advantage. If the pair loses ground and closes below the 20-day EMA, the selling could intensify further and a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.10) is possible.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.24) on April 21, suggesting the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears broke the $1.03 support today but have not been able to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/20f242e0-6bdc-4e2b-8755-a372c2059c5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to keep the price above $1.03. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could again rise to the moving averages. If the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $1.48.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the pair to $0.80 and then to $0.70. Such a move will suggest the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt hit a barrier at the 50-day SMA ($37) on April 22, suggesting the sentiment has turned negative and traders are offloading their positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9ee55f2f-2589-44fc-baf1-bd599f4cbb45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum today and the DOT/USDT pair dropped to the $26.50 support. However, the sharp bounce off this support suggests the bulls are defending this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls sustain the recovery, the pair could remain range-bound for a few more days. A breakout of the moving averages will be the first sign of strength while a break below $26.50 will signal the possible start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $35.20 overhead resistance on April 21 and again on April 22. However, on both occasions, the altcoin met with stiff resistance at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/781743d8-b704-44d5-9b1d-baca1303f635.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the breakout above $35.20 may have trapped the aggressive bulls who dumped their positions today. If the UNI/USDT pair closes below the 50-day SMA today, the decline could extend to $25.52 in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support will suggest that traders are defending this level aggressively. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. On the other hand, if the $25.52 support cracks, the down move could extend to $20.\par \par \uc2 This neutral to negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $35.20.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the up-move on April 21 and 22 but met with stiff resistance at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlesticks. The bears continued their selling today and pulled \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) below both moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/0e077dfe-41a0-4c52-8e70-38082c1b9f77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls are buying at lower levels and trying to stage a recovery. However, they are likely to face stiff resistance near the 20-day EMA ($250.)\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the LTC/USDT pair could plunge to $168.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $246.96.\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from $998.49 on April 21 and the selling intensified today when the bears broke the 20-day EMA ($797) support. However, the bulls are attempting to stage a recovery from the intraday lows as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/be0e384c-701d-4b42-a522-a9603b6655c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the BCH/USDT pair sustains the recovery, it will suggest buying at lower levels. The bulls will then try to push the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the pair could again rise to $1,000 where the bears will mount stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the bulls have lost their advantage. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($629).\par \par \uc2 Such a deep fall is likely to delay the next leg of the uptrend and keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvY2E4ODhjZmUtNTNhMC00Zjc0LWE5NjMtNGRkYzJiNWFlZmY2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210423eh4n000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, BCH\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,075 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin is struggling to recover from its recent crash, Ethereum is pushing toward a new high and prompting several altcoins to rally.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  strategist Nikolaos Panigirtzoglou believes that if Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) does not break above $60,000 within the next few days, the momentum signals could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-bitcoin-price-concerns-from-jpmorgan-at-odds-with-immense-support-at-52k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weaken}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cfor several months, given their still-elevated level.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/guggenheim-cio-repeats-20k-bitcoin-price-forecast-as-btc-doubles-since-last-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  voice was that of Guggenheim chief investment officer Scott Minerd who said in an interview with CNBC on April 20 that Bitcoin looked frothy and was at risk of a correction to $20,000 to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Minerd said that such a massive fall will be part of a normal market cycle and that will not alter his long-term target of $400,000 for Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/0b7e75f9-7de1-4b1f-ace5-2c33ac9a1656.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, several analysts, including statistician Willy Woo, countered the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecasts of technical traders with on-chain indicators. Woo pointed out that 14% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply last moved above the $1 trillion market capitalization, hence this becomes a strong support and makes Bitcoin less likely to drop below $53,000.\par \par \uc2 A recent survey by Gemini crypto exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/64-of-us-adults-are-interested-in-crypto-new-survey-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed}}}\uc2  that 13% of the respondents planned to invest in cryptocurrencies in 2021. Extrapolating the numbers to the U.S. population, Gemini said that 19.3 million adults may join the crypto bandwagon this year, which \u8220\'20\'1Cwould nearly double the current crypto investor population of 21.2 million adults.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the trends and then identify the paths of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are buying the dips to the $54,000 level as seen from the long tail on the candlesticks of the past three days. However, the buyers have not been able to clear the hurdle at the 50-day simple moving average ($56,769), which has flipped to resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4326b678-c699-438d-aeb5-6240e5610369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($58,280) has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) is trading below 43, indicating that the bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a break below $54,000. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $50,460. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $50,460 could keep the pair range-bound for a few days. However, if the bears sink the price below $50,460, the sentiment could sour and the pair may plummet to $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls can drive the price above $60,000. Such a move will suggest that traders continue to buy at lower levels. A breakout of the all-time high at $64,849.27 could attract momentum traders, starting the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) strongly bounced off the $2,040.77 level on April 20, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls at lower levels. The successful retest of the breakout level at $2,040.77 is likely to attract further buying from short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/82df17c6-746a-4361-bad7-41851169544a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in control. If the bulls can propel the price above the all-time high at $2,545.84, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the next target objective at $2,745 and then $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, then a few days of consolidation between $2,040.77 and $2,545.84 is possible. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the pair slips and sustains below $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($476) on April 18 attracted buying on April 19. The momentum picked up further on April 20 and the bulls are now trying to thrust the price above the all-time high at $638.56 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from Cointelegraph Markets Pro began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for BNB on April 20 at 20:30 UTC, just as the relief rally was picking up strength.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historic and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/e05318e4-393f-46b7-bf68-f634460af4af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score (green) vs.BNB price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?_ga=2.38235429.749482555.1618458878-1008951168.1618458878"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 The 7-day chart above shows the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for BNB flipped green on April 20 when the price was $527.05.\par \par \uc2 While the market was still contemplating the direction of the next move, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score picked up strength and BNB also followed higher, hitting $608.31 about 16-hours later.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/77dfae86-4fd0-46b4-b332-4a3e53f5fe5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could start its journey toward the next target objective at $832. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to mount a stiff resistance in the $600 to $638.56 resistance zone. If the bulls do not cede much ground, it will enhance the prospects of a breakout of the resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price dips back below $520, then the bears may make one more attempt to break the 20-day EMA. A break below $428 could result in a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are aggressively attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($1.26). This suggests the sentiment in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  remains positive. The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone indicate a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/390f7665-e044-4301-b261-0b495ab878fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair may now rally to $1.56 where the bears are likely to again mount stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could extend its decline to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.10. Conversely, a break above $1.56 could put the bulls back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to resume the uptrend in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) on April 19 but they could not clear the hurdle at the all-time high of $0.45. The price turned down sharply from $0.43, indicating that traders are booking profits on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/e1c9833e-fad5-4c81-964f-4e8e292ae2c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has formed an inside-day candlestick pattern today, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the price turns down and breaks the $0.27 support, the pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($0.19).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls continue to buy at lower levels. However, after such a deep correction, the next leg of the uptrend could be delayed.\par \par \uc2 If the 20-day EMA support cracks, the selling could intensify as several traders who are stuck at higher levels may book their losses. The price could then drop to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.14.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 50-day SMA ($1.20) on April 20 but the bulls staged a swift recovery. This shows that the bulls continue to buy at lower levels. If the buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.27), a rally to $1.48 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/58625de8-32b1-494f-8c54-aea62aa12191.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the support of the range at $1.03.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the pair could remain range-bound between $1.03 and $1.48 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start if the bulls drive the price above the $1.48 resistance or the bears sink the pair below the $1.03 support.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $31.55 on April 20 but the buyers are struggling to build upon the initial recovery today, indicating hesitation to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/190b4049-a0a6-4125-833f-f0f225a56411.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($38.96) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 That will increase the likelihood of a break below $31.55. If that happens, the decline could extend to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push the price above the moving averages. Such a move will open the gates for a rally to $42.28 and then to the all-time high at $48.36.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the candlesticks of the past three days shows strong accumulation by the bulls at lower levels. The buying picked up momentum today and the bulls are attempting to push and sustain Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the $35.20 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/29353458-2934-4aeb-876d-b40ede0a9ed8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $39.60. A breakout of this resistance could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend, which may reach $44.88 and then $50.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($32.62) has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 58, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and slips below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($252) on April 20 but the bulls arrested the decline at $234.43. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. The buyers are currently attempting to sustain the price above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $270.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/f5dfd3f8-aa6b-4ff5-b0e3-9e422add49a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair could rally to the 50% retracement level at $282.51 and then to the 61.8% retracement level at $294.91. The marginally rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 58 suggest a slight advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $270.12, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and the bears are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a drop to the 50-day SMA ($216).\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully defended the support at the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $828.24. Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/bitcoin-cash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) could now rally to $1,041.70 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/27b640bc-6f81-4960-95cd-4d3a36bb38e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BCH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BCHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can drive the price above $1,041.70, the BCH/USDT pair could retest the 52-week high at $1,213.51.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($797), it will increase the likelihood of a deeper correction. The 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $737.31 may act as a support but if it cracks, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($618).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvY2E3MzBjNGMtNTliYi00ZWQ0LWI3NzktOThlNWExZDJmMWI2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210421eh4l000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Coinbase\par \b \uc2 One week of COIN: How is \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Nasdaq listing shaping up so far\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,464 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s largest investors \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2 , Union Square, \uc2 Ribbit Capital\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 have already roped in multi-billion-dollar profits.\par \par \uc2 April 14 was considered by many crypto enthusiasts all over the world as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-say-coinbase-listing-represents-a-watershed-moment-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 watershed moment for the \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22  industry}}}\uc2 , as it marked the day when \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , one of the largest crypto trading platforms in the world, made its debut on Nasdaq via a direct listing. As one can imagine, the lead up to the moment was replete with a market-wide surge, with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) scaling up to a price point of $64,800 a day before the listing went live.\par \par \uc2 In the run-up to \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Nasdaq debut, COIN\u8217\'20\'19s reference price was set at just $250, with all of the company\u8217\'20\'19s staff receiving a total of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-coin-stock-reference-price-set-at-just-250-as-1-700-staff-get-free-shares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 100 shares each}}}\uc2 . What\u8217\'20\'19s more, in true crypto fashion, COIN\u8217\'20\'19s debut was mired by \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with stock prices rising sharply to around $430 just minutes after trading commenced.\par \par \uc2 However, following this positive price movement, the value of COIN proceeded to plunge drastically \u8212\'20\'14 all within a matter of hours \u8212\'20\'14 finally wrapping up its debut at a respectable price point of $328. Since then, COIN\u8217\'20\'19s value has continued to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nasdaq.com/market-activity/stocks/coin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hover}}}\uc2  between $320 and $345, settling at the lower end of that range exactly one week after the listing. At the time of writing, the stock\u8217\'20\'19s total market capitalization is touted to be worth just under $64 billion, some way off the previously estimated $100 billion.\par \par \uc2 A real breakthrough or just a lot of hype?\par \par \uc2 COIN\u8217\'20\'19s debut within the traditional finance sector is widely considered to be an important step forward for the crypto industry, especially since it provides investors \u8212\'20\'14 who may not be interested in trading digital assets otherwise \u8212\'20\'14 with indirect exposure to cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Providing his thoughts on the subject, Jelle Pol, project manager for oil and gas multinational Shell\u8217\'20\'19s first three blockchain projects as well as business director for Dusk Network \u8212\'20\'14 a privacy-oriented blockchain protocol \u8212\'20\'14 told Cointelegraph that \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s direct listing is potentially a very interesting wake-up call for companies and regulators that are still sticking with the \u8220\'20\'1Canything crypto-related is bad\u8221\'20\'1D angle, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCOIN\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization now dwarfs the cumulative valuation of most of the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest traditional stock exchanges, and they did it in years instead of decades. It is clear that they operate under the highest standards, otherwise, a Nasdaq listing would have been out of the question, so it seems that self-\b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in this case, has paid off immensely.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Indeed, with \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s listing potentially bridging the gap between the traditional finance sector and crypto, an increasing number of mainstream players seem to be quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on COIN. For example, New York-based asset management firm Ark Invest was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cathie-woods-ark-buys-a-further-110m-worth-of-coinbase-shares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 quick to snap up more than 1 million shares}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 currently worth around $350 million \u8212\'20\'14 which will be spread out across three of the company\u8217\'20\'19s exchange-traded fund offerings.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, it bears mentioning that back in 2013, American venture capital firm Union Square {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/04/14/coinbase-who-gets-rich.html#:~:text=Andreessen%20Horowitz%20builds%20the%20biggest,exchange%20worth%20about%20%249.7%20billion."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invested}}}\uc2  in \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  at $0.20 a share, essentially allowing the company to amass a total stock haul that is now worth more than $4.6 billion.\par \par \uc2 That said, the company\u8217\'20\'19s biggest backer by far is venture capital giant \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2 , through its A16z crypto fund, \u8220\'20\'1Cwhich owns shares in the crypto exchange worth about $9.7 billion.\u8221\'20\'1D According to the information contained in \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s prospectus, just seven months after the conclusion of the firm\u8217\'20\'19s Series A funding round, A16z {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://techcrunch.com/2013/12/12/coinbase-raises-25m-from-andreessen-horowitz-to-build-its-bitcoin-wallet-and-merchant-services/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led}}}\uc2  a $25-million Series B round, buying shares at $1 apiece.\par \par \uc2 Subsequently, the firm was able to purchase $57.1 million worth of shares in October 2019, from Union Square at $23 apiece and then another $30 million in \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  stock at $28.83 a share just 12 months later.\par \par \uc2 Outside of Union Square and A16z, fintech-focused venture firm \uc2 Ribbit Capital\uc2  is the third-largest investor in \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , with the company owning a total of 12 million shares \u8212\'20\'14 worth approximately $3.9 billion \u8212\'20\'14 of the cryptocurrency exchange via its Series A funding round. Some of the other major players that had gotten a piece of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.barrons.com/articles/coinbase-reference-price-set-at-250-ahead-of-market-debut-tomorrow-51618348634"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 action}}}\uc2  include Tiger Global, \uc2 Institutional Venture Partners\uc2 , AH Equity Partners and DFJ Growth.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, insider activity reports suggest that a number of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s early-stage investors, as well as members of its executive brass, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-insiders-dump-nearly-5-billion-in-coin-stock-shortly-after-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sold billions worth of equity shortly after the direct listing}}}\uc2 . For example, Coinbase chief financial officer \uc2 Alesia Haas\uc2  sold some 255,500 shares at $388.73 per share while retaining certain options. Similarly, Brian Armstrong, the platform\u8217\'20\'19s current CEO, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://d18rn0p25nwr6d.cloudfront.net/CIK-0001679788/620432fc-5305-43d4-9ad5-7dca027ea10b.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sold}}}\uc2  749,999 shares in three transactions at various prices, netting around $291 million.\par \par \uc2 That being said, while the filings initially seemed to portray a picture wherein multiple \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  executives sold a large part of their stake in the firm to net handsome profits, a representative for Coinbase told Cointelegraph that the sellers still maintain strong ownership positions.\par \par \uc2 What does the future hold for COIN?\par \par \uc2 According to independent investment research firm CFRA, \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s stock value can potentially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/currencies/news/coinbase-stock-price-jump-cryptoeconomy-buy-in-institutional-investors-cfra-2021-4-1030318560"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grow}}}\uc2  by a whopping 20+% in the near future, primarily due to the accelerated adoption of crypto-enabled technologies around the globe and the entry of more institutional players into this nascent space.\par \par \uc2 In this regard, a group of CFRA analysts led by Chris Kuiper stated in a recent note to the company\u8217\'20\'19s clients that within the next 12 months or so, the price of COIN could settle at around the $400 level. Not only that, but the research firm has also given its clients the green light to purchase \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  stock, even affording the stock a \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy\u8221\'20\'1D rating.\par \par \uc2 Kuiper and his team believe that investors can potentially earn up to $6.89 per share for 2021 and $3.00 for 2022, pointing out that they see operating margins ramping up, which can eventually stabilize around the 35% mark. \u8220\'20\'1COur base case scenario implies COIN not only becomes one of the largest financial exchanges for crypto but it is also successful in diversifying into other products and services, most notably those aimed at institutional investors,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 CFRA analysts have chalked out three possible scenarios for \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . Firstly, they believe that COIN may be faced with \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum in the coming months, causing the stock to dip to $120. The second scenario is one where the stock hits $400 and stabilizes around that range. The third case revolves around the share prices going \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and scaling up to a price point of $840.\par \par \uc2 Almost a week after the \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  listing, a representative for the company announced that Nasdaq {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-to-launch-options-trading-for-coinbase-global"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started trading options for Coinbase Global}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 COIN.O \u8212\'20\'14 effective April 20. The launch of equity options will offer investors yet another avenue through which they can bet on \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s future. Simply put, equity options represent the right, but not the obligation, to buy or sell a stock at a certain price, known as the strike price, on or before an expiration date.\par \par \uc2 Crypto market takes a tumble\par \par \uc2 In the aftermath of \uc2 Coinbase Global Inc\uc2 . going public, the crypto market has been faced with turbulence, with the value of Bitcoin plunging by 15% in the days following the listing, dropping from $64,000 to $51,000, albeit briefly. Similar dips were witnessed across the board, with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) also being on the receiving end of some serious negative price action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/154b7d33-2c4c-46fc-94d7-54ba8556f487.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, as part of the above-stated development, the total market capitalization of the cryptocurrency sector dropped from $2.37 trillion to $1.87 trillion, only to rise once again to around $2 trillion. \u8220\'20\'1CWith hindsight it was inevitable. Markets got too excited around the $Coin direct listing. Basis blowing out, coins like $BSV, $XRP and $DOGE pumping,\u8221\'20\'1D Galaxy Digital founder Michael Novogratz {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/novogratz/status/1383759005667917825"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  recently.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, SkyBridge founder Anthony Scaramucci stated following the listing that he was surprised that \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s debut was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/scaramucci-surprised-at-lack-of-banking-response-to-coinbase-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not met with more attention from banks}}}\uc2 , insinuating that legacy institutions still have been unable to realize the immensity of the crypto-led financial revolution that is currently sweeping the globe.\par \par \uc2 It now remains to be seen if more cryptocurrency exchanges follow in the footsteps of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and go public in the near term, essentially bolstering traditional investor confidence in this yet evolving space.\par \par \uc2 In this regard, \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading platform Kraken recently announced that while it is unsure of when it will go public, it will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-exchange-kraken-says-it-is-too-big-to-go-public-through-a-spac"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pursue a direct listing}}}\uc2  rather than the special-purpose acquisition company route, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-friendly-trading-platform-etoro-to-go-public-via-10b-spac-merger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Israeli brokerage platform eToro took recently}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvODBmMzZlNTgtNzA0MC00NDg3LWIwMDItNDdlMDRlMDkyMTkzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210421eh4l0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming Alonzo update pushes  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price despite a major delay\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anirudh Tiwari \par \uc2 1,245 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano will strive to become an Ethereum contender if the upcoming Alonzo update lives up to the expectations of being a game-changer.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has risen to become one of the top 10 cryptocurrencies in the world by market capitalization in a short time span. It currently ranks seventh, with a market capitalization of over $41 billion. It accounts for nearly 2% of the entire cryptocurrency market. According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from CoinGecko, Cardano hit an all-time high of $1.55 on April 14.\par \par \uc2 The IOHK is led by Charles Hoskinson, the founder of Cardano and also the co-founder of the Ethereum blockchain. On April 6, through his \uc2 YouTube\uc2  channel, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WRYRjmMvkJM&t=116s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 discussed}}}\uc2  Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s roadmap covering the next four years in a video titled \u8220\'20\'1CSome Musings about the Roadmap.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In these musings, he mentioned that although the Cardano developers are working on solving the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://forum.cardano.org/t/blockchain-scalability-and-cardano-approach-to-it/29943"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scalability issue}}}\uc2  and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s approach to it, he will only turn his attention toward this issue once the Alonzo update has been completed. The scalability phase of the Cardano roadmap is coming up next, following the completion of the Goguen update. This phase is named Basho, after the 17th-century Japanese haiku master.\par \par \uc2 The Deadalus and Alonzo upgrade\par \par \uc2 On April 1, Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://roadmap.cardano.org/en/status-updates/update/2021-04-01/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  the Deadalus update, which ushered in support for native tokens on the Cardano blockchain, along with the Project Catalyst Fund3 voting registration, effectively beginning the countdown to Cardano becoming an entirely decentralized blockchain.\par \par \uc2 This countdown has since reached its fruition. Cointelegraph discussed more on the Deadalus update with a representative of the Cardano Foundation. They stated: \u8220\'20\'1CDaedalus users can now use their wallet as a single unified interface to receive both \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as well as a host of other native tokens deployed on the Cardano blockchain.\u8221\'20\'1D They further spoke on Cardano becoming a completely decentralized network, elaborating:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are delighted to report that the D=0 countdown, which signaled the full decentralization of the Cardano blockchain, has also been included in the latest implementation of Daedalus. This marks a momentous milestone where all of Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s stake pools are operated by community-led stake pool operators.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On its official website, Cardano claims that this decentralization event makes it one of the most decentralized blockchains in the world. The next and final phase of Goguen in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s roadmap is the previously {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULBLgPgxtN8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delayed}}}\uc2  Alonzo update. The upgrade will bring smart contract functionality to the blockchain. The development of this upgrade is enabled by the Plutus platform, which brings a native smart contract language to users of the Cardano blockchain as mentioned in an IOHK {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2021/04/13/plutus-what-you-need-to-know/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blog}}}\uc2  about Plutus.\par \par \uc2 Before the Deadalus update, Cardano went through its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-approaches-a-new-major-upgrade-as-ada-posts-an-inspired-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mary hard fork}}}\uc2 , which introduced tokens to the Cardano unspent transaction output set that allows custom tokens and nonfungible tokens to be processed by miners with the same cost efficiency as the native coin of the blockchain network, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, Cardano developers have even found a way to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wild-west-as-developers-macgyver-highly-popular-nfts-on-cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mint and sell NFT collectibles}}}\uc2  without smart contract functionality. Cointelegraph discussed with Johannes Jensen, product and project manager of eToroX \u8212\'20\'14 a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform. He said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Alonzo hard fork introduces a more complex coordination problem, as the surrounding ecosystem of service providers will need to prepare for the hard fork and the subsequent Cardano-based tokens and smart contracts altogether.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could reach $2 soon due to DeFi growth\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has seen nearly 10% gains in the last 14 days. Considering that the significant $2 mark is $0.6 away from the current trading price, at the current rate of growth, it is highly unlikely that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  will surpass the $2 mark in the near future.\par \par \uc2 However, another possible \u8220\'20\'1CDeFi summer\u8221\'20\'1D is one of the main reasons that could drive the growth. If we use the DeFi summer of 2020 as a gauge for this year, the DeFi markets will probably grow to new highs in 2021. In fact, the one-year gains for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently stand at 3,490.8%.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from DappRadar, the total value locked in decentralized finance protocols reached its all-time high of $70.43 billion on April 16. Since the beginning of this year, the TVL has grown nearly four times, at the time of writing. The TVL went from $30.74 billion on Jan. 20 to currently standing at $64.47 billion as of April 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d9abc790-6cd7-4e45-9e2b-b903bea91bad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 This period has marked immense growth for this sub-sector of the cryptocurrency market. On this, Jensen further opined: \u8220\'20\'1CThere is little doubt that the final stages of the Goguen phase on Cardano will introduce a host of existing trends in DeFi onto the network, such as automated market makers and lending market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, most DeFi protocols currently in existence are built on the Ethereum blockchain. Ethereum has also onboarded the development teams of top DeFi protocols such as Uniswap, Yearn.finance and others. Although even Cardano remains to be positive about their scope in the DeFi markets, the representative from the foundation said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe are sure that as more of our components become available, we will see a multitude of DeFi solutions and indeed all manner of DApps built and migrated to the Cardano blockchain.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/life-beyond-ethereum-what-layer-one-blockchains-are-bringing-to-defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Life beyond Ethereum: What layer-one blockchains are bringing to DeFi}}}\par \par \uc2 With its use cases and the incoming Alonzo update bringing smart contract functionality, Cardano is well-positioned to become a DeFi alternative platform to Ethereum. Adoption among decentralized applications and DeFi protocols will also impact the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In addition to expanding its footprint in the DeFi markets, Cardano is making efforts to improve blockchain adoption in markets such as South America, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://emurgo.io/ja/blog/cardano-strategy-africa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Africa}}}\uc2  and Southeast Asia. The platform intends to offer the blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s capability to various different use cases such as logistics, procurement agriculture and trade. Cardano is working with Emurgo, an emerging market consultancy, to achieve this goal. Here, Jensen said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf they are successful in convincing leaders in Africa, South America and Southeast Asia to use the Cardano blockchain, the yardstick will switch from the Ethereum-based DeFi applications for global commerce and trade processing applications.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cardano already has use cases in the supply chain domain. The Cardano-Scantrust solution lets businesses use various blockchain functions to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardanofoundation.org/en/news/cardano-reveals-its-first-supply-chain-solution-in-association-with-scantrust/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 aid}}}\uc2  multiple aspects of their business. Along with aiding business solutions, the Cardano blockchain is seeing adoption from new domains.\par \par \uc2 Recently, the first Cardano-based stablecoin was announced, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinmonks/ageusd-the-first-stablecoin-on-cardano-a9789ef3711a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AgeUSD}}}\uc2 , which is an algorithmic stablecoin protocol that was developed on the Ergo blockchain in collaboration with Emurgo and Input-Output Global. This stablecoin will be available on Cardano along with the Alonzo smart contract update.\par \par \uc2 With Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s rising gas fees, the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-ethereum-killer-on-chain-data-shows-competitor-networks-are-still-behind"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum killer}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D narrative has been in the cryptocurrency market almost since Ethereum gained the spotlight. There has been little development on this as Ethereum continues to be king of the DeFi ecosystem. However, Cardano takes a very positive approach to this entire narrative, with its representative stating:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are less interested in competing for market share and more interested in delivering best-in-class components for the decentralized future. [...] We would rather focus on interoperability and cooperation with other blockchains, as we believe that decentralized technology is too important to fail. We work for the good of the entire blockchain industry and the adoption of blockchain technology as a whole.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNmUzMmFiN2MtYTBhMy00YWYxLTg5ZjQtZTdhZjZmZDI3ZTFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210420eh4j0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 The crypto FBAR: Implications beyond\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jason Morton \par \uc2 1,397 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The U.S. \uc2 FinCEN\uc2  may soon require crypto owners to file annual FBARs, and with it, the tax code is becoming more and more complicated.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Department of Treasury\uc2  is again sharpening its sword upon crypto. In January 2021, the Department of Treasury\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Financial Crimes Enforcement Network\uc2  issued {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fincen.gov/sites/default/files/shared/Notice-Virtual%20Currency%20Reporting%20on%20the%20FBAR%20123020.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Notice 2020-2}}}\uc2 . The Notice states that \uc2 FinCEN\uc2  intends to amend its regulations concerning the reporting of foreign financial accounts to include digital currency as a type of reportable account.\par \par \uc2 In simple terms, this means \uc2 FinCEN\uc2  may soon require crypto users to file annual Reports of Foreign Bank and Financial Accounts, or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/report-of-foreign-bank-and-financial-accounts-fbar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FBARs}}}\uc2 , for crypto held on foreign exchanges. The effects of such an amendment are expansive. A mere paragraph long, the notice carries several implications that affect crypto owners \u8212\'20\'14 well beyond a simple FBAR report.\par \par \uc2 Presently, cryptocurrency accounts are not reportable accounts within the meaning of the FBAR regulations. Should a change occur, crypto owners \u8212\'20\'14 already burdened by heightened \uc2 Internal Revenue Service\uc2  focus \u8212\'20\'14 would then be required to report annually the highest aggregate balances of their crypto accounts to \uc2 FinCEN\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This requirement is in addition to the crypto disclosure question on IRS {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/f1040.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Form 1040}}}\uc2 , Individual Income Tax Return. Along with disclosing the highest aggregate balance, the crypto owner must also disclose the custodian of the crypto, its location and the crypto account number (or some other identifier). Assuming the reporting rules stay the same, the crypto accounts would be reported on \uc2 FinCEN{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fincen.gov/report-foreign-bank-and-financial-accounts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Form 114}}}\uc2  and filed electronically by April 15 of the following applicable year (like tax returns).\par \par \uc2 Crypto FBAR requirements\par \par \uc2 But not all crypto accounts would be reportable. The FBAR filing requirement only applies to foreign accounts whose balances exceed $10,000 (in the aggregate) for the tax year. So, if two accounts have a combined account balance greater than $10,000 at any one time, then both accounts are reportable.\par \par \uc2 For example, if one holds $4,000 of Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and another has $7,000 of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) on a non-U.S. exchange, both holdings are reportable because, in the aggregate, they exceed $10,000. Therefore, crypto owners should carefully track the fair market values of their crypto accounts throughout the year in a volatile market. What is worth $5,000 today could exceed the $10,000 threshold in a short time.\par \par \uc2 Penalties and failures to disclose\par \par \uc2 And failure to disclose a reportable account is a fool\u8217\'20\'19s errand. FBAR penalties are draconian. For \u8220\'20\'1Cnon-willful\u8221\'20\'1D failures to file FBARs, the penalty is $10,000 per failure. The courts are currently in flux over whether that $10,000 is per account per year or just per FBAR due.\par \par \uc2 The IRS \u8212\'20\'14 predictably \u8212\'20\'14 takes the former view. If the $10,000 penalty is per account per year, it is easy to see how FBAR penalties can easily exceed the actual balances of the accounts themselves. That is, a taxpayer could pay more in FBAR penalties than the worth of their accounts. And for \u8220\'20\'1Cwillful\u8221\'20\'1D non-compliance, the penalties teeter on unconscionability. They prescribe a civil penalty for willfully failing to file an FBAR of up to $100,000 or 50% of the balance in the account at the time of the violation. Willful violations include both knowing and reckless nondisclosures.\par \par \uc2 There is yet another requirement birthed from the possible changes in the FBAR \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . At the bottom of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/f1040sb.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Schedule B}}}\uc2  of Form 1040, there is a series of foreign bank account questions. Presumably, if crypto accounts fall within the new FBAR regulations, then an FBAR-reporting taxpayer would also need to answer the Schedule B questions in the affirmative. And answering in the negative is not a good choice. Untruthfully answering \u8220\'20\'1Cno\u8221\'20\'1D to the Schedule B foreign bank account questions is considered \u8220\'20\'1Cwillful\u8221\'20\'1D behavior in the eyes of the IRS.\par \par \uc2 And importantly, unlike the FBAR rules, there is no account value threshold with the Schedule B questions. Voluntary foreign bank account disclosures do not begin and end with the filing of an annual FBAR. If applicable, the taxpayer must also answer the Schedule B foreign bank account questions truthfully.\par \par \uc2 Regrettably, the work does not stop there. If crypto accounts are deemed reportable accounts under the FBAR regulations, then they are naturally reportable accounts under IRS {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/f8938.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Form 8938}}}\uc2 . If U.S. taxpayers have a financial interest in specified foreign financial assets and meet certain account balance thresholds, they must also file a Form 8938 with their Form 1040 Individual Income Tax Return. Form 8938 is an attachment to Form 1040. The same foreign bank accounts reportable under the FBAR regulations are currently the same types of accounts reportable on Form 8938. In effect, the FBAR disclosures bleed over to Form 8938.\par \par \uc2 The reporting thresholds are different, however. To be reportable, for unmarried taxpayers, the foreign bank account balances must exceed $50,000 on the last day of the tax year, or if more than $75,000 at any time during the year, to implicate Form 8938. The thresholds are higher for Married Filing Jointly taxpayers. And akin to FBAR, the penalties are heavy-handed. There is a $10,000 penalty for failure to disclose on Form 8938 and an additional $10,000 for every 30 days of non-filing after the IRS notices the taxpayer of a failure to disclose for a potential maximum penalty of $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Criminal penalties may also apply. Effectively, FBAR and Form 8938 are two peas in a pod, and a crypto owner may need to report on both Forms. For a good comparison of FBAR and Form 8938, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/businesses/comparison-of-form-8938-and-fbar-requirements"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Tax amnesty for crypto\par \par \uc2 In all of this, there may be a ray of good news. I previously argued for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tax-justice-for-crypto-users-the-immediate-and-compelling-need-for-an-amnesty-program"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a crypto income tax amnesty program}}}\uc2 , and this may be a case where amnesty emerges. Currently, there are several {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/streamlined-filing-compliance-procedures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/streamlined-filing-compliance-procedures}}}\uc2  voluntary disclosure {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/streamlined-filing-compliance-procedures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 procedures}}}\uc2  for failures to file FBARs. Presumably, if crypto accounts are the types of accounts now reportable under the FBAR regulations, then the same amnesty procedures should apply to crypto accounts as well. Unless the new regulations carve out an exception, crypto accounts may fall within those types of accounts available to participate in the Offshore Voluntary Disclosure procedures. And importantly, the procedures capture \u8220\'20\'1Cboth\u8221\'20\'1D penalties for nondisclosure and the penalties for the non-reporting of income. It is an amnesty program that covers both.\par \par \uc2 For example, let\u8217\'20\'19s assume the new FBAR regulations go into effect in 2021. A crypto owner named Joe fails to report capital gains on his crypto in tax years 2021, 2022 and 2023. In each year, Joe also fails to file FBARs on his crypto accounts. Then, in 2024, Joe wants to come clean. Presumably, Joe can then participate in the FBAR voluntary disclosure procedures and capture both his failure to file his FBARs as well as his failure to report his crypto capital gains. While Joe must pay a 5% miscellaneous penalty under voluntary disclosure procedures, he can avoid the $10,000 \u8220\'20\'1Cnon-willful\u8221\'20\'1D penalty for each year and avoid any additional penalties associated with his non-reporting of crypto income, including the 20% accuracy-related penalty and civil fraud penalties. This may be a backdoor into crypto income tax amnesty.\par \par \uc2 What started as an innocuous one-paragraph notice, Notice 2020-2 carries broad implications. It is not uncommon for a tax reporting requirement to touch one or more tax forms as it does here. Crypto owners are well served to understand the breadth of the tax code. A misstep in one area is likely a misstep in another.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal advice.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Jason Morton practices law in North Carolina and Virginia and is a partner at Webb & Morton PLLC. He is also a judge advocate in the Army National Guard. Jason focuses on tax defense and tax litigation (foreign and domestic), estate planning, business law, asset protection and the taxation of cryptocurrency. He studied blockchain at the \uc2 University of California, Berkeley\uc2  and studied law at the \uc2 University of Dayton\uc2  and \uc2 George Washington University\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYjM1YjZhYmYtZDI5MC00ZmEwLTlhYTQtMmQxYWY2OGRkZjNhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210417eh4h0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, LTC, UNI, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,961 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s epic pump are signals that the market could be overheating and in need of a short-term correction.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) massive rally to $0.45 propelled it to a market capitalization of over $54 billion to make it the fifth most valuable cryptocurrency by market cap.\par \par \uc2 This lofty market cap comes as a surprise to many since the project has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-whales-move-12b-in-one-day-twice-as-much-as-ether"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no}}}\uc2  active developers and is only a meme coin, thus the current rally brings back memories of the excesses seen during the ICO boom in 2017.\par \par \uc2 Rallies like the one seen in \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  indicate that several traders have entered the fray and are looking to get rich overnight. The only positive sign is that the mania has not spread to other coins. If it does, then the crypto markets are likely to witness a sharp correction in order to shake out the weak hands.\par \par \uc2 CNBC host \uc2 Jim Cramer\uc2  has become one of the first well-known people to reveal that he closed half of his Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) position. While Cramer\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jim-cramer-cashes-out-half-his-phoney-money-bitcoin-to-pay-off-mortgage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling}}}\uc2  is an isolated event, it does warn that not all professional investors who have recently turned Bitcoin believers are going to be long-term HODLers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/c9848a0c-5d84-404d-b61d-83399c0270c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If the institutional investors rush to the exit, it could cause a huge correction in several cryptocurrencies. Traders should be mindful of irrational exuberance and avoid being sucked into FOMO-driven trades as it's better to stick to a trading plan and think long-term rather than dream of overnight riches.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the critical support levels and outline various \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenarios.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not capitalize and build upon the breakout of the overhead resistance zone at $60,000 to $61,825.84 on April 13. Bitcoin price turned down on April 14 after hitting an all-time high at $64,849.27 and the bulls are currently attempting to flip the $60,000 level to support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1a8b9e4e-6e8b-41d2-8b44-0f0da629f3d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair may make one more attempt to resume the uptrend. A breakout of $64,849.27, could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $69,540 and then $79,566.\par \par \uc2 However, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) is warning of a possible correction. Interestingly, the price reversed direction when the RSI had reached close to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the 20-day exponential moving average ($59,427), it will be the first sign that buyers may be losing their grip. The break below the 50-day simple moving average ($55,814) will further cement the view that a deeper correction is likely.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may attempt to arrest the decline near $50,460.02 but if this level cracks, the pair could drop to the critical support at $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) extended its uptrend and hit an all-time high at $2,545.80 today. Profit-booking by traders pulled the price down to $2,300 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls continue to buy on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/f1d84e52-1378-4563-b1af-06963ea2531d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price recovers and the bulls push the price above $2,545.8, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $2,745 and then the psychological level at $3,000.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,131) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price down to $1,925.10.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on April 14 and that was followed by an inside day candlestick pattern on April 15. Both these setups indicate indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the downside today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/3fa31de2-318e-489c-bccb-3777c971480f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the bulls are defending the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $483.95, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The bulls will now try to push the BNB/USDT pair above the all-time high at $638.56 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below $483.95 could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($437). A break below this support will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit and that could result in a drop to the breakout level at $348.69.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is currently correcting the sharp rally. The bulls are attempting to defend the first support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.48, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/581b3400-1c6e-4e49-a4cf-52062b208e05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair may now consolidate between $1.48 and $1.96 for a few days before starting the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 A break above $1.96 could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $2.54. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this positive assumption, if the bears sink the price below the $1.48 support, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($1.18). Such a move will suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and that could delay the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s momentum has been picking up since the past three days and that has resulted in the massive pump today. This shows that more and more traders are getting sucked into the trade due to FOMO.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/baa389d9-3acc-439f-a8db-8af133e5a3f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, such buying frenzies end in a major top formation. After the last bull has purchased, the price reverses direction and the waterfall decline starts. It is difficult to predict a top during such a frenzy but the psychological $0.50 level may act as a hurdle.\par \par \uc2 The decline after the DOGE/USDT pair tops out is likely to be vicious. The usual 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level may not hold and the pair is likely to drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Traders should control the urge to get into such trades even at the risk of missing out on some profits.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been facing a tough battle between the bull and the bears near $1.48 for the past two days. Although the bulls managed to push the price above $1.48 today, the bears have been quick to pull the price back below the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/70608576-53d8-40c9-ab94-ad867074281c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After the third unsuccessful attempt to sustain the price above $1.48, the bulls seem to have dumped their positions today, resulting in the formation of an outside day candlestick pattern.\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls bought the dips to the 20-day EMA ($1.28) aggressively. The bulls may now make one more attempt to drive the price above the $1.48 to $1.55 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume the uptrend and start the journey toward $2. Conversely, a break below the moving averages could offer the bears an opportunity to sink the price to $1.03.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the $42.28 level on April 13 but could not challenge the all-time high at $46.80. This shows a lack of demand at higher levels. The altcoin has dropped below $42.28 today and the bears will now try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/0f7075f5-b2c3-4a90-93f7-7a793999645d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the selling could pick up further as the bulls may rush to cover their positions. Such a move could sink the DOT/USDT pair to $32.50 and then to the critical support at $26.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls have not given up. They will make one more attempt to thrust the price above the $46.80 resistance and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bears had tried to start a correction today but the bulls purchased the dips aggressively as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The reversal may have caught several aggressive bears on the wrong foot, which could be the reason for the pick-up in momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/6c30a596-7e72-4fcf-97ba-f10a46fe9f39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair has broken out of the target objective at $307.42, clearing the path for a rally to $374. However, the RSI above 76 signals caution because, in the past, the pair has repeatedly entered a correction when the RSI level reaches close to 80.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($241). A break below this support will be the first sign that the bulls are tiring and a deeper correction is likely.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke out to a new all-time high on April 15 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels. When the price fails to follow up higher after breaking out of a significant resistance, it indicates exhaustion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/70fd33f6-0ce4-47f2-ac73-fd3126dd6bcc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests the bulls continue to buy on dips. If the buyers can propel the price above the all-time high at $39.60, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to $43.43 and then $50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price again turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($32), several aggressive bulls who had purchased the breakout of $35.20 may bail out of their positions. The long liquidation could pull the price down to $27.97.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) surged above the $36.93 overhead resistance on April 14, signaling the resumption of the uptrend. The altcoin hit an all-time high at $44.33 where profit-booking set in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/88b7f684-b2f7-4c35-828c-03a4af43a34a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to $38.52 today. This indicates that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $44.33. If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair could rally to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again turns down and breaks below the $36.93 support, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($34). If this support cracks, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($30).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYzU3ZTRjY2EtMThlMy00YTg3LWE3ZDgtZmQxZTczMzRlMDQzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210416eh4g000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, DOGE, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Today's \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  (COIN) listing is likely to remain a focal point that will dictate the short-term price action in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  (COIN) listing on Nasdaq could eventually {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-will-happen-to-bitcoin-price-as-coinbase-goes-public"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost }}}\uc2  cryptocurrency adoption and attract droves of institutional investors. However, that is unlikely to happen immediately. In the first few days after the listing, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be high as Wall Street tries to value \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  . This could also increase the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Sharp movements in the price of Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) could also result in liquidations of leveraged positions in the derivatives market. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-futures-open-interest-soars-to-new-heights-ahead-of-coinbase-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massive }}}\uc2  $27 billion in Bitcoin futures open interest and $8 billion in Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) futures {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-8b-open-interest-on-ethereum-futures-shows-the-pros-are-here"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open interest }}}\uc2  indicate that a spike in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could chop several traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9737bcb2-a89d-48b7-a3ec-782b6215e5ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 PlanB, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-can-hit-92k-in-april-and-still-not-match-bull-run-rsi-peaks-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analyst }}}\uc2  behind the popular stock-to-flow price model for Bitcoin, cited the monthly Relative Strength Index (RSI) indicator and said that the current reading of above 92 is high but falls short of the 95 levels hit in the previous bull markets of 2017, 2013 and 2011.\par \par \uc2 According to PlanB\u8217\'20\'19s calculation, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price would have to rise to $92,000 by the end of April to push the RSI to 95.\par \par \uc2 Traders will keep a close watch on the price action in COIN and that is likely to determine the short-term sentiment. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the critical support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the stiff overhead resistance at $61,825.84 on April 13, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The sharp rally also completed the breakout from the inverse head and shoulders pattern that has a target objective at $69,540.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1ffcb5cc-b8d9-4c4a-8d80-8cf3a1b39943.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($58,713) and the RSI above 63 suggest the bulls have the upper hand. However, the BTC/USDT pair is unlikely to run away vertically.\par \par \uc2 Usually, after the breakout from a critical level, the price retraces and retests the level. In this case, the pair could drop to $60,000. If the bulls can flip this level into support, the pair could resume its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it could catch several aggressive bulls off guard. That could intensify the selling and the pair may even crack the 50-day simple moving average ($55,241). Such a move will increase the possibility of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke above the $2,200 resistance on April 13, which resumed its uptrend. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,040) and the RSI above 70 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1e38646e-d5b5-40f8-9cd3-faf511b165c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the ETH/USDT pair toward the next target objective at $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair turns down from the current level, it could drop to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips as they anticipate the rally to rise further.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that traders are booking profits in a hurry. That may pull the price down to the trendline.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) is currently in a corrective phase following the sharp uptrend that took it from $233.81 on March 26 to $638.56 on April 12, a 173% rally in a short time. The first strong support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $483.95.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/ee5c6e38-8fb1-4db0-89a2-e58aa126fcd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $483.95, it will suggest the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will try to resume the uptrend by thrusting the price above $638.56. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could start its journey toward $888.70.\par \par \uc2 The Doji candlestick pattern today suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. If this uncertainty resolves to the downside and the bears sink the price below $483.85, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($417), which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The strong up-move in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  continued with a breakout above $1.50 on April 13 and reached an intraday high at $1.96 today. However, the price has reversed sharply, which suggests the bears are aggressively defending the psychological level at $2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/2a6966f6-5c7a-4610-a9f9-dc22e3861791.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $1.43. A strong rebound off this support will indicate that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the up-move by pushing the price above $1.96.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below $1.43 could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($1.05). Such a deep fall will suggest that traders are dumping their positions in a hurry, which may delay the next leg of the rally.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pierced the $1.48 overhead resistance today and climbed to an intraday high at $1.55. However, the bulls have not been able to sustain the breakout as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b2eea132-31b7-4294-b5b6-9adbc1ba49da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price back into the $1.48 to $1.03 range. They will now try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($1.24).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls may make one more attempt to push the pair above the overhead resistance at $1.55. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $2.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, a drop to $1.03 is possible.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading in Polkadot ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ) resolved to the upside on April 13 and the bulls pushed the price above the $42.28 overhead resistance. However, the price has again dipped back below $42.28 today, indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/3e7c8203-da2b-4f4e-881a-e74daadb96b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($39.78), the selling could intensify and the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $32.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $46.80. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $53.50 and then $57.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI }}}\uc2  ) broke out to a new all-time high on April 12 but the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the momentum. The altcoin formed an inside day candlestick pattern on April 13 and has extended its correction today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/c0192ae0-e3a9-4922-a605-dc9b6f600d57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $38.16, the UNI/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The first target on the upside is $43.43 and if this resistance is crossed, the pair could march toward the psychological mark at $50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below $33, the pair could lose momentum as the bulls who bought the breakout on April 12 may rush to the exit. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($31) and keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) flipped the breakout level at $246.96 into support on April 11 and 12. This reignited buying from the bulls and the altcoin resumed its uptrend on April 13. The next target objective to watch on the upside is $307.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/adf0e4d3-26ae-44a6-bfde-961a569c1d31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($227) is rising and the RSI is close to the overbought territory, suggesting the bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, the long-legged Doji candlestick pattern today shows indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the price slips below $255, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to the $239 to $246.96 support zone.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this zone will suggest the bulls are accumulating on dips while a break below it could drag the price down to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) broke above the stiff overhead resistance at $0.087 on April 13, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The breakout has been followed by further buying today, which has propelled the price to an all-time high at $0.145.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/66dd1086-dc96-4b99-966d-6219df7a7cde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOGEUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI above 85, which suggests the rally is getting overheated in the short term. The bears may try to stall the up-move at $0.15. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could enter a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.112. A bounce off this support will suggest strength. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend. If they can propel the price above $0.145, the pair could move up to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below $0.112 could result in a drop to the breakout level at $0.087.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have propelled Chainlink ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK }}}\uc2  ) above the $36.93 overhead resistance today, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. If the bulls can sustain the price above $36.93, the altcoin could continue its march toward $50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8fea5874-1bdc-4cd1-93ce-653b9df6fc31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($32) has turned up and the RSI has risen above 65, suggesting the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above the $36.93 level, then it will indicate aggressive selling by the bears at higher levels. That could result in a drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this level will suggest the sentiment remains positive.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the LINK/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNzJjMDUxMjQtOTg1Mi00MTdhLTg1ZTMtYmVjZjI4YTdmMGQ3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210414eh4e000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, LINK, XLM\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,013 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins continue to press higher while Bitcoin bulls work on holding the $60,000 level as support.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-caged-bull-ready-to-escape-at-60k-bloomberg-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 equated}}}\uc2  the current consolidation in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price to that of a \u8220\'20\'1Ccaged bull, well-rested to escape.\u8221\'20\'1D When compared with the rallies a year after the previous two Bitcoin halvings in 2012 and 2016, the strategist called the current price action \u8220\'20\'1Ctame.\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 According to McGlone, Bitcoin is \u8220\'20\'1Cstill in price-discovery mode\u8221\'20\'1D and its plateau is still far away.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin remains in focus, altcoins have continued to steal the show. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market dominance, which stood closer to 70% on Jan. 4 has continued to slide even though its price has risen more than 104% year-to-date. The current market dominance at 54.3% is the lowest since April 2019 according to data from CoinMarketCap. This suggests that several altcoins are outperforming Bitcoin by a large margin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/98f73c4d-17a2-4cde-81e9-975eebc08a6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, approval of a Bitcoin exchange-traded fund could tilt the advantage back in favor of Bitcoin. Mike Novogratz\u8217\'20\'19s Galaxy Digital became the latest to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxy-digital-submits-bitcoin-etf-application-with-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 file}}}\uc2  an application with the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  for a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  on Monday. The growing list of candidates applying to launch a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  shows that there is still huge demand for the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin continue to trade sideways while altcoins rally or will it resume its uptrend and lead from the front. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed an inside day candlestick pattern on April 11, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls tried to resolve this uncertainty to the upside today by piercing the all-time high at $61,825.84, but the bears had other plans. They again successfully defended the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/13093c8a-8510-4ca1-bd17-1c871158d418.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the bears are defending the overhead resistance, they have not been able to sink the price further away from $60,000. This suggests the bulls are not closing their long positions in a hurry as they anticipate the uptrend to continue.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can drive and sustain the price above $61,825.84, the BTC/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern. That could result in a rally to the pattern target at $69,540. If the momentum sustains, the next target to watch out for is $79,566.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average ($54,7823). Such a move could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the breakout level at $2,040.77 for the past three days, but the up-move lacks momentum. The long wick on the April 10 candlestick and the inside day candlestick pattern on April 11 suggests hesitation by the bulls to push the price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9c6f5367-a9f5-4b6e-9030-b8fff1033266.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price does not pick up momentum within the next few days, the bears will try to pull the price back below $2,040.77. If the ETH/USDT pair breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average ($1,985), the next stop could be the trendline. A break below this support could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) above 61 indicate advantage to the bulls. If the bulls punch the price above $2,200 with force, the pair may start the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend, but the up-move of the past two days is showing signs of a melt-up. The long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests some traders are booking profits at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d6d4ff2c-af8d-4bd3-a794-d10142b39481.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day EMA ($385) is sloping up, the RSI above 84 indicates the rally is overheated in the short term. This could result in a minor correction or consolidation for the next few days. In strong uptrends, the corrections generally do not last for more than three days.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $483.95. If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest the sentiment remains positive and bulls are buying on dips. They will then try to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the all-time high at $638.56.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the next leg of the uptrend could begin, which may propel the BNB/USDT pair to $888.70. On the contrary, if bears sink the price below $483.95, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  contraction on April 9 was resolved to the upside on April 10 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rallied above $1.11. The bulls continued their purchase on April 11 and pushed the price to $1.50. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests traders booked profits at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/7d360133-576a-4c4b-bc04-76dd3c84a86a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears could not build up on the advantage today and start a correction. The bulls tried to resume the uptrend but failed, resulting in the formation of a Doji candlestick pattern. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can propel the price above $1.50, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $2. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and dips below $1.30, the pair could start a correction.\par \par \uc2 The major support on the downside is $1.11. If the buyers can flip this level into support, the pair will make one more attempt to rise above $1.50. On the other hand, a break below $1.11 may result in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.89).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($1.17) in the past few days and are currently attempting to start an up-move. However, the long wick on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that buying dries up above $1.33.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/635af7cd-551c-4fd7-8191-2577b53e4f98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to sustain the price above $1.33, the aggressive bears may again try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the $1.03 to $0.98 support zone.\par \par \uc2 A rebound off this zone could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. Alternatively, if the bears sink the price below the zone, the pair could decline to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the pair sustains the price above $1.33. That could push the price to $1.48. A break above this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $2.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been sandwiched between the 20-day EMA ($39.30) and the overhead resistance at $42.28 for the past few days. However, this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4a2b9306-24ca-43a7-85cd-2f2f0ff8c3b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above $42.28, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $46.80. The bears may again offer resistance at this level but if the bulls can overcome the barrier the pair could climb up to $53.50 and then $57.\par \par \uc2 The marginally upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI above 54 suggest only a minor advantage to the bulls. If the bears can sink the price below the moving averages, it will open the gates for a decline to $32.50 and then $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has soared above the all-time high at $36.80 today. Although the moving averages are yet to turn up, the RSI has risen close to the overbought territory, indicating a pick-up in momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4d9796f5-a3a5-47bb-a569-689647caa7c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can sustain the price above $35.20, it will suggest strong demand at higher levels. The UNI/USDT pair could then march up to $43.43 and if this level also gets taken out, the up-move may hit $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $35.20, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. If the price dips and sustains below $35.20, the range-bound action in the pair could continue.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  contraction on April 8 and 9 was followed by an expansion in favor of the bulls. The buyers pushed the price above $246.96 on April 10 and have successfully managed to sustain the price above it since then.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/279f349f-c1cd-4c7a-9d66-7ca4f7886590.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($218) and the RSI above 63 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the buyers can drive the price above $262.93, the LTC/USDT pair could rally to its next target objective at $307.42.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price breaks and sustains below $246.96. Such a move will suggest that traders booked profits at higher levels. The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off it will suggest the sentiment remains positive and the bulls will once again try to resume the uptrend. Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA could pull the price down to $170.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between $24 and $36.93. The marginally rising 20-day EMA ($30.92) and the RSI above 55 suggest the bulls have a slight edge. However, the failure of the bulls to challenge the $36.93 overhead resistance indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4b7b158d-0f39-454d-81dd-4bf3f7c8d8f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently trying to sink the price below the $32 support. If they can accomplish that, the possibility of a break below the moving averages increases. Such a move could pull the price down to $24.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to drive the price above $36.93. If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair could resume its uptrend and rally toward $40 and then $50.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to resume the uptrend in Stellar Lumens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) but they are facing stiff resistance at the $0.60 level. The bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance on April 11 and today but they could not sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/e0720e98-4bce-4bfd-9345-cdebc83005a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XLMUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not allow the price to slip below $0.55, it will suggest accumulation on dips. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.47) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $0.60 will be the first sign that bulls have overpowered the bears. If that happens, the XLM/USDT pair could resume the uptrend and rally to $0.72 and then $0.85.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bears sink the price below $0.55, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvMjNhNjU4MTQtZTMwMC00ZTQ3LThmYjktZTFlMTRhYjRlMzZmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210412eh4c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 xrp price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP seeing a monster rally when Ripple is worth just $3B on the secondary market?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joseph Young \par \uc2 780 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ripple is reportedly trading at a $2 to $3 billion valuation but its XRP holdings are worth around $70 billion.\par \par \uc2 The equity of Ripple, the company that builds the infrastructure around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  used by networks like RippleNet to process cross-border payments \u8212\'20\'14 is reportedly trading at $2 to $3 billion in the secondary market.\par \par \uc2 Yet, the XRP holdings of Ripple are reportedly worth $70 billion, which is many times higher than the valuation of the firm\u8217\'20\'19s equity.\par \par \uc2 Returns over last year...\par \par \uc2 Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  : +3,290%\par \par \uc2 BinanceCoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BNB&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BNB}}}\uc2  : +3,058%\par \par \uc2 Polkadot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24DOT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOT}}}\uc2  : +1,353%\par \par \uc2 Ethereum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\uc2  : +1,171%\par \par \uc2 Uniswap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}\uc2  : +953%\par \par \uc2 Chainlink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}\uc2  : +875%\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  : +728%\par \par \uc2 XRP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\uc2  : +532%\par \par \uc2 Litecoin{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}\uc2  : +406%\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}\uc2  : +161%\par \par \uc2 Gold: +3%\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24USD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $USD}}}\uc2  : -8%\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charlie Bilello (@charliebilello) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/charliebilello/status/1380901303405150215?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 10, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Michael Novogratz, billionaire cryptocurrency investor and the CEO of Galaxy Digital, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/novogratz/status/1380898768191688704"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRipple equity is \u8216\'20\'18trading\u8217\'20\'19 in secondary market at $2-3bn valuation. The $XRP on their balance sheet is worth approx $70bn. One price seems wrong. If $XRP price is saying settlement coming, the equity is crazy cheap. If not, the token seems expensive. Thoughts?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 So, is XRP undervalued? Not exactly\par \par \uc2 According to Leonidas Hadjiloizou, a long-time cryptocurrency researcher, XRP that is locked in Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheet in escrow is likely not priced into Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s equity.\par \par \uc2 As such, these holdings are inaccessible until they start unlocking, which might not be priced in the value of the firm\u8217\'20\'19s equity.\par \par \uc2 He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LeoHadjiloizou/status/1380910078312742912"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWell, $62 bn of the XRP in Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheet is locked in escrow. At the same time, Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s XRP sales are the ones under attack from the SEC so the market probably hasn\u8217\'20\'19t priced in Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s XRP holdings since they are in limbo right now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In December 2017, the Ripple team explained that the XRP holdings in Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s escrow unlock by 1 billion XRP per month for 55 subsequent months.\par \par \uc2 400,000,000 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/XRP?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #XRP}}}\uc2  (226,995,603 USD) transferred from Ripple Escrow wallet to unknown wallet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/DMzYUxVBMR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/DMzYUxVBMR}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Whale Alert (@whale_alert) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/whale_alert/status/1377677812883058689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 1, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The team {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ripple.com/insights/explanation-ripples-xrp-escrow/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  at the time:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe escrow consists of independent on ledger escrows that release a total of one billion XRP each month over the next 55 months. This provides an upper limit on the amount of new XRP that can be brought into circulation. The amount of XRP actually released into circulation will likely be much less than this.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Theoretically, the value of Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s equity would be considered undervalued if the amount of XRP on the firm\u8217\'20\'19s balance sheet unlocks and the price of XRP does not drop.\par \par \uc2 The question on the discrepancy between the value of Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s equity and the amount of its XRP holdings started to emerge as the price of XRP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-surpasses-1-for-the-first-time-since-2018-what-s-behind-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started to rally above $1}}}\uc2  despite an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/you-don-t-own-me-xrp-price-surge-defies-sec-s-clamp-down-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing lawsuit}}}\uc2  with the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/59f6b0f9-e9a8-4297-8ec6-787fd0f1519c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD 1-day price chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 Since April 1, the price of XRP has rallied from $0.57 to as high as $1.49, or around 160%.\par \par \uc2 What is behind the XRP rally?\par \par \uc2 Throughout the past two weeks, the main catalysts for the 160% rally {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-becomes-tidal-wave-leads-weekend-pump-and-notches-legal-victories"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 came from victories in the company\u8217\'20\'19s legal battle}}}\uc2 . Ripple lawyers were granted access to internal SEC discussion history regarding cryptocurrencies, and a court denied the SEC the ability to disclose the financial records of two Ripple execs, including CEO Brad Garlinghouse.\par \par \uc2 Another reason may be the convergence trade between Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins, particularly as BTC sees sideways price action, allowing alternative cryptocurrencies to rally and catch up.\par \par \uc2 Kelvin Koh, managing partner at Spartan Group \u8212\'20\'14 one of the largest DeFi-focused funds in Asia \u8212\'20\'14 said that large quant funds try to trade the convergence between Bitcoin and major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Hence, the trend of capital moving into altcoins and back into Bitcoin occurs periodically. Koh {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SpartanBlack_1/status/1381120323483930625"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe reason this happens periodically is because there are a bunch of quant funds out there that play the convergence trade between $BTC and a handful of liquid alts. Whenever there alts look cheap relative to $BTC, they pile in. When they look expensive, they rotate back to $BTC. No fundamentals involved so don\u8217\'20\'19t try too hard to rationalize the moves. This strategy has proven effective over time and there are enough managers playing this that it becomes self-fulfilling and keep recurring.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvZGNhMDAzOTAtZGQyZi00OGFlLWIxZmItOTU0MzVjOTU4ZmUzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210412eh4b0005t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 xrp price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP seeing a monster rally when Ripple is worth just $3B on the secondary market?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joseph Young \par \uc2 783 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ripple is reportedly trading at a $2 to $3 billion valuation but its XRP holdings are worth around $70 billion.\par \par \uc2 The equity of Ripple, the company that builds the infrastructure around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  used by networks like RippleNet to process cross-border payments \u8212\'20\'14 is reportedly trading at $2 to $3 billion in the secondary market.\par \par \uc2 Yet, the XRP holdings of Ripple, are reportedly worth $70 billion, which is many times higher than the valuation of the firm's equity.\par \par \uc2 Returns over last year...\par \par \uc2 Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  : +3,290%\par \par \uc2 BinanceCoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BNB&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BNB}}}\uc2  : +3,058%\par \par \uc2 Polkadot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24DOT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOT}}}\uc2  : +1,353%\par \par \uc2 Ethereum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\uc2  : +1,171%\par \par \uc2 Uniswap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}\uc2  : +953%\par \par \uc2 Chainlink {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}\uc2  : +875%\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  : +728%\par \par \uc2 XRP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\uc2  : +532%\par \par \uc2 Litecoin{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}\uc2  : +406%\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}\uc2  : +161%\par \par \uc2 Gold: +3%\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24USD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $USD}}}\uc2  : -8%\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charlie Bilello (@charliebilello) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/charliebilello/status/1380901303405150215?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 10, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Michael Novogratz, the billionaire cryptocurrency investor and the CEO of Galaxy Digital, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/novogratz/status/1380898768191688704"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 "Ripple equity is \u8216\'20\'18trading\u8217\'20\'19 in secondary market at $2-3bn valuation. The $XRP on their balance sheet is worth approx $70bn. One price seems wrong. If $XRP price is saying settlement coming, the equity is crazy cheap. If not, the token seems expensive. Thoughts?:\par \par \uc2 So is XRP undervalued? Not exactly\par \par \uc2 According to Leonidas Hadjiloizou, a long-time cryptocurrency researcher, XRP that is locked in Ripple's balance sheet are in escrow are likely not priced into Ripple's equity.\par \par \uc2 As such, these holdings are not accessible until they start unlocking, which might not be priced in the value of the firm's equity.\par \par \uc2 He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LeoHadjiloizou/status/1380910078312742912"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 "Well, $62 bn of the XRP in Ripple's balance sheet is locked in escrow. At the same time, Ripple's XRP sales are the ones under attack from the SEC so the market probably hasn't priced in Ripple's XRP holdings since they are in limbo right now."\par \par \uc2 In December 2017, the Ripple team explained that the XRP holdings in Ripple's escrow unlock by one billion XRP per month for 55 subsequent months.\par \par \uc2 400,000,000 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/XRP?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #XRP}}}\uc2  (226,995,603 USD) transferred from Ripple Escrow wallet to unknown wallet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/DMzYUxVBMR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/DMzYUxVBMR}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Whale Alert (@whale_alert) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/whale_alert/status/1377677812883058689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 1, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The team {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ripple.com/insights/explanation-ripples-xrp-escrow/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  at the time:\par \par \uc2 "The escrow consists of independent on ledger escrows that release a total of one billion XRP each month over the next 55 months. This provides an upper limit on the amount of new XRP that can be brought into circulation. The amount of XRP actually released into circulation will likely be much less than this."\par \par \uc2 Theoretically, the value of Ripple's equity would be considered undervalued if the amount of XRP on the firm's balance sheet unlocks and the price of XRP does not drop.\par \par \uc2 The question on the discrepancy between the value of Ripple's equity and the amount of its XRP holdings started to emerge as the price of XRP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-surpasses-1-for-the-first-time-since-2018-what-s-behind-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started to rally above $1}}}\uc2 , despite an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/you-don-t-own-me-xrp-price-surge-defies-sec-s-clamp-down-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing lawsuit}}}\uc2  with \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC)\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/59f6b0f9-e9a8-4297-8ec6-787fd0f1519c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD 1-day price chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView.com\par \par \uc2 Since April 1, the price of XRP rallied from $0.57 to as high as $1.49, by around 160%.\par \par \uc2 What is behind the XRP rally?\par \par \uc2 Throughout the past two weeks, the main catalysts for the 160% rally {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-becomes-tidal-wave-leads-weekend-pump-and-notches-legal-victories"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 came from victories in the company's legal battle}}}\uc2 . Ripple lawyers were granted access to internal SEC discussion history regarding cryptocurrencies, and a court denied the SEC the ability to disclose the financial records of two Ripple execs, including CEO Brad Garlinghouse.\par \par \uc2 Another reason may be the convergence trade between Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins, particularly as BTC sees sideways price action, allowing alternative cryptocurrencies to rally and catch up.\par \par \uc2 Kelvin Koh, the managing partner at Spartan Group, one of the largest DeFi-focused funds in Asia, said that large quant funds try to trade the convergence between Bitcoin and major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Hence, the trend of capital moving into altcoins and back into Bitcoin occurs periodically. Koh {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SpartanBlack_1/status/1381120323483930625"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 "The reason this happens periodically is because there are a bunch of quant funds out there that play the convergence trade between $BTC and a handful of liquid alts. Whenever there alts look cheap relative to $BTC, they pile in. When they look expensive, they rotate back to $BTC. No fundamentals involved so don\u8217\'20\'19t try too hard to rationalize the moves. This strategy has proven effective over time and there are enough managers playing this that it becomes self-fulfilling and keep recurring."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvZGNhMDAzOTAtZGQyZi00OGFlLWIxZmItOTU0MzVjOTU4ZmUzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210411eh4b0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP Futures\par \b \uc2 XRP futures open interest reaches $1.2 billion record\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 592 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP's price rally above $1 coincided with its futures open interest hitting an all-time high of $1.2 billion.\par \par \uc2 XRP price's journey to $1 this year has been nothing short of spectacular, considering the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-unveils-1-3b-suit-against-ripple-over-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing Securities and Exchange Commission lawsuit against Ripple}}}\uc2  initiated in December 2020. The regulator alleges that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  was a $1.3 billion unregistered securities offering, and both CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  and co-founder \uc2 Christian Larsen\uc2  are also in the crosshairs.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-access-to-sec-discussions-on-defining-crypto-assets-as-securities"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 granted access to the SEC's documents}}}\uc2  "expressing the agency's interpretation or views" on the subject of crypto assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/666130b3-fea1-4493-aacc-d2c56371da4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP price in USD at \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 . Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Such news coincided with an explosive 75% rally in 30 hours, causing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-surpasses-1-for-the-first-time-since-2018-what-s-behind-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP to cross the $1 mark}}}\uc2  for the first time since March 2018.\par \par \uc2 It is worth noting that coincidently, on Monday, XRP posted a 10% gain following Ripple's announcement of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-surges-55-to-a-3-year-high-amid-push-for-financial-inclusivity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 40% stake acquisition in Tranglo}}}\uc2 , an Asian fiat money remittance company.\par \par \uc2 Positive news boosts XRP derivatives market growth\par \par \uc2 Whatever the rationale behind such an impressive move, investors' interest in XRP futures trading skyrocketed as open interest reached $1.2 billion, a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4f9689f8-c2f7-42c0-b139-40d4a0fcef78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP futures aggregate open interest. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 The 119% open interest increase in 30 days caused XRP to retake the third position, which had been lost to Polkadot's DOT, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  over the past couple of months. As a comparison, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) futures open interest stood at $3.3 billion just three months ago.\par \par \uc2 Even though futures buyers and sellers are evenly matched at all times, a healthy derivatives market allows larger players to participate. Once an asset gets enough hedging and arbitrage activity, its volume on spot exchanges tends to grow, and the cycle perpetuates.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/ca85306b-a61c-46df-8a7c-b500dbc15ca6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top cryptocurrencies 1-month performance and volumes. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 As depicted above, XRP spot volume over the past 30 days amounts to $44.3 billion, some 31% of Ether's. Regardless of the price move, as long as the token continues to attract investors' attention, a healthy derivatives market creates a self-fulfilling growth path.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, price pumps unaccompanied by spot volume growth raise the risk of large sell-offs and shun arbitrage traders.\par \par \uc2 Social metrics activity has gone ballistic\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for XRP on April 5 while the token price seemingly stagnated at $0.72.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historical and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points, including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b74cc55a-7b48-4160-a67b-9169dc7b66d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score vs. XRP price (white). Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for XRP flipped green on April 5 and continued to flash a positive indicator as the price rallied to a $1.10 high on April 6, resulting in a 53% gain in 36 hours.\par \par \uc2 While the indicator currently remains neutral, XRP price could further continue its rally if more positive news regarding the SEC lawsuit emerges.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNWI1MDhmZTItNDA3OC00YjZhLTk5YzMtMWEzMzkxODgxYjcxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210410eh4900004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP Futures\par \b \uc2 XRP futures open interest reaches $1.2 billion record\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 592 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP price rally above $1 coincided with its futures open interest hitting an all-time high of $1.2 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price's journey to $1 this year has been nothing short of spectacular, considering the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-unveils-1-3b-suit-against-ripple-over-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing Securities and Exchange Commission's lawsuit against Ripple}}}\uc2  initiated in December 2020. The regulator alleges that XRP was a $1.3 billion unregistered securities offering and both CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  and co-founder \uc2 Christian Larsen\uc2  are also in the crosshairs.\par \par \uc2 On April 6, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-access-to-sec-discussions-on-defining-crypto-assets-as-securities"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple Labs was granted access to the U.S. SEC's documents}}}\uc2  "expressing the agency's interpretation or views" on the subject of crypto assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/666130b3-fea1-4493-aacc-d2c56371da4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP price in USD at \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 . Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Such news coincided with the explosive 75% rally in 30 hours, causing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-surpasses-1-for-the-first-time-since-2018-what-s-behind-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP to cross the $1 mark}}}\uc2  for the first time since March 2018.\par \par \uc2 It is worth noting that coincidently, on April 5, XRP price posted a 10% gain following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-surges-55-to-a-3-year-high-amid-push-for-financial-inclusivity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 40% stake acquisition in Tranglo}}}\uc2 , an Asian fiat money remittance company.\par \par \uc2 Positive news boosts XRP derivatives market growth\par \par \uc2 Whatever the rationale behind such an impressive move, investors' interest in XRP futures trading skyrocketed as the open interest reached $1.2 billion, a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4f9689f8-c2f7-42c0-b139-40d4a0fcef78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP futures aggregate open interest. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 The 119% open interest increase in 30 days caused XRP to retake the third position, which had been lost to Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) over the past couple of months. As a comparison, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) futures open interest stood at $3.3 billion just three months ago.\par \par \uc2 Even though futures buyers and sellers are evenly matched at all times, a healthy derivatives market allows larger players to participate. Once an asset gets enough hedging and arbitrage activity, its volume on spot exchanges tends to grow, and the cycle perpetuates.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/ca85306b-a61c-46df-8a7c-b500dbc15ca6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top cryptocurrencies 1-month performance and volumes. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 As depicted above, XRP spot volume over the past 30 days amounts to $44.3 billion, some 31% of Ether's. Regardless of the price move, as long as the token continues to attract investors' attention, a healthy derivatives market creates a self-fulfilling growth path.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, price pumps unaccompanied by spot volume growth raise the risk of large sell-offs and shuns arbitrage traders.\par \par \uc2 Social metrics activity has gone ballistic\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  began to detect a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for XRP on April 5, while the token price seemingly stagnated at $0.72.\par \par \uc2 The VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 score, exclusive to Cointelegraph, is an algorithmic comparison of historical and current market conditions derived from a combination of data points, including market sentiment, trading volume, recent price movements, and \uc2 Twitter\uc2  activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b74cc55a-7b48-4160-a67b-9169dc7b66d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score vs. XRP (white) price. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\par \par \uc2 As seen in the chart above, the VORTECS\u8482\'21\'22 Score for XRP flipped green on April 5 and continued to flash a positive indicator as the price rallied to a $1.10 high on April 6, resulting in a 53% gain in 36 hours.\par \par \uc2 While the indicator currently remains neutral, XRP price could further continue its rally if more positive news regarding the SEC lawsuit emerges.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNWI1MDhmZTItNDA3OC00YjZhLTk5YzMtMWEzMzkxODgxYjcxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210409eh49000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, LINK, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,028 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The rally in Bitcoin and select altcoins seems to have hit a wall as bears continue to aggressively push back at key overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong tech company Meitu {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meitu-now-holds-100-million-in-btc-and-ether-after-latest-bitcoin-purchase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  on April 8 that it had added $10 million worth of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to its holdings which were purchased at an average rate of $57,000 per coin. After the latest purchase, Meitu\u8217\'20\'19s total cryptocurrency portfolio consists of $49.5 million worth of Bitcoin and $50.5 million worth of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). This acquisition shows that institutional investors are confident that the rally in Bitcoin is still in its early stages.\par \par \uc2 Tom Jessop, Fidelity\u8217\'20\'19s head of the crypto division, believes that Bitcoin has reached a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-s-tom-jessop-says-crypto-has-hit-a-tipping-point"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tipping}}}\uc2  point and that traditional finance companies will continue to adopt cryptocurrency aggressively in the next few years. Jessop believes the massive monetary stimulus from governments and central banks has accelerated institutional adoption and this is a trend that could extend for at least another year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/25abf721-1640-4183-8889-381b2cbdd00a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only institutional investors who are rushing into cryptocurrencies. Data shows that the number of retail investors trading cryptocurrency has also increased. Popular trading app Robinhood {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-s-crypto-business-explodes-in-the-first-quarter-despite-gamestop-controversy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  on April 8 that crypto trading on its platform surged to 9.5 million users in Q1 2021, a six-fold increase over Q4 2020.\par \par \uc2 While \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  is on the rise, some legacy finance firms are still taking an anti-crypto approach. \uc2 HSBC\uc2  has reportedly blacklisted \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  stock and will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hsbc-reportedly-blacklists-microstrategy-s-stock-for-investing-in-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 not allow}}}\uc2  customers on its \uc2 HSBC InvestDirect\uc2  platform to buy shares from the company.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and major altcoins extend their uptrend and attract more buyers or will they enter a corrective phase? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears could not capitalize on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s break below the 20-day exponential moving average ($57,043) on April 7. Their failure to break the 50-day simple moving average ($54,572) support could have attracted buying from the aggressive bulls, resulting in the rebound on April 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/0c459513-7f2d-488a-9475-36837953c01a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, today's Doji candlestick suggests the bulls are struggling to sustain the momentum at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has formed an inverse head and shoulders pattern that will complete on a breakout and close above $60,000. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $69,540. If the bulls sustain the momentum and clear this hurdle, the uptrend may reach the next target at $79,566.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will once again try to break the critical support at the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the selling could intensify as short-term traders may rush to the exit. That could pull the pair down to $50,460.02 and then $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) drop on April 7 was arrested at the 20-day EMA ($1,933), which shows the bulls are accumulating on dips. The price rebounded sharply on April 8 and rose above the resistance at $2,040.77.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/f5201a23-a6f0-4e67-bef9-c62a26991232.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now make one more attempt to climb above the all-time high at $2,150. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could resume its uptrend and march toward the next target objective at $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could intensify the selling, resulting in a drop to the trendline. A break below this support will suggest a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to be in a strong uptrend. The bulls flipped the $348.69 level to support on April 7 and followed that up with a breakout to a new all-time high on April 8. This shows a strong appetite from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/ecc60b89-73e8-4d77-8bb8-932cf5761337.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) above 75 indicate that the bulls are in command. The next target objective on the upside is the $500 to $530 zone where the bears may mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 On any correction, the first support to watch out for is the 20-day EMA ($334). A strong rebound off this support will suggest the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 However, if the BNB/USDT pair dips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  made successive inside day candlestick formations on April 7 and April 8. The current price action is pointing to another inside-day candlestick pattern today. The drop in daily \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  shows the altcoin is still digesting the recent gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d56b8fc1-bff9-4989-9cf9-a622be48fbda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This tightening of the intraday range usually ends with a strong breakout. If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and the bulls drive the price above $1.11, the XRP/USDT pair could start the next leg of the rally that could take it to $1.34 and then $1.66.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the indecision resolves to the downside, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand and traders have dumped their positions. If that happens, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.72). A break below this level could pull the price down to $0.65.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($1.18) on April 7 but the bulls did not allow the price to slip below the 50-day SMA ($1.16). This shows the bulls are defending the moving averages aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9e29a0ea-514c-49e1-af1c-de6a8921a97d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above $1.33. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $1.48. This is an important level to watch out for because the pair has returned from it on two previous occasions.\par \par \uc2 If the price again reverses direction from $1.48, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days. On the other hand, if the bulls can drive the price above $1.48, the pair could resume the uptrend toward the next target objective at $2.\par \par \uc2 A break below the moving averages will be the first sign of weakness and that could result in a drop to the $1.02 support. If this level breaks down, the bears could start a deeper correction to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($38.68) on April 7, indicating buying on dips. The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $42.28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/94ad12be-24e1-4c77-8836-ad28b53c0944.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair will retest the all-time high at $46.80. A breakout and close above this level could start the next leg of the rally that has a target objective at $53.50 and then $57.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that traders are closing their positions on rallies. That could result in a fall to $32.50 and then $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the $27.97 support on April 7, which is a positive sign as it shows accumulation on dips. Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) bounced back above the 20-day EMA ($29.65) on April 8 and the buyers will now try to push the price above $32.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/96b13592-4228-46a8-b635-fb862cbaeaa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the $35.20 to $36.80 overhead resistance zone. The bears are likely to defend this zone aggressively. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the price below the $27.97 to $25.50 support zone. If they manage to do that, the pair could start a deeper correction to $20.74.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) successfully completed the retest of the breakout level from the symmetrical triangle on April 7. That was followed by a rebound on April 8, but the bulls are struggling to pick up momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1fbab7b9-6200-400a-8886-a90cbd2a6611.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This shows hesitation to buy at higher levels. If the bulls do not overcome the hurdle at $246.96 within the next few days, the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA ($207) increases. In such a case, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to the support line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls sustain the momentum and propel the price above $246.96, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $307.42. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 59 suggest a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) sharp reversal on April 7 could not break below the 20-day EMA ($30.29). This shows the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The rebound on April 8 rose above the $32 resistance but the bulls are struggling to build on this strength today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1ff4311f-3e75-4d82-a3e2-f1c430114b13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand at higher levels. That could pull the price down to the critical support at $24.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the bulls again defend the 20-day EMA, the LINK/USDT pair could rise to the all-time high at $36.93. A breakout and close above this resistance will suggest the bulls have absorbed the supply and that may indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price again turns down from $36.93, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the large range day on April 7, THETA made an inside day candlestick pattern on April 8 and has followed it up with another one today. This shows indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. While the bears are defending the overhead resistance, the bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/44070898-1f9c-4ead-a11e-8dd3f4ec8c49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($11.33) and the RSI above 62 suggest a minor advantage to the bulls. The buyers will have to clear the hurdle at $14 to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. If they manage to do that, the THETA/USDT pair could rally to $17.65 and then $22.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, it will be the first sign of a possible change in sentiment. It will suggest that the bulls are no longer buying the dips to the 20-day EMA. The next critical support to watch will be $10.35. If this level is taken out, a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA may start.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYWEzMTczODEtMGI3OC00ODg1LTg3NDEtMTU1NTM2NTg1NGQ1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210409eh49000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BTC Price\par \b \uc2 Retail traders become 'sitting ducks' as sell-off triggers $1.4B liquidation\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 675 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Retail traders have been using high leverage throughout the current bull market, but that's not the real reason for today's marketwide sell-off.\par \par \uc2 After flirting with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-market-cap-hits-2-trillion-now-worth-as-much-as-apple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $2 trillion market capitalization}}}\uc2  for the last couple of days, the cryptocurrency market took a 7% hit on April 7, dropping the total crypto market cap to $1.8 trillion. As the unexpected sell-off took place, investors scrambled to find a reason to explain the move.\par \par \uc2 Analysts typically identify the use of excessive leverage as the prime suspect, as this usually occurs as the market reaches an all-time high and traders get greedy, but this is an easy conclusion to reach.\par \par \uc2 The actual cause could be near impossible to determine. Still, a starting place is looking at how high buyers' leverage was compared with the previous weeks. Analysts must also question whether a $1 billion liquidation is even significant in the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  environment.\par \par \uc2 Leverage amplifies price movements on both sides\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b284d6de-5beb-40e1-9621-aa14a34b7b4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total cryptocurrency market capitalization. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The negative price swing on April 7 resembles the rally that took place two days earlier. However, retail traders deploy leverage by using perpetual futures contracts (inverse swaps), which can amplify price corrections.\par \par \uc2 A 5% move is enough to liquidate traders using 20x leverage, and exchange order books tend to become thin below that level, as traders seldomly have orders in place.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/11a0a721-cb91-4658-8fa5-260531a672ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )USDT order book. Source: Binance\par \par \uc2 As shown above, there is $4.6 million worth of bids down to $1.15 for Cardano's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  in the above example. Behind the 5% threshold, there's only $1.9 million down to $1.06, or 12% below last trade.\par \par \uc2 Thin order books are a gold mine for scalpers and arbitrage desks. Once retail markets enter highly leveraged positions, there are multiple incentives to push down the price and trigger liquidations.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/1314fe89-8f85-4533-8e42-e159713e1cf0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Aggregate liquidations. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 Today's 12-hour, $1.4 billion liquidation might seem excessive, but this aggregates the entire futures markets. Moreover, this represents a mere 3% of the total $46 billion in open interest. Had this movement taken place some six months ago, the figure would have been north of 12%.\par \par \uc2 However, implying that liquidations triggered the drop is not the best answer, as those are only triggered when markets drop 4% or more. Although analysts may never fully understand what has triggered the correction, a "buy the rumor, sell the news" event could have taken place after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-s-first-quarter-revenue-hits-record-1-8b-ahead-of-its-nasdaq-listing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase presented its quarterly earnings}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The funding rate is high but not abnormal\par \par \uc2 It's also important to review how high the funding rate was and, more importantly, for how long. Even if the eight-hour fee reaches 0.20%, equivalent to 4.3% per week, this will not force longs to close positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/2bb30c59-b18f-49bd-9234-8939bd4d9c23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC perpetual futures 8-hour funding rate. Source: Coinalyze\par \par \uc2 As shown above, the average funding rate across top exchanges did not rise above 0.10%, which is substantially lower than the late February levels.\par \par \uc2 It is natural during rallies for long traders to enter excessively leveraged positions, and this situation can last from a couple of hours to weeks.\par \par \uc2 Sometimes retail traders turn into sitting ducks\par \par \uc2 Whales and market makers likely knew that the exchange order books were thin and that retail traders were excessively leveraged. Thus, one cannot discard today's price action being a premeditated maneuver.\par \par \uc2 However, arbitrage between exchanges and futures markets happens almost instantly, so no trail is left. Analysts and pundits might pinpoint numerous reasons for today's move, but the available data suggests that leverage itself isn't to blame.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNGY1ZjcxMDQtMzRkMC00NzE1LWJjMDktZWI1MDZkNTY5YTU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210407eh47000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, UNI, LTC, LINK, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,878 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins retraced to key lower support levels after Bitcoin price dropped below $56,000, but will traders view the dip as a buying opportunity?\par \par \uc2 According to CoinShares, the institutional {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-first-quarter-for-institutional-crypto-investment-products-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflow}}}\uc2  into crypto products hit $4.5 billion in Q1, which is 11% higher than the intake seen in Q4 2020. This shows that institutional interest is on the rise but the quarter-on-quarter growth has slowed down from the 240% recorded in Q4 2020.\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin price moves higher, more funds are needed to sustain the levels. Therefore, if institutional inflows do not pick up in the next few days, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other altcoins could witness a major correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/e08245df-78c9-4802-bd5a-b5d9d4d81d6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The next correction could test the resolve of institutional investors and even though these investors have deep pockets, some may have jumped into crypto only for quick speculative gains. There is always the possibility that investors may dump their positions if Bitcoin starts a correction.\par \par \uc2 While this may accelerate the fall, lower levels are likely to attract investors who may have missed the bus earlier. If this assumption plays out, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the market may remain high in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to see if it also projects a possible correction.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to cross the stiff overhead resistance zone at $60,000 to $61,825.84 seems to have attracted profit-booking from short-term momentum traders. This has pulled the price back below the 20-day exponential moving average ($56,863) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/27a31a9a-cfd7-4c96-8fef-a42e82120950.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears may sense an opening and are likely to challenge the critical support at the 50-day simple moving average ($54,333). If this support cracks and the bears manage to sustain the price below the 50-day SMA, the selling could intensify.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is $50,460. If this level also gives way, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet down to $43,006.77. The flattening moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) dropping below 52 suggest that the bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair to a new all-time high. If they succeed, the pair could start its journey to the next target objective at $69,540 and then $79,566.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke to a new all-time high on April 2 but could not take off and continue its climb. This showed hesitation among the bulls and even though they managed to push the price to a new all-time high at $2,150 on April 6 the rally has since stalled.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9ea3436c-b562-4cfc-816a-fd442886e47a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That may have frustrated the momentum traders who seem to have dumped their positions today, resulting in a drop to the 20-day EMA ($1,904). If the ETH/USDT pair rebounds strongly from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make one more attempt to drive the price above $2,150. If they succeed, the pair could start its journey to the next target objective at $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest a possible change in sentiment and that could drag the price down to the trendline.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level at $348.69 today but the long tail on the candlestick shows the bulls purchased this dip aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9e804cfd-bfaa-4a2a-9941-d269c8b6f150.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest the bulls are firmly in command. If the buyers can flip $348.69 into support, then the BNB/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that could take it to $500 and then $530.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price dips below $348.69, it will suggest that higher levels are attracting profit-booking from traders. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may weaken if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($314).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s breakout above $0.65 on April 5 completed an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which had a target objective at $1.11. The altcoin met this target on April 6 when it reached an intraday high at $1.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/41cc3860-092a-4787-9043-f25fc809429d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders who follow technical analysis seem to have booked profits near the target objective, resulting in a sharp pullback today.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to stall the correction near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.84 as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. If the buyers can sustain the rebound, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels and keep the prospects of a break above $1.11 alive.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the XRP/USDT pair breaks below $0.84, the correction could deepen to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.77. Such a deep correction may delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) attempted an up-move on April 6, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears have latched on to the opportunity today and are attempting to sink the price to $1.03.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d8d52593-0c0f-49c8-aefe-4e07b67100a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the $1.03 support aggressively. If the price rebounds off this level strongly, the bulls will try to push the price above the moving averages. If they can do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 10-day EMA ($1.18) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate if the $1.03 support cracks. In such a case, the pair could start its journey toward the support at $0.80 and then $0.70.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the price above the all-time high at $146.80 on April 5 and 6 could have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders. That may have pulled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back below the breakout level at $42.28 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b0b261d9-1b89-4e0d-aef3-deb25a894f3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($38). If they can achieve a strong rebound off this support, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers may then make one more attempt to clear the all-time high. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $53.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a weak rebound will suggest weakness and a lack of urgency among traders to buy aggressively. That will open the chances for the bears to pull the price below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could drop to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the $32.50 resistance but failed. This shows a lack of buyers at higher levels. The bears are now attempting to sink the pair below the $27.97 to $25.50 support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/6a1ed0f3-6521-421f-96b7-8660874c9064.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the UNI/USDT pair could start its journey toward the next support at $22 and then $18.\par \par \uc2 However, the flat 20-day EMA ($29.59) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the bulls can defend the support zone, the pair is likely to extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on April 5 and followed it up with another up-move on April 6 that took the price to the stiff resistance at $246.96.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d989c8dd-2f76-4e3f-aadf-d01d9bf52d33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to clear the hurdle at $246.96 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders and selling by aggressive bears. That pulled the price down to the breakout level from the triangle today.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USDT pair rebounds off this level aggressively, it will suggest that the bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will then make one more attempt to climb the wall at $246.96. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its journey to $307.42.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $32 resistance on April 5 and followed it with another up-move on April 6 but the bulls could not challenge the all-time high at $36.93. This suggests the bears have not given up and are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/5cad402e-e150-4e11-8cd4-a845d735c65d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USDT pair has dipped back below the $32 level today. The bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($29.85). If they manage to do that and push the price back above $32 within the next couple of days, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may then again try to propel the price above $36.93. Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the moving averages, it will suggest that the recent breakout above $32 was a bull trap. The pair could then drop to $24.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading in a tight range for the past few days, THETA surged today and attempted to break out of the $14 to $14.96 overhead resistance. However, the bears thwarted this attempt as seen from the long wick in today's candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/788789fe-47bd-4a5d-9c3d-65da1b43651a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the THETA/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that has a target objective at $17.65 and then $22.50. The 20-day EMA ($11.13) has started to turn up once again and the RSI has risen above 68, suggesting the momentum favors the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the uptrend in the overhead resistance zone. If they manage to do that, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvYzlhY2Y3ZDktODVmYS00MDA5LTk1YjgtMGQ0Y2EwZWZmZjM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210407eh47000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,056 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have bounced off their immediate support levels, indicating an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization reached the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-market-cap-hits-2-trillion-now-worth-as-much-as-apple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 important}}}\uc2  milestone of $2 trillion on April 5. As cryptocurrencies increase in value, they are likely to attract further investments from institutional investors because they can no longer afford to neglect it.\par \par \uc2 Less than three months ago, the crypto market had reached the $1 trillion in market cap for the first time ever. This rate of growth shows that investors are hugely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the potential of the sector and the ones who delay their investment decisions may have to enter at much higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Ark Invest founder and CEO Cathie Wood is well known for identifying disruptive technologies and the firm is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/renowned-stock-picker-believes-bitcoin-will-eclipse-gold-s-10t-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 backing}}}\uc2  Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to do just that. Yassine Elmandjra, a crypto asset analyst at Ark, said Bitcoin was \u8220\'20\'1C100 times better\u8221\'20\'1D than gold, hence he believes Bitcoin will rise 10-fold from the current market capitalization of $1 trillion to match gold\u8217\'20\'19s $10-trillion market cap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/647bdbd3-4903-48a5-be7d-c1d9008448df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 For Bitcoin to continue its northward journey, the institutions will have to continue {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-big-60k-hodl-is-on-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pumping}}}\uc2  money into it. \uc2 Purpose Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , Canada\u8217\'20\'19s first licensed Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) launched two months ago and currently, it holds 16,462 BTC.\par \par \uc2 If a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  gets the approval of the regulators in the United States, it could attract huge investments, dwarfing the inflows into the \uc2 Purpose Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The crypto story has widened beyond Bitcoin. Data from business analytics firm CB Insights showed crypto and blockchain technology-focused startups {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-industry-got-more-funding-in-q1-2021-than-all-of-last-year-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received}}}\uc2  $2.6 billion in funding in Q1 2021. This is way above the total funding of $2.3 billion received in 2020, indicating the growing interest in the sector.\par \par \uc2 So the question on the minds of most investors is whether or not the crypto market will be able to sustain its current momentum. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average ($56,750) today, which suggests that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/91449754-efd4-4550-9545-85ea5c79c699.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above the $60,000 to $61,825.84 overhead resistance zone. If they succeed, it could open the doors for a rally to $69,540 and then $79,566.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will once again try to stall the rally in the resistance zone. If that happens, the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA increases.\par \par \uc2 That could result in a drop to the critical support at the 50-day simple moving average ($53,978). If the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to the next support at $50,460.02.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) made a new all-time high at $2,144.59 on April 2. However, the bulls could not build upon this move as the bears sold aggressively and pulled the price back below the breakout level at $2,040.77 on April 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/a350dd38-c055-4330-aff4-bb4fab165557.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Since then, both the bulls and the bears have been battling it out near $2,040.77. While the bulls are attempting to flip this level into support, the bears are trying to pull the price below it and trap the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1,872) and the relative strength index (RSI) above 65 suggest the bulls have the upper hand. If the buyers succeed in pushing the price above $2,144.59, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend that may reach $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears pull the price below $1,977, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A break below this level will suggest the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened and could result in a decline to the trendline.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) cleared the $348.69 to $356.98 overhead resistance zone today and made a new all-time high. Whenever an asset class hits a new all-time high, it is a sign of strength because it shows that traders are buying at higher levels as they expect the rally to extend further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/b8477392-dd91-4728-9271-b5185b93d757.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI has risen into the overbought territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside. The BNB/USDT pair could now rally to its target objective at $400 and then $430.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price reverses direction and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($297). Such a move will suggest that traders are aggressively booking profits at higher levels and supply exceeds demand.\par \par \uc2 That could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($258) and a crack below this support may extend the decline to $220.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to trap the bulls on April 3, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. However, the bulls were not ready to surrender their advantage and they again pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above $42.28 on April 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4815ec63-e9c3-48f6-84bd-a43c377a552c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears near the $42.28 level. The buyers are trying to flip this level to support and launch the next leg of the uptrend, which could reach $53.50.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($37.30) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the bears can pull the price back below $40. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the moving averages and a break below the 50-day SMA ($35.34) could start a deeper correction to $26.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($1.17) for the past few days. Attempts by the bulls to start an up-move on April 2 and 3 did not find buyers at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlesticks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/d609c070-63f0-4feb-bb96-99df6fb6c7c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, every low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase is followed by a sharp increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout. Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before initiating any trades.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $1.30, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may challenge the stiff resistance at $1.48. This will be the third attempt to clear the overhead resistance, hence the possibility of a break above it is high. The next target objective is $2.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the indecision resolves to the downside, the bears will try to sink the price below $1.03 and start a deeper correction to $0.80 and then $0.70.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke above the stiff overhead resistance at $0.65 today, which completed an inverse head and shoulders pattern. The altcoin picked up momentum and cleared the minor resistance at $0.75 and $0.78.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/480a588e-c685-44a4-825e-d6cb03295bbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp pace of the rally suggests that several bears may have been caught off guard, resulting in a massive short squeeze. This opens the possibility for a rally to the pattern target at $1.11.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.57) and the RSI above 80 suggest the bulls are back in command.\par \par \uc2 However, the XRP/USDT pair may not rally to the target objective in a straight dash as short-term traders may book profits after the sharp rally today. That may pull the price down to the $0.75 to $0.65 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The strength of the rebound off this support zone will give a better insight into the next leg of the rally.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($29.52) on April 2 but the bears did not allow the price to run away. They sold at higher levels and pulled the price back to the 20-day EMA on April 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/f071a01f-7e19-48f1-adf2-0899f4a70c5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The positive sign is that the bulls have held the 20-day EMA successfully for the past three days. If the bulls can drive the price above $32.50, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the $35.20 to $36.80 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI below 56 suggests a lack of strong momentum in favor of the bulls. This could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days. The next trending move could start on a break above $36.80 or a break below $25.52.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) had broken out of the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on April 3 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The altcoin quickly reversed direction and dropped back into the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/21a61e3b-1034-42b8-be5e-5240af593c77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the positive sign is that the buyers did not allow the price to break below the moving averages. This shows that the bulls are accumulating on dips. They will again attempt to push and sustain the price above the triangle.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair could rally to $230 and then to $246.96. Above this level, the pair could rise to the pattern target at $307.42.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again turns down from the resistance line, then the possibility of a break below the moving averages increases. If that happens, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $32 resistance on April 2 but the bulls could not build upon this breakout and the bears pulled the price back into the range on April 3. This suggests the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/2dd97332-5be7-4481-92fb-37150c89f33b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the strong rebound off the 20-day EMA ($29) on April 4 shows the bulls are buying the dips. The bulls will now try to thrust the price above the $32 to $33.17 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 If they can achieve that, the LINK/USDT pair may retest the all-time high at $36.93. If this level is also conquered, the rally may extend to $40.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price again turns down from the overhead resistance zone and plummets below the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 THETA has been stuck inside the $10.35 to $14 range for the past few days. The bears are trying to sink the price to the support of the range but the bulls have not allowed the altcoin to dip below $11.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/ae3e4796-5aac-46b6-8bb9-610d0726caf4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($10.81) is gradually flattening out and the RSI has dropped below 61, pointing to a possible range-bound action in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls can drive the price above $12.58, the THETA/USDT pair could rally to $14. A breakout of this resistance will be the first sign that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the pair turns down from the current level and slips below $11.20, a drop to $10.35 is possible. A break below this support could intensify selling.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNjk0ODQ5ZWEtMzcwNC00ZTlkLWI1MmMtODY2Yzg5YjgwNDE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210405eh45000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/2: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, XRP, UNI, LTC, LINK, THETA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,903 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 April 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Select altcoins could rally higher if Bitcoin and Ethereum hold on to their recent gains.\par \par \uc2 According to a recent research note by \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 , institutional investors have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/currencies/news/bitcoin-price-outlook-volatility-attractive-institutions-supports-price-target-jpmorgan-2021-4-1030270274"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 withdrawn}}}\uc2  about $20 billion from their gold investments since mid-October and during the same time frame, institutional inflows into Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) have increased by $7 billion.\par \par \uc2 The bank said, \u8220\'20\'1Cany such crowding out of gold as an 'alternative' currency implies big upside for Bitcoin over the long term."\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  believes that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s declining \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could increase adoption from institutional investors. If that happens, the value of the private investments in Bitcoin may mirror that of gold and this gives Bitcoin an upside target of $130,000 in the long term, added the bank.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8c7ed419-b213-485b-8f54-8618a592cff8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In other news, billionaire investor Mark Cuban said his crypto portfolio {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mark-cuban-owns-30-eth-because-it-s-closest-to-a-true-currency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 consists}}}\uc2  of 30% Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) because he believes it is the closest thing to being a true currency. Cuban said the remainder of his crypto portfolio consists of 60% Bitcoin and 10% in other crypto investments.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-season-eth-options-traders-are-placing-big-bets-for-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  that 400,000 Ether had left \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , a sign that institutional investors may have started accumulating the top altcoin.\par \par \uc2 The increased adoption of cryptocurrencies by legacy financial institutions and investors is a positive sign but will this newsflow act as a tailwind and boost the price of the top-10 cryptocurrencies?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on March 31 and April 1, which suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. The bulls are again trying to push the price above the $60,000 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/362d177f-a29e-4649-a18c-2672fc765373.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong breakout above the $60,000 to $61,825.84 overhead resistance zone will suggest that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. That could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend, which has a target objective at $69,279 and then $79,566.\par \par \uc2 Traders can keep an eye on the relative strength index because a break above the downtrend line will indicate a pick-up in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again reverses direction from the overhead resistance zone, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($53,362). A break below this critical support could attract profit-booking from short-term traders and that could pull the price down to $50,460.02 and then $43,006.77.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke out of the symmetrical triangle on March 31 and has continued its journey higher. Today, the bulls have pushed the biggest altcoin above the all-time high at $2,040.77.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/6bb29e06-90db-469c-915d-b4fdb103e92f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($1,798) has turned up and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the buyers can sustain the price above $2,040.77, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the up-move. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $2,618.14.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, a drop to the 20-day EMA is possible. A strong bounce off it will signal strength and the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the bears sink the price below the trendline. Such a move could pull the price down to $1,289.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After some hesitation on March 31, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $315 resistance on April 1 and has followed it up with a breakout above the all-time high at $348.69 today. If the bulls can sustain the breakout, the altcoin could rally to $400 and then $430.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/f959f363-40d5-4b5f-aaf9-9d74eb1dc3ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BNBUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to defend the price above $348.69, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $315. If the bulls can flip this level into support, it will increase the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the pair turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a tight range for the past few days but the positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($1.17). This suggests a lack of buying but does not show an urgency among traders to dump their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/2589ccac-04c9-4abb-9610-1cd88658b284.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls may now attempt to push the price above $1.30. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $1.48. This is an important resistance because the price had turned down from it on Feb. 27 and March 18.\par \par \uc2 If that happens once again, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. However, if the bulls propel the price above $1.48, the pair could resume its uptrend that may reach $2. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate on a break and close below $1.03.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) had turned down from the downtrend line on April 1 but the bulls did not give up much ground. This shows that traders did not close their positions in a hurry. The buyers have pushed the price above the downtrend line today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/9d1b972b-dee5-4502-a157-2ba988ab2559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/DOTUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($35.06) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating advantage to the bulls. If the buyers can sustain the price above the downtrend line, the DOT/USDT pair could challenge the all-time high at $42.28.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $42.28 could resume the uptrend with the next possible move to $53.50. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the all-time high and slips below the moving averages. That could pull the price down to $26.50.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 After hesitating near $0.60 for the past few days, the bulls are currently attempting to propel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  to the $0.65 overhead resistance. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance because the price has turned down from it on five previous occasions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/46c41533-83dc-4ac2-8a30-078bb7225827.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/XRPUSD/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the rising 20-day EMA ($0.53) and the RSI above 65 suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls can push and sustain the price above $0.65, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.78 and then $1.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that traders are selling on rallies. That could keep the pair range-bound between $0.42 and $0.65 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/uniswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between both the moving averages for the past few days. The bears could not sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($27.59) on March 31 and the bulls could not sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($29.13) on April 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/3004f49a-947e-4341-a88b-91b936bf37f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/UNIUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view could tilt in favor of the bulls if they propel and sustain the price above $30.31 today. If that happens, the UNI/USDT pair could start to move up toward the $35.20 overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below $25.50, the pair could witness increased selling pressure, which may pull the price down to $18.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) recovered sharply from its intraday low on March 31 and broke above the 50-day SMA ($197) on April 1. The bulls will now try to push the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/8fddff8c-e26c-43bf-bebc-749a494d06cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LTCUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the LTC/USDT pair could rally to $230 and then to $246.96. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $307.42. However, the marginally rising 20-day EMA ($193) and the RSI at the downtrend line suggest a weak \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. The bears will gain the upper hand on a break below the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/chainlink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) reversed course from $26.18 on March 31 and rose above the downtrend line of the descending triangle. This move invalidates the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and the bulls will now try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/4d72b0e8-8fc3-4d02-9481-f7eeaae4d144.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/LINKUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair could start its march toward the all-time high at $36.93. The 20-day EMA ($28.45) has started to turn up and the RSI has risen above 59, indicating a minor advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls fail to propel the price above $32, then the pair could drop to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will indicate that traders are buying on minor dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above $32.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, then the pair could remain stuck inside the $24 to $32 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT\par \par \uc2 THETA is currently range-bound in an uptrend. The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-04/7564927e-3586-4c75-a49f-3afac0483b9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 THETA/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/THETAUSDT/?utm_source=cointelegraph&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is at 63, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls can propel the price above the triangle, the THETA/USDT pair could rally to the all-time high at $14.96 and then to the pattern target at $17.85.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle. Such a move will increase the possibility of a break below the critical support at $10.35, signaling a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMDQvNjIyYzJmYmMtYWM5Yi00OWQ2LWJjM2UtNDJlOWRjNjI2MzNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020210402eh42000b5\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market reaction" OR "price drop" OR "price rise" OR "volatility" OR "bullish" OR "bearish" OR "investor sentiment" OR "regulation" OR "ETF approval" OR "crypto ban" OR "crypto adoption" OR "digital\u160\'00\'A0asset")\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2